window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":501,"title":"Chapter 501 - Scram From The Entertainment Industry!","paragraphs":["The host stared at the screen, and his expression changed. He lowered his voice and said, “Anran, stop talking.”","The comments had completely covered the screen, filling it with curses.","(We’ve already seen the surveillance videos! Xu Anran is a liar! Doesn’t she blush when she lies?]","[Not only did Xu Anran snatch Qiao Xi’s role, but she even wrongfully accused Qiao Xi. I can’t believe Xu Anran’s fans are still cursing Qiao Xi online!)","[How can there be such a scheming woman?! If we hadn’t seen the surveillance videos, we would have misunderstood Qiao Xi. I think this isn’t the first time Xu Anran has done this. It’s just that there was surveillance footage this time!)","(B*tch! Get out of the entertainment industry!)","Xu Anran did not understand what was going on. She walked in front of the camera and saw the curses. Her face instantly turned pale, and her eyes were filled with horror.","[Are you stupid?! You didn’t expect this, did you? We saw the surveillance footage!]","Although Xu Anran had many fans, there were still many non-fans who were paying attention to this matter. At this moment, they were defending the innocent Qiao Xi.","Faced with everyone’s questions, Xu Anran clenched her fists tightly and forced herself to calm down. She pretended to be innocent and asked, “What are all of you talking about?! Why don’t I understand? You’re saying that... I stole Qiao Xi’s role?”","[Continue acting! Let’s see how long you can continue acting! We’ve all seen the surveillance footage!)","Surveillance footage?","Xu Anran’s body trembled.","Hadn’t the surveillance footage been deleted?","In reality, the relevant videos had already been posted on Weibo. In just ten minutes, the number of views had exceeded ten million. The videos of both Qiao Xi’s and Xu Anran’s auditions were posted.","Xu Anran’s expression changed. That was impossible! Director Ding had already said that he deleted it. He would not lie to her. After all, it would not be good for Director Ding if this matter was exposed.","Xu Anran suppressed the doubts in her heart. Now was not the time to think about this matter. She had to explain herself and not let everyone know what she had done. Otherwise, her future would be ruined.","She glanced at the surveillance videos, then widened her eyes and pretended to be aggrieved. “This... Miss Qiao actually auditioned? But... But the director told me that Qiao Xi didn’t audition and the role wasn’t confirmed yet. I didn’t know that they had already signed the contract. It turns out that I... I stole Miss Qiao’s role! I... I’m sorry, Miss Qiao. I’m really sorry!”","The host heard the voice coming from the earpiece and hurriedly asked, “Anran, when you received the invitation for this role, you didn’t know that Qiao Xi had already signed the contract, right?”","Xu Anran nodded, her eyes filled with tears of self-reproach. “I-I didn’t know. If I had known, I... I wouldn’t have agreed to play this role. I was wrong about Miss Qiao, but the director... Sigh! Forget it, it’s all my fault.”","She looked like she wanted to say something but hesitated. She was clearly pushing all the responsibility to the director now.","[Damn! Stop acting! We all saw it. You were the one who told the director that as long as he chased Qiao Xi away and agreed to let you have this role, you would invest ten million yuan into the production. Do you think we’re all fools? Do you think we’ll believe you if you shed a few tears?]","[Moreover, you can’t even memorize your lines. How do you have the confidence to snatch the role from Qiao Xi with your lousy acting skills? How are you so shameless?! Don’t think that just because you’re the eldest daughter of the Xu family you can do whatever you want in the entertainment industry. Didn’t you say that being in the entertainment industry requires ability or the audience won’t buy it? With your acting skills, you’d better get lost!)","Tears trickled down Xu Anran’s face as she said aggrievedly, “I... I didn’t! Actually... many directors are looking for me to film a movie with them. Why must I compete with Qiao Xi? You must have misunderstood. Qiao Xi and I don’t know each other, so there’s no need for me to target her.”","“Everyone, calm down. Actually, the candidate for the role has already been decided.” At this moment, Madam Lu slowly walked over and explained generously.","Qiao Xi, who was in front of the screen, was stunned for a moment. This Madam Xu looked very familiar. She looked a little like... her mother. However, Madam Xu was a socialite in Luo City. How could she be related to her mother?","Could it be that it was really as Gu Yao had said? Her mother was once the daughter of a big family. She only married Qiao Zhenguo after encountering some difficulties? Otherwise, it would be very difficult to explain why her mother would marry that good-for-nothing Qiao Zhenguo when she was so rich."]},{"number":502,"title":"Chapter 502 - Qiao Xi’s Relationship With The Xu Family","paragraphs":["Madam Xu was polite and elegant as she said, “Miss Qiao isn’t even from the entertainment industry. She just went to the audition to give it a try. She didn’t have the intention to play that role.","“As for our Anran...” Madam Xu paused for a moment and continued, “Actually, it has long been decided that the role would go to Anran. The audition was just a formality. The reason why she couldn’t memorize the script is that she was too busy, but she’ll definitely be well-prepared during the official shoot.”","Xu Anran’s expression softened as she wiped her tears. “My mom is right. Miss Qiao already knew that the role had been decided. We’ve already agreed on it. I don’t know... things turned out like this?”","Qiao Xi mixed into the audience and typed a comment: (What are you saying when Miss Qiao is not around? Are you lying to us again? After all, you said that Miss Qiao stole your role! Can we still believe you?]","Xu Anran looked at the striking line of words and hurriedly explained, “You have to believe me. If I really stole Miss Qiao’s role, why didn’t I delete the video? Why did I leave the evidence behind?","“Our Xu family doesn’t lack money at all. If I really made a mistake, I would’ve just deleted those surveillance videos. That way, no one will ever know, right?”","an","Madam Xu said, “That’s right! Our Anran doesn’t even know Miss Qiao, so why would she target a stranger?! I personally hope Anran won’t continue acting. That way, she can come back home and inherit the company. Our Xu family doesn’t care about dealing with a nobody.” At this moment, there were suddenly fewer comments. Everyone did not know who to believe for a moment. At this moment, Xu Anran’s fans stood forward and began to clear her name.","[Anran is right. She’s the eldest daughter of the Xu family. If she really stole the role, she definitely wouldn’t have left behind any evidence!)","(Didn’t Anran say that she had already discussed it with Qiao Xi?! Miss Qiao isn’t from the entertainment industry, so she probably just went to try auditioning for the part. Someone deliberately posted the videos online, so it caused a misunderstanding.)","[With Anran’s status, there’s no need for her to snatch a role. Many directors want to invite her to film with them. Moreover, if she really wants to act in something, the Xu family can just fork out money to invest in the movie. There’s no need for her to snatch the role from Miss Qiao, right?! Madam Xu is right. The Xu family can’t be bothered to do all this.)","Seeing that the situation had changed, Xu Anran immediately stood up. “Yes, with my identity, why would I go and deal with a newcomer?”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. She really hated the Xu family’s way of doing things. It was as if the Xu family was the greatest in the world and the most powerful. They thought that they could control everything just because they had money. They clearly stole someone else’s role but insisted on forcefully turning the tables. If she was really a newbie and was wronged by Xu Anran, she would not be able to survive in the entertainment industry anymore. She might even be hated by everyone.","as","At this moment, Gu Zheng raised his hand and curled his finger.","Song Shijing understood immediately. He picked up his phone and said, “Do it.”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes slightly and said softly, “Xi Xi, the Xu family... might be related to you.”","Qiao Xi was not surprised in the slightest and nodded. “This Madam Xu looks very similar to my mother.”","Gu Zheng was a little hesitant. “No, it’s more than that.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and was slightly puzzled.","At this moment, Song Shijing handed a document to Qiao Xi. “Back then, when Madam Xu gave birth, someone swapped her child. Her biological daughter went missing, while the child who was with them was just a servant’s child. However, the Xu family did not know this and raised that child as the apple of their eye.”","Qiao Xi instantly understood when she heard this.","Gu Zheng said, “After that, the Xu family accidentally found out about this, but they didn’t plan to look for their biological daughter. For some reason, however, they suddenly started looking for her now. That’s why they came to Li City.”","“So? What does the Xu family have to do with","me?”","Gu Zheng looked serious. “You... are the biological daughter they’re looking for.”","The living room was silent.","Song Shiyu and Song Shijing looked at each other and lowered their eyes while holding their breaths."]},{"number":503,"title":"Chapter 503 - Xu Anyi Was Captured","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi was stunned for a few seconds, then she calmed down and sneered. “Me? You’re saying that I’m Madam Xu’s biological daughter?”","Gu Zheng was not surprised that she did not have much of a reaction. Instead, he looked at the screen indifferently. “After knowing about this, are you still going to go against the Xu family?”","“They provoked me first!” Qiao Xi was indignant. “First, it was Xu Zidie who came to my shop to create trouble. Then, Xu Anran stole my role and even sent people to kill me. Even if they don’t know my identity, they shouldn’t be treating me like this. Since they’ve already bullied me, why should I be soft-hearted?”","Gu Zheng said helplessly, “But if you do this, you might not be able to return to the Xu family in the future.”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Senior, do you think I’m very interested in becoming the eldest miss of the Xu family? Why should I go back to such an unscrupulous family?”","However, Madam Xu definitely knew her mother. She could investigate her mother’s background and secrets through Madam Xu.","Gu Zheng heaved a sigh of relief when he saw that Qiao Xi did not care.","“Didn’t I say this before? It doesn’t matter whether I find my biological father or not. I already have a mother, grandfather, brothers, and sisters. I have many godparents and...”","Qiao Xi smiled. “I have you.”","Gu Zheng rubbed her head with a tender gaze. “Yes, it’s good that you’ve made up your mind not to go back. Actually, the Xu family already knew that their biological daughter was wandering outside a few years ago, but they only started looking for her now. I wonder what their motive is.”","no","His expression turned cold. “It’s time.”","Qiao Xi looked at the screen. At this moment, the public support had shifted back to Xu Anran. It was the effort of those fans who were frantically defending their idol.","Xu Anran saw the change in the situation and said gently, “Thank you for believing me. As the eldest daughter of the Xu family, I really don’t have to target a stranger. This is just a misunderstanding. If anyone still has doubts,","I...”","Bang!","Before she could finish, the police rushed in.","Everyone looked up and saw that they were holding arrest warrants.","Xu Anyi’s heart thumped, and his eyes were filled with horror.","Why were they here? Could it be that... those people he sent were captured?","Before he could think, the butler rushed over. “Madam! I... I can’t stop them. He... They said...”","Madam Xu looked at the livestream, then at Xu Anran. Her heart jumped as she hurriedly shouted, “Stop them! Stop them! Let’s talk outside!”","The audience watching the livestream heard the commotion and looked puzzled.","A police officer walked in front and showed his identification and arrest warrant. He walked in front of Xu Anyi and announced word by word, “Xu Anyi, someone has reported you for hiring hitmen. Please cooperate with us for an investigation.”","Boom!!!","A clap of thunder exploded in everyone’s ears.","The host sensed that something was wrong and hurriedly wanted to turn off the livestream. However, for some reason, he could not turn it off. He could only put the camera to the side, but the audio was still being recorded.","Xu Anyi took a few steps back in horror. “Nonsense! I didn’t! Show me the evidence, or I won’t leave with you!”","“Miss Qiao Xi has already reported the case and provided surveillance footage as evidence. The four people you hired have already confessed. They were instructed by you. Mr. Xu, can you leave with us now?”","The venue fell silent.","Xu Anyi widened his eyes and looked at the police officer in front of him in disbelief. His throat moved, and he gulped. His body was trembling violently.","Qiao... Qiao Xi was not dead and had even called the police.","Madam Xu immediately retorted, “My son is the young master of the Xu family. How could he hire people to kill someone? Qiao Xi must have seen that she failed to humiliate my daughter, so she wants to harm my son now. She’s slandering—”.","“Madam Xu, according to our investigation, those four people are Mr. Xu’s personal bodyguards.” The police officer took out the surveillance footage and a few photos of the bodyguards.","“We have witnesses and evidence. What else do you have to say? Miss Qiao was seriously threatened, yet you’re still saying that Miss Qiao is slandering you? There’s an arrest warrant here. No matter what you say, Xu Anyi has to go back with us to be investigated! Take him away!” A few law-enforcement officers came forward and handcuffed Xu Anyi before pushing him out the door."]},{"number":504,"title":"Chapter 504 - 4 Evil Leads To Self-Destruction","paragraphs":["Xu Anyi was stunned for a few seconds before resisting crazily and shouting, “Mom! Save me! I don’t even know Qiao Xi, so why would I get people to kill her?! I didn’t!”","Those pieces of trash had dug a grave for him. They didn’t kill Qiao Xi and were even captured!","He was the young master of the Xu family. He would not go to jail just like that. His parents would definitely think of a way to save him.","“Qiao Xi wronged me! Officer! You have to believe me. You can’t be deceived by her.”","“Young Master Xu, if you have anything to say, go back to the police station with us first. If you’re unconvinced, we have other evidence. You called your personal bodyguards to kill Qiao Xi. We’ve already gotten our hands on the recording of this call. Do you need us to play it for you now?”","Recording of the call?","They actually found the recording of his call? Xu Anyi’s body was stiff, and his face was pale. He lowered his head weakly. He could not explain himself anymore.","“Get in.” The two of them pressed Xu Anyi into the car.","Madam Xu thought that the livestream had already been switched off when the police entered. When she saw that her son was arrested, she could not suppress the anger in her heart.","“Qiao Xi! This b*tch! She actually dares to report my son? If we don’t kill her, where will our Xu family put our dignity?”","[Damn! The Xu family is shameless!]","(Didn’t Madam Xu and Xu Anran just say that the Xu family can’t be bothered to deal with Qiao Xi? They went back on their word in front of everyone!)","(There’s nobody good in the Xu family! Madam Xu’s daughter stole Qiao Xi’s role and even falsely accused Qiao Xi. Her son is even more vicious and directly got his bodyguards to kill her! What era is it now? There are actually still people who don’t know the law and do such shocking things? Is the Xu family really lawless just because they have money?!]","[You all heard it, right? Madam Xu said that she wants to kill Qiao Xi. The Xu family are all murderers! Maybe they’ve even killed someone before!)","evei","meone","[The fact is that Xu Anran stole someone else’s role. Now that the matter has been exposed, she wants to silence Qiao Xi. The Xu family is too arrogant! Are they crazy?]","Madam Xu cursed. “B*tch! Qiao Xi! Qiao Xi...”","“Madam... Madam Xu...” the host said in fear. “The live broadcast hasn’t ended yet.”","Boom!!!","The Xu family looked at the host in disbelief.","What? The live broadcast... hadn’t been turned off?","The host looked at Xu Anran’s fierce expression and carefully explained, “I... I can’t do anything about it. I’ve tried, but... I can’t turn it off.”","cree.","At this moment, a line of red words suddenly appeared on everyone’s screen. [Those who are unjust will end up killing themselves. Don’t be so pretentious in front of others. I’ll help the Xu family and let everyone see the Xu family’s true colors! You’re welcome!-Black Tide.]","Black Tide?","The people in the livestream realized that Black Tide was the one who played those videos earlier. No wonder their phones and computers seemed to be infected with a virus and could not be switched off.","[Let me explain to everyone. Xu Anran deleted the videos long ago to cover up her trail. However, I can’t let Miss Qiao Xi suffer injustice, so I restored the deleted videos and played them during the livestream for everyone to see! Miss Xu, remember to delete the videos thoroughly next time. Don’t let me find them!)","Gu Zheng chuckled as he looked at Qiao Xi.","Everyone knew that there was a pampered little princess nicknamed Black Tide in the hacker world. She did things as she pleased. As long as she did not want to accept the job, she would not accept it no matter how much the other party offered. On the other hand, if she wanted to interfere, she would stand up even without the other party paying her.","It was precisely because she would not be bewitched by money and never did anything that would make her feel guilty that everyone knew she was not a liar.","At this moment, the comments exploded again. (Xu Anran! Black Tide has already come forward to clarify things. What else do you have to say?! Didn’t you say that Qiao Xi was just auditioning for fun and she didn’t want to play this role?]","[Since you didn’t do anything wrong, why did you delete the videos? Why did your brother get his bodyguards to commit murder? He’s guilty!) (The Xu family is too scary! If we didn’t have this evidence, we would have been deceived by Xu Anran! Qiao Xi was almost killed by their family!)"]},{"number":505,"title":"Chapter 505 - The Xia Family’s Secret","paragraphs":["Xu Anran’s spirits had crumbled. Her body went weak as she fell onto the sofa. Her nails dug into her palms as she said in a suppressed voice, “I... I’ll explain it clearly later. Mom... saving Brother is more important now.”","Then, Xu Anran and Madam Xu ran out in a panic. The host picked up the equipment and was surprised to find that the live-stream could be switched off now.","This matter was trending again, but this time, things took a 180-degree change.","Xu Anran was an A-list celebrity, after all. There were naturally many people paying attention to this matter. Although the Xu family spent a lot of money to suppress the trending topics, they still could not suppress the criticisms from everyone.","Xu Anran’s expression was ugly. It was fine. She would apologize in two days. Everyone would forget about this matter after a while. The most important thing now was to save her brother.","However... the Xu family’s business might be affected.","Qiao Xi had caused huge trouble and caused the Xu family to be in such a mess. Her parents would definitely hate her. If they knew that Qiao Xi was their biological daughter, they would have no reason to acknowledge her.","Two days later.","Xu Anran posted an apology video on Weibo. In the video, she kept apologizing with teary eyes. Coupled with the fans clearing her name and the Xu family spending a lot of money, the matter gradually calmed down.","Qiao Xi took a look at the video. “Tsk tsk... As expected of an actress! Look at how pitifully she’s crying. She looks like she’s about to die! She’s just trying to say that her manager was the one who wanted her to fight for this role, and the matter of Xu Anyi getting his people to commit murder has nothing to do with her. She wants to say that she’s still that pure and flawless goddess in her fans’ eyes, huh?","“Her brother is still at the police station! How dare she say such things?”.","Qiao Xi knew very well that the evidence was sufficient now. As long as she did not forgive Xu Anyi, he could not come out. Even if the Xu family was rich and powerful, they could not openly snatch someone from the police station. However, how could the Xu family, a wealthy family, tolerate such a family scandal?","Qiao Xi had just come downstairs when she saw Gu Zheng instructing Song Shijing on something. His eyes were cold, and Song Shijing nodded with a serious expression before turning to leave.","Gu Zheng stood up and walked in front of her. His voice was low. “I have something to tell","you.”","Qiao Xi shook her head. “Forget it. I don’t want to hear about the Xu family. I’m annoyed. I want to send that kid from the Xu family to jail. It’s useless no matter what anyone says. Since he dared to get people to kill me, I won’t let him off!”","Gu Zheng smiled helplessly. “Don’t be so angry. This matter has to do with you. You’ll want to know.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and became interested as well. “Are you trying to say that I have a relationship with the Xu family? Even if the Xu family and I are related by blood, I don’t intend to acknowledge them. After all, Xu Anran has already caused a huge ruckus. It’ll be awkward for me to acknowledge her now. Why should I rush over to make others dislike me?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent as he handed the document in his hand to Qiao Xi. There was a photo in it with two women who looked similar. “Mom?”","Qiao Xi was surprised. This was indeed a photo of her mother when she was young, and the other woman who looked very similar to her mother was... Madam Xu?","“The people in the photo are your mother, Xia Yunqiu, and Madam Xu, Xia Yunlou. They’re biological sisters from the same father and mother. They’re from the Xia family of Luo City. They’re a legendary top family. Rumor has it that the Xia family has two devastatingly beautiful daughters, but the two of them have never appeared together. The Xia family dotes on these two daughters very much. They didn’t even reveal their names before they got married.","“After that, Xia Yunlou married into the Xu family. However, the eldest daughter of the Xia family went missing. The Xia family kept it a secret and never released news of it. They only announced to the public that the eldest daughter was bedridden and needed to rest.”","“However, your mother appeared in Li City later on. The Xia family didn’t go to look for her because everyone thought that the eldest daughter of the Xia family was recuperating in the Xia family.”","Qiao Xi’s gaze was slightly cold.","She suddenly felt that there must be a conspiracy behind this. Otherwise, why would her mother come to Li City with so many assets and marry Qiao Zhenguo?","Gu Zheng wanted to continue speaking when he suddenly felt a sharp pain in his eyes. His head felt heavy, and his vision suddenly darkened. Coincidentally, he was tripped by something on the floor and fell forward uncontrollably.","Qiao Xi immediately stretched out her hand to support him when she saw this scene, but because he was too tall, she lost her balance and fell with him."]},{"number":506,"title":"Chapter 506 - The Xu Family Wants To Talk","paragraphs":["At this moment, Qiao Xi was lying on Gu Zheng’s body. Her head was snuggled on Gu Zheng’s stomach. It was even to the extent that her head was sliding down. This scene could not be described in words.","The man took a deep breath and reached out to lift her up. His voice was low but slightly charming. “Mrs. Gu, are you helping me up? Or are you crushing me?” Qiao Xi blushed in embarrassment. “...”","assm","She really did not mean anything else. She just wanted to support Gu Zheng, but she did not expect to lie on Gu Zheng’s body in such an embarrassing position.","She thought carefully and seemed to have bumped into something just now. Her face turned redder and redder. Then, she shook her head and said with a righteous expression, “I didn’t do it on purpose!”","“Yes, Mrs. Gu, you always use this excuse. You should change your excuse next time!”","Qiao Xi was just about to retort when she suddenly recalled the embarrassing scenes from before. She would indeed say that she did not do it on purpose every time, even calling it a misunderstanding. In short, it was just an excuse.","However, she really did not do it on purpose this time. She just wanted to help him up.","The air was quiet at this moment, and she was still lying on Gu Zheng’s body. When she realized that something was wrong and was about to get up, Song Shiyu suddenly came in. “President! President, didn’t you tell me to keep an eye on the Xu family? I—”","Song Shiyu was petrified when he saw this scene.","He stood on the spot in a daze for a few seconds before hurriedly covering his eyes. His voice was filled with panic. “I didn’t see anything! Please go on! Pretend you didn’t see","me!”","Gu Zheng: “...","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘Go on, my foot! Song Shiyu, can you not think so much?!’","She stood up from Gu Zheng immediately and cleared her throat. “Song Shiyu.”","“Ah? Young Madam, I’m leaving. You don’t have to care about me. I really didn’t see anything. I won’t tell anyone either. I know it feels thrilling to do it in the living room, but you should at least lock the door! i’ll go out now. Continue!”","Qiao Xi was so angry that she was speechless. At this moment, the man straightened his clothes and sat on the sofa. He said indifferently, “Song Shiyu.” The next second, Song Shiyu rushed to Gu Zheng and smiled obsequiously. “President, I’m here! Please tell me what to do!”","Qiao Xi: “...” Why did she feel that she was the third party while Song Shiyu and Gu Zheng were the couple?","After a short moment, Qiao Xi smiled. “The Xu family wishes to talk to me?”","Gu Zheng replied casually, “You’ve never been willing to settle matters privately. Xu Anyi is still locked in the police station, so the Xu family is anxious and wants to talk to you about the price for letting him go.”","Qiao Xi was expressionless. She supported her chin with one hand and tapped the table with the other. Her gaze was extremely cold, making Song Shiyu tremble with fear.","“In that case, let’s meet them. Senior, I won’t go easy on them just because they’re my biological parents. Previously, when I thought that Qiao Zhenguo was my father, I didn’t let him off, let alone these strangers from the Xu family.","“Do they think that I’ll forgive Xu Anran and Xu Anyi if they say that I’m their biological daughter? How laughable!”","She stood up. “Where’s the Xu family?”","Song Shiyu said, “The Xu family has looked into getting your address. They probably think you’re living in the old district, so they might go there directly.”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “Alright, I understand.”","Song Shiyu reminded her at once. “Young Madam, Young Madam! Calm down. The Xu family is related to you by blood, after all. It won’t be good if someone dies. Although they’re ruthless and vicious, you can’t be too harsh on them. Give them some face!","Ruthless and vicious? Song Shiyu’s description was very accurate!","Song Shijing also said, “Young Madam, the Xu family already knew that their biological daughter was stranded outside a few years ago, but for the sake of the Xu family’s reputation and Xu Anran, they never looked for her. They must have come to Li City to look for you for a reason. Young Madam, you have to be careful not to be deceived by them.”","Qiao Xi’s expression was composed. “It’s fine. They don’t have the ability to do that.”"]},{"number":507,"title":"Chapter 507 - Persuade Her To Settle","paragraphs":["A few years ago, they knew that their biological daughter had gone missing, but they never looked for her. Now that they had suddenly appeared, there must be some secret to it!","They could give up their biological daughter for Xu Anran. Could it be that they had finally thought things through?","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up, revealing her white teeth. Then, she smiled in embarrassment. “Song Shiyu, you think too highly of me. I’m so weak. The Xu family is here to acknowledge me. How could I possibly kill someone?! I won’t be so violent!”","Song Shiyu: “...”","It was fine if Young Madam did not smile while saying that, but when she did, it was even scarier.","Perhaps he should send someone to protect the Xu family. If Young Madam could not suppress her anger and killed one or two of them, it would be difficult to handle. After all, the Xu family was a reputable family in Luo City.","Moreover, the Xu family had Xu Anyi, who was after Young Madam. If Young Madam was angered...","A day ago.","The Xu family was burning with anxiety. They had spent a lot of money looking for connections, but they could not get Xu Anyi out. Madam Xu and Xu Anran sat on the sofa and cried.","Xu Anran’s face was filled with self-reproach. “It’s all my fault. It’s my fault. If it weren’t for me, Brother... He wouldn’t have gone to look for trouble with Qiao Xi and wouldn’t have been captured.”","“My precious daughter! It’s not your fault! It’s all that b*tch Qiao Xi’s fault!”","Madam Xu comforted her at first, then shouted agitatedly, “I don’t believe that Qiao Xi dares to go against our Xu family. When Anyi comes out, I’ll definitely make her pay the price!”","At this moment, Mr. Xu entered.","Madam Xu stood up immediately, her eyes filled with anticipation. “How’s An Yi? When can he be released?”","Mr. Xu looked serious and said helplessly, “The police said that unless Qiao Xi agrees to settle, An Yi will be charged if she insists on pursuing the matter. Hiring someone to kill someone is no small matter!”","Madam Xu was burning with anger. “Qiao Xi! That little b*tch! Immediately... call her over. What right does she have to refuse to settle? I’ll kill her!”","“Calm down! Don’t you think this is enough? I’ll have a good talk with Qiao Xi and get her to agree to the settlement,” Mr. Xu said.","Madam Xu immediately asked, “What are we talking about? You want to pay her?”","Mr. Xu’s expression was serious as he said word by word, “Actually... Qiao Xi is our biological daughter. After she was taken away by Xia Yunqiu, she was brought into the Qiao family.” Boom!!!","Madam Xu widened her eyes and looked at him in disbelief.","Xu Anran looked at Madam Xu’s shocked expression and smiled proudly. Then, she pretended to be surprised and covered her mouth with her hand. Her voice trembled. “Ah! Miss Qiao... is actually Dad and Mom’s biological daughter. No wonder... No wonder she targeted me the first time we met. It’s my fault. I shouldn’t have fought with her. It’s okay. As long as she’s willing to come back, I can apologize.” Mr. Xu said affectionately, “I’ve found out her current address. Let’s go talk to her and get her to agree to a settlement. We’ll get Anyi out as soon as possible. Get ready.”","Xu Anran’s tears trickled down her face. She looked sad. “Dad, I... I’m not going. Sister... She doesn’t like me. I’m occupying the position of the eldest daughter of the Xu family. She probably... doesn’t want to see me.”","“Anran!” Before Mr. Xu could say anything, Madam Xu retorted, “You’re the eldest daughter of the Xu family. What does that have to do with her?!”","“Mom, actually... I once thought that if you found your biological daughter, I would leave the house.” Xu Anran choked and said, “I really wish I’m your biological daughter, but I’m not related to you by blood. If my sister doesn’t want to come home because of me, how can I feel at ease? So... it’s better for me to leave.”","“Anran! Don’t go!”","Madam Xu’s heart ached. Then, she said angrily to Mr. Xu, “I don’t want Qiao Xi! She’s not my daughter! She’s just a wild girl. She hasn’t even acknowledged her ancestors yet and has already caused such a mess in the Xu family. If she returns to the Xu family, who knows what will happen to the family?!","“Look at how the internet is scolding Anran! Your son was also captured by Qiao Xi and is suffering in the police station now. Could it be that you still want to acknowledge Qiao Xi?”"]},{"number":508,"title":"Chapter 508 - Xu Family’s Visit","paragraphs":["Madam Xu was about to explode with anger. Mr. Xu frowned. “If we don’t acknowledge Qiao Xi, how are we going to save our son? How are we going to make her agree to settle?”","Madam Xu choked, and her face turned red.","At this moment, Xu Anran wiped her tears and said softly, “It’s better to acknowledge my younger sister... Actually, I... have always wanted a younger sister. Besides, she’s my parents’ flesh and blood. It’s not appropriate for her to be left outside.”","Madam Xu did not expect Xu Anran to say such words. Her heart ached even more. “My precious Anran is so obedient. She takes the overall situation into consideration. But we’re afraid that you’ll suffer.”","Mr. Xu sighed. “No matter what, we have to go. Even if we don’t acknowledge Qiao Xi, we should thank your sister, Yunqiu. Back then, it was she who saved Qiao Xi and brought that child to live in Li City. Now that we’ve finally found Yunqiu’s whereabouts, it’s time to give the Xia family an explanation.","“Moreover, didn’t the patriarch say that we must bring Qiao Xi back? If we don’t acknowledge her, it’ll be equivalent to disobeying the patriarch’s orders.”","Madam Xu’s heart trembled. She was indeed too agitated just now. After calming down, she also felt that it was inappropriate. Hence, she said hatefully, “Alright! It’s fine to let her return to the Xu family, but the title of Eldest Miss Xu has to be Anran’s! Qiao Xi is just a wild girl. Even if she returns to the Xu family, she shouldn’t even think about stealing Anran’s limelight. It’s already her blessing that she can return to the Xu family.”","Xu Anran said, “Mom, but she’s...”","“What’s the use of being my biological daughter?! I don’t have any feelings for her, and she even caused so much trouble before she returned to the Xu family. I think she’s a jinx. She’s not worthy to be my daughter. Even if she returns to the Xu family, I won’t admit that she’s my biological daughter!”","Xu Anran lowered her eyes and smiled coldly.","As expected, her mother would not accept Qiao Xi. After all, Qiao Xi had already hurt the Xu family and even caused her brother to be taken away. Even if Qiao Xi were to return to the Xu family, her mother would not be able to accept her.","At this moment, Qiao Xi had returned to her secret base. It was where she carried out her activities as Black Tide. It was an old estate. Although it was small and dilapidated, it was filled with people from all walks of life.","The Xu family finally found this place. After they got out of the car, they were truly shocked. They did not expect Qiao Xi to live in such a shabby place.","Xu Anran frowned. The road in this district was too narrow, so the car could not drive in. They could only get out of the car and walk in. However, it had just rained the day before, so the road was filled with muddy water. Her sheepskin heels would be completely ruined if they came into contact with water.","Madam Xu, who was at the side, suppressed her anger. Her face was gloomy as she felt that her daughter had embarrassed her. She could only grumble in a low voice, “I really didn’t expect my daughter to live in such a shabby place! It’s too embarrassing! If she returns to the Xu family, I don’t know how outsiders will mock our Xu family.”","The socialites of high society had to receive etiquette lessons and top-notch education since they were young. This was because they represented the family’s reputation. If outsiders knew that the Xu family’s daughter grew up in such a place and was vulgar, how would Madam Xu have the cheek to attend banquets in the future?","Madam Xu lowered her head. If it were not for her son, she would never have come to such a place. The few of them slowly went upstairs. The stairwell was narrow, and because it had been neglected for years, the cement stairs had already cracked. Every step they took felt like they were stepping on a large rock. They walked slowly. Mr. Xu was so tired that his forehead was covered in sweat. He confirmed the address and knocked on the door.","Qiao Xi, who was in the room, heard the knock on the door and smiled meaningfully. Then, she closed the computer and stood up to open the door with a surprised expression. “Madam","Xu?”","A moment later.","Qiao Xi asked with a calm expression, “Mr. and Madam Xu, are you saying that I’m your long-lost biological daughter? I was replaced by the Xu family’s enemy? That person was afraid of being discovered, so they found a child of similar age to replace me? You came to Li City to look for me?”","Madam Xu suppressed her anger and did not say anything","Mr. Xu looked up at the small house in front of him. He endured the annoyance in his heart and said gently, “We just found out that our child was replaced, so we followed the traces and came to Li City. There have been some conflicts between you and Anran, but it’s all a misunderstanding.”"]},{"number":509,"title":"Chapter 509 - Revealing Her True Colors","paragraphs":["“Yunqiu is Yunlou’s sister. After you were replaced, it was Yunqiu who found you and saved you. I wanted to bring you back, but I didn’t expect to be chased after by my enemies all the time. I didn’t dare to expose myself, so I stayed in Luo City.","“Actually, I’ve been looking for Yunqiu all these years. I didn’t expect her to...”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and looked at the three of them coldly. “So I’m not Mom’s daughter but Madam Xu’s?”.","A trace of impatience flashed through Madam Xu’s eyes, but for the sake of her son, she controlled her temper. “Yes, since you already know, quickly come back with us.","Mr. Xu said, “You’re the daughter of the Xu family now. You should call Yunqiu your aunt. We’re your biological parents. Although Yunqiu raised you, you have to admit your identity.”","Qiao Xi’s gaze was deep.","The Xu couple did not really want to look for her. A few years ago, they knew that their biological daughter was wandering outside, but they were unwilling to look for her. Now that they were here to reunite with her, their eyes were filled with unwillingness and disdain.","It was as if it was her blessing that they were willing to accept her. She had to accept it gratefully. However, Qiao Xi had never intended to acknowledge them. Hence, she slowly said, “I heard that Madam Xu only has one daughter. If I’m your biological daughter, then is Miss Xu Anran the one who was swapped by your enemy?”","The atmosphere instantly became extremely awkward.","Xu Anran’s body trembled as she leaned against Madam Xu and cried aggrievedly.","Madam Xu’s heart ached extremely. She hurriedly pulled Xu Anran into her embrace and roared with an impatient expression, “Although Anran isn’t my biological daughter, she grew up by our side since she was young. She’s like our biological daughter. Qiao Xi,","you...”","At this point, Madam Xu suddenly felt that something was wrong. She was here to reconcile with Qiao Xi. If she angered her and Qiao Xi refused to go back with them in a fit of anger, what would Anyi do? Hence, her tone immediately became gentle. “Xi Xi, it has indeed been hard on you all these years. Come home with Dad and Mom. We’ll treat you well, alright?”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Treat me well?”","Madam Xu was a little guilty and immediately lowered her eyes to hide her emotions. “Of course. Why would I lie to you? Be good and come back with us.”","As she spoke, her eyes suddenly turned red. She thought of her sister who died in a foreign land, and her eyes were filled with sorrow.","“We came all the way here to look for you because we wanted to bring you back to the Xu family and treat you well, but Xi Xi, I’m not just your mother. I’m also Anyi’s mother. He’s your biological brother, but he was arrested and sent to the police station. He can’t stay there forever.”","Had she finally revealed her true agenda?","Qiao Xi sneered. If she were just an ordinary girl who had suffered a lot outside and her biological parents were finally here to bring her out of misery but she realized that her parents not only did not like her but even hated her, would she be sad?","The Xu couple only wanted to achieve their goal and did not consider their biological daughter’s feelings at all. They just wanted to use her feelings to make her relent and reconcile with them so that they could save Xu Anyi.","This family was really disgusting!","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up while her eyes were filled with ridicule. “Alright, I’ll go back with you.”","Song Shiyu, who was listening in the corner, was speechless. It was over. The Xu family was definitely going to suffer.","Song Shiyu knew that the Xu couple had ulterior motives. They said that they wanted to reunite with Young Madam, but in fact, they wanted to save their son who attempted murder. If their son was not arrested, they would have pretended not to know where their biological daughter was.","If Young Madam was just a helpless young lady who really returned to a dark family like the Xu family, where she would have to face her scheming parents and vicious siblings, how would she survive?","Song Shiyu thought about it carefully and shuddered. He took a few photos and sent them to Gu Zheng.","(President, Young Madam is going back with the Xu family. She clearly knows that the Xu family has ulterior motives, yet she still agreed to go back with them. She even agreed to reconcile with them. Young Madam is too kind! Boo-hoo...)","Before he could finish typing, Song Shiyu’s phone rang"]},{"number":510,"title":"Chapter 510 - Am I Not Worthy Of Taking The Xu Family’s Car?","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi had sent a voice message with a fierce tone: (Keep Xu Anyi locked. He wants to come out without my permission? I’m being kind enough by not killing him!]","Song Shiyu: “...”","He was joking just now. Young Madam was not kind at all. Anyone who went against her would not have a good ending.","Qiao Xi did not actually live here, so she had nothing to take. She was about to get into the Xu family’s car when an awkward situation happened.","When they arrived, the chauffeur was driving. Mr. Xu was sitting in the front passenger seat while Madam Xu and Xu Anran were sitting in the back. It was impossible for socialites like them to squeeze in the back with someone else. It would be embarrassing for them.","After Madam Xu got into the car, she suddenly realized that Anran was standing there at a loss. She realized that the backseat had always belonged to her and Anran. How could she let Qiao Xi sit there? She was stunned for a few seconds, then hurriedly waved her hand. “Anran, get in the car! Xi Xi, wait for a moment. I’ll get the chauffeur to come...”","Before she could finish speaking, Qiao Xi got into the car and sat in the backseat. She closed the door and left Xu Anran outside.","Xu Anran’s face turned pale. Madam Xu gasped and glared at Qiao Xi unhappily. “What are you doing?”","Qiao Xi had an innocent expression. “What’s wrong?”","Madam Xu was angry. “Why don’t you know how to be humble at all? I asked Anran to get in the car first. Why are you here? Hurry up and get down!”","Qiao Xi had a puzzled expression. “Didn’t you ask me to go back with you? Why would you leave me here alone? Are you sure you want me to go down?","“Moreover, I’m your biological daughter, the legitimate daughter of the Xu family. Why are you chasing your biological daughter out of the car but letting your adopted daughter sit inside? Could it be that you don’t have any feelings for me at all? Or do you think I’m not worthy of sitting in the Xu family’s car?” Qiao Xi said weakly, “Could it be that you weren’t looking for your biological daughter to acknowledge me? You just want me to agree to reconcile with you guys so that you can save Xu","Anyi?”","It was quiet in the car.","Xu Anran lowered her eyes and said aggrievedly, “Sister is right. I’m just an adopted daughter. I shouldn’t fight with her for a seat in the car. I...”","“Madam Xu, look at how obedient your adopted daughter is. Even if she gets into the car, she’ll definitely feel guilty about it. You can’t bear to see her blame herself, right? Then, I’ll have to trouble you to wait here for a while. Let’s go!”","Qiao Xi leaned lazily and smiled at Xu Anran. “It’s been hard on you. Wait a while. After all, I’m the family’s biological daughter!”","Xu Anran gritted her teeth: “...”","This b*tch!","Xu Anran was wearing a high-end dress and a pair of sheepskin heels. She stood at the entrance of the old district like a celebrity. The surrounding people would look at her strangely from time to time.","She suppressed the anger in her heart and forced a smile but looked like she was about to cry. “Mom, it’s okay. You guys can go home first. I... I’ll wait for the chauffeur to pick me up.”","Madam Xu’s eyes were filled with heartache. Her baby, Anran, was so obedient. How could Qiao Xi bear to bully her like this?","As expected, her wild daughter was vulgar and could only embarrass the Xu family! At this moment, the car was speeding along the road. The chauffeur was trembling with fear, afraid that the Xu couple would take their anger out on him. Only Qiao Xi had a calm expression as she leaned back in her seat with a satisfied expression.","20 minutes later, the car stopped. The chauffeur said carefully, “Sir, Madam, we’re here.”","After Qiao Xi got out of the car, a luxurious villa greeted her eyes.","Previously, when Xu Anran was live-streaming, she had seen the villa. Hence, she had an impression of it.","Seeing Qiao Xi get out of the car, the Xu family’s servants were a little confused. Madam Xu did not introduce her but said indifferently, “Xi Xi, you’ll stay here in the future. I’ve already instructed someone to clean your room.”","Not long after, Xu Anran returned to the Xu family in another car.","She walked in elegantly and pretended to be the host. “Xi Xi, it seems that you’ve just arrived as well. You’re new to the villa and shouldn’t be too familiar with it. How about I take you on a tour?”","Xu Anran walked in front of her with a gentle expression. Her raised head and the high-end dress she was wearing showed her status as a top socialite."]},{"number":511,"title":"Chapter 511 - Confronting Xu Anran","paragraphs":["Xu Anran’s eyes were cold. Although Qiao Xi was wearing ordinary clothes, her temperament was extraordinary. Her appearance and eyebrows were not similar to her mother’s, but she was very similar to her mother’s devastatingly beautiful and talented sister, Xia Yunqiu.","covered in dirt.","Xu Anran suddenly felt jealous. She restrained the emotions in her heart and pretended to be enthusiastic. “Xi Xi, welcome home. We can live together in the future.”","Qiao Xi was speechless. Her tone made it seem as if she was the one who was adopted. Was it her blessing that the Xu family could accept her?","Her expression was indifferent as she sneered. “Heh! You want me to live with you? Xu Anran, you’re not a daughter of the Xu family, so why","to the Xu family. I’m the eldest daughter of the Xu family. Could it be that... you still want to stay in the Xu family?”","As soon as she finished speaking, she entered the living room like a gust of cold wind. The servants immediately lowered their heads in fear. Only then did they realize that this unfamiliar lady was the biological daughter the Xu family came to Li City to look for.","Xu Anran was not the real daughter of the Xu couple.","When Madam Xu heard these words, she instantly said hatefully, “Qiao Xi, what are you talking about? You’re back, but why do you have to ask Anran to leave? Anran has been living in the Xu family for so many years, after all. She’s your sister. In the future, you have to respect her. Don’t bring the shameless behavior you learned from outside to the Xu family!”","Qiao Xi had an innocent expression. “Shameless behavior? How am I shameless? Madam Xu, you already said that I’m your biological daughter. Xu Anran is someone who replaced me after she was swapped. Moreover, I heard that Xu Anran is only the daughter of a servant!”","Madam Xu was infuriated.","Qiao Xi remained calm. “I’ve already returned to the Xu family, so Sister Anran should return to her biological parents. Could it be that Madam Xu thinks that Sister Anran will forever be the eldest daughter of the Xu family? Could it be that just because the Xu family is rich, she has to abandon her biological parents and pretend not to know anything?”","Madam Xu was so angry that her face turned red, but she did not know how to retort.","Before Madam Xu could speak, Qiao Xi nodded. “So, this is how the Xu family educates their children. Anran doesn’t need to care about her parents’ lives or deaths. There’s no need for her to show filial piety to her parents. She should just stay in the Xu family and be the eldest daughter, right?” Madam Xu was so angry that she almost vomited blood. This little b*tch was really sharp-tongued! Xu Anran shed tears aggrievedly. “If you want to chase me away, then I...” “Anran!” Madam Xu shouted anxiously, then her tone became gentle. “Xi Xi, although Anran is not our biological daughter, she has been by my side for so many years. We have feelings for each other, so we plan to take her in as our adopted daughter. The two of you must get along well in the future.” Xu Anran’s eyes were filled with tears. “Sister, I really just want to stay by Dad and Mom’s side. I won’t snatch anything from you. Everything that happened before was a misunderstanding. I’ll let you have your way in the future. I don’t want Mom to be sad, so don’t make a scene, alright?”.","When Xu Anran approached, her eyes revealed a trace of provocation.","How was it? Was Qiao Xi very angry?","‘So what if you’re Dad and Mom’s biological daughter? So what if you’re back? The person Dad, Mom, and Brother dote on is still me. Your appearance won’t change anything.’","Xu Anran was actually looking forward to Qiao Xi getting angry. As long as Qiao Xi made a scene, everyone would think that she was unreasonable and not worthy to be the eldest daughter of the Xu family.","Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi smiled lightly. “Sure!”","The smile on Xu Anran’s face froze as she looked at her in disbelief.","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “Miss Xu, I’m not fooling around. I’m just stating the facts. Since you’re already the adopted daughter of the Xu family and Dad and Mom have agreed to let you stay here, I naturally won’t object. It’s just one more person to feed. The Xu family’s big business doesn’t lack this bit of money. We’ll just take care of you!”","“...” Xu Anran was instantly infuriated.","Her anger surged, and she took a few deep breaths to suppress her anger. After calming down, she said, “Sister, I’ll bring you around now.”","Qiao Xi nodded. “Alright.”"]},{"number":512,"title":"Chapter 512 - The Yin Family In Shengdu","paragraphs":["At Gu Corporation.","Gu Zheng was holding his phone and watching the video. He had installed a surveillance camera on Qiao Xi’s necklace, so he could completely see what Qiao Xi was seeing at this moment.","The man smiled lightly. The Xu family had schemed against the wrong person this time. Qiao Xi was not a kind person.","Moreover... the matter of Xu Anyi getting his bodyguards to kill Qiao Xi was not over yet!","Just then, Song Shijing knocked on the door and came in to report about work. He then said seriously, “President, I’ve already investigated the Xia sisters, but many things have been hidden by the Xia family.”","“Yeah.”","“However, I’ve also found some clues. Actually, Madam Xu and her sister, Xia Yunqiu, didn’t have a good relationship. They weren’t as close as the rumors said. Although they were biological sisters, they didn’t live together when they were young.","“Madam Xu Yunlou grew up in the Xia family, while Madam Xia Yunqiu lived with her mother in the Yin family in Shengdu. After Madam Xia Yunqiu went missing, the Yin family has been searching for her. Unfortunately, Madam Xia Yunqiu died at a young age. The Yin family never found her.","“Xia Yunlou doesn’t like Young Madam but still wants to bring her back to the Xu family. I think it’s not just because of Xu Anyi. There might be other reasons. Otherwise, why would the entire family come to Li City?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. “The noble Yin family of Shengdu?”","At the Xu family’s villa.","Qiao Xi followed Xu Anran to her room and could not help but narrow her eyes.","Although she had never lived in a villa when she was young, she had been living in Longwan Residential after marrying Gu Zheng. Generally speaking, the second and third floors were where the owners and guests stayed. The basement was where the servants stayed. The Xu family coincidentally arranged for her to stay on the first and second floors.","Xu Anran said with a gentle expression, “Dad, Mom, I’ve already instructed someone to prepare a room and even decorated it personally. I think my sister will definitely like it.”","Mr. Xu and Madam Xu looked at her affectionately. “Anran is not only obedient but also meticulous.”","When they looked at Qiao Xi, they had an impatient expression. “If you need anything, tell the servants at home to prepare it for you. There are some rules to living here.”","Qiao Xi smiled and did not say anything. She followed Xu Anran to the room in the basement.","The Xu family’s villa was very large, and there were many rooms in the basement. Qiao Xi’s room was in the corner of the basement. Although it was a little remote, the Xu family felt that it was much better than the place Qiao Xi used to live in.","Xu Anran pushed open the door. As the room was in the basement, the lights were switched on. However, the lights were very dim, making one feel very depressed. Who would have thought that the Xu family’s biological daughter would be asked to stay in such a room?","Xu Anran chuckled and said, “Sister, Nanny Li’s room is next door. If you need anything, just look for her.”","“Nanny Li?”","Xu Anran replied, “Yes, Nanny Li is an old servant of ours.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. The adopted daughter was staying in the largest room in the villa, but the biological daughter was only worthy of staying in the basement?","Xu Anran arranged her room here for her own selfish reasons. However, the Xu couple also tacitly agreed. This meant that this family did not take her seriously at all.","No family with a good upbringing would let a rich young miss stay on the same floor as the servants. If news of this went out, wouldn’t it be embarrassing for the Xu family? However, the Xu family felt that all of this was reasonable. It seemed that agreeing to let Qiao Xi stay in the Xu family was already a great show of kindness. Xu Anran curled her lips. “Sister, do you like it here? But don’t bring your things in. Mom said that the place you used to live in is too dirty. She’s afraid that there would be germs, so she got someone to throw everything out. You won’t mind, right?” Qiao Xi sneered.","Xu Anran thought that someone like her who came from the slums would definitely agree excitedly if she suddenly had a clean and spacious room.","However, what right did Xu Anran have to be so arrogant? In terms of blood relations, Qiao Xi was the biological daughter of the Xu family.","Qiao Xi smiled. “It’s alright, but I still want to see other rooms.”","Xu Anran’s expression froze as she panicked. “This place is so nice! What’s there to see?”","Qiao Xi had an innocent expression. “Can’t I? Didn’t you say that I can change rooms if I’m not satisfied? Could it be that you were just saying it?” “Uhh... sure!”"]},{"number":513,"title":"Chapter 513 - I Want Your Room!","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi rolled her eyes at her. “Then what are you waiting for? Let’s go!”","“...” Xu Anran’s face darkened.","This little b*tch was treating her as a servant. She was actually talking to her in a commanding tone.","Xu Anran was walking around the basement with Qiao Xi. They passed by a few empty rooms. “Sister, what do you think of these rooms?”","“Tsk tsk, why must I stay in the basement? Although I’ve never stayed in a villa, I know that the basement is where the servants stay. The second and third floors are where the owners stay. The Xu family is really strange. They actually like staying in the basement, huh?”","Xu Anran frowned. “Sister, you’ve misunderstood. Dad and Mom don’t stay in the basement. Do you want them to stay in the basement? That’s against the rules.”","Qiao Xi glanced at her coldly. “Oh, Dad and Mom aren’t willing to stay in the basement, so why do you want me to stay here? Could it be that you like staying in the basement?","“As the biological daughter of the Xu family, if I stay in the basement, doesn’t that mean that the Xu family likes to stay in the basement?”","The atmosphere instantly became awkward.","Qiao Xi said casually, “If the Xu family likes to stay in the basement, then bring me to see if there are any other good rooms here. In any case, I don’t like this one.","“How strange. A wealthy family likes to stay in the basement!”","Xu Anran’s expression was ugly as she hurriedly retorted, “Sister, what nonsense are you talking about? How could the Xu family like staying in the basement?”","Qiao Xi stopped in her tracks and sneered. “Since you don’t like it, why did you bring me to the basement? Do you think I’m not worthy of being the Xu family’s daughter, or are you jealous of my identity and want to target me, so you arranged for the real daughter of the Xu family to stay in the basement”","Xu Anran immediately choked: “...”","Qiao Xi blinked. “If that’s not the case, why did you arrange for me to stay here?”","Xu Anran’s eyes were cold. This little b*tch was really hard to deal with. It was already her blessing to be able to return to the Xu family. Was she still not satisfied?","Xu Anran suppressed her anger and gritted her teeth. “But... the rooms on the second floor are full.”","“Can’t I take a look?” Qiao Xi raised her eyes coldly. “Sister, you just said that you want to show me around the house. Why can’t I do it now?”","Xu Anran suppressed the anger in her heart and nodded. “Alright, alright. Sister, follow me.”","The two of them went upstairs.","The rooms on the second floor were bright and spacious, completely different from the ones in the basement.","Xu Anran pretended to be the host and introduced, “This is Dad and Mom’s bedroom, as well as the study and cloakroom. There are also two servants’ rooms here, so there’s really no room available on the second floor.”","Qiao Xi said casually, “It’s fine. Isn’t there a third floor?”","“Uh... This...” The corners of Xu Anran’s mouth twitched slightly, but she thought that even if Qiao Xi liked her room, she could not snatch it away. Her parents would definitely not agree.","Xu Anran said generously, “Then come upstairs with me, Sister.”","When the two of them reached the third floor, Qiao Xi went straight to a room.","The last time she watched the live broadcast, she knew that this was Xu Anran’s room. It was luxuriously decorated and looked like a princess’ residence. All the ornaments were extremely expensive. Even the most ordinary desk was specially customized and was worth more than 100,000 yuan. The room in the basement was completely different from this one. This was where the daughter of the Xu family should stay. It was obvious that the Xu couple doted on Xu Anran very much and treated her as their biological child.","Qiao Xi sized it up and praised in her heart that this room was luxuriously decorated. Its aesthetics were not bad, so she nodded. “This room will do!”","Xu Anran’s eyes widened abruptly. “Sister, this... This is my room! There were originally many rooms on the third floor, but Dad and Mom thought that my room was too small. They took down the rest of the rooms, turning them into a cloakroom and a study for me. The other room is occupied by my brother. There are no more rooms here.","“You want to stay in my room, but the things in my room can’t be moved out anytime soon, So...”","Qiao Xi directly interrupted her and said coldly, “Don’t you understand human language? I want this room!”","Xu Anran’s eyes turned red. “Sister, how could you...”"]},{"number":514,"title":"Chapter 514 - Successfully Snatched Xu Anran’s Room","paragraphs":["“What are you arguing about?!” At this moment, Mr. Xu and Madam Xu went upstairs. Madam Xu said impatiently, “Have you handled the matter of the room?”","Qiao Xi did not say anything. Xu Anran said aggrievedly, “Mom, Sister... she doesn’t like the room I decorated for her. She... She wants my room, but I...”","The Xu couple looked at each other, then glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. “Didn’t we already arrange a room for you? Why do you have to snatch your sister’s?”","Qiao Xi sneered. Xu Anran was still gnashing her teeth in anger just now, but she pretended to be weak in front of the Xu couple.","If she were just an ordinary child, she would definitely be sad because her parents despised her and might even leave the Xu family. However, she was Qiao Xi. She would make whoever wanted to deal with her pay the price.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes. “Madam Xu, do you really not agree to let me stay in this room?”","“Anran is so thoughtful. She arranged a room for you before you even came, but you want to steal her room instead! Why are you so insensible?!”","Madam Xu frowned. She felt that her biological daughter was really not modest.","Qiao Xi was helpless. “Alright, if you don’t want me to stay here, then forget it. I’ll go stay in the basement, but if news of this gets out and outsiders know that the Xu family’s biological daughter is staying in the basement, I don’t know what they’ll think of the Xu family.”","Madam Xu froze. Mr. Xu was confused, “Staying in the basement?”","Qiao Xi had an aggrieved expression. “Yes, the room my sister arranged for me is in the basement. Moreover, the servants’ rooms are all there too. My sister said that there are no empty rooms on the second and third floors. The empty rooms on the third floor have all been made into her dressing rooms, so I have to stay in the basement. I thought my parents knew about it. Otherwise, why wouldn’t they agree to let me stay in Xu Anran’s room?","“At first, I thought that my sister didn’t like me, so she arranged for me to stay in the basement behind my parents’ backs. It turns out you all know about it. Perhaps this is the Xu family’s rule. A biological daughter is only qualified to stay in the basement while an adopted daughter can stay on the spacious and bright third floor.","“Actually, it doesn’t matter where I stay, but if news of this gets out, it won’t be good for the Xu family’s reputation. It’ll make outsiders think that the Xu family’s upbringing isn’t strict. Since Dad and Mom think so, I’ll just stay in the basement.”","Mr. Xu quickly stopped her. “Wait!”","Mr. Xu glared at Xu Anran, then said seriously, “Anran, pack your things now. In the future, Xi Xi will be staying in this room!”","Xu Anran’s eyes instantly turned red as she shed tears aggrievedly. “Dad! Alright! i’ll move out now.”","This damned Qiao Xi! She had been gone for 20 years. What right did she have to snatch away what belonged to her the moment she returned?","She snatched her room as soon as she came. Wouldn’t she go overboard in the future?","Madam Xu’s heart ached as she advised, saying, “Xi Xi, there’s no empty room upstairs. You can just stay in the basement for the time being. It’s much better than the room you used to stay in, anyway. Why are you...”","Madam Xu did not think that there was anything wrong with letting Qiao Xi stay in the basement. Instead, she thought that she was very suitable. After all, she came from the slums.","“The basement is indeed better than the old neighborhood I lived in, but...”","Qiao Xi paused for a moment and continued, “But I’m the daughter of the Xu family now. If I hadn’t been swapped back then, I would have been the one staying in this room. Madam Xu, you wouldn’t even have known Xu Anran, yet you think that I’m not worthy of living in this room? Then do you think Xu Anran is worthy?","“She’s just an adopted daughter, but she’s staying in the largest and most luxurious room in the entire villa. I’m your biological daughter, but I have to stay in the basement. Do you think that’s appropriate?","“The Xu family is a noble family, after all. If others find out that the Xu family doesn’t care about status, aren’t you afraid of being mocked by the other families in high society? Aren’t you afraid that the company’s interests will be affected?”","Everyone frowned.","Madam Xu gritted her teeth and raised her hand with the intention of slapping Qiao Xi.","Mr. Xu quickly grabbed her hand and stopped her. “Xi Xi is right. Anran, how could you arrange for your sister to stay in the basement? You can’t be so unruly in the future!”","Xu Anran was already angry. Hearing her father scolding her, her tears began to fall."]},{"number":515,"title":"Chapter 515 - The Xu Family Is Truly Ridiculous!","paragraphs":["Mr. Xu said seriously, “Xi Xi, you’re right. If outsiders find out about this, they’ll definitely laugh at our Xu family for being unruly. Wouldn’t that be embarrassing for the Xu family?!”","Madam Xu was still unconvinced. “What are you afraid of? They don’t even know that Qiao Xi is our biological daughter. Why should Anran suffer?”","Qiao Xi sneered. Look at this, this was her biological mother. She was so biased toward Xu Anran in front of her.","It was because she led a life outside of the family and did not receive any etiquette guidance. Xu Anran was a top socialite raised by Madam Xu, so she was unwilling to acknowledge her biological daughter?","Mr. Xu said sternly, “Although everyone thinks that Xi Xi is our adopted daughter now, letting her stay in the basement with the servants is not the Xu family’s upbringing. “You have to know how developed the internet is now. A small matter can spread like wildfire. If others find out that we let Xi Xi stay in the basement, they’ll say that we abused our daughter! They’ll even say that Anran is jealous.”","Hearing that Xu Anran would be affected as well, Madam Xu did not retort anymore.","Qiao Xi leaned against the wall and looked at Xu Anran provocatively. “Sister, quickly move your things!” Xu Anran sobbed and looked at her with red eyes. “You...”","“You what?! Hurry up and pack up. I want to move in!” Qiao Xi sized up the room. “Take all your things with you, or I’ll throw them away later. If you lose anything, don’t blame me!”","Xu Anran was so angry that she gritted her teeth. “Alright, I’ll... pack my things up now.”","“Mr. and Mrs. Xu.” Qiao Xi suddenly thought of something. “Earlier, Xu Anran said that there are no more rooms on the second and third floors, so she asked me to stay in the basement. If Miss Xu still stays upstairs after moving out, doesn’t that mean that she was deliberately targeting me just now?”","Xu Anran was so angry that her face turned red.","Did Qiao Xi want her to stay in the basement?","Mr. Xu frowned and turned to leave unhappily.","When Madam Xu saw that he had left, she immediately roared angrily, “Qiao Xi! Are you done? Nothing good has happened since you appeared. You’re just a wild girl. What right do you have to compete with Anran?! Anran, stop crying and leave with me!”","Xu Anran nodded and stopped in her tracks before turning around. “Sister, don’t blame our parents. If you want to blame someone, blame me. Mom only said that for my sake. I only hope that you can stop fooling around for the sake of our family’s harmony. Let’s get along well, alright?”","Qiao Xi rolled her eyes and closed the door fiercely.","She looked around the room and really liked it the more she looked at it. Then, she instructed the servants to throw Xu Anran’s things out. Then, she lay on the bed comfortably.","Suddenly, a strange sound came from the window. Qiao Xi abruptly stood up. The man climbed in through the window and nimbly entered the bedroom. He scanned the room and said with a faint smile, “Mrs. Gu, you’re living very comfortably!”","Qiao Xi curled her lips. “Gu Zheng, you’re the dignified president of Gu Corporation, yet you climbed in from the window?”","The man’s expression was indifferent. “The Xu family went to pick someone up.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Is that so? Do you think Xu Anyi can come out?”","Xu Anyi got his bodyguards to kill her. The evidence was conclusive. If she sued him, Xu Anyi would definitely be put in jail. That was why the Xu family was so anxious to acknowledge her. If she admitted that this was just a joke between the siblings and she did not pursue the matter anymore, everything would be resolved.","Gu Zheng said casually, “They’ve proven that you’re the Xu family’s daughter and Xu Anyi is your brother. They claimed that the two of you were just joking around. With the Xu family’s help, Xu Anyi will indeed be released soon.”","Qiao Xi smiled. She knew that Gu Zheng definitely had a backup plan.","“However, I was in the car then.” Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully.","Qiao Xi suddenly reacted.","That was right, Gu Zheng was in the car too!","If Gu Zheng was unwilling to settle, Xu Anyi could not be released!","The man slowly approached her and reached out to touch her fair collarbone. His hand landed on her slender neck again as he looked at the necklace with the hidden camera.","He sneered. “The Xu family is really laughable!”","“How laughable, indeed! They just appeared and they already dare to take me down a notch. If I spread this news, will they still have the cheek to stay in high society?”"]},{"number":516,"title":"Chapter 516 - Justice For Her Granddaughter","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “Only Mr. Xu is considered a smart person in this family, but his good attitude toward me is also for the sake of the Xu family’s reputation. As for that Madam Xu, she’s really hopelessly stupid. Moreover, she’s filled with hostility toward me I really don’t understand.”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes.","Actually, he did not understand why the Xu couple doted on an adopted daughter more.","They were not happy that their biological daughter had returned home. Instead, they thought that she was a burden.","Perhaps it was because they felt that Qiao Xi was just a wild girl who had led a wandering life outside, while Xu Anran was a top socialite","Perhaps there was another reason.","Qiao Xi pursed her lips. “I have to find out about Mom, so I have to stay with the Xu family for a few days. Moreover, I realized that Madam Xu seems to have a secret!”","“Previously, the investigation showed that although Madam Xu and her sister didn’t grow up together, the two of them were biological sisters, after all. Their relationship was quite good. Back then, if it weren’t for Madam Xu’s sister, I wouldn’t know where I would have ended up. In other words, it was her sister who saved her biological daughter. Logically speaking, she should be grateful, but she doesn’t seem to think so.","“You’ve also investigated and found out that the Xia family is a noble family in Luo City. They’re a century-old family. Before their two daughters got married, they never stepped out of their houses. But look at Madam Xu’s shrewish appearance. Does she look like someone from such a family?”","Gu Zheng looked indifferent. “Mr. Shen and Madam Shen are here in Li City. It seems that they’re here because of you.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes instantly lit up. “They’re here!”","“They’re here to avenge you, so they’re holding a banquet and have invited the Xu family.”","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. The Xu family had not even gained any benefits from her yet, but her elder brother and the rest came to vent their anger?! However, she really looked forward to seeing the Xu family’s dejected expressions at the banquet.","At the Yin family’s residence in the capital.","“Madam, the Xu family has found their biological daughter.”","An elegant and noble old madam was half-leaning on a small couch. Her eyes were narrowed slightly, and she looked very pleased.","She opened her eyes. Although she was old, she had taken good care of herself. There were not many wrinkles on her face. “Have you found Yunlou’s child?”","The old madam’s eyes were red as her voice trembled. “After so many years, we’ve finally found that child. Hurry! Call the young master at home and follow me to Li City!”","The servant nodded and hesitated. “Old Madam, although Madam Yunlou has found her biological daughter... I heard that the Xu family doesn’t treat her well. They even arranged for her to stay in the basement and let their adoptive daughter stay in the largest and most luxurious room in the villa. Look at this...”","The old madam glared.","The servant took a deep breath and continued, “Madam Yunlou doesn’t even treat her biological daughter well. The Xia family is so biased. I wonder how they’re going to make things difficult for that child!”","The old madam’s face was filled with anger as she slammed the table. “This Yunlou! She’s really too much! I still can’t change her character. That’s her biological daughter! How can she be so insensible?! That little girl was lost the moment she was born., yet she can even bear to do this?”","The old madam was furious, and the servant was helpless. “Old Madam, I think Madam Yunlou doesn’t like that child not because she led a wandering life since she was young, nor because she despises the child for being uneducated and not like a top socialite. It’s because...","“It’s because after that child was swapped, she was saved by Eldest Madam.”","When the old madam heard these words, tears fell uncontrollably. “Yunqiu...”","into a family in Li City. Then, she died because of an illness. Young Miss lost her protection and was bullied by that man’s mistress and illegitimate daughter since she was young. She almost died in the hands of those two vicious women. After that, she finally found her biological parents but they still treated her badly. Sigh! My heart really aches!”","“I’ll go to Li City now!”","The old madam stood up abruptly with a gloomy expression. “That granddaughter of mine has finally returned home. Let’s see who still dares to bully her! Yunlou doesn’t know what’s good for her, so as the child’s grandmother, I have to stand up for her!”","The servant’s heart ached."]},{"number":517,"title":"Chapter 517 - The Pain Of Love","paragraphs":["The servants thought that Second Madam had completely cut off all contact with the old madam a few years ago. They originally thought that the old madam did not want to see her daughter anymore, but she was, after all, her biological daughter. How could she completely cut ties with her? After the old madam found out that Second Madam’s biological daughter went missing, she had been hoping to find her biological granddaughter. Now that she had finally found her, how could she not meet her?","Li City’s Xu family.","Xu Anran sat on the sofa with tears streaming down her face. She was trembling. Mr. Xu pointed at her and roared, “You idiot! It’s fine that you let your brother take revenge for you, but why didn’t you tell him that Gu Zheng was in the car? Getting people to kill Gu Zheng is equivalent to killing the Xu family!”","Madam Xu quickly shielded Xu Anran. “Stop shouting. What does this have to do with Anran? Anran didn’t ask Anyi to do it. Anyi wanted to stand up for his sister, so he sent his people to do the task. I say that Qiao Xi is to blame for this. If she hadn’t caused trouble, how could so many things have happened? How could Anyi have been arrested?”","“Anyi has been focusing on his job for the past 20 years and has never done anything wrong. He just happened to run into trouble when he encountered Qiao Xi. It’s all Qiao Xi’s fault!”","Qiao Xi sat in front of the table in the bedroom with a computer in front of her. The screen showed the surveillance footage from downstairs. When she heard their words, she could not help but sneer. Gu Zheng smirked. “Mrs. Gu, it’s against the rules to do this.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Who asked them to have ill intentions? I did this for the sake of protecting myself. After all, the Xu family harbors a criminal who hired people to kill me. Even though I wasn’t killed, I’m afraid. Is there a problem with installing a pinhole camera?”","The man took a few steps closer and smiled. “Mrs. Gu, do you want me to forgive the Xu family?”","Qiao Xi smiled slyly.","Gu Zheng instantly understood and said casually, “They’ll come and beg me soon. In order to avenge Mrs. Gu, of course, I won’t let go easily.”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up as she lowered her head in embarrassment.","Gu Zheng’s heart instantly felt warm. Mrs. Gu was always so cute. She would be so touched that she did not know what to do whenever he helped her.","The next second...","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and lifted her head arrogantly. “Don’t tell me you think you can move my heart just like that? Even without you, there are still many people who will help me vent my anger. You’re not the only one. I’m really too charming. I’m just so doted on by so many. It can’t be helped. Being too outstanding is also a flaw.”","Gu Zheng: “...”","The man was silent for a moment. He pursed his lips and sighed helplessly. “I’ll get Song Shiyu to stay here to protect you.” Qiao Xi pretended to be unwilling. “Ah Zheng, I’ll miss you!”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and looked at her smiling eyes. He could not help but smile gently. “Alright, I’ll miss you too.”","Qiao Xi waved at him. Just as she was about to leave, Gu Zheng reached out and pulled her into his embrace, scaring her into shouting.","She blushed. “What? I already said that I’ll miss you. After all, this is the first time we’ve been separated since we got married. If you really miss me, Ah Zheng, why don’t...”","1 ca","“Mrs. Gu, I’ll go back now. You can call me if you need anything.”","Qiao Xi instantly choked. “How can phone calls make up for the pain of missing you? Without me by your side, every day must feel like a year to you!”","She smiled slyly. “Why don’t-“.","“I’ll come again tomorrow.”","Qiao Xi’s face sank as she glared at Gu Zheng’s smiling eyes.","At this moment, even if he could not hear Qiao Xi’s thoughts, he could tell what she was thinking. She just wanted him to stay so that she could recover her taste buds again.","Gu Zheng smiled helplessly when he saw Qiao Xi frown and look troubled. “Alright.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and was slightly puzzled. She was just about to ask what ‘okay’ meant when she felt a warmth on her lips. “Rest well. The Xu family won’t look for trouble with you for the time being.’ Qiao Xi hurriedly picked up the apple on the table and took a bite. The sweetness was truly too wonderful. Her taste buds were finally recovered.","“I don’t think so. If the Xu family knows that you and I were in the same car, they might come looking for me directly and ask me to plead for Xu Anyi. They’ll definitely come looking for trouble with me.”"]},{"number":518,"title":"Chapter 518 - Even If You Can’t Kill, You Can Set Fire","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng was silent for a few seconds before smiling meaningfully. “You’ll know what’s going on in a while.”","Qiao Xi was puzzled.","She felt that Gu Zheng was hiding something!","Gu Zheng and Song Shiyu left the villa. They were about to leave when they heard rustling sounds in the Xu family’s villa. Then, Xu Anran could be heard sobbing. “Dad, don’t be angry anymore. It’s all my fault. I’m occupying the identity of the eldest daughter of the Xu family, making my sister unhappy. I’ll leave now!” Then, Madam Xu stopped her in a loud voice. “No! Anran, why are you the one leaving? Qiao Xi should be the one leaving!”","Mr. Xu’s face darkened. “Anyi hasn’t been released yet. Don’t provoke Qiao Xi. It’ll be","me if she changes her mind! Anran, go to the basement and suffer there for a while.”","an","“Dad!”","Mr. Xu was impatient. “You heard what Qiao Xi said. If you don’t go to the basement, then that means you were deliberately targeting her by making her stay in the basement. You’ll anger her. If she’s unhappy and goes to President Gu to complain about you, will your brother still have a chance of getting released?”","Madam Xu quickly shut up when she thought of her son who was suffering in the detention center.","Xu Anran sobbed. “Alright, I... I’ll move to the basement now. Dad, Mom, I really didn’t do it on purpose. I... I’m sorry.”","Gu Zheng turned to Song Shiyu. “Did you hear that?”","Song Shiyu looked up and hesitated for a moment before giving her a thumbs up. “Yes. Young Madam, is so capable!” Gu Zheng could not help but laugh. He was really curious about why the Song brothers were so stupid when they clearly came from the same womb. Hence, he reminded him, “Xu Anran is staying in the basement now. Don’t you get it?” Song Shiyu reacted abruptly and was excited. “You’re finally going to deal with Xu Anran, that scheming b*tch. President, how do you want her to die? I promise I won’t leave a trace!”","“...” Gu Zheng frowned. “I told you long ago not to keep talking about fighting and killing. Can you not be so violent?!” Song Shiyu scratched his head in embarrassment. He was no longer an adjutant, and Xu Anran was not an enemy on the battlefield. He really should not kill anyone.","Then, he asked obsequiously, “President, what should I do?”","Gu Zheng said slowly, “Even if you can’t kill, you can still set fire.”","Song Shiyu: “...”","‘You’re so noble and virtuous, huh? You said that I can’t fight and kill, but you want her to burn to her death!’","Xu Anran sat on the sofa in the living room and cried for a while. Then, she went to the basement pitifully. Madam Xu’s heart ached. “An An has been pampered since she was young. I can’t bear to see her suffer even a little. As soon as Xi Xi came back, she forced An An to stay in the basement... This child is really vicious. How could I have such a daughter?!”","Mr. Xu looked helpless.","Madam Xu was so sad that tears fell. “When I said that Xi Xi should stay in the basement, it was only a temporary arrangement. Our villa in Li City is not big, and there are no other empty rooms. However, as soon as we return to Luo City, I’d arrange a new room for her. However, Xi Xi insisted on snatching Anran’s room. She’s too insensible!”","“Someone! Help! Fire!”","Before Madam Xu could finish, the servants screamed in horror.","At this moment, Qiao Xi was watching a TV show upstairs when she heard a commotion coming from downstairs.","Fire?","If she did not hear wrongly, Xu Anran’s room was on fire. No wonder Gu Zheng said that they would not look for trouble with her. It turned out that he had found something for the Xu family to busy themselves with.","Qiao Xi smiled lightly and walked downstairs with her head held high.","In the living room, Xu Anran was crying in Madam Xu’s arms.","The servants hid in the corner and discussed softly. “This is retribution. Who asked her to target the real daughter of the Xu family? That’s why people can’t do bad things.”","The butler quickly berated, “Shut up!”","Although he did not allow everyone to discuss this matter, he agreed with the servants’ words. How did the basement catch on fire for no reason?","Moreover, the other rooms were not affected. It was just Xu Anran’s room. This might really be retribution. “What are you doing here? Are you here to see your sister make a fool of herself?! You don’t even care about your sister!” Madam Xu berated."]},{"number":519,"title":"Chapter 519 - Don’t Blame Me For Being Unrighteous","paragraphs":["Madam Xu watched as Xu Anran cried sadly, and her heart ached so much that tears kept falling. Unexpectedly, when she looked up, she saw Qiao Xi standing at the staircase with an indifferent expression. She was instantly infuriated.","“You’re a jinx. It’s all your fault! That room was originally yours, but you insisted on snatching Anran’s room and even forced her to stay in the basement. Anran was harmed by you!”","Everyone fell silent.","Nanny Li was an outsider and could not take it anymore. Although Second Miss had gone missing for 20 years, she was still the daughter of the Xu family. Moreover, the basement had suddenly caught on fire. Second Miss could not be blamed for this.","It was just that she was just a servant and did not dare to criticize Madam Xu. However, she was afraid that Qiao Xi would be wronged and was about to speak up for her","Qiao Xi suddenly had an aggrieved expression. “What does the fire in the basement have to do with me?! Could it be that it doesn’t matter if my room catches fire, but it matters if Xu Anran’s room catches fire? If Madam Xu, you have the time to push the blame on me but why can’t you send people to investigate the cause of the fire? Otherwise, the same incident will only happen again.","“By the way, Madam Xu, now that you mention it, you reminded me of something. That room was originally arranged for me by Xu Anran. Now, it suddenly caught on fire. Could it be that she tampered with the room and wanted to burn me alive? If that’s the case, the news of the adopted daughter murdering the biological daughter of the Xu family will blow up.”","After that, Qiao Xi said with a smile, “Fortunately, I wasn’t in the room. Sister Anran doesn’t have to bear the infamy of conspiring to kill the biological daughter of the Xu family.”","Xu Anran was so angry that her face turned red.","“You were the one who set the fire!” Madam Xu roared.","Qiao Xi had an innocent expression. “Madam Xu, what are you talking about? I’ve always been upstairs. Nanny Li and the other servants can testify. How could I have gone to the basement to set the fire?”","Nanny Li said firmly, “Madam, Second Miss has been upstairs all this time. She really didn’t go downstairs, much less the basement.”","Upon hearing this, everyone was indignant. Their adopted daughter’s room caught on fire, but the madam actually blamed her biological daughter. Moreover, everyone had seen with their own eyes that Second Miss had been in her room the entire time. How could the madam blame her for this?","Second Miss was right. This room was originally arranged for her by Eldest Miss. Perhaps she was jealous of Second Miss’ identity and tampered with the room. Unexpectedly, the room caught fire as soon as she entered. Second Miss could not be blamed for this. If Eldest Miss wanted to blame someone, she could only blame herself!","Qiao Xi glanced at the pair of mother and daughter, grunting coldly. “Continue crying, then. I won’t disturb you anymore.”","“You...”","Madam Xu’s expression was ferocious. “Qiao Xi! Even if you didn’t set the fire, it was you who caused the entire family to be unlucky. Before you came back, the house was always peaceful. As soon as you came home, you caused so much trouble. Now, Anran’s room even caught on fire! Perhaps something terrifying will happen in the future!”","Qiao Xi stopped in her tracks.","It was true that Gu Zheng was the one who was behind the fire, but he would never let anyone have a handle on him. Why did he have to set the room on fire so openly? If they found evidence, wouldn’t it be hard to explain?","There was only one reason for this. There was something wrong with that room from the very beginning. Xu Anran had deliberately put many flammable things in it when she arranged the room for her.","This sister was really scheming!","Since she was heartless, she could not blame Qiao Xi for being heartless as well.","Qiao Xi turned around and said coldly, “If Madam Xu insists that this fire is related to me, why don’t you just call the police and get them to investigate? Why did the basement catch fire for no reason?”","As soon as she finished speaking, a fireman walked over. “Madam Xu, we found flammable powder on the floor of the basement room. There are many flammable items in the corner as well. As long as the temperature in the room reaches a certain level, it’ll catch fire. Don’t scatter this powder on the floor in the future.","“This time, only this room was burned and no one was killed. But if you continue doing this, the entire villa will be engulfed in flames!”","Xu Anran’s expression froze.","Madam Xu was stunned for a moment, then she looked at Xu Anran in disbelief. “Anran,","you...”","“The person in charge has already said that. Who do you think had the chance to scatter flammable powder in the room? Moreover, there were a lot of flammable things piled up there. The truth is right in front of you. Whether you believe it or not, it’s up to you, Madam Xu!”"]},{"number":520,"title":"Chapter 520 - Eyes Full Of Personal Gains","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi stared coldly at Xu Anran. “This room was originally meant for me. If I really stayed there, even if I didn’t get burned to death, I would’ve been disfigured. Everything in the Xu family will then belong to you, the adopted daughter. Miss Xu, you’re really vicious!”","The servants were full of disdain.","Eldest Miss was too much. Fortunately, Second Miss did not stay in the basement. Otherwise, the consequences would have been unimaginable.","“I... I...”","Seeing Xu Anran stammering and looking guilty, Madam Xu understood. When Anran was setting up the room, she scattered the flammable powder on the floor and also put a lot of flammable things there. If Qiao Xi had stayed there, then...","No! Impossible! Anran was so gentle and kind. How could she do such a thing?","Even if Anran really did it, it was because Qiao Xi had provoked her first. In short, it was all Qiao Xi’s fault! Qiao Xi paid no further attention to them and turned around to go upstairs.","“Xi Xi.”","At this moment, a male voice sounded from behind.","Qiao Xi turned around. Mr. Xu had a serious expression on his face. “I heard that you and Shen Yu know each other. The Shen family is holding a banquet tomorrow. Come with us!”","Qiao Xi was calm. Although Mr. Xu was still considered polite to her, his eyes were filled with the glow of personal gains. To him, it did not matter who his biological daughter was. He only cared about who could bring more benefits to him.","She smiled and nodded. “Alright! I know Shen Yu. He even recommended me for a role previously!”","When Mr. Xu heard this, his gloomy expression eased up a little. Although he liked Xu Anran more, Qiao Xi was still useful and not completely useless.","Mr. Xu said, “Alright, then get ready and dress up nicely tomorrow. You’re the daughter of the Xu family now. You have to attend the Shen family’s banquet as one of us. Don’t embarrass the Xu family.","“I heard that President Gu will be participating too...”","The crowd fell silent.","Mr. Xu hesitated for a moment, then said in a gentle voice, “Anyi likes to create trouble, so he made a small joke with you. Although you won’t hold it against him anymore, President Gu was in the car that day. He probably thought that Anyi got people to kill him, so...","“I think you must be very familiar with President Gu since you were in the same car as him. Help your brother put in a few good words and tell President Gu not to pursue the matter anymore. Tell him to just forgive your brother!”","Qiao Xi looked troubled. “Of course, I want to save Young Master Xu, but everyone knows that President Gu has a bad temper. At that time, Young Master Xu sent so many people to chase after us. Someone even attacked President Gu. If it weren’t for President Gu’s assistant, we might not have survived. It won’t be easy to make him relent.”","Mr. Xu’s expression was heavy. He knew that Qiao Xi was telling the truth, so he gritted his teeth. “Why don’t you tell President Gu that as long as he agrees to reconcile, the Xu family will give him a gift? I hope he’ll give us some face.”","Qiao Xi chuckled and nodded. “Yes, I’ll tell President Gu that tomorrow!”","Mr. Xu heaved a sigh of relief and took out a card from his pocket. “Xi Xi, this card is for you. There’s 200,000 yuan in it. Buy whatever you like. If it’s not enough, you can ask me again.” Qiao Xi smiled sweetly and received it casually. “Thank you.”","As soon as she finished speaking, she skipped upstairs. After she left the crowd’s line of sight, Madam Xu could not help but roar, “What right does she have to receive 200,000 yuan and attend the Shen family’s banquet? She’s just a wild girl. It’ll be so embarrassing to bring her to a banquet in high society! Is the Shen family in the capital people she can climb over?”","Mr. Xu frowned unhappily. “If we were still in Luo City, it wouldn’t matter. Now that we’re in Li City, everyone knows that we came here to look for our daughter. If we only bring Anran with us when we attend the banquet, the Shen family will definitely think that the Xu family is uneducated. They’ll say that we didn’t let our biological daughter attend but we brought our adopted daughter with us instead. Wouldn’t that be a loss of status?”","Madam Xu was unwilling to give up. “Then... Then why did you give Qiao Xi so much money? Just let her pick one of Anran’s old clothes. They’re all new anyway. She won’t be able to tell. She’s not a top socialite, so what’s the point of wearing such good clothes?!”","Mr. Xu was helpless. “We have a favor to ask of Qiao Xi now. If we don’t coax her, how can we get her to plead with President Gu? Do you still want to save your son?”"]},{"number":521,"title":"Chapter 521 - Giving Me 200,000 yuan?","paragraphs":["Mr. Xu’s expression softened. “Anran, I’ll give you ten million yuan. Just take it as pocket money. Xu Zidie is just a daughter from the side family, yet she’s spending so much money. You’re the daughter of the Xu family, so you can’t be worse than her. If you think it’s not enough, I’ll give you another ten million.” “Just now, I gave Qiao Xi 200,000 yuan because I was afraid that she would be upset. Anran, you should know very well that you’re my favorite daughter. You and Shen Yu had a misunderstanding regarding the production earlier. You have to explain it clearly. We have to build a good relationship with the Shen family in the capital. This will be very helpful to the Xu family’s business.”","Xu Anran nodded obediently and smiled proudly. She knew that her parents still liked her best. Qiao Xi was just a stranger with blood relations.","Her father gave her ten million yuan but only 200,000 yuan to Qiao Xi. This was enough to explain everything.","To the Xu family, 200,000 yuan was only the price of a pair of shoes or a set of clothes. The desk in her room was worth 100,000 yuan. Seeing Qiao Xi’s happy expression and how she happily went upstairs after taking 200,000 yuan, she was really a country bumpkin.","Xu Anran smiled. “Don’t worry, Dad. I’ll definitely do well at the banquet.”","In the bedroom upstairs.","After Qiao Xi entered, she casually tossed the bank card on the table.","Mr. Xu was only willing to fork out 200,000 yuan?","As expected of this family! This father of hers was not filled with hostility like Madam Xu, nor was he scheming like Xu Anran. He was quite good to her, but Qiao Xi knew very well that although Mr. Xu seemed to be very good to her on the surface, it was actually just because he thought she could be of some use to him. He just wanted to use her to please Gu Zheng at the Shen family’s banquet.","Unfortunately, the Shen family was her family, and Gu Zheng was her husband!","How could the Xu family beat her?","The next day. The news that the Shen family was holding a banquet in Li City had spread throughout high society. However, they did not invite many people this time. They only invited some relatives and friends.","Hence, the Xu family was very proud of being able to receive the Shen family’s invitation. They thought that the Xu family was considered a friend of the Shen family.","To everyone, the Shen family inviting the Xu family meant that they wanted to get to know the Xu family, so they handed them an invitation. If the Xu family was interested, they would naturally attend.","Although the Xu family of Luo City had the Xia family as their backer, their foundation was still unstable. In the past few years, they had been mediocre among the wealthy families.","As the daughter of the Xia family, Madam Xu naturally knew the importance of this banquet. Hence, she reminded her daughter, “Anran, you have to follow me closely when we’re at the banquet. Moreover, Madam Shen said that this is just a gathering with friends and relatives. Don’t dress too formally, or it’ll look too much.”","Madam Xu had already prepared a dress for Xu Anran to wear to the banquet. It did not look too gorgeous. The dress reached her knees. It was a light blue princess dress. However, if one looked carefully, one would realize that the dress was exquisite. The diamond at the waist shone under the light.","Xu Anran smiled proudly. “Thank you, Mom! This dress is really beautiful, but Sister... What is she wearing to attend the banquet?”","When she heard this, Madam Xu’s eyes were filled with impatience. “She can just casually wear whatever. Anyway, she’s not going because of the banquet. She just has to please Gu Zheng! She’s a wild girl who grew up in the countryside. No matter how well she dresses, she still can’t hide her rustic aura. It’s already her honor that we’re letting her attend this banquet!” The corners of Xu Anran’s mouth curled up as a trace of viciousness flashed past her eyes.","orne","“Anran, I think you can get to know President Gu. It’s just that your brother angered him previously. After this matter is over and your brother is released, I’ll arrange for the two of you to meet. You have to perform well and try to win him over!”","Xu Anran was extremely shy. “Mom! Don’t say that!”","“Why are you shy?! You’re already a big girl. Actually, I can tell that you like President Gu. You’re so beautiful. As long as you use a few small tricks, President Gu will definitely like","you!”","...","In the Shen family’s residence.","Mr. Xu took out the invitation letter. The servants immediately invited them in respectfully and sent someone to lead the way."]},{"number":522,"title":"Chapter 522 - The Shen Family’s Banquet","paragraphs":["At this moment, Butler Liu of the Shen family walked over. Xu Zhi and Xia Yunlou knew that this butler had worked in the Shen family for decades. The entire Shen family treated him as family, so no one dared to offend him.","Xu Zhi hurriedly greeted warmly, “Hello, Butler Liu.”","Butler Liu glanced meaningfully at Qiao Xi, then smiled lightly. “Mr. Xu, Madam Xu, please!”","Xu Zhi immediately beamed. Since Butler Liu was so easy-going with them, it meant that the Shen family thought highly of the Xu family. Xia Yunlou and Xu Anran also went forward to greet him. Only Qiao Xi remained silent.","After Butler Liu left, Xia Yunlou immediately reprimanded her unhappily, “Qiao Xi! You’re really rude! You don’t even greet people when you see them. When you’re out, don’t ever say that you’re the daughter of my Xu family. You’ll make us lose all our dignity!”","At this moment, the guests gradually walked in.","Xu Anran immediately walked in front of Qiao Xi and said weakly, “Sister, don’t blame Mom for calling you out. You have to understand the importance of etiquette when attending banquets. You might not have attended banquets before and don’t know these rules. If you have anything you don’t understand, you can ask me. Don’t offend the other guests. Butler Liu isn’t just a servant in the Shen family but you’ve offended him as soon as you entered. Aren’t you making things difficult for Dad and Mom?!”","Qiao Xi did not say anything while Xu Anran continued nagging, “Sister, although you haven’t learned these rules, you... You’re the daughter of the Xu family, after all. You have to attend many banquets in the future, so you have to try to learn the rules. Don’t lose your temper, alright?","“You grew up in the countryside and have definitely never attended occasions like this. However, this is the Shen family’s residence, not our own home. Even if you see something valuable here, you can’t take it without the owner’s permission. Do you hear me?”","Although Xu Anran’s voice was not loud, everyone could hear her clearly. They could not help but discuss softly.","“The Xu family said that Qiao Xi offended Butler Liu? Are they joking?” “They’re shooting themselves in the foot this time. Everyone who’s attending the banquet knows that Qiao Xi is the beloved daughter of the Shen couple. Moreover, she’s President Gu’s wife. This adopted daughter of the Xu family actually dares to publicly reprimand Miss Qiao? She’s really overestimating herself!”","“Look at the Xu family. They probably don’t know that Butler Liu gave them the honor of greeting them only because Qiao Xi is with them. Without Qiao Xi, Butler Liu wouldn’t even look at the Xu family!”","“All the guests present know about the relationship between Miss Qiao and the Shen family, except for the Xu family. They’re really stupid! If it weren’t for Miss Qiao, would they be qualified to attend the Shen family’s banquet?”","The Xu family did not hear the guests’ discussion.","Xu Zhi frowned. “Anran, stop talking. I’ve already told your sister. She’s not a child. You don’t have to say anymore.” Xu Anran immediately looked aggrieved. “Dad, it’s my fault. I thought that my sister didn’t remember, so I reminded her again. I... I’m also afraid that she’ll do something bad. I’m not... I’m not teaching my sister a lesson or anything. I’m just reminding her.”","Xia Yunlou immediately protected Xu Anran and shouted at Xu Zhi, “Why are you so fierce?! Anran is doing this for the sake of the Xu family. It’s all Qiao Xi’s fault for being rude. She doesn’t even know how to greet people when she sees them. Anran is afraid that Qiao Xi will embarrass the Xu family, so she said a few words to her. I already said not to bring this jinx to the banquet, but you just didn’t listen to me and insisted on bringing her here. How embarrassing!”","Xu Zhi raised his eyes to look at Qiao Xi with an impatient expression.","He could not help but snort. “Before we left, I already gave you a reminder. You’ve only been here for a while. Why are you so stupid?! You should learn from your sister Anran. Don’t embarrass the Xu family!” Xu Zhi lowered his voice. “Qiao Xi, don’t forget why you’re here today. President Gu is also here in the Shen family. Go look for President Gu now. I don’t care what you do, but you have to get President Gu to agree to the settlement and let your brother go.”","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes and said, “But... the banquet is about to start. If I’m not around, then...”"]},{"number":523,"title":"Chapter 523 - She Has Her Family","paragraphs":["“Why are you still thinking about the banquet? The most important matter is to save your brother!” Xia Yunlou interrupted unhappily. “Do you think I brought you here to attend the banquet? Actually, it doesn’t matter whether you come or not. Now that you’ve shown yourself, the Shen family won’t say anything.","“Let me tell you, we have to get President Gu to relent and reconcile with us today no matter what. It’s all your fault. If you hadn’t called the police, your brother wouldn’t have been captured. Hence, you have to solve this matter!”","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent. “I came to attend the banquet but disappeared in the Shen family’s residence. It won’t affect the two of you, but it won’t be good for my reputation if news of this gets out!”","Xu Zhi immediately choked.","Xia Yunlou could not help but roar, “So what if your reputation goes down the hill?! You can’t represent the Xu family. Anran’s and your brother’s reputation is the most important thing now!","“You grew up in the countryside and don’t know etiquette. You’re extremely crude. I don’t expect you to have a good reputation either. I might as well sacrifice you to help everyone. What other concerns do you have? Hurry up and go!”","Qiao Xi’s expression turned cold, then she raised her eyes to look at Butler Liu, who was standing in the corner. She nodded indifferently. “Alright.”","“Madam Xu...” Just as she was about to leave, she suddenly stopped in her tracks and turned around. “I’ll be right back. I hope you won’t be too surprised when the time comes!”","Xia Yunlou frowned. “Hurry up and go! Don’t pretend to be mysterious. Who knows what you’re going to do?!” Xu Anran hurriedly said, “Mom, I think Sister might be unhappy. She thought she was here to attend the banquet but she’s not even allowed to show her face now. She must be feeling uncomfortable and think that you guys are targeting her...”","She looked helpless. “Actually, it’s because of my sister that my brother got locked up, so she should be responsible for this. I think you guys did the right thing.”","Xia Yunlou nodded in satisfaction. “Look at how sensible our Anran is. Quick, let’s go in.”","At this moment, Qiao Xi had already walked to a corner.","Butler Liu immediately bowed respectfully. “Miss, we’ve already recorded the video according to your request. The banquet will start in an hour. Do you want to go to Madam’s place to rest first? Madam has already prepared the pastries you like and is waiting for you to go over!”","Qiao Xi nodded and followed Butler Liu into the inner courtyard. “Miss, Madam said that you don’t have to worry. With her around, no one can bully you. She’ll help you deal with the Xu family. Just rest here.”","Qiao Xi’s heart was warm. This room was obviously decorated for a young lady. It must have been specially prepared for her. The pastries and other food on the table were all carefully prepared.","Butler Liu said, “Miss, Madam said that this banquet is for you, but it’s up to you to decide if you want to attend. If you don’t want to attend, then you can rest peacefully here. You can leave everything to her.”","Leave everything to her... After Butler Liu left, these words kept repeating in Qiao Xi’s mind. She could not help but sniffle. Actually, she had never cared whether she was the biological daughter of the Xu family or not because she had long since found a family that cherished her.","After Qiao Xi fell asleep, Shen Yu came over once.","Song Shiyu stood not far away and looked resentful. “President, Young Master Shen has gone in. Y-You’re not going to do anything?”","“You’re noisy.”","“President, I’m doing this for you! Actually, I’ve been keeping some things to myself for a long time. I really can’t take it anymore this time.”","Gu Zheng did not even raise his head. “You’d better endure it.”","Song Shiyu looked serious as if he was facing death. “I have to say it no matter what. I’ll say it even if it’ll cost me my salary! President! You know Young Madam’s identity as well. She’s the descendant of the divine physician and has four outstanding brothers. Moreover, the families behind these four brothers dote on Young Madam as though she’s their biological sister.”","Gu Zheng did not understand. Song Shiyu said seriously, “Not only that, but Young Madam is also a designer and the champion of the translation competition. She knows how to play the violin, has medical skills, looks good, and has a good figure.","“Look at yourself. You’re hot-tempered and a bastard in Young Madam’s heart. Do you think you’re worthy of Young Madam? If you don’t change yourself, you might be abandoned by Young Madam one day. Are you really not anxious at all? President!”","In an instant, the air seemed to have frozen."]},{"number":524,"title":"Chapter 524 - Exposing Family Scandals","paragraphs":["Song Shiyu was trembling. He was really sacrificing too much for the president’s happiness. Everything he said was true. He was like a loyal eunuch beside the ancient emperor. After saying this, he closed his eyes as though he was ready to face death.","Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng smiled. Song Shiyu’s heart skipped a beat. The president’s smile only made things worse. He was already mourning for himself, but Gu Zheng nodded affirmatively.","“You’re right.","“I do have to work hard. How can I let another man enter my wife’s room?”","Song Shiyu: “?”","Before he could say anything, Gu Zheng stood up and left. He stood there and looked at Gu Zheng’s back view in a daze. His president was finally enlightened.","An hour later.","Qiao Xi slowly opened her eyes. The curtains were blocked. The room was very dark, but Qiao Xi still spotted a tall man standing by the bed.","“Ah Zheng?”","Gu Zheng’s voice was hoarse. “Yes.”","Qiao Xi reached out to switch on the bedside lamp and sized him up under the light. Indeed, his eyes were gray, dim, and empty.","Her heart ached as she asked in surprise, “The curtains are drawn. Why are you here?”","Qiao Xi knew that the dark environment would affect Gu Zheng’s eyes. Hence, wherever he went, the place had to always be bright. The servants in Longwan Residential were also very tactful. As long as Gu Zheng appeared, they would turn on the brightest lights.","Qiao Xi’s heart ached. “You can’t see. You don’t have to come in to accompany me.”","Song Shiyu stood at the door, looking excited. ‘President! Young Madam must be very touched now. Tell her that even though you can’t see anything, you insist on accompanying her!’","Gu Zheng said, “I... I just came in. I’m fine.”","Song Shiyu: “...”","Qiao Xi hurriedly got up and pulled open the curtains. Gu Zheng closed his eyes to calm himself down for a while. When he opened them again, his eyes gradually recovered their clarity. “Shen Yu asked me to give you this.”","Qiao Xi took it. There was a tablet in her bag that was connected to the cameras in the banquet hall. She could see everything that was happening at the banquet.","At this moment, all the guests had arrived and were sitting at their designated seats. There were only a few people who were invited to the banquet this time, so the empty seats were obvious.","After Madam Shen sat down, she glanced around and coldly glanced at the Xu family. She sneered.","“Mr. Xu, Madam Xu, this is your first time attending the Shen family’s banquet, right? I heard that the Xu family has two daughters. Why is there only one with you?” Everyone’s gazes fell on the three of them. Xu Zhi could not say that Qiao Xi was trying to please Gu Zheng, so he said helplessly, “Xi Xi is young and a little playful. I don’t know where she went off to play. Madam Shen, please don’t take offense. I’ll get her to apologize to you another day.” Madam Shen’s slender fingers tapped the table lightly. “I heard that she’s the biological daughter of the Xu family who was previously missing for many years. Madam Xu, how could you not keep an eye on your daughter? She disappeared right after the banquet started.”","Xia Yunlou’s expression was ugly as she replied nervously, “Madam Shen, I want to take good care of this daughter of mine as well, but... she’s really a little naughty. After all, she grew up in the countryside and hasn’t seen much of the world. She doesn’t know the rules of high society, so I don’t know where she went. Madam Shen, please don’t lower yourself to her level. I’ll definitely teach her well.”","Qiao Xi held the tablet and could not help but sneer. Any normal person would know that family scandals could not be made public, but in order to slander her reputation, Madam Xu actually said in public that her daughter grew up in the countryside and was naughty.","The entire banquet hall instantly fell silent.","Everyone looked at the Xu family awkwardly. Then, they could not help but whisper and look at the Xu family as though they were looking at fools.","During the Shen family’s banquet, Madam Xu said that the daughter of the Shen family did not know etiquette and was a country bumpkin. She even said that she was naughty and mischievous?","Was there something wrong with the Xu couple? Were they openly challenging Madam Shen’s patience?","Madam Shen said, “Oh, I see. So, it’s Miss Xu who doesn’t know how to appreciate others’ kindness? She came to attend the Shen family’s banquet but is wandering around. Now that the banquet has started, she’s nowhere to be seen.”","Xia Yunlou hurriedly nodded. “Madam Shen, you’re right. She doesn’t know how to appreciate others’ kindness. Although... she’s my biological daughter, she’s completely unlike the children of our Xu family. Her behavior is crude, and she doesn’t look like a socialite at","all!”"]},{"number":525,"title":"Chapter 525 - If She Doesn’t Even Care About Her Biological Daughter, What Does She Care About?","paragraphs":["“I don’t have a choice either. I didn’t plan on bringing her here, but I was afraid that she would be upset. I’ve been on tenterhooks the entire time!","“It’s only because Anran has a gentle character and doesn’t despise her younger sister that we agreed to let the child out after she begged us for a long time. In the end... As soon as the banquet started, this child disappeared! Anran is still sensible. Although she’s not related to us by blood, she’s more like the daughter of our Xu family.”","What Xia Yunlou meant was that although her biological daughter had returned home, the family still favored their adopted daughter. Her adopted daughter was kind, sensible, obedient, and a top socialite. Her biological daughter was vulgar and did not deserve to be the Xu family’s daughter. Hence, they could only give up on that child and focus on nurturing their adopted daughter.","Xia Yunlou pretended to be helpless. She felt that she was not showing any disgust on her face. In her mind, she just looked helpless.","However, when everyone heard her words, they remained silent and looked at them with disdain.","The guests were all famous people in high society. They had to mind their identities and image outside, but at this moment, they especially wanted to say, ‘Does everyone in the Xu family suffer from brain damage?’","Madam Shen’s expression was cold. “So, it’s because your biological daughter is so naughty and doesn’t know etiquette that you let an adopted daughter take her place?”","Xia Yunlou could not help but be stunned. “Yes... that’s how it is. I wanted Xi Xi to follow me and show her face in front of everyone, but she kept running around and disappeared in the blink of an eye...”","“You dare to lie to me?” Madam Shen narrowed her eyes and slammed the table. Xia Yunlou was terrified to the point of trembling. She explained, “Madam Shen, I... I didn’t lie to you. Qiao Xi left by herself. I’m her biological mother, so how could I lie? She’s too naughty...”","“Mr. Xu, Madam Xu.”","At this moment, Butler Liu walked forward with a faint smile on his face. “There was a conflict at the entrance of the Xu family just now. I’ve also just learned something.”","Xia Yunlou frowned, not understanding why Madam Shen would suddenly flare up. Even if the Xu family did not like Qiao Xi, it had nothing to do with the Shen family. Although the Shen family was rich and powerful, they should not interfere in other people’s family matters.","Moreover, she got angry at her in front of everyone. She was clearly not giving her any","face.","Xia Yunlou suppressed her anger. “Madam Shen, we—”","“Madam Xu, even though you’re Miss Qiao Xi’s mother, there are some things that you did wrong. As the host, Madam Shen has the right to say something.”","Butler Liu said indifferently, “Madam Xu, you seem to be sure of your words. You’re saying that Miss Qiao Xi is naughty and unruly, so that’s why she’s nowhere to be seen now?”","“Of... Of course!”","“Why are you still thinking about the banquet? The most important matter is to save your brother! Do you think I brought you here to attend the banquet? Actually, it doesn’t matter whether you come or not. Now that you’ve shown yourself, the Shen family won’t say anything. “Let me tell you, we have to get President Gu to relent and reconcile with us today no matter what. It’s all your fault. If you hadn’t called the police, your brother wouldn’t have been captured. Hence, you have to solve this matter!","“So what if your reputation goes down the hill?! You can’t represent the Xu family. Anran’s and your brother’s reputation is the most important thing now! You grew up in the countryside and don’t know etiquette. You’re extremely crude. I don’t expect you to have a good reputation either. I might as well sacrifice you to help everyone. What other concerns do you have? Hurry up and go!”","Xia Yunlou’s voice sounded from the phone. The entire venue was silent.","Madam Shen’s gaze was cold. “Mr. Xu, if Butler Liu hadn’t checked the surveillance footage, everyone would have misunderstood Miss Xu. I really don’t understand why you and your wife are slandering your biological daughter?”","Shen Yu’s gentle face was full of smiles, but his voice was so cold that it made one’s body tremble. “I heard that Young Master Xu got people to kill his own sister. However, Madam Xu is blaming her biological daughter instead. She doesn’t even care about her biological daughter’s life. What else does the Xu family care about, then? Uncle Liu, please have the Xu family leave!”"]},{"number":526,"title":"Chapter 526 - Feelings Can Be Nurtured","paragraphs":["Butler Liu said, “Yes, Young Master! This family doesn’t even care about their biological daughter. What else do they care about, then? Please leave!”","“This... What does this have to do with you...” Xia Yunlou looked embarrassed. She wanted to retort but did not have the guts.","Xu Anran gritted her teeth with a gloomy expression. This Butler Liu was really a busybody. What right did he have to release the recording?!","Xia Yunlou shifted her eyes and said obsequiously, “Madam Shen, you really can’t blame me for this. I... I actually heard that Xi Xi often fooled around outside before we reunited. She has seduced many men, so I deliberately said that to see if she would agree.","“As for Anyi’s matter, we all know very well that Anyi is too much of a troublemaker. It’s only right for President Gu to punish Anyi. I asked Xi Xi to please President Gu because I wanted to test her. I wanted to see if she would take this opportunity to deliberately approach President Gu and seduce him.","“If she really seduced President Gu, I would bring her back and teach her well. I’m Xi Xi’s biological mother, so I won’t harm her. I just want to nurture her so that she won’t go astray.","“I did it for her own good!","“But I didn’t expect her to actually agree. Moreover, she hasn’t been back for so long. Xi Xi and Anyi don’t have any feelings for each other, so she’s definitely not pleading for her brother. I think she must have gone to seduce President Gu in hopes of climbing up the social ladder. I really didn’t expect our biological daughter to be so unbearable. It’s not wrong for me to not like her. After all, what she’s doing is too embarrassing!”","Madam Shen sneered. The Xu family clearly wanted Xi Xi to curry favor with Gu Zheng and wanted Gu Zheng to let Xu Anyi go. Now that the matter had been exposed, they even forcefully pushed all the responsibility to Xi Xi. Xia Yunlou pretended to be sad. “I didn’t expect this daughter of mine to not only be naughty and mischievous, but she even abandoned her reputation for a man. Our Xu family has been utterly embarrassed! I... I really am left with no choice.”","Xia Yunlou was talking excitedly, but everyone’s faces were cold and disdainful.","At this moment, someone finally could not help but say, “Madam Xu, you probably don’t know yet...”","Xia Yunlou ignored them and continued pretending to be sad. “No matter what, Xi Xi is my biological child. How can I not feel sorry for her? However, I really can’t control this child.","“Xi Xi, our biological daughter, is insensible. On the other hand, Anran is obedient. Actually, she has also admired President Gu for many years. However, as a top socialite, she has never stepped out of line. She has always been disciplined.","“Look at Xi Xi, that child. She ran after President Gu. It’s been so long but she still hasn’t come back. I don’t know what she’s doing now. She clearly knows that Anran likes President Gu, but she disregarded their relationship as sisters and her reputation to fight with her sister for a man.","“It’s all my fault. I didn’t teach my daughter well. If Madam Shen thinks that I’ve done a bad job at raising my daughter as well, then you can chase me out. I have no complaints.” Xia Yunlou’s words were eloquent, and her face was filled with sorrow. She displayed the image of a mother who had sacrificed everything for her daughter. However, everyone was not moved at all. Instead, they looked at her as though she was a fool.","Someone reminded her awkwardly, “Madam Xu, you said that Eldest Miss Xu likes President Gu. That doesn’t seem appropriate-“","Before the other party could finish, Xia Yunlou interrupted arrogantly. “What’s inappropriate about it? Anran is the daughter of the Xu and Xia families. She’s the apple of our eyes. Her marrying President Gu is appropriate considering her status. Although I know that President Gu might not like Anran yet, feelings can be nurtured.","“I’m Anran’s mother, so I naturally have to help her fulfill her wish. I hope President Gu can take notice of my outstanding daughter. I believe that as long as he’s willing to get to know her, he’ll definitely like her.” Everyone could not help but be stunned.","The Xu family was too shameless. They thought Xu Anran was worthy of marrying President Gu? The Xu family was a noble family? Did they think that Xu Anran was a fairy from heaven? Did they think every man would like her?"]},{"number":527,"title":"Chapter 527 - Sorry, I’m Late","paragraphs":["Moreover, the Xu family was really strange. They did not dote on their biological daughter but doted on an adopted daughter. They even belittled their biological daughter in public. What was even more shocking was that they did not know that Qiao Xi had already married President Gu.","One of the madams could not control the anger in her heart. “Madam Xu, we’re all madams of high society, but I still can’t help but complain today. Why are you so shameless?! Your daughter adores President Gu, but does he have to like her back? Even if you don’t like your biological daughter, you shouldn’t slander her reputation in public, right? Are you worthy of being a mother?","“And you don’t know, President Gu—”.","Before she could finish, a cold female voice sounded from outside the door. “Sorry, I’m late.”","Everyone widened their eyes.","They saw Qiao Xi holding Gu Zheng’s arm as they slowly walked over. Everyone simultaneously looked at the Xu family. As expected, their eyes were filled with disbelief.","Xia Yunlou’s face darkened. This little b*tch had to come back at this time!","After thinking for a moment, Xia Yunlou rushed forward and berated loudly, “So, you still knew to come back, huh?! We brought you to the banquet, but you disappeared in the blink of an eye. You even spent so much time with another man. Do you have any respect for me? Do you know what shame is?!”","These words implied that Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng had been fooling around. An hour had passed, so the two of them must have done something unspeakable. Gu Zheng’s eyes were deep. The corners of Qiao Xi’s lips curled up, then she sobbed aggrievedly. “Mom, why are you scolding me? Didn’t you ask me to please President Gu? Although the case of my brother getting people to commit murder can’t be so easily withdrawn, President Gu has already agreed not to pursue the matter. My brother can be released now.”","Qiao Xi had an innocent expression. “I thought that you would praise me for saving my brother. Unexpectedly... Boo-hoo...”","Song Shiyu shook his head helplessly. He was already mourning the Xu family in his heart.","At this moment, the expressions on their faces were very interesting. They were shocked, angry, and frightened. They could not wait to escape from the banquet hall.","The entire venue was silent as everyone’s gazes landed on Xia Yunlou.","Xu Anran glared fiercely at Qiao Xi and stared fixedly at her hand that was holding Gu Zheng’s. She wished for nothing more than to burn a hole in Qiao Xi’s hand.","Was this little b*tch worthy of standing beside President Gu?","Xu Anran had been pampered since she was young. She became an A-lister in the industry and was also a top socialite. She worked hard to become more outstanding so that she could be worthy of the most outstanding man in the world.","Originally, the Xu family had an engagement with another family, but Xu Anran did not like that useless man, so she asked her parents to look for Qiao Xi and have Qiao Xi marry that man in her place.","Her parents naturally looked down on that man’s family too, but the engagement had been set. If they went back on their word, it would be a breach of their promise. That was why they thought of their biological daughter who was stranded outside.","Xu Anran was arrogant and had high expectations for her future partner. The moment she saw Gu Zheng, she knew that this man was the Prince Charming she had been waiting for. Only he was worthy of her.","Xu Anran looked at Gu Zheng shyly and instantly blushed.","Xia Yunlou looked at Qiao Xi’s aggrieved appearance and felt depressed in her heart. She said impatiently, “You still have the cheek to ask? I did tell you to look for President Gu, but I was just testing you. I didn’t expect you to be gone for so long. I don’t know what horrible things you’ve done. You’re really embarrassing our Xu family!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and said slowly, “I see. So you wanted me to curry favor with President Gu just to test me. You didn’t really want me to plead with him.”","Xia Yunlou immediately choked.","However, since Qiao Xi had already said so, Xia Yunlou could only bite the bullet and admit it. Moreover, Qiao Xi had already said that President Gu had agreed to let Anyi off. President Gu probably would not go back on his words. She could just push all the blame to Qiao Xi. Qiao Xi would be the perfect foil to Anran’s excellence. President Gu would definitely like Anran.","Xia Yunlou gritted his teeth. “Yes, I know that your brother did something wrong. It’s reasonable for President Gu to punish him. I was just testing you. Who knew that you would take the opportunity to seduce President Gu? You even forgot about the banquet. Do you know what shame is?!”"]},{"number":528,"title":"Chapter 528 - Who Gave Madam Xu Confidence?","paragraphs":["Everyone was silent and looked awkward. Madam Shen, who was sitting at the head of the table, was so angry that her face turned red.","Xia Yunlou must be a fool!","Everyone had heard the recording just now. It was clearly Xia Yunlou who asked Qiao Xi to please President Gu. Now that President Gu had agreed, she pushed all the blame on Qiao Xi. This was too wicked.","When Xia Yunlou saw that Qiao Xi was silent, she thought that she had tacitly agreed to what she said. Just as Xia Yunlou thought that the matter was over, she heard Qiao Xi speak.","“I didn’t expect you, my mother, to know that my brother did something wrong by getting people to kill me! You’re going to jail.”","She turned her head and said with a smile, “President Gu, if that’s the case, then forget about what I said before.” Gu Zheng nodded, then ordered casually, “Alright! Song Shiyu, sue Xu Anyi immediately.”","Xia Yunlou’s expression froze.","She did not... That was not what she meant. She just wanted to tell everyone that Qiao Xi was shameless and not as obedient or sensible as her daughter, Anran, who was reserved and calm. She did not expect President Gu to want to sue Anyi.","Xia Yunlou was unconvinced. “President Gu, this has nothing to do with Anyi. You’ve already agreed. You can’t...”","“Didn’t you say just now that my relationship with my brother is not good? I went to look for President Gu just to seduce him, not for my brother’s sake at all. You even scolded me for being shameless. Since you think so, why should I do anything for you?”","Xia Yunlou cursed, “Shut up! You have no right to speak!”","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent. “You asked me to curry favor with President Gu, so I did as you said. President Gu also agreed not to pursue the matter, but you kicked me to the curb after I outlived my usefulness. You’re even calling me shameless. Aren’t you going too far?”","Seeing that she was still refuting, Xia Yunlou instantly shouted in exasperation, “Can you shut up?! I’m talking to President Gu! What are you talking about?! President Gu agreed not to pursue the matter because of the Xu family. What has it got to do with you? Don’t flatter yourself!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Gu Zheng said slowly, “Of course, it has to do with her.”","Xia Yunlou widened her eyes. Xu Anran’s heart could not help but skip a beat. “Madam Xu, don’t tell me that you think I chose to pursue this matter earlier because of your Xu family or because of your... adopted daughter?” Gu Zheng’s voice was cold.","“I-Isn’t it?”","Xia Yunlou blurted out. How could an outstanding man like Gu Zheng fall for a wild girl like Qiao Xi who grew up in the countryside? Even if he were to like someone, he could only like a noble lady like Anran.","Hence, Xia Yunlou thought that Gu Zheng must have agreed to let Xu Anyi go because of Xu Anran.","Gu Zheng glanced coldly at the confident Xia Yunlou and sneered. “I wonder who gave Madam Xu the confidence?”","“President Gu, when you agreed not to pursue the matter, could it be because...”","Before Xia Yunlou could finish, Song Shijing said coldly, “Our president agreed to not pursue the matter because of Miss Qiao.”","Xia Yunlou looked confused. “How is that possible?! President Gu, you must be trying to cover for Qiao Xi, but her reputation has already been ruined. She’s secretly seducing you. Don’t speak up for her. I’ll bring her back now-“","“Madam Xu, how could our young madam be secretly seducing the president as you said?” Song Shijing’s eyes were cold. “What’s wrong with a pair of husband and wife attending the banquet together? I really don’t understand what you mean, Madam Xu. Do you think only your adopted daughter is suitable to be with our president? Do you consider it an act of seduction when any other woman gets close to our president?”","Xu Zhi’s body trembled when he heard this.","He and Xia Yunlou looked at each other and saw surprise in each other’s eyes.","“Your young madam? Who? Do you mean Qiao Xi?”","Xia Yunlou’s eyes were filled with shock. She thought that she was hallucinating. “That’s impossible! President Gu, you can’t just say that she’s Mrs. Gu just to protect her. Only Anran is worthy of being Mrs. Gu...” “Shut up!”","Xu Zhi roared, then explained to Gu Zheng while trembling, “President Gu, my wife is drunk, so she said something she shouldn’t have. Please don’t blame her. I... I didn’t expect Xi Xi to be your wife. Then, we’re a family...”"]},{"number":529,"title":"Chapter 529 - This Family Is Really Weird!","paragraphs":["“Mr. Xu, it’s not up to you to decide whether we’re a family or not. Didn’t Madam Xu say that our young madam isn’t worthy to be the daughter of the Xu family?” Song Shijing interrupted. Gu Zheng did not even bother to look at Xu Zhi. He held Qiao Xi’s hand and sat down. Only the Xu family was left standing awkwardly in the center of the banquet hall.","Xu Zhi’s face was filled with horror. He finally knew why Qiao Xi looked down on the Xu family. It was because Gu Zheng was her backer. However, he did not understand why Gu Zheng would marry Qiao Xi.","Xu Zhi sized up Qiao Xi in confusion, then looked at the sobbing Xu Anran and sighed helplessly.","Of course, his heart ached for Anran. This daughter had always been arrogant. It was not easy for her to fall in love with a man. Unexpectedly, this man was her brother-in-law.","“Qiao Xi married President Gu a long time ago. Although the two of them didn’t hold a wedding, many people in the industry know about this, right?!” The guests looked puzzled. “That’s right! It’s fine if others don’t know, but as Mrs. Gu’s parents, they didn’t even know that their daughter was married?”","“Just look at Madam Xu’s attitude toward Qiao Xi. The Xu family doesn’t care about their biological daughter at all. They only have that adopted daughter in their hearts. Moreover, that adopted daughter likes President Gu. Xia Yunlou wanted Xu Anran to marry President Gu. She had no idea that her biological daughter was President Gu’s legitimate wife.”","“This family is really strange! They want to help their adopted daughter snatch their biological daughter’s husband? Moreover, I heard that the adopted daughter arranged a room for Qiao Xi in the basement and tampered with it. She wanted to burn Qiao Xi to death!”","“Huh? She’s too vicious! She looks innocent and harmless. Who would have thought that she would do such a thing?!”","Xia Yunlou was pulled by Xu Zhi and made to sit down. She gnashed her teeth and said, “Qiao Xi is married to Gu Zheng! Why didn’t she tell us earlier? She did it on purpose! She made us lose face in public!”","Xu Zhi also had a helpless expression. If he had known earlier that Qiao Xi was Mrs. Gu, he would not have let Qiao Xi suffer.","When he thought of the 200,000 yuan he had given Qiao Xi, Xu Zhi felt his face burn. 200,000 yuan was nothing to Gu Zheng. He reckoned that Qiao Xi’s heart was filled with ridicule when she accepted the money!","Now, Qiao Xi must be extremely disappointed in the Xu family. Coupled with the fact that she did not grow up by their sides, it would be difficult for her to help the Xu family gain benefits.","Xia Yunlou and Xu Anran had gloomy expressions.","They did not dare believe that Qiao Xi, someone who had led a wandering life outside, could actually marry a god-like man like Gu Zheng. Shouldn’t she be a poor person living in the slums? What right did she have to snatch the man Anran liked?","Moreover, they came to Li City to look for Qiao Xi for the sake of the marriage agreement. Now that Qiao Xi was married, how should this matter be resolved? Xia Yunlou rolled her eyes and lowered her voice. “Hubby, do you think Xi Xi is suitable to be Mrs. Gu?”","“Xi Xi grew up in the countryside since she was young. She doesn’t know any etiquette. How is she worthy of being Mrs. Gu? It’s only because President Gu thinks she’s a little pretty, so he’s interested in her. He’ll get sick of her soon. The woman President Gu should marry should be a noble daughter and a top socialite. Only a girl like Anran is worthy of him.”","Xu Zhi was silent while Xia Yunlou continued, “Moreover, we came to Li City to look for Xi Xi for the sake of that marriage agreement. Could it be that you want Anran to marry that good-for-nothing? Qiao Xi, this wandering daughter, is so compatible with that good-for-nothing. Why don’t we get Qiao Xi to divorce President Gu?","“President Gu is good to Qiao Xi only because of her face. If he gets to know Anran, he’ll definitely realize her good qualities and won’t like Qiao Xi anymore.","“Although Qiao Xi is our biological daughter, she has no feelings for us. Even if she marries President Gu, it won’t be of any use to our Xu family. However, Anran is different. Hubby, what do you think?","“Everyone knows that Qiao Xi married Gu Zheng, but our Xu family didn’t. She deliberately didn’t tell us and made us lose face in front of everyone!”","The more Xu Zhi listened, the more his eyebrows furrowed. He could not help but feel angry. Even if Xi Xi was Mrs. Gu, it was useless if she was not close to the Xu family. However, if Mrs. Gu was Anran, then they would be a family with the Gu family."]},{"number":530,"title":"Chapter 530 - Persuading Mrs. Gu To Divorce","paragraphs":["attention to the Xu family.","Hearing the mockery around her, Xia Yunlou gritted her teeth. She thought that when Anran became Mrs. Gu, she would make everyone kneel in front of her and apologize!","The Shen family had already arranged rooms for the guests to rest. After night fell, the guests all returned to their rooms to rest.","Xia Yunlou hurriedly sent someone to get Qiao Xi. After a long time, Qiao Xi walked over with sleepy eyes.","“Why are you so slow?! Do I not even have the right to call you over?” Xia Yunlou said angrily.","Qiao Xi said slowly, “Madam Xu, I was sleeping, alright? I had to change.”","“Why did you bother changing? You should’ve come over as soon as I told you to!”","Qiao Xi was helpless. “It’s already so late. Ah Zheng and I were already asleep. I was wearing pajamas. Of course, I had to change before coming out. Could it be that you think I should come out the moment you called me? It doesn’t matter even if I was wearing pajamas?”","Xia Yunlou could not retort. She gritted her teeth and said, “You still have the cheek to say that? You came to the banquet with us, but you’re not staying in the same room as us. Instead, you went to sleep with President Gu? How can you be so shameless?!”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing when she heard this.","“Gu Zheng is my husband. Can’t we sleep together? Don’t Madam Xu and Mr. Xu sleep together, then? Do you two sleep in separate beds?”","The corners of Xia Yunlou’s mouth twitched slightly. “What are you talking about? Look at your shameless appearance. You’re really not presentable!”","Qiao Xi sneered. “I’m not presentable? Gu Zheng and I are legally married. Is it shameless for us to sleep together? What about the two of","you?”","“Sister, don’t make Mom angry. She’s doing this for your own good,” Xu Anran said gently. “You secretly went to sleep with President Gu and didn’t tell us. We’ve been waiting for you. We were afraid that you would be in danger!”","Xia Yunlou suppressed her anger. She could not fall out with Qiao Xi yet. No matter what, if she wanted to safely climb to the top, she had to rely on Qiao Xi. Her tone softened. “Xi Xi, I’m really doing this for your own good. Don’t be stubborn.”","Qiao Xi sat on the chair and poured a cup of tea. She took a sip and asked slowly, “What do you want?”","“I’m your biological mother. Why would I harm you? That’s why I have something to say to you.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. Xia Yunlou was shameless enough to say that she was her biological mother?","Xia Yunlou said gently, “President Gu is rich, powerful, and has top-notch looks. He must have high expectations for his partner. There are countless women who want to marry him. Why did he choose you? “I don’t know what method you used to get President Gu to agree to marry you, but a marriage without feelings is impossible to maintain. You grew up in the countryside and don’t have any culture or temperament. You’re also not a daughter of a noble family. How can you be worthy of a man like President Gu?","“I think President Gu might have gotten married to you because of the novelty of it. However, when you’re old or a better-looking woman appears by his side, you’ll be abandoned. Instead of being abandoned in the future, why don’t you divorce President Gu before anything happens?”","Outside the door, Song Shiyu shuddered when he heard that and felt a chill run down his spine.","Gu Zheng stood behind him, exuding a cold murderous aura.","Qiao Xi drank a few mouthfuls of tea to moisten her throat and nodded meaningfully. “Madam Xu, you’re right. I can get a divorce, but you have to ask President Gu if he agrees. After all, a divorce is not a small matter. If I divorce him, who will be Mrs. Gu?”","Xia Yunlou instantly beamed. “You don’t have to worry about that. As long as you take the initiative to ask for a divorce, a proud man like President Gu probably won’t keep you.”","As long as Qiao Xi lost Gu Zheng’s protection, she would be an ordinary wild girl. How could she compete with Anran?! “But, Madam Xu, why should I get a divorce?” Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes, and her eyes were filled with coldness. “You already said that Gu Zheng is outstanding, and I also think my husband is very outstanding. He has money and is willing to spend it on me. He can even support me. Most importantly, he’s handsome. What reason do I have to divorce him?”"]},{"number":531,"title":"Chapter 531 - Beautiful, Long Legs","paragraphs":["The atmosphere instantly became awkward. The corners of Xia Yunlou’s and Xu Anran’s mouths twitched.","Xia Yunlou forcefully endured the anger in her heart and gritted her teeth, saying, “Qiao Xi, if you don’t get a divorce now, you’ll regret it sooner or later!”","Xu Anran also tried to persuade her. “Sister, I’m just afraid that you’ll get hurt in the future. How can you refuse? You and President Gu are really not compatible. You should let a more outstanding woman marry him.” Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing. She raised her eyebrows and said, “The ‘more outstanding woman’ you’re referring to can’t possibly be you, right? Do you want to marry Gu Zheng? Is that why Madam Xu publicly announced that you like Gu Zheng?”","Xia Yunlou said self-righteously, “Anran is a daughter of a noble family. You grew up in the countryside and are extremely vulgar. President Gu still has some feelings for you now because you’re good-looking. In a few years, he’ll be completely sick of you. President Gu won’t even look at you then, but Anran is different. She has knowledge and means. She can make President Gu completely fall for her.”","Pfft!","Song Shiyu could not help but choke.","Qiao Xi looked at Xia Yunlou with an icy cold gaze. “You’re really confident!”","Xia Yunlou knew that Qiao Xi was mocking her, and her face turned livid.","Xu Anran was silent for a moment before saying gently, “Sister, I’ve actually liked President Gu for a long time. After Mom found out, she couldn’t bear to see me not being able to be with him, so she’s advising you to get a divorce.","“Moreover, you’re not compatible with President Gu. Instead of getting hurt by him in the future, why don’t you get a divorce as soon as possible to prevent anything bad from happening? Moreover, you have another marriage agreement to fulfill. Since you’re not suitable to be Mrs. Gu, just let me have President Gu, alright?”","Qiao Xi widened her eyes. She was shocked by the shamelessness of this mother and daughter pair.","Qiao Xi was not the only one who was angry. When Song Shiyu heard Xu Anran asking Qiao Xi to let her have the president, Song Shiyu wished he could rush in and beat her up.","Qiao Xi sneered. “Madam Xu, it’s not that I don’t want to, but President Gu likes beautiful women with fair skin and long legs like me. However, my sister’s appearance is a little inferior to mine. Gu Zheng probably won’t be willing to settle for less. Even if I divorce him, Anran won’t get a chance!”","Upon hearing this, Xu Anran’s heart trembled as her face turned pale.","Xia Yunlou was angered to the point of gnashing his teeth. She raised the teacup Qiao Xi had just used and slammed it on the floor with a mad roar.","“Shut up! How is your sister inferior to you?! Not only is your sister beautiful, but she’s also a top socialite. She’s countless times better than you! You’re the ugly one!”","Qiao Xi’s expression turned cold.","What a good mother! For the sake of an adopted daughter, she was actually forcing her biological daughter to divorce her husband. She even said that Xu Anran was so much better than her.","Qiao Xi’s eyes looked indifferent as she said slowly, “That’s true. I’m your daughter, after all. I’m ugly because your genes are too inferior!”","“You!” Xia Yunlou was unable to retort, and she was angered to the point her face flushed red. She picked up the teacup on the table and threw it at Qiao Xi. “You little b*tch! You still dare to scold me? Hurry up and apologize to Anran and me! How is Anran not as good-looking as you? Look at your shameless appearance. You can’t even compare to a strand of Anran’s hair. You came out from a slum... Ah!”","Suddenly, a stone flew in from outside the door and hit Xia Yunlou’s wrist.","Gu Zheng slowly entered with a cold gaze. His voice was calm but carried a faint chill. “Madam Xu, since you’ve insulted my wife to this extent, there’s no need for us to continue talking. Xi Xi, let’s go.”","When Xu Zhi heard this, he hurriedly rushed over. “Xia Yunlou! You’re being silly!”","Xia Yunlou panicked and could not help but look at Gu Zheng. She felt that his gaze was like a sharp sword, scaring her until she trembled.","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm, but his deep eyes were suffocating her.","Xia Yunlou pretended to be strong and calm. “I... I was just joking with Xi Xi. President Gu, don’t misunderstand. Xi Xi is a little naughty. As her mother, it’s fine for me to reprimand her, right? This is for her own good.” Xu Zhi quickly roared, “I told you to shut up! Did you hear me?!”"]},{"number":532,"title":"Chapter 532 - Xu Anran Is Despised","paragraphs":["Xia Yunlou was so scared that she did not dare to say anything else. Then, Xu Zhi looked at Gu Zheng obsequiously. “President Gu, take a seat. Don’t just stand there!”","Xu Anran had a shy expression. She was sure that Gu Zheng was the most perfect man she had ever seen. If she could marry him, she was willing to pay any price.","Gu Zheng ignored everyone and held Qiao Xi’s hand as they sat on the main seats. He asked casually, “I’m very curious why Madam Xu reprimanded my wife. What did she do wrong?” Xu Zhi was shocked.","However, Xia Yunlou felt that she finally had a chance. She quickly explained, “President Gu, of course, I reprimanded her for a reason. Xi Xi is not worthy of you. It’s really unfair to you to have her as your wife.”","The entire venue was silent.","After a few seconds of silence, Gu Zheng smirked. “So?”","Xia Yunlou thought that Gu Zheng had confirmed her words, so she continued, “Xi Xi grew up in the countryside. She doesn’t have the aura of a socialite at all. She doesn’t know etiquette and isn’t cultured. It’s really inappropriate for her to be your wife.","W","“After thinking about it, I think Anran is more suitable for you. Old Xu and I had high expectations of her since she was young. We raised her to become a top socialite. She graduated from a famous university and is proficient in all kinds of musical instruments, calligraphy, painting, and dancing. Although she’s not our biological daughter, Old Xu and I have always treated her as our biological daughter. I think only Anran is worthy of such an outstanding and successful man like you.”","As soon as she finished speaking, the air was silent. One could only hear Song Shiyu gritting his teeth.","Xia Yunlou did not think that there was anything wrong with what she said. She pushed Xu Anran forward like a matchmaker. “Anran, quickly go over and greet President Gu.”","Xu Anran blushed. “President Gu.”","She was gentle, shy, and charming. Her eyes were filled with affection, but she was also reserved.","However, Gu Zheng did not respond. The atmosphere was extremely awkward.","The shyness on Xu Anran’s face gradually turned into embarrassment. “President Gu, I _ II","“Madam Xu.” Gu Zheng’s eyes darkened, his expression indifferent.","“What kind of person do you think I am? Why do you think any Tom, Dick, or Harry can be shoved to my side? My taste isn’t that bad. I don’t like just anyone.”","There was silence-dead silence.","The expressions on Xia Yunlou’s and Xu Anran’s faces gradually stiffened. They turned as pale as paper. Any Tom, Dick, or Harry? He actually described her that way? She... She was the eldest daughter of the Xu family, a top socialite in high society. “Madam Xu, your biological daughter has already married our president, yet you’re still so anxious to give your adopted daughter to the president. Aren’t you deliberately trying to ruin our president’s reputation by acting like this? In today’s society, we practice monogamy. Don’t you know that?”","Song Shiyu sneered. “Our president has married Young Madam, yet the Xu family wishes to deliver your adopted daughter to him. Is that appropriate? The Xu family is also a noble family. Don’t tell me you indulge in such bad practices!”","Xia Yunlou’s breathing quickened.","Even if President Gu and his assistant, Song Shiyu, did not like Anran, they should not belittle her so much. What did they mean by their words? The Xu family wanted Anran to be Mrs. Gu because Qiao Xi was not worthy of this identity.","“Mr. Xu, our president isn’t here to listen to your excuses. Since you don’t like Young Madam, the president will bring her back to","rest.”","Song Shiyu snorted. “It’s already so late, but Young Madam was still called out by her biological mother and forced to divorce our president. If news of this gets out, will the Xu family still be so arrogant?”","Gu Zheng was about to leave when Xu Zhi hurriedly went up to him. “President Gu, my wife and daughter were just anxious. Please don’t take it to heart. I just want to talk to Xi Xi about her brother. Anyi is Xi Xi’s brother, after all. So...","“It was Anyi’s fault for what happened before, but... we’re family, after all. President Gu, you’re magnanimous, so let’s not kick up a fuss. Why don’t we talk in the study?”","Gu Zheng nodded calmly.","Song Shiyu followed the two upstairs. At this moment, only the mother and daughters were left downstairs.","Qiao Xi did not even look at the two of them as she stood up and walked out.","“Wait!”"]},{"number":533,"title":"Chapter 533 - If You Want To Be Beaten, I’ll Help You","paragraphs":["Xu Anran hurriedly chased after her with tears in her eyes. “Sister, I know you hate me and think that I stole your identity, but I’m innocent. Mom is also in a difficult position. On one hand, it’s her biological daughter, and on the other, it’s her adopted daughter who has accompanied her for 20 years. Why can’t we get along well? Sister, let’s go out and talk, alright?”","Xu Anran looked sad, but a sinister smile flashed across her eyes.","Qiao Xi knew that she had ill intentions, but she was just curious about what Xu Anran wanted to do. Hence, she nodded. “Alright.”","The Shen family’s courtyard was very big. Xu Anran walked around and brought her to a remote corner.","Xu Anran was scheming in her heart with every step she took. Now that everyone knew that she had arranged a room in the basement for Qiao Xi and she wanted to kill Qiao Xi, she had to clear her name. The best way was to push all the blame on Qiao Xi.","Before leaving, Xu Anran had already found out that the Shen family’s courtyard was full of surveillance cameras, but there was no audio function. As long as she deliberately angered Qiao Xi and made her unable to restrain her anger, then all the guests in the Shen family would see Qiao Xi’s ugly face.","The eldest daughter of the Xu family could only be her! The title of Mrs. Gu could only belong to her!","Hence, Xu Anran tried her best to persuade her. “Sister, do you know why President Gu married a country bumpkin like you? He probably just thinks that you don’t know anything. A few years later, he’ll kick you away. If you don’t get a divorce now, you’ll regret it in the future. I’m your sister, so why would I lie to you?","“Mom asked me to marry President Gu not because she’s biased toward me, but because she thinks that I can hold on to President Gu more and bring more benefits to the Xu family. But you... If you don’t have the ability, then don’t occupy the position of Mrs. Gu.","“Moreover, Dad and Mom said that the eldest daughter of the Xu family can only be me. You’re just a country bumpkin. You’re not worthy to be the daughter of the Xu family at all. They brought you back just to—”.","Qiao Xi interrupted her. “Xu Anran, you called me out alone just to infuriate me, right? You want me to attack you, so you’re saying these words to trigger me. You’ll then claim that I beat you up, that I’m irritable and easily angered. Meanwhile, you’ll make yourself seem innocent to completely destroy my reputation. Is that it?”","Xu Anran’s eyes darkened as she pretended to be aggrieved. “Sister, that’s not what I meant. I’m telling the truth. Do you think you’re worthy of being the eldest daughter of the Xu family? Dad and Mom didn’t want to look for you before because—”","Smack!","Before she could finish, a slap landed on Xu Anran’s face.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. “Since you want to be beaten so badly, then I’ll fulfill your wish!”","This slap made Xu Anran’s face burn, but her face seemed fine.","Xu Anran wanted to anger Qiao Xi, but she did not expect Qiao Xi to be so arrogant and slap her. She gritted her teeth and forcefully endured her anger. Now that Qiao Xi had fallen into her trap, it could be said that she had gotten what she wanted. Hence, tears immediately welled up in her eyes. “Sister, why did you hit me? I know you hate me for taking your position, but someone swapped us back then. At that time, I was only an infant. How can you blame me for this?","“Although you and President Gu are married, I know that you’re not happy. You just refuse to tell the family about the issues you’re facing, so Mom wants me to be Mrs. Gu in your place. It’s also considered “","Smack!","Qiao Xi raised her hand and slapped her again.","Xu Anran had a surprised expression. In just a short while, she was actually slapped twice by Qiao Xi.","“You actually... Just you wait!”","Qiao Xi stroked her hair. “Do you know how noisy you are?!”","“Although I’m an adopted daughter, I’ve been by Dad and Mom’s side for 20 years. Dad and Mom treat me as their own. What right do you have to hit me? I can’t let you bully me like this!”","“Bully? Do you think I’m bullying you?” Qiao Xi crossed her arms and smiled coldly.","Xu Anran felt a chill run down her spine. She suppressed her anger and was about to cry.","“Are you going to cry, throw a tantrum, and make everyone see the palm print on your face? Will you accuse me of hitting you for no reason? Will you say that I was so jealous that I wanted to chase an adopted daughter like you out of the house? Will you say that I’m targeting you?” Qiao Xi asked."]},{"number":534,"title":"Chapter 534 - Regretting Provoking Qiao Xi","paragraphs":["The corners of Xu Anran’s mouth twitched.","“Since that’s your plan, won’t I ruin it if I don’t hit you?” Qiao Xi sneered as she clenched her fists and gradually approached her. “Those two slaps just now can’t be considered bullying just","yet.”","Xu Anran took a few steps back in horror. If this was not considered bullying, then what","was...","Smack! Smack!","Two consecutive slaps landed heavily on Xu Anran’s face. Qiao Xi snorted coldly. “Xu Anran, I’ve wanted to hit you for a long time. You’ve been targeting me since the first time we met. You also scattered flammable powder on the floor of the room you arranged for me. Did you want to burn me to death?”","Xu Anran gritted her teeth in pain. She was still getting slapped. Qiao Xi was not giving her a chance to resist at all.","Qiao Xi looked at her with a smile. “How could that piece of trash, Xu Anyi, dare get his people to kill me? It was probably your idea, right? If Xu Anyi had succeeded, he would’ve gotten rid of your biggest problem. If he failed, it wouldn’t have anything to do with you. In any case, he’d be the one in jail, while you’d still be the pure and innocent eldest daughter of the Xu family.”","“Sister, I... I didn’t. You wronged me...”","Smack!","“Why are you pretending in front of me?! Just because you like Gu Zheng, you expect me to divorce him and give up my position to you. Why are you so shameless? Even the earth can’t handle you anymore!”","Xu Anran held her burning cheeks and looked at Qiao Xi with horror.","At this moment, she actually regretted provoking this demon!","Qiao Xi slowly raised her hand and placed it on Xu Anran’sslapped neck, then she curled her lips into a cold smile. “Miss Xu, you should be glad that I’m feeling much better after just slapping you a few times. Otherwise...”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, Xu Anran’s breathing paused. She felt the blood in her entire body freeze as she broke out in a cold sweat from fear.","It was obvious from Qiao Xi’s eyes that she was not joking. She really wanted to kill her. “Ah! Let go of me! You devil! Ah!” Xu Anran suddenly felt a pain in her chest. Then, the pain spread throughout her body. It was as if she was being pricked by needles. It was so painful that her entire body spasmed. Her expression was ferocious as she could not help but roar.","Her body trembled violently. She did not believe that Qiao Xi would really dare to kill her. She was the eldest daughter of the Xu family and the beloved daughter of her parents. How would Qiao Xi dare?!","Xu Anran’s chest was so painful that she broke out in a cold sweat. She wished she could faint, but at this moment, she heard footsteps. It seemed like someone was coming.","She quickly pinched her arm to come back to her senses. She forced herself to stay conscious. Then, her eyes were filled with tears as she said in pain, “Sister! It hurts! I’m your sister. Why are you doing this to me?!","“Sister, please let me off! I was wrong. I shouldn’t have fought with you. I’ll leave the Xu family now. I don’t want anything anymore. Please spare my life! Don’t kill me...”","The footsteps gradually approached. Someone asked, “Do you hear cries for help?”","“I do. It seems to be the eldest daughter of the Xu family.”","Xia Yunlou suddenly rushed over and roared, “Qiao Xi, what are you doing?! You’re trying to kill your sister! Anran, Anran!”","Xu Anran’s face was covered in tears as she said weakly, “Mom, I’m fine. Don’t blame my sister. She misunderstood me, so she slapped me a few times. It’s just that my chest hurts now...”","Xia Yunlou was furious and charged aggressively at Qiao Xi. “You unfilial daughter! You dare hit your sister? Are you even human? Quickly apologize to your sister!”","Xu Anran sobbed. “Mom, don’t... force Sister. She said that I’m your adopted daughter and I’m not worthy to compete with her. Actually... she’s right. I’m not related to you by blood. She’s your biological daughter. I’ll leave now!”","“My precious Anran, stop crying. I won’t let you leave. You’ll always be my daughter!”","Xia Yunlou’s eyes were filled with heartache, then she pointed at Qiao Xi and roared furiously, “Qiao Xi! You’re fooling around again. You actually hit your sister this time. Quickly kneel down and admit your mistake!” Xu Anran curled up in Xia Yunlou’s embrace with a sinister smile. She wanted Qiao Xi to pay a painful price for these few slaps.","Now, everyone had seen Qiao Xi hit her and her forgiving Qiao Xi. Everyone would know that Qiao Xi was vicious, while she was the magnanimous Eldest Miss Xu."]},{"number":535,"title":"Chapter 535 - Crying Children Are Given Candy","paragraphs":["Xu Anran was weak, and she shed tears aggrievedly. “I’m fine... Sister doesn’t have to apologize. She only slapped me a few times. It’s okay.”","When Xia Yunlou saw her daughter’s aggrieved appearance, the anger in her heart burned even more. “Qiao Xi! You’re too heartless. This is your sister, yet you still dared to do such a thing. You actually learned such vicious methods when you were wandering outside! Get out of the Xu family right now. Our Xu family doesn’t want a vicious daughter like you!”","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi with puzzled expressions.","Qiao Xi stood there silently for a short while before sighing helplessly.","“Sigh! Miss Xu, don’t malign me. You were the one who suddenly fell to the floor. Why did you say that I hit you? Don’t tell me you’re dizzy from the pain!”","Qiao Xi said casually, “You said that I slapped you a few times and want me to apologize to you, but... Everyone, look at her face. Does it look like she has been slapped?”","Everyone took a closer look and saw that Xu Anran’s face was indeed extremely smooth. There were no traces of her ever being slapped. However, her tears were streaming down her face, making her look like she was in pain.","Qiao Xi sneered. “Just because Miss Xu is crying, Madam Xu is forcing me to kneel and apologize to Miss Xu. If I really return to the Xu family, I don’t know how much more I’ll have to suffer. Since that’s the case, it’s fine if I don’t return home.”","Everyone instantly understood. Madam Shen frowned and snorted. “It seems that Miss Xu is just pretending!”","Xu Anran’s face was pale.","She was really not pretending this time. Qiao Xi had clearly slapped her a few times just now. For some reason, her chest was hurting too. Why did everyone not believe her?","Xu Anran fell to the floor aggrievedly, and her eyes trickled down. She looked so pitiful that it made one’s heart ache.","She said softly, “Xi Xi, you did slap me a few times just now. Now, you’re saying that I wronged you. You... How can you do this to","me?!”","Her eyes were filled with sorrow as she sobbed weakly. “President Gu, you saw it too. Xi Xi hit me. Are you going to protect her?”","Xu Zhi and Gu Zheng walked over together. They looked at Xu Anran, who was lying on the floor, then at the crowd. They immediately frowned.","When Xia Yunlou saw Gu Zheng coming over, she immediately pretended to be sad. “Xi Xi, you’ve been wandering outside for so many years. My heart ached for you, but I didn’t expect you to have learned so many bad things during your time outside the family. It’s fine if you bully Anran at home, but even when you’re in the Shen family’s residence, you still dare to beat up your sister. You’re really lawless!”","Xu Anran’s eyes were filled with tears. “Madam Shen, it’s my fault. Even though my sister hit me, I shouldn’t have made things worse. I’m sorry... I’ve let everyone down.”","Xia Yunlou’s heart ached when she saw her compromise. She berated, “Qiao Xi, hurry up and apologize!”","Everyone did not dare to make a sound, but Madam Shen’s expression turned cold. She was about to speak when Qiao Xi spoke first. “Madam Xu, you said that I hit Xu Anran. Did you see it with your own eyes? They say that crying children are given candy, and I guess it’s true. As long as Xu Anran cries, will Madam Xu believe her no matter what she says?”","She did hit Xu Anran this time, but even if she did not, Madam Xu would still reprimand her in public all the same as long as Xu Anran cried.","Instead of being wronged, Qiao Xi might as well teach Xu Anran a lesson to vent her anger. Xia Yunlou glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. “What else could it be? Anran is so obedient. Could it be that she’d lie? You’re just jealous of Anran, so you brought her to a remote place to hit her. But you’re still unwilling to admit it!”","Qiao Xi said slowly, “Miss Xu, do you know who called me out?”","Xia Yunlou immediately choked.","Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “I was sleeping in my room when Madam Xu woke me up and called me over in the middle of the night.","“After that, when I was about to leave, it was Miss Xu who asked me out for a chat. I didn’t expect to be brought here either. Then, Madam Xu rushed over to accuse me. Coincidentally, so many people came over soon after.”","Everyone’s eyes landed on Xia Yunlou. She hurriedly explained, “Anran was just looking for you to have a chat with you. You’re sisters","“Chatting in the middle of the night? Madam Xu, you really know how to find excuses.” Qiao Xi sneered."]},{"number":536,"title":"Chapter 536 - This Place Is Remote And Has No Surveillance Cameras","paragraphs":["The entire venue was silent. Xu Anran gritted her teeth in hatred. This little b*tch actually dared to deny it?","Xu Anran had indeed deliberately lured Qiao Xi here with the intention of seizing the opportunity to wrong her. Now that her objective had been achieved, why should she waste her breath on Qiao Xi?","Xu Anran endured the pain in her cheeks and chest. Her voice trembled slightly as she said, “Madam Shen, if you don’t believe me, we can check the surveillance footage.”","For the sake of wronging Qiao Xi, she proposed to check the surveillance footage. Even though this place was remote, there were still surveillance cameras here that would have captured everything. Now that everyone was watching, as long as they checked the surveillance footage, the crime of Qiao Xi beating up her sister would be confirmed.","Unexpectedly, Madam Shen smiled sarcastically.","“Miss Xu, this place is remote and there are no surveillance cameras.”","Xu Anran widened her eyes. How could there be no surveillance cameras?","She had clearly been to the surveillance room before. There were surveillance cameras here, so why did Madam Shen say that there were no surveillance cameras here? Was she protecting Qiao Xi?","Xu Anran’s heart could not help but tremble. She suddenly realized that Madam Shen had been speaking up for Qiao Xi since the banquet began. Now, she said that there was no surveillance camera here.","She said aggrievedly, “Madam Shen, how could there be no surveillance cameras in the Shen family’s courtyard? As long as we check the surveillance footage, we’ll be able to see my sister hitting me. Are there really no surveillance cameras, or are you just unwilling to check the footage?","“Madam Shen, I’m innocent! I beg you to show everyone the surveillance footage!”","Everyone’s eyes were filled with confusion. Although the Xu family’s attitude was not good and Xu Anran, their adopted daughter, was also vicious and merciless, she had a sincere expression at this moment. She did not seem to be lying. Could it be that Qiao Xi really hit someone?","Xu Anran looked at everyone’s uncertain gazes and curled her lips.","She knew that someone would definitely stand on her side. She was already crying so sadly, so how could they not believe her?","Even though she had received a few tight slaps from Qiao Xi, it was worth it to take this opportunity to ruin Qiao Xi’s reputation.","Xu Anran’s eyes were filled with tears. She was very confident. “Madam Shen, show everyone the surveillance footage! You’ll know the truth once you see it. My sister really hit me. I’m not lying!”","Hearing her sincere complaint, everyone echoed, “Yes, Madam Shen. Now that the two of them are saying the different things, it’s better to check the surveillance footage. We’ll know who’s telling the truth then.”","Xia Yunlou glared fiercely. “Qiao Xi, why aren’t you saying anything? Are you feeling guilty?”","Everyone’s gazes landed on Qiao Xi. They saw her slowly raise her eyes and chuckle.","“Didn’t Madam Shen just say that there are no surveillance cameras here?”","Xia Yunlou was angry and blurted out, “Madam Shen is protecting you! Qiao Xi, it’s fine that you beat up my sister, but you’re also unwilling to admit it. Seriously...”","“Me?” Madam Shen asked coldly.","“Miss Xu, you said that Xi Xi hit you and are asking for the surveillance footage. But I already said that there are no surveillance cameras here. You said that I’m protecting Xi Xi, but I remember that it’s your first time coming to my residence. Why are you so sure that there are surveillance cameras here?”","Xu Anran immediately choked and panicked.","Madam Shen’s face was filled with mockery. “Miss Xu, you’re really scheming! You secretly went to the surveillance room, and after confirming that there are no surveillance cameras here, you invited Xi Xi here in the middle of the night. You’re now accusing Xi Xi of beating you up.","“You’re sure that there are no surveillance cameras here, so no one will know whether Xi Xi hit you or not. In any case, as long as you fall to the floor and cry, someone will definitely believe you. You clearly know that there are no surveillance cameras here, but you still want to check the surveillance footage. You just want to accuse me of protecting Qiao Xi!”","Xu Anran’s body went weak as her face turned pale.","This was impossible!","She had clearly gone to the surveillance room and saw that there were surveillance cameras here, so she came up with this plan. She wanted Qiao Xi to attack her and have the scene be captured by the surveillance cameras so that Qiao Xi would not be able to explain herself.","However, the surveillance cameras were gone now, and Madam Shen’s words had pushed the blame to her.","Xia Yunlou defended her daughter agitatedly, “Madam Shen! You... You’re protecting Qiao Xi! What did she say to you?! Anran... How could Anran be lying? Even if she went to the surveillance room, she might not have seen the screens.”"]},{"number":537,"title":"Chapter 537 - The Shen Family Can’t Tolerate The Scheming Adopted Daughter","paragraphs":["“Anran was beaten up by Qiao Xi. Qiao Xi must know that there are no surveillance cameras here and that’s why she’s so arrogant. We can’t let her off!”","As soon as Xia Yunlou finished speaking, Madam Shen sneered. “Madam Xu, you’re really strange. You always protect your adopted daughter but never listen to your biological daughter’s explanation. Since you don’t believe me, it’s easy to settle this. Butler Liu!”","Butler Liu immediately walked forward.","Madam Shen instructed, “Go! Get the doctor to examine Miss Xu!”","Xia Yunlou’s gaze froze. Before she could say anything, she heard Madam Shen say sarcastically, “Right, you must find a respectable doctor to prevent Madam Xu from saying that I’m protecting Xi Xi!”","Everyone looked at Xia Yunlou and her daughter in disdain.","Putting aside whether Xu Anran was beaten up or not, she must have ulterior motives for secretly going to the surveillance room. She must have something up her sleeve.","No matter whether Qiao Xi had hit someone or not, it was all Xu Anran’s fault. Otherwise, why would she be beaten up after asking Qiao Xi out in the middle of the night and setting all this up?","However, Madam Xu was really infuriating. She was biased toward her adopted daughter. If it were not for Madam Shen speaking up, Qiao Xi would probably have a bad reputation after being misunderstood for having beaten her sister.","“What’s there to check?! There are only a few tears on Miss Xu’s face. There are no red marks at all. She doesn’t look like she was beaten up at all!”","“That’s right! Madam Xu, your adopted daughter is really... scheming! She secretly went to the surveillance room just to set up this show, right?” “Mr. Xu, your Xu family is also considered a noble family. I didn’t expect your family to be so unethical. You actually let your wife and adopted daughter fool around in the Shen family’s residence! Later, the doctor will come to check on Miss Xu. If she doesn’t have any injuries, I’ll see how you’ll explain it then!”","Xu Zhi’s face was ashen.","He sized up Xu Anran. The sides of her cheeks were still smooth with no red marks on them. There were no injuries on her body either, but she fell to the floor and looked to be in pain. It was really hard to believe.","Xu Zhi frowned. “Xu Anran, what are you doing? Hurry up and go back!”","Xu Anran widened her eyes in disbelief. “Dad, you have to believe me. My sister really hit me. For some reason, my chest hurts too!”","“There were surveillance cameras here, but... But for some reason, they’re gone now. You have to believe me! I’m telling the truth!”","At this moment, a madam stood up, and her eyes were filled with anger. “It’s really annoying! Madam Shen, I don’t understand why you invited such people to the Shen family’s banquet. Now that Miss Xu has admitted that she went to the surveillance room, it’s obvious that Miss Xu set up a trap to wrong Qiao Xi!”","Butler Liu explained, “Madam invited the Xu family because she thought that the Xu and Xia families were both wealthy and noble families. She didn’t expect them to be so unscrupulous.” Madam Shen instructed coldly, “Butler Liu, since everyone thinks so, then send them out. Our Shen family holds banquets for entertainment. We can’t tolerate such a scheming adopted daughter who causes trouble. Moreover, I invited the Xu family. An adopted daughter can’t be considered a member of the Xu family.”","Xu Anran was about to faint.","She did not expect Madam Shen to say these words in public. She did not show her any respect at all.","Even now, she still could not understand why Madam Shen would be so biased toward Qiao Xi. There were clearly surveillance cameras. As long as they checked the surveillance footage, they would be able to confirm that Qiao Xi had hit her. However, Madam Shen did not admit that there were surveillance cameras here.","Wait!","Xu Anran’s eyes suddenly widened as if she had realized something. No wonder Qiao Xi was so decisive and fearless when she hit her. It turned out that she had known all along...","This b*tch had already guessed her plan and joined forces with Madam Shen to put on an act. However, she still fell into this trap.","She was forcefully slapped a few times, yet everyone suspected her instead! Qiao Xi had really played a good move!","Qiao Xi’s gaze was indifferent as she silently looked at Xu Anran.","Did she think she was going too far? She was just giving her a taste of her own medicine.","If she did not have a backer and was just an ordinary country girl, how could she face Xu Anran’s repeated attacks after being found by the Xu family?"]},{"number":538,"title":"Chapter 538 - Had To Endure It","paragraphs":["If this was not the Shen family but the Xu family, Xu Anran’s plan would have succeeded. Then, Qiao Xi would be the one despised by everyone. Xu Anran could firmly sit on the seat of the eldest daughter of the Xu family and forever suppress her.","Everyone would say that the true daughter of the Xu family was scheming and vicious. She was not worthy to be the eldest daughter of the Xu family. Only the pure and kind Xu Anran was worthy of being the eldest daughter of the Xu family.","Now that Xu Anran’s plan had failed, she gritted her teeth in hatred.","Madam Shen did not even bother to look at Xu Anran. She turned around and left. “Butler Liu, I’ll leave this to you. Mr. Xu, if you want to leave with Miss Xu, our Shen family won’t say anything about it.”","Seeing that the matter was settled, everyone left with Madam Shen.","Gu Zheng said casually, “Mr. Xu, since you can’t even handle your own family’s matters, let’s talk about Young Master Xu in the future! Xi Xi, let’s go.”","Qiao Xi gently held Gu Zheng’s arm and said delicately, “Fortunately, Madam Shen stepped in. Otherwise, I would’ve been wronged! I was really scared! Sob sob sob...”","Gu Zheng curled his lips slightly. He really liked this side of Mrs. Gu. She was very cute.","After everyone left, only the Xu family was left.","Xu Anran was still sitting on the floor with tears streaming down her face. She really did not understand how Qiao Xi had guessed her plan and even managed to slander her.","She looked at the angry Xu Zhi and had a bad feeling. She explained while trembling, “Dad, I’m really not lying. Do you believe—”.","Smack!","Xu Zhi raised his hand and slapped Xu Anran hard. A clear palm print appeared on her smooth and fair cheek.","This was the first time Xu Zhi slapped Xu Anran. This slap was also full of strength. Xu Anran immediately vomited blood.","“Xu Zhi! Are you crazy?!” Xia Yunlou screamed in shock.","Xu Zhi roared, “I’m crazy? I think this unfilial daughter is crazy! Anyi is still locked up in the police station, but she just had to find trouble with Qiao Xi! Is she crazy? How can our Xu family have such a stupid daughter?","“You keep saying that she hit you, but there’s no mark on your face at all. Couldn’t you have thought things through a little before deciding to lie? She didn’t hit you at all, yet you insisted on saying that she hit you in front of everyone. Isn’t that equivalent to shooting yourself in the foot? You’re really as stupid as a pig! Get lost right now!”","Xu Anran sobbed. “Dad, Sister...”","“Anran, stop talking.” Xia Yunlou’s eyes were filled with warning. Then, she comforted her softly.","“It’s your fault this time. I know you hate Xi Xi, but you can’t be so anxious. This is the Shen family’s residence. So many eyes are on you, yet you still wanted to provoke her. I don’t even know what to say to you now.”","Xia Yunlou looked at her red cheek and her heart ached. “Don’t mess around like this in the future.”","Xu Anran was so angry that she bit the corner of her mouth until blood flowed out. She was wronged yet she had to endure it. No one believed that Qiao Xi had really hit her.","Xu Anran was about to explain when a servant walked over and said softly, “Miss Xu, Madam has instructed you to leave as soon as possible. If you’re done packing, come out with me!”","Xu Anran almost gasped.","The news that she was chased out of the Shen family’s banquet tomorrow would probably spread throughout high society. How was she going to survive in the socialite circle, then?!","Xu Anran’s eyes were filled with viciousness.","‘Qiao Xi! Just you wait!’","The next day.","After the banquet, Qiao Xi watched Xu Zhi and Xia Yunlou get into a car. Xia Yunlou even glared at her after getting in.","“The guests from the Shen family all know what happened last night. The Xu family will definitely hate you. They clearly know that Xu Anran framed you, but they’ll still blame","you.”","Gu Zheng opened the car door.","Qiao Xi was not surprised in the slightest. It was no secret that the Xu couple was biased toward Xu Anran. However, Xu Anran would probably stop making a move on her for a while.","After the two of them returned to Longwan Residential, Qiao Xi noticed that Gu Zheng’s expression was slightly gloomy."]},{"number":539,"title":"Chapter 539 - President Gu Is Suddenly Crazy","paragraphs":["“Follow me,” the man said indifferently. His voice was low and filled with dominance. The entire villa seemed to be filled with a chill.","Qiao Xi was puzzled and frowned slightly.","What was going on? He was fine when he got into the car just now. Why was he suddenly unhappy?","After entering the bedroom, Gu Zheng tossed his jacket aside and sat on the sofa. He loosened his tie, revealing his well-defined collarbone. His expression was cold and serious.","“When I asked you how you planned to deal with the Xu family, you said that you’re weak and timid, so you won’t bicker with the Xu family at all.”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched slightly. Gu Zheng had asked her the question last night when the two of them were lying on the bed. At that time, in order to maintain her weak image, she spouted a few nonsensical words. However, she beat Xu Anran up the next day.","Qiao Xi was slightly guilty. “That was what I said at that time, but Xu Anran insisted on provoking me, so I punished her a little so that she wouldn’t provoke me anymore. How can you blame me for this? I’ve always been weak and timid. If Xu Anran hadn’t set me up, why would I hit her?”","Gu Zheng sneered and said word by word, “Weak? Timid? You can even bring yourself to say those words, huh?”","Qiao Xi did not expect that he would mock her. She instantly glared at him. “You’re mocking me? Do you feel sorry for Xu Anran?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. “Mrs. Gu, is your head just there for decoration? Don’t make me think that I married a fool.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","What was wrong with this bastard?!","Qiao Xi’s heart ached. She had only slapped Xu Anran a few times. Moreover, it was Xu Anran who provoked her first. She had also said that she could handle these matters herself, but Gu Zheng insisted on following her.","After seeing her hit Xu Anran, this bastard was unhappy.","The anger and grievance in her heart instantly surged. Tears welled up in Qiao Xi’s eyes.","She did not care that the Xu family favored Xu Anran, but she would not allow Gu Zheng to side with Xu Anran. Gu Zheng wass her senior and they had known each other for ten years.","Gu Zheng took a deep breath. “In order not to let Xu Anran wrongly accuse you, you got Madam Shen to remove all the surveillance cameras, so no matter what you did, no one would know. However, didn’t you ever think that since Xu Anran dared to go to such a remote place with you alone, she must have a trump card?","“You were so bold and thought that Xu Anran couldn’t beat you, but were you so sure that she wouldn’t have helpers?”","Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes.","“Xu Anran is stupid, so you managed to turn the tables around. However, you knew that she hated you and invited you to the courtyard with ill intentions. Yet you actually dared to go out alone with her and even walked to a remote corner where there were no surveillance cameras. Mrs. Gu, you’re too gutsy!”","Qiao Xi originally wanted to retort, but when she heard the latter part of Gu Zheng’s words, she realized that Gu Zheng was just afraid that she would be in danger. The anger in her heart instantly vanished. “I-I’m very familiar with the Shen family’s courtyard. Even if Xu Anran had helpers, I wouldn’t be afraid. I could just run away. They wouldn’t be able to catch up to me. Moreover,”","Before she could finish, warm lips attacked her and stopped her from defending herself.","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes. “Xi Xi, stop fooling around. You’re not allowed to go out alone with such a person anymore. What should I do if something were to happen to you? Let Song Shiyu follow you secretly in the future. At least let him protect you.”","A wave of warmth surged in Qiao Xi’s heart. This man was quiet the entire night because he was worried about her.","Qiao Xi wrapped her arms around his strong waist and said sweetly, “Ah Zheng, I love you so much!”","The man’s body trembled slightly. His hot palm landed on her back and slowly roamed across her body.","Qiao Xi hugged the man’s waist before letting her hands wander. When she touched his tight abs, some lingering scenes instantly appeared in her mind.","Back in Maple Garden, she had touched Gu Zheng’s waist as well. Then, this man tormented her like crazy for the entire night. However, she recovered her taste buds the next day. Now that a few days had passed, her ability to taste had disappeared again. Should she...","Now was the time to be touched. Why were her thoughts a mess? She was actually thinking about such things. She was really too unrestrained.","However, this man’s body was so tempting. She could not control the thoughts in her mind, and her eyes gradually became confused."]},{"number":540,"title":"Chapter 540 - A Man’s Strength","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng glanced at her red cheeks and dazed eyes. He instantly understood.","The man smirked. “Mrs. Gu.”","“Huh?”","“Don’t think I don’t know what you’re thinking. You’re drooling.”","Qiao Xi subconsciously touched the corners of her mouth and noticed that she had been deceived by Gu Zheng, so she pouted. “Ah Zheng, you lied to me. How annoying!”","The man pulled her into his arms and pressed his body tightly against hers. He stared at her fair neck and collarbone with burning eyes. “You want it?”","Damn! He was too straightforward! She was still a baby!","Qiao Xi’s face turned red. Although it was not appropriate to say all this at this moment, Gu Zheng still brought her to the bedroom. The atmosphere could not help but make one imagine.","The scene from that day suddenly appeared in her mind. Gu Zheng was lying on top of her, panting slightly. The strands of hair on his forehead were swaying.","The more Qiao Xi thought about it, the shyer she felt. The blush on her face even spread to the back of her ears. “Ah Zheng, um,”","“Okay, stop thinking about it,” the man interrupted coldly. “As your punishment for making me worry, put away your thoughts and come downstairs for dinner with me immediately!”","As soon as he finished speaking, he walked out of the bedroom first, leaving Qiao Xi standing in the same spot in a daze.","Qiao Xi had an embarrassed expression on her face while the corners of her mouth twitched slightly. Then, she muttered unhappily at his back.","Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng suddenly turned around and happened to see Qiao Xi’s angry expression. He sneered. “Mrs. Gu, you seem to be very dissatisfied with me?”","Qiao Xi smiled awkwardly with her hands supporting her chin.","“I... How could I be dissatisfied?! I like you so much! Hahaha...”","Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully. Unfortunately, he could not hear Qiao Xi’s thoughts now. They would certainly be very interesting.","In the dining room.","Song Shijing and the butler had already prepared the food. They were waiting for the president and Young Madam to come down and eat.","However, after a long time, the two of them did not come downstairs. Song Shijing could not help but find it strange. In the past, when the president lived alone, he would usually get the kitchen to prepare the food only after he was done with work. However, after he married Young Madam, the time was fixed. Why were they still not here yet?","After a while, Song Shiyu rushed downstairs.","Song Shiyu smiled ambiguously. “Haha, Brother, don’t wait anymore. When I was going upstairs, I heard something in the bedroom... Hehe, just leave them be for now.”","Song Shijing was stunned for a few seconds before he realized what was going on.","Song Shiyu said excitedly, “Do you know what Young Madam and the president are doing? Brother, you know how capable the president is. It’ll probably take a long time, so...”","Before he could finish, footsteps came from upstairs.","Gu Zheng stood at the stairs and stared at Song Shiyu with a faint smile.","Song Shiyu: “...” Although the president seemed to be smiling, why did he find it so scary? He choked on his saliva and coughed violently.","“President... Ahem... President, so soon? Um... Let’s eat, hehe.”","He thought that the president would take at least two hours. He did not expect him to come out in just a few minutes. He was too weak. Was there something wrong with the president?!","Fortunately, he did not say what was on his mind just now. Otherwise, the president would definitely not let him off easily. If he openly talked about him being incapable, he probably would not just have his salary deducted but also risk losing his life!","Gu Zheng’s eyes narrowed slightly as he looked coldly at Qiao Xi, who was behind him. Qiao Xi was terrified to the point her entire body trembled.","‘I’m innocent! Song Shiyu is thinking too much. It’s not my fault!’","Gu Zheng gave a small smile and held Qiao Xi’s hand as they sat down. The man thoughtfully picked up some food for her and took the opportunity to whisper into her ear, “I’ll let you off this time, but I won’t let you off next time.”","Qiao Xi’s entire body trembled while her face flushed red.","Xu family.","Xu Anran was suddenly sent back to the Xu family in the middle of the night. The person who sent her said that she was scheming and did not want to see her at high society banquets in the future.","Although the Xu family’s servants did not know what was going on, they could roughly guess what was going on. They were all mocking her in their hearts. Since she was an adopted daughter, she should know her place. However, she just had to compete with the real daughter of the Xu family. What was even more infuriating was that the Xu couple were also muddle-headed and actually allowed their adopted daughter to bully their biological daughter."]},{"number":541,"title":"Chapter 541 - The Yin Family Brought A Birthday Present","paragraphs":["Xia Yunlou flew into a rage. “Qiao Xi is really a jinx. She caused so much trouble the moment she came back and now, she says she’s not coming back to the family. Everyone must be talking bad about our Xu family!","“Alright, it’s better that you’re not coming back. Otherwise, I’ll be upset.”","Xia Yunlou was a little tired. She curled up on the sofa and instructed, “Nanny Li, go upstairs and throw out Qiao Xi’s things. Move Anran’s things back.”","Nanny Li looked troubled.","Xu Zhi immediately roared at the top of his voice, “Are you crazy?! You actually wanted to throw away Xi Xi’s things?! If Xu Anran hadn’t framed Qiao Xi and let others have a handle on her, how could there have been such a huge commotion? How could Qiao Xi still want to come back after that?”","Xia Yunlou retorted, “It’s all because Qiao Xi was unwilling to let things go. Otherwise, why would they say Anran is fine? Moreover, you can’t say that Anran framed Qiao Xi. The two of them were just playing around. Anran and Xi Xi were just joking, but Xi Xi insisted on looking for trouble!”","Xu Zhi felt anger rush to his head. “Xu Anran is just our adopted daughter. Even if you dote on her, she can’t blatantly frame our biological daughter!”","“Anran has been by our sides for 20 years. Although we’re not related by blood, she’s more like our biological daughter! Anran has been the eldest daughter of the Xu family for so many years. What right do you have to give her position to Qiao Xi as soon as she returns? Have you ever thought about Anran’s feelings? Why are you so vicious?!”","Xia Yunlou started crying as he spoke. “My Anran has been pampered since she was young. She has never been wronged. Ever since Qiao Xi returned, she has always bullied Anran. It’s been so many years since the incident. It doesn’t matter if she’s my biological daughter or not. Can’t we just go back to the way things used to be?”","Nanny Li turned around. She found it hard to accept.","Speaking of which, Qiao Xi never said that she wanted to return to the Xu family. It was them who took the initiative to look for her. Now, Madam Xu said that she wanted things to go back to how they were before. Then why did they disturb Qiao Xi’s life back then? It was just because of the patriarch’s orders. They were also greedy for the large amount of wealth Miss Xia Yunqiu left behind.","If Miss Qiao did not return to the Xu family, they would have gone to look for her and beg her to come back. When Miss Qiao came back, they said that she returned to snatch Xu Anran’s identity and status.","They were so unruly and did everything they wanted, yet they still wanted to blame Qiao Xi. How unreasonable!","At this moment, a servant rushed in. “Sir, Madam.”","The servant was holding a beautiful gift box. “Madam, this is a gift from your mother. She said it’s for Eldest Miss’ birthday.”","Xia Yunlou was a little surprised. She had not contacted her mother for a long time. Why did her mother suddenly give Anran a gift?","Thinking about it, Anran’s birthday was indeed coming soon. The Yin family had given her a gift, which meant that they thought highly of Anran and hoped that she could become the heir to the Xu family.","At this moment, in Longwan Residential, Qiao Xi hurriedly went upstairs after eating. She was prepared to continue working hard to recover her taste buds and seduce... Gu Zheng.","Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng came downstairs in a suit.","Qiao Xi was puzzled. “You’re going out?” Gu Zheng said casually, “Yes, Gu Yao owns a horse ranch. I’ll bring you there today.”","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. When did Gu Yao have a horse ranch? Why didn’t she know?","When the two of them got into the car, she could not help but size up the man in front of her. This man had been throwing a tantrum the entire night because she made him worry about her last night. Her heart softened as she leaned closer to his body.","“Stop fooling around.” The man stopped her softly.","Qiao Xi said sweetly, “Ah Zheng, Xu Anran always bullies me. Can you help me deal with her?”","Gu Zheng did not hesitate. “Yes.”","Qiao Xi’s face was full of smiles as she hugged his arm tightly and pressed her entire body against his. She said slowly, “What if I want to kill her?”","Before Gu Zheng could say anything, Song Shiyu, who was driving, could not help but say, “Young Madam, the president said not to always fight and kill. Don’t be so violent.”","Only then did Qiao Xi realize that there was another person in front of them. She could not help but feel a little embarrassed. She stroked her hair and said with a smile, “Song Shiyu.”","Song Shiyu asked, “What’s wrong, Young Madam?”","Qiao Xi said meaningfully, “I think it’s really a waste of your talent to stay by Gu Zheng’s side with your intelligence. I think you should broaden your horizons.”"]},{"number":542,"title":"Chapter 542 - 100 Million Is Just A Small Amount Of Money!","paragraphs":["Song Shiyu looked delighted. “Young Madam, you have keen insight! You’re right! I think I’m super smart too. It’s indeed inappropriate for me to be a mere assistant.”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘Do you think I’m praising you? Your IQ is really startling!’","At the horse ranch.","After Qiao Xi got out of the car, she could not help but sigh at how luxurious the horse ranch was. There was no end in sight, and there were many luxury cars parked around. It seemed that it was a place exclusively for the people of high society to enjoy themselves.","Gu Yao rushed over like a husky and ran in front of Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “You spent a lot of money on this, right?”","Gu Yao looked arrogant. “It’s alright. It’s just 100 million. It’s just a small sum to me.”","He did not set up the horse ranch to earn money, but to squander the money of the Gu family before Lu Yan took over. Anyway, even if he had no money, Gu Zheng would support him. He was not afraid of anything.","However, this matter was very difficult to accomplish. After all, the Gu family was too damn rich!","Qiao Xi could not help but be stunned. 100 million was a small sum?","“Let’s go! I’ll bring you to take a look. This horse ranch has just opened, so we won’t be disturbed by anyone. We can play as much as we want!”","The few of them entered the ranch. At this moment, there were a few horses of good quality walking leisurely. Gu Yao casually pointed. “Qiao Xi, pick the one you like.”","She walked in front and suddenly pointed at one of the horses, asking, “Gu Yao, where did this horse come from?”","The horses in Gu Yao’s ranch were all expensive. Only the horse Qiao Xi pointed at looked very ordinary. It did not have any special characteristics at all, but it was a little taller than the rest.","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with surprise. Although it had been a while since they last met, she could still recognize that this was the horse that her elder brother had given her on the mountain.","Gu Zheng smiled.","Qiao Xi instantly reacted when she saw him smile. “This is my horse, right? Wasn’t it in F Country? How did you get it back?”","As soon as the horse saw Qiao Xi, it immediately ran over to her and panted excitedly while drooling.","Gu Yao had a look of disdain as he leaned closer to Gu Zheng and asked in a low voice, “This is... Qiao Xi’s horse? Why does it look so silly? Moreover, this horse is so big. How can Qiao Xi’s height be suitable for it? Girls should choose a petite and gentle horse. Qiao Xi is so short, so she shouldn’t ride such a tall horse. The difficulty level is too high.”","Qiao Xi: “....”","She looked at Gu Zheng with an aggrieved expression and said delicately, “Ah Zheng, your younger brother despises me for being short.”","Gu Zheng sneered. “I can beat him up. If he’s in a wheelchair, he won’t be as tall as you.”","Gu Yao: “...” The two of you are bullies! I just said something casually and you want to cripple me?’","Qiao Xi smiled proudly and gently stroked the horse’s mane. She had not seen her horse for a long time, but she was still very attached to it. She previously planned to bring the horse back to Longwan Residential to raise it. She was about to leave when she suddenly heard a voice from afar","“Xi Xi, this horse is too tall and not suitable for girls to ride. You’ve just started learning how to ride a horse. It’s better to be careful and not hurt yourself.”","Yao Mengqing was wearing a blue riding suit as she rode on a horse. Her perfect waist was outlined as she slowly approached like a proud princess.","She got off the horse with a gentle expression. “Xi Xi, I’m good at horse riding. I wonder if you can let me try this horse. I can help you choose a horse that’s more suitable for you.”","Before Qiao Xi could answer, Gu Yao blocked her unhappily. “Why are you here?”","The ranch had just opened. He had only informed a few close friends and did not tell Yao Mengqing","In any case, he was not doing this for money. It did not matter if he lost customers. It would be better if no one came. He could hide here and relax every day.","However, Yao Mengqing suddenly appeared here and had even brought others with her. The scene instantly fell into awkwardness.","Her expression was gentle, and she was smiling. “Ah Yao, won’t you welcome me when you’ve opened your doors to do business? You’re my good friend. You opened a horse ranch, so of course, I have to come and support you.”","At this moment, a man behind Yao Mengqing said, “Miss Yao, you’re right. Ah Yao, I know that this is your first time starting a business, so I brought many friends to support you. You won’t refuse to welcome us, right?”","Gu Yao frowned.","Qiao Xi was calm."]},{"number":543,"title":"Chapter 543 - Both Humans And Ghosts Are Welcome When Running A Business","paragraphs":["Lu Yan smiled gently as more than ten people followed behind him.","Gu Yao’s face darkened as he muttered softly, “You’re not welcome...”","“Since you’re doing business, it naturally doesn’t matter if you’re human or a ghost,” Qiao Xi spoke first with a mocking smile on her face. “You’re all customers, so of course, we have to welcome you. One can’t be picky when doing business, right, Ah Zheng?”","The smile on Yao Mengqing’s face froze.","Gu Yao echoed stubbornly, “Sister-in-law, you’re right. I’m a businessman. It doesn’t matter who the other party is. They just need to pay, so I welcome everyone who pays.”","Yao Mengqing ignored Gu Yao and walked to Qiao Xi’s side.","“Xi Xi, can you give this horse to me?”","Gu Yao was instantly angry. “Sister Mengqing, although my horse ranch isn’t big, there are still thousands of horses for you to choose from. Why do you have to have Qiao Xi’s horse? Have you forgotten what you did in the design competition? You deliberately tried to make Qiao Xi look bad. Don’t you find yourself annoying?”","His mocking comments made everyone’s expressions change.","Yao Mengqing’s eyes were vicious as she suppressed the anger in her heart. “What happened before was a misunderstanding. I was deceived by Jason. Moreover... I’ve already apologized. I just think that this horse is too tall and am afraid that Xi Xi will get injured. I’m just being kind. I didn’t expect you to think of me that way.”","Gu Yao was just about to explain that the horse belonged to Qiao Xi. Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi nodded indifferently and said, “Miss Yao, you’re really kind!”","Everyone sized up Qiao Xi and saw her let go of the reins with an indifferent expression. “I don’t know anything about horses. I just randomly chose one. Since you say the horse doesn’t suit me, then forget it. I’m also afraid that I’ll get injured.”","Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully.","Yao Mengqing had a victorious smile on her face. Qiao Xi was really sensible!","Immediately after, she heard Qiao Xi say casually, “Miss Yao, you’ve been emphasizing that this horse isn’t suitable for me. You also said that you’re skilled in riding. Does that mean that you have the ability to control this horse? Why don’t you personally demonstrate how to ride this horse and let us broaden our horizons?”","Yao Mengqing looked at Gu Zheng with a gentle expression. “Ah Zheng, what do you think? I’m not trying to snatch Xi Xi’s things. It’s just that she—”.","The man’s expression was indifferent as he said, “Up to you.”","Everyone was stunned. Rumor had it that Gu Zheng and Yao Mengqing had cut ties, but now, Gu Zheng was simply watching as Yao Mengqing stole Qiao Xi’s horse. He did not say anything to stop her. Could it be that Gu Zheng still had feelings for Yao Mengqing?","Yao Mengqing was touched. “Ah Zheng, thank","you.”","She said gently, “Xi Xi, I’ll take this horse with me. Once I tame it, I’ll bring it back for you to try.”","Qiao Xi smiled as she said, “Alright! I’ll be waiting for your good news! I don’t think you’ll fail. After all, you’re skilled in riding!”","After that, Qiao Xi tossed the reins to Yao Mengqing.","Yao Mengqing did not find it strange. On the other hand, Qiao Xi agreeing so readily gave her an extremely strong sense of confidence.","Everyone was also waiting for Yao Mengqing to display her superb riding skills. They wanted to see Mrs. Gu get taken down a notch to prevent her from overestimating herself.","Yao Mengqing smiled proudly. Actually, she was utterly unable to discern this horse’s character. She just saw that Qiao Xi was not wearing any riding clothes and concluded at a glance that Qiao Xi did not know how to ride a horse. However, this horse was standing docilely and obediently by her side. It seemed to be a horse with a gentle temperament, so it should not be difficult at all.","She did not care whether she could tame the horse or not. As long as she could snatch it from Qiao Xi, she would feel happy.","As long as she rode this horse and circled around once, she would be able to highlight Qiao Xi’s incompetence. Not only would Qiao Xi embarrass herself, but she would also embarrass Ah Zheng.","Yao Mengqing’s lips curled into a proud smile as she nodded. “In that case, I’ll try riding it.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Yao Mengqing grabbed the reins and got into a standard riding posture. However, the next second","The originally gentle horse suddenly raised its head and neighed, shaking Yao Mengqing off.","Yao Mengqing was shocked. She held the reins to steady herself and stepped on the stirrups in shock.","Neigh","The horse neighed and shook its front hooves angrily. Yao Mengqing was shocked."]},{"number":544,"title":"Chapter 544 - Don’t Boast If You Don’t Have The Ability","paragraphs":["Everyone took a few steps back in fear and stared at Yao Mengqing.","Yao Mengqing looked embarrassed. This horse was very gentle when it was with Qiao Xi just now. Why did it suddenly become irritable when she was riding it?","It was impossible that she could not control a horse that Qiao Xi could!","Yao Mengqing smiled awkwardly. “I haven’t ridden a horse in a long time. I’m probably a little rusty, so I scared the horse.”","The people behind her quickly comforted her. “It’s okay. This horse looks very fierce, but you’re skilled in horse riding. It’s only a matter of time before you tame this horse.”","Yao Mengqing’s expression softened a little. She was so nervous that her palms were sweating, but she gritted her teeth and held the reins tightly. She stepped on the stirrups and tried to get on the horse again,","However, the horse was even more irritable. It jumped up crazily and shook her off it.","There was complete silence.","Yao Mengqing tried three times but could not even get on the horse. This was enough to prove that Yao Mengqing’s riding skills were just so-so. Yao Mengqing, who originally thought that her riding skills were superb, was so embarrassed that she wished she could find a hole to hide in.","No one dared to say anything. Only Qiao Xi looked at her with a serious expression and sighed. “Sigh! Miss Yao, you kept saying that you were skilled in riding, but you can’t even get on the horse!”","The air was eerily quiet. The horse stood obediently to the side, its eyes innocent as if everything happening had nothing to do with","it.","The corners of Yao Mengqing’s mouth twitched slightly. Her expression was ugly. She grabbed the reins tightly and gritted her teeth as she forced herself onto the horse.","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly. That was a horse given to her by her eldest brother. She was usually unwilling to even scold it, yet Yao Mengqing was actually treating her baby so fiercely.","Yao Mengqing finally heaved a sigh of relief after getting on the horse. She turned around and smiled. “Xi Xi, this horse is indeed a little temperamental. Fortunately, I didn’t let you ride it just now. Otherwise, you would’ve gotten in trouble if you fell and got injured.”","At this moment, Yao Mengqing felt that the horse under her was a little anxious. It moved back and forth, pulling the reins and tightening its neck. Her voice carried a hint of fear. “This horse is just like a human being. If you’re a little more forceful with it, it’ll be obedient. Xi Xi, you don’t know how to ride. If you simply get on the horse, you’ll definitely... Ah!”","Before she could finish, the horse suddenly let out a long neigh and galloped anxiously. It shook its hooves crazily in an attempt to shake off the person on its back. Yao Mengqing was shocked and held the reins tightly.","Her actions seemed to be hurting the horse, so it became even more irritable and swung it with all its might.","“Ah!”","Yao Mengqing instantly felt the world spin as she fell to the ground. Fortunately, she was wearing protective gear. Her injuries were not too serious, but she still felt sore all over.","Seeing this, Yao Mengqing’s admirers instantly rushed over to help her. They shouted, “Second Young Master Gu, the horses in your ranch are wild and difficult to tame. It actually injured Miss Yao. What do you think we should do about this?!”","“That’s right. This wild horse injured someone! We shouldn’t let it live. I think we should just kill it to avenge Miss Yao.”","Yao Mengqing was angered to the point of gnashing her teeth. This bastard was simply like Qiao Xi, deliberately going against her. Not only did it cause her to lose face, but it even injured her. She should kill it.","“Didn’t Miss Yao say that her riding skills are superb? Actually, they’re just so-so!”","Qiao Xi chuckled as she spoke with a carefree tone, but she had a surprised expression on her face. “I’ve learned something today. You want to kill a horse just because you can’t tame it? Second Young Master Gu is running a horse ranch, not a slaughterhouse. You say you’re here to support Second Young Master Gu, but why do I feel like you’re here to cause trouble?!”","Gu Yao hurriedly echoed, “That’s right. Don’t boast if you don’t have the ability. You’re not good at riding, yet you insisted on riding a horse. Sister Mengqing, you want to kill the horse just because you couldn’t tame it. How can I continue operating this ranch, then?!”","Yao Mengqing’s face turned pale.","Qiao Xi said slowly, “Miss Yao, you spent so much effort snatching my horse away. I thought that your riding skills were very commendable, but I didn’t expect that you still fell after finally getting on it.”","Gu Yao snorted in disdain. “Sister Mengqing, forget it. You want to kill the horse just because you can’t tame it? I can’t afford it. However, you fell and injured yourself on my ranch. Hence, the medical fees will be on me. Quickly send her to the hospital!”","The two of them spoke one after another, making Yao Mengqing so angry that her face turned livid."]},{"number":545,"title":"Chapter 545 - Betting On Victory","paragraphs":["Her eyes were red as she looked at Gu Zheng aggrievedly. “Ah Zheng...”","Yao Mengqing’s admirers were instantly angry. “Mrs. Gu, your words are too harsh. This horse is too temperamental. It’s not strange that a weak girl like Miss Yao can’t tame it. You can’t say that Miss Yao isn’t good at riding!”","“Mrs. Gu, you’re so harsh with your words. If you’re good, tame this horse, then. Otherwise, what right do you have to mock Miss Yao?”","These men must like Yao Mengqing a lot. When they saw Yao Mengqing crying aggrievedly, they hurriedly stood up to defend her.","Before Qiao Xi could speak, Gu Zheng’s eyes turned cold. His voice was icy-cold and dignified. “I didn’t know that everyone would be so displeased just because Mrs. Gu spoke the truth.”","Everyone immediately fell silent. Then, a few friends who were close to Gu Yao stood up.","“Mrs. Gu was the one who took a liking to this horse first. It was Yao Mengqing who said that Mrs. Gu doesn’t know how to ride a horse. She claimed to be worried that Mrs. Gu couldn’t control this horse, so she forcefully snatched it away. Now that she has embarrassed herself, she’s blaming Mrs. Gu?”","“Moreover, you guys claim that the horse is temperamental, but when it was standing beside Mrs. Gu just now, it was as obedient as a child. Why did it suddenly become irritable when it was beside Yao Mengqing?”","“You stole her horse yet you’re blaming her after you humiliated yourself. Isn’t this too much?”","Yao Mengqing’s expression darkened as she gritted her teeth.","However, there was one thing she was very sure of. Qiao Xi definitely did not know how to ride. Otherwise, with her character, she would definitely have retorted when she mocked her for her lack of riding ability just now.","All the young ladies and madams of the upper-class society were proficient in music, chess, calligraphy, riding, and dancing. Some of them even reared horses in their villas for daily training","Qiao Xi was not even wearing a riding suit, so her riding skills were definitely inferior to hers.","Yao Mengqing was full of hatred as she thought about it. Why should she be the one losing face? She wanted Qiao Xi to have a taste of this as well.","“Ah Zheng, it’s all my fault. I thought that Xi Xi didn’t know how to ride a horse, so I asked her to give me this horse for her own good. I didn’t expect that I actually can’t control this horse. Since Xi Xi can control this horse, why don’t we let Xi Xi try riding it?”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. She wanted to drag her down with her?","Yao Mengqing was helped up by everyone. She said weakly, “I... I didn’t mean to make things difficult for Xi Xi. It’s just that if news of this gets out, I’m afraid people will say that Xi Xi doesn’t know how to ride a horse herself but she still wants to mock me. If... Xi Xi can tame this horse, the rumors will be unfounded.”","Her admirers all looked at her in admiration. Mengqing was still the most understanding.","One of the men echoed, “That’s right, President Gu. If others find out that Mrs. Gu doesn’t know how to ride a horse but still taunts others, she’ll definitely make a fool of herself. If Mrs. Gu knows how to ride a horse, why don’t she give it a try?","“Otherwise, when others hear this, they’ll say that Mrs. Gu was deliberately targeting Miss Yao. They’ll also say that Mrs. Gu is vicious and can’t think for the greater good of her family. Whenever she sees someone in an embarrassing situation, she’ll mock them without regard for anything else.”","Gu Yao was indignant. Qiao Xi was vicious? They really knew how to play the blame game!","The man continued, “Mrs. Gu, if you can tame this horse, I’m willing to apologize. Since my family owns a lot of shops, how about I give you two to three if it turns out that I’m wrong?”","Shops?","Qiao Xi was instantly interested, but she pretended to be troubled. “This...”","The other admirer thought that Qiao Xi did not dare to do it, so he said, “Since Young Master An is so generous, then I can’t fall behind. If you can tame this horse, I’ll give you a building!”","“Count me in too!”","These people were afraid that Qiao Xi would be unwilling to get on the horse, so they made their offers successively.","Lu Yan, who had been silent for a long time, suddenly smiled. “President Gu, why don’t we let Miss Qiao try riding the horse? Even if she can’t control it, it won’t be a loss. However, if she can, she’ll gain a lot of benefits.”","Everyone looked at Lu Yan. The others did not know Lu Yan’s relationship with the Gu family, but Yao Mengqing knew it very well.","In the past few days, she had been getting very close to Lu Yan. Now that Yao Mengqing had appeared in front of Gu Zheng to make her presence known, she definitely did not have good intentions.","Qiao Xi’s eyes sank, and her expression was troubled. “Young Master Lu is right. Even if I can’t do it, I won’t have anything to lose. If I can do it, I’ll receive many benefits. I really want to take this challenge.”"]},{"number":546,"title":"Chapter 546 - A Bet","paragraphs":["Yao Mengqing smiled smugly.","Who said that Qiao Xi had nothing to lose? If Qiao Xi was unable to tame this horse, then she would be embarrassing herself in public. Moreover, everyone had heard Qiao Xi ridicule her just now.","At that time, the news that Mrs. Gu was not good at riding but still mocked others would quickly spread.","Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi wanted to retreat and was hesitant. “It’s just that Miss Yao’s riding skills are superb, but she still fell off. I’m a little afraid. It must be very painful to fall from a horse, right? Although everyone’s offers are very attractive, my husband is rich and powerful. He doesn’t lack those things. There’s no need for me to risk injuring myself for these small benefits. It’s really not worth it!","“Miss Yao, you’re right. I grew up in the countryside and never practiced riding. I’ve never ridden a horse before. If I can’t tame it, I’ll definitely fall harder than you.”","Lu Yan’s expression did not change as he thought about it for a moment. It seemed that Qiao Xi looked down on those people’s offers.","When Yao Mengqing heard this, she was instantly excited. “I’ll give you a set of jade jewelry, Xi Xi. If you can tame this horse, my precious jade will belong to you!”","Qiao Xi remained silent as she calculated how much these things were worth in her heart. However, these were not enough because the person she really wanted to scam had yet to give his offer!","Hence, she still looked troubled. “Sigh, but...”","“Miss Qiao,” Lu Yan said slowly, “Since everyone is generous, I can’t just stand on the sidelines. If you really manage to tame this horse, I’m willing to give up five percent of the Lu family’s shares. I won’t go back on my word. What do you think?”","Boom!!!","Everyone gasped.","Gu Yao widened his eyes and looked at Lu Yan in disbelief.","Give 5% of the Lu family’s shares to Qiao Xi?","How could the Lu family agree to this? Although this 5% did not sound like much, 5% of the shares of a rich family like the Lu family was equivalent to a large sum of money. Moreover, too many people had shared the shares of the Lu family. Lu Yan probably did not take up too much of the shares. It was really unexpected that he was willing to give up the shares.","He was taking the joke too far!","If Qiao Xi really tamed this horse under the gazes of everyone, then he could not go back on his word.","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed. She knew that Lu Yan would definitely not be so stupid. He probably had something else to say.","Sure enough, the next second, Lu Yan looked at Gu Zheng with a provocative gaze and said casually, “However, the Lu family’s shares are not something that can be used as a bet. Why not... President Gu participate in the bet too? If Mrs. Gu can tame this horse, I’m willing to transfer 5% of the shares to her. If she can’t tame it, President Gu, you’ll have to transfer the shares of Gu Corporation to Miss Yao. What do you think?”","Everyone was silent. The air seemed to be filled with electricity.","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. “Young Master Lu, you must be joking. This deal seems very fair on the surface. If I can do it, you’ll give me the Lu family’s shares. But if I can’t, Ah Zheng will have to give Yao Mengqing Gu Corporation’s shares.","“But... are your Lu family’s shares on the same par as Gu Corporation’s? How can your 5% shares and Ah Zheng’s 5% shares be on the same level?","“I’m not stupid. I won’t partake in a losing deal. Forgive me for not being able to participate in this bet.”","There was dead silence.","Although it was not pleasant to hear, her words were very reasonable. If Mrs. Gu could tame this horse, it would be fine. However, if she could not, it would be a heavy loss!","Yao Mengqing’s admirers immediately stood up to seek justice. “Mrs. Gu, you can’t do it but you still mocked Mengqing earlier. Now, you don’t dare to prove yourself?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “I’m just speaking the truth. Besides, my words before can’t be considered mocking. I didn’t expect Miss Yao to be so weak that I can’t even say a few words about her. Moreover, a certain someone insisted on snatching my horse just now and said that her riding skills were superb. After she fell, it just proves that she doesn’t have the ability. However, she was the one who wanted to snatch another person’s horse. Isn’t this called reaping what one sowed?”","Yao Mengqing’s expression was ugly. She forcefully suppressed her anger and said aggrievedly, “It’s just a bet. It’s better not to let Ah Zheng participate. Xi Xi, since you want to place a bet, then why don’t you use the business under your name?”","Qiao Xi sneered.","She was indeed Gu Zheng’s admirer. She still tried to protect Gu Zheng’s best interests."]},{"number":547,"title":"Chapter 547 - Yao Mengqing’s Admirers Are All Idiots","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi was just about to nod and agree when an icy-cold male voice suddenly sounded from beside her. “I agree.” Gu Zheng slowly raised his eyes and said casually, “I agree to use 5% of Gu Corporation’s shares as a bet. If Xi Xi can’t do it, I’ll voluntarily hand over the shares.”","Everyone was dumbfounded.","President Gu really doted on Mrs. Gu. He was actually willing to bet 5% of Gu Corporation’s shares?","Or perhaps, Mrs. Gu really knew how to ride a horse. If she managed to do it, they would all have to keep their promises. Otherwise, they would be going back on their word...","“Ah Zheng, calm down. How can you bet on 5% of Gu Corporation’s shares? Xi Xi grew up in the countryside since she was young. She doesn’t know how to ride horses at all. I asked her to use her business as collateral because I thought that I could return it to her later. But if I sign the share transfer contract, then...","“Moreover, Gu Corporation’s shares involve a large amount of money and have a huge impact on you. You know very well that you can’t pay such a price for Xi Xi’s reputation!”","Yao Mengqing’s eyes were filled with sorrow. “Xi Xi, can’t you think about Ah Zheng?”","When everyone heard this, they immediately understood. After all, Mrs. Gu did not know how to ride horses. President Gu was only willing to give up his shares for Mrs. Gu’s sake.","However, that was Gu Corporation’s shares they were talking about. Even 1% was a huge sum of money. Now, they were talking about 5%. Gu Zheng was giving them away so casually?","With just a few words from Young Master Lu, President Gu was already willing to give up his shares. If Mrs. Gu could not do it, it would be a small matter if she lost her reputation. If she caused her husband to lose his shares, however, how could she raise her head in high society after this?","Lu Yan curled the corners of his mouth. Actually, he knew that Qiao Xi knew how to ride a horse. Her brothers were all dragons and phoenixes among men. She was also married to Gu Zheng, so how could she not know how to ride a horse?","However, knowing how to ride a horse did not mean that she knew how to tame a horse. Moreover, this horse was too temperamental. Even Yao Mengqing, who was skilled in riding, could not tame it, so there was no need to mention Qiao Xi.","This horse looked gentle, but Yao Mengqing was not allowed to mount it. It probably had an owner. Even if Qiao Xi knew how to ride it, she would not be able to make this horse recognize her as its owner on the spot.","Gu Zheng would definitely lose this time.","At this moment, Qiao Xi had already walked over to the horse.","Yao Mengqing tried to persuade her. “Xi Xi, why are you so insensible?! For your own selfish desires, you’re betting on Ah Zheng’s blood, sweat, and tears. After this,”","“Miss Yao, you don’t have to waste your breath on her. A prodigal woman like her has to suffer a little and be taught a lesson. Let’s see if she still dares to mock you in the future.”","Another man chimed in, “President Gu is her husband, so he must want to save her some dignity. In the end, it’s because Qiao Xi is too arrogant and isn’t considerate of her husband that she agreed to this bet.”","“It was originally a small matter. If she hadn’t mocked Miss Yao, the matter wouldn’t have blown up so much.”","“She’s not worthy to be Mrs. Gu. She’s really embarrassing the Gu family!”","Qiao Xi’s expression remained unchanged when she heard everyone’s ridicule. She was just speechless.","Yao Mengqing snatched her horse the moment she arrived. She did not know how to tame a horse and fell from it. She was also the one who proposed the bet. The person who wanted to bet on shares was Lu Yan. What did this have to do with her?","Were the admirers around Yao Mengqing all idiots?","They all wanted to be humiliated, right? Then they should open their eyes wide and watch.","Qiao Xi held the reins in her hand as she raised her eyes to coldly glance at Yao Mengqing, then at Lu Yan who was beside her.","“Young Master Lu.”","“Miss Qiao, is something the matter?”","Qiao Xi said, “It’s nothing. I’m just curious why Young Master Lu is so sure that I can’t tame this horse. You’re actually willing to bet on 5% of the Lu family’s shares?”","Lu Yan smiled gently. “Miss Qiao, you’re thinking too much. I don’t have any ill intentions. Actually, Miss Qiao, you should know that I’ve always liked you. Even if you really fail to tame this horse, I’ll tell my friends not to spread this news lest it damages your reputation.”","Qiao Xi sneered. “You make it sound so nice, but everyone knows what you’re really thinking. Everyone knows what you’ve done.”","Lu Yan was not angry. He was still smiling.","“I’m really surprised that Young Master Lu and Miss Yao are together. You two shameless people are quite compatible. I hope the two of you will live long lives.”"]},{"number":548,"title":"Chapter 548 - The Owner Of This Fierce Horse Is Actually Qiao Xi!","paragraphs":["“I remember Miss Yao previously saying that she likes Gu Zheng. Now, she’s helping Young Master Lu deal with Ah Zheng. Young Master Lu keeps saying that he likes me, but he hopes I’ll lose this bet. The two of you really don’t mean what you say!”","Qiao Xi sighed lightly. “Unfortunately...”","Lu Yan’s heart skipped a beat, and he suddenly became nervous. “Miss Qiao, what do you mean?”","Qiao Xi ignored him and gently stroked the horse’s mane. The horse leaned intimately against Qiao Xi and rubbed her hand. Lu Yan’s expression changed as he suddenly had a bad feeling.","Qiao Xi looked so indifferent as she neatly tied her hair up. She turned around and said word by word, “You guessed correctly that this horse has an owner, but you didn’t guess that I’m its owner!”","Boom!!!","Lu Yan felt as if he had been struck by lightning. His heart seemed to have exploded.","He stared blankly at Qiao Xi, and he was dumbstruck. He completely lost the bearing of a noble young master.","Under Lu Yan’s shocked gaze, Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “Young Master Lu, I asked you just now why you were so sure I can’t tame this horse. In the end, it’s just because you’re too conceited.","“I’ll thank you first. You’re going to give me 5% of the Lu family’s shares. Young Master Lu, since you already said so, you won’t go back on your word, right?”","Lu Yan’s gaze landed on Qiao Xi. She swiftly got on the horse and sat steadily on it.","His face was filled with disbelief. The owner of this fierce horse was actually Qiao Xi!","The others were laughing and did not notice that Qiao Xi had already gotten on the horse.","“Mengqing, as long as she falls off the horse, she won’t just embarrass herself. She’ll even cause President Gu to lose his shares. I reckon President Gu will get tired of her soon. At that time, the position of Mrs. Gu will be yours.”","“Yes, only a noble daughter like you is worthy of the status of Mrs. Gu. You’ll definitely become President Gu’s virtuous wife.”","“Qiao Xi clearly knows that Young Master Lu and President Gu are not on good terms, yet she still agreed to this bet. She’s clearly making President Gu lose face in front of Young Master Lu. She doesn’t care about her husband for the sake of her own reputation. President Gu will be disappointed in her sooner or later.” “If Qiao Xi loses this time, you’ll get 5% of Gu Corporation’s shares. Mengqing, after you become a shareholder of Gu Corporation, you can officially accompany President Gu. It won’t be long before President Gu sees your good qualities and despises that country bumpkin, Qiao Xi.”","“That’s right, Mengqing. Although you didn’t tame that horse, it’s not your fault. It’s just that the horse is too temperamental...”","Before that person could finish, a shadow flashed in front of him.","Yao Mengqing had her back facing Qiao Xi and did not know what was happening. She smiled gently. “Xi Xi is young and a little naughty. Don’t take her behavior to heart, everyone. I just feel sorry for Gu Zheng. I’m worried about Xi Xi. I’ll teach Xi Xi well when I have the chance.","“Actually, even if I’m given the 5% shares, I won’t take them. Ah Zheng and I are childhood sweethearts. How could I have the cheek to take his things?! I just want Xi Xi to remember this lesson. In the future, she can’t disregard Ah Zheng’s interests for her own sake.”","“M-Miss Yao, look!” someone said in shock.","Yao Mengqing did not turn around and said proudly, “There’s nothing to be surprised about. Xi Xi grew up in the countryside. It’s natural that she doesn’t know how to tame horses. I hope she doesn’t get injured. That horse is indeed—”","“No, no. Miss Yao, Mrs. Gu...”","Yao Mengqing was annoyed by the interruption and suddenly turned around”Mrs. Gu is actually riding it!”","Yao Mengqing’s heart trembled. The blood in her body seemed to have frozen.","They saw Qiao Xi riding her horse casually and indifferently as she approached them.","Yao Mengqing’s pupils constricted abruptly as she widened her eyes in horror.","This was impossible. How could Qiao Xi tame this horse?","“Miss Yao, you don’t dare to believe it?” Qiao Xi looked down from above and said, “I don’t think this horse is that difficult to tame. It’s very obedient. I’ve already gone around the course once, but it never tried to shake me off. But when you got on the horse, it became irritable. How strange!” Qiao Xi chuckled. “Gu Yao, give it a try.”"]},{"number":549,"title":"Chapter 549 - Breaking The Promise","paragraphs":["Although Second Young Master Gu was a little afraid, he could not help but run over when he saw Qiao Xi riding the tall horse.","Qiao Xi stroked the horse a few times and whispered a few words before nimbly dismounting.","Immediately after, Gu Yao got on the horse and sat on it. The horse let Gu Yao ride on its back and started galloping away. It did not have the intention to shake Gu Yao off at all. After circling once, it returned to its original spot obediently.","Everyone was extremely shocked.","“This horse looks very obedient!”","“Yes, one look and you can tell that it has been trained. It’s very intelligent and even knows how to bring Second Young Master Gu back to where he got on. I just don’t know why it was so irritable just now.”","“Mrs. Gu said that she doesn’t know how to ride a horse, but she can ride this horse. Miss Yao said that she’s good at riding, but she was thrown down by this horse.”","With that said, someone could not help but start to suspect. “Miss Yao, don’t tell me you don’t actually know how to ride a horse at all? This horse is clearly very gentle.”","“No matter what, she’s the daughter of the Yao family. It’s fine that she doesn’t know how to ride a horse, but she even bragged that she’s good at horse riding. I remember that she secretly mocked Mrs. Gu for not knowing how to ride a horse, so she stole this horse from her.”","Yao Mengqing’s face was pale as paper. She gnashed her teeth in hatred, then glared fiercely at Qiao Xi.","She had actually lost to that b*tch, Qiao Xi!","At this moment, someone suddenly said, “So many people have placed their bets just now. Now that Mrs. Gu has tamed that horse, shouldn’t everyone fulfill their promises?”","Yao Mengqing lowered her head even more.","“Didn’t someone say that Mrs. Gu is willful? They said Mrs. Gu didn’t mind causing President Gu to lose 5% of his shares for her. Now that Young Master Lu lost his shares, who’s the reason?”","“Mrs. Gu, you’re right. Some people reap what they sow. They just had to snatch someone else’s horse. In the end, the one who lost is themselves.”","At this moment, Yao Mengqing’s heart was exploding. She wished for nothing more than to find a hole to bury herself in.","She quickly retorted, “I... I just said it casually. I didn’t mean to criticize Xi Xi. Besides, I said it before. Even if Xi Xi lost, I wouldn’t take Ah Zheng’s shares.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi sneered. “Are you being a sore loser now! Young Master Lu, you and Miss Yao are both reputable people in high society. But both of you are actually going back on your word now. Everyone was so happy when we made the bet just now. Now that I’ve won, you’re unwilling to fulfill your promises?”","Qiao Xi waved her hand helplessly. “Alright, if you’re unwilling to give those things to me, then forget it. I can’t force you to give them to me either. However, if news of this gets out, others will inevitably say that Miss Yao is inferior to others and is the kind of person who goes back on her word. Meanwhile, Young Master Lu has a vile character and is also someone who goes back on his word.”","Although she said it indifferently, Yao Mengqing’s and Lu Yan’s faces alternated between red and white.","“Yeah, who knows who will be the one losing face then?”","Gu Yao had a mocking look on his face as he ordered arrogantly, “Guards! Chase them all out! My horse ranch has just opened, yet they dare to cause trouble on my territory. They’re looking down on me, the young master of the Gu family!”","With that order, the bodyguards immediately rushed over.","Gu Yao shouted loudly, “I’ve really learned something today. Some people even dare to go back on their word after placing bets. They’re really shameless!”","Everyone was extremely embarrassed.","Yao Mengqing knew very well that if they fulfilled the bet, they would suffer a huge loss. Compensating them with her Yao family wouldn’t even be enough. She hurriedly moved in front of Qiao Xi, and Qiao Xi felt the back of her hand hurt.","Qiao Xi silently withdrew her hand and watched indifferently as Yao Mengqing put on an act.","Yao Mengqing advised Gu Zheng gently, “Ah Yao, don’t be angry. Actually, this is just a joke.”","Gu Yao immediately retorted, “Qiao Xi originally didn’t want to bet with all of you. It was all of you who placed your bets one after another. Now that you’ve lost, you’re saying that it’s just a joke. Yao Mengqing, you said that it’s a joke, but why didn’t you stop Qiao Xi when everyone was urging her to get on the horse just now? I think you just wanted to see Qiao Xi make a fool of herself. Unexpectedly, she actually tamed that horse!”","Yao Mengqing was speechless, and her face turned livid.","The friends Gu Yao had invited were also discussing","“I actually didn’t know that one can go back on one’s word after making a bet. Then, I’ll get someone to bet with me. If I lose, I’ll just say it was a joke. If I win, I’ll make sure the bet is fulfilled. In short, I can’t lose out.”","Everyone roared with laughter. “Haha, you’re right!”"]},{"number":550,"title":"Chapter 550 - Could He Refuse In Front Of Everyone?","paragraphs":["“Everyone says that Miss Yao is gentle and kind, but she’s just pretending. She’s just a b*tch!”","Yao Mengqing could not help but tremble when she heard this. Her gentle face gradually turned ferocious.","She clenched her fists tightly, her long nails digging into her palms. “I’ll naturally fulfill my promise. I’ll give 5% of the Lu family’s shares to Miss Qiao as promised,” Lu Yan said indifferently.","At this moment, one of Yao Mengqing’s admirers’ phones suddenly rang. Just as the call connected, there was a furious roar. “You unfilial son! Are you crazy?! Our family was able to establish ourselves in Li City all because of President Gu. How dare you look for trouble with Mrs. Gu? Are you f*cking tired of living?!","“You do any proper work. It’s fine if you eat, drink, and play all day, but are you trying to kill your entire family now? Let me warn you, go beg Mrs. Gu for forgiveness immediately. Otherwise, I’ll chase you out of the house. I’ll cut off all ties with you. Your life and death will have nothing to do with me!","“You caused this huge trouble just because of that little b*tch from the Yao family. Are you crazy?! Also, don’t even think about inheriting the family’s assets. I’ve already decided to give them to your brother. How can I leave the family’s business to you, a fool who was deceived by a woman?!”","The man froze.","He had been fighting with his eldest brother for so many years and finally had the ability to compete for the inheritance. This time, he was only helping Yao Mengqing, but...","“Young Master An, it’s all my fault. It’s my fault. I didn’t expect Xi Xi to know how to tame horses.”","Yao Mengqing’s eyes were filled with tears as she spoke weakly. Her delicate body leaned closer to this young master as she said delicately, “Don’t worry, this matter started because of me. I’ll do my best to compensate you for your loss.”","Young Master An was originally angry, but when he saw his goddess treating him gently and getting closer to him like never before, the dissatisfaction in his heart instantly vanished.","“Mengqing, you have to help me. President","Gu—”","“Young Master An, I’m sorry. Xi Xi has always hated me. She must have said many bad things about me in front of President Gu. That’s why... Ah Zheng is blaming you. It’s all my fault.”","Young Master An was about to say something when Gu Yao suddenly kicked the chair beside him, looking like a rich young master. “What’s wrong? You’re blaming Qiao Xi for your mistake? Yao Mengqing, why are you still pretending?!”","Yao Mengqing’s eyes turned red with grievances.","She lowered her eyes, and her weak body trembled slightly. Everyone looked at her with disdain and took a few steps back.","Qiao Xi said slowly, “Lu Yan, don’t forget to give me 5% of the shares. If news of this gets out, you’ll be forced to give them to me regardless if you want to uphold the Lu family’s status as nobles.”","So what if Lu Yan was unconvinced? Now that he had lost 5% of his shares in front of everyone, could he still refuse?","“Miss Qiao, don’t worry. Since I’ve agreed, I won’t go back on my word.” Lu Yan’s expression was indifferent.","He looked at Yao Mengqing and suppressed his anger. “Let’s go.” Qiao Xi skipped over to Gu Zheng. “Ah Zheng, why aren’t you saying anything? As long as you say something, they’ll definitely have to give in to you.”","Gu Zheng smirked, his eyes dark as if everything was under his control. “Even if I don’t say anything, they won’t dare to go back on their word.”","Yes, that’s right. They did not dare to. They had already been set up since they placed their bets.","Qiao Xi lowered her voice and asked, “Have you never thought that if I lost, you’d have to give up 5% of Gu Corporation’s shares? You wouldn’t really have given them to Yao Mengqing, right?”","“That won’t happen.” Gu Zheng did not hesitate.","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with gratification. “Ah Zheng, do you really believe in me so much? Actually, if this horse weren’t mine, I wouldn’t dare to bet on Gu Corporation’s shares either. If these shares fell into Yao Mengqing’s hands, she would definitely take the opportunity to get close to you.”","“It’s just 5% of the shares. It doesn’t matter if I give them to her. After this, I can acquire the Yao family. The shares will naturally return to me.”","He said indifferently, “No matter whether you win or lose, the shares won’t fall into her hands.”","Qiao Xi: “...” She was touched for nothing. It turned out that the person this bastard was confident in was himself!"]},{"number":551,"title":"Chapter 551 - Qiao Xi Was Poisoned","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng turned his head to look at her with a deep gaze. “But I know that as long as you make a promise, it means you’re confident that you can keep your word. That’s why I let you do whatever you want. Even if you had lost 5% of the shares, I wouldn’t blame you. I’ll just snatch the shares back.”","Qiao Xi smiled delicately. She was just about to say something when she felt her heart go numb.","She frowned. She had almost forgotten about this.","Gu Yao saw her dark expression and was about to ask her what was wrong when he heard her say slowly, “I’ve been poisoned.”","Instantly, there was silence.","Gu Yao widened his eyes.","Gu Yao’s eyes turned cold, and his voice became anxious. “What’s going on?”","Qiao Xi raised her hand. There was a red spot on the back of her hand, and the blood vessels on her wrist were slightly dark. Even so, she said casually, “This poison is colorless and odorless. So long as it goes into one’s bloodstream even if just a little, one will be poisoned. The poison will flare up within seven days and the victim will die from blood loss after bleeding extensively from their seven apertures.”","Qiao Xi took out a silver needle from her bag and pricked her finger. The silver needle was stained with blood, and after a moment, the silver needle turned black.","The expressions of the Gu brothers changed.","Gu Zheng, who was usually calm, trembled. Anger erupted from his body as he gritted his teeth and shouted, “Yao Mengqing!”","Qiao Xi held the silver needle between her fingers and raised her eyebrows in disdain. “Where did Yao Mengqing get this poison? I thought that this poison was too savage, so I destroyed it a long time ago. It should be something that can’t be bought with money. She must have some connections.”","Gu Zheng immediately bent down and hugged Qiao Xi’s waist. He picked her up horizontally and strode away.","Qiao Xi fell into a warm embrace and hugged Gu Zheng’s neck tightly. She blinked. “Ah Zheng, why do you think Yao Mengqing thought of poisoning me?”","Gu Zheng glanced at her coldly. How would outsiders know that she was immune to poison?","It was Liang Pingchuan who told him about this. Otherwise, even as her husband, he would not have known.","Qiao Xi’s blood could detoxify poisons, so naturally, any poison was useless against her. Moreover, after the poison entered her body, it would gradually dissipate due to her metabolism.","Gu Zheng knew that she would not have a relapse, but knowing that someone had poisoned her, he could not help but be angry. He wished he could hack Yao Mengqing into pieces.","Qiao Xi looked at Gu Zheng’s cold gaze and knew that Yao Mengqing would definitely be miserable after this.","Gu Zheng smiled coldly, then looked at Qiao Xi with a gentle expression. “You developed this poison?”","Qiao Xi did not know what Gu Zheng meant and nodded obediently. “Yes, Third Brother and I found a type of poisonous mushroom on a mountain. Later on, when we extracted the poison from it, we accidentally developed this poison. Because this poison is colorless, odorless, and savage, the person who’s poisoned by it is practically incurable. Moreover, the process of the poison acting up is quite painful, and the way the victims die from it is extremely tragic.","“If this poison were to get in the hands of others, it would definitely have an extremely adverse effect, so I immediately destroyed it. I wonder where Yao Mengqing got this poison from.”","Gu Zheng was silent. He was too kind to Yao Mengqing previously. He should be more vicious when dealing with such people. Killing her directly would be letting her off easy.","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm, but only he knew that he was forcefully suppressing the anger in his heart. When he faced Qiao Xi, his tone was still gentle. “Do you still have this poison, then?”","Qiao Xi did not feel that anything was wrong and replied truthfully, “I’ve already destroyed it all, but if you want it, I can extract a little from my blood now.”","“Alright.” The man’s eyes were cold as his lips curled into a cold smile.","Qiao Xi looked at him in confusion. Why did he want this poison?","She hid in Gu Zheng’s arms and stared at the silver needle with a burning gaze. She sneered. “Yao Mengqing used the poison I developed to harm me. It’s really too interesting!”","After a moment, Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes. She seemed to have thought of something and asked in shock, “Y-You’re not surprised to know that I was the one who developed the poison? Actually, that... that poison was developed by Third Brother. I was just helping him.”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow.","“Mrs. Gu, isn’t it too late to maintain your weak image now?”","Qiao Xi was instantly speechless and suddenly felt as if she had a heart attack."]},{"number":552,"title":"Chapter 552 - Is My Life Worth 20 Million?","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi was only thinking about Yao Mengqing poisoning her earlier and actually forgot to maintain her image. She did not expect her image of a weak lady to collapse so quickly. Qiao Xi smiled awkwardly. “Heh... Heh, Ah Zheng, this...”","“Mrs. Gu.” Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully. “I already know everything about you. It’s just that I never say anything.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","This bastard knew too much.","The man looked at her dazed expression and smiled. He carried her into the ranch’s lounge.","On the other hand.","Smack!","Lu Yan slapped Yao Mengqing hard. A red handprint immediately appeared on her smooth cheek.","“Yao Mengqing, 5% of the Lu family’s shares have been lost. How are we going to settle this score?!”","Yao Mengqing endured the pain, suppressing the anger and unwillingness in her heart. She forcefully squeezed out a smile. “Young Master Lu, we’re in a cooperative relationship. You want Qiao Xi, and I want Ah Zheng. The 5% shares are given to your sweetheart. It’s not a loss for you.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Lu Yan suddenly reached out and grabbed her chin.","Yao Mengqing frowned in pain. “Lu Yan...”","“Miss Yao, since you know that Qiao Xi is my woman, who gave you the guts to poison her? Are you tired of living?!”","Hearing this, Yao Mengqing could not help but tremble.","The corners of Lu Yan’s mouth curled up into a bloodthirsty smile. His hands moved down from her chin and landed on her smooth neck. “I’ve already warned you not to hurt Qiao Xi. Miss Yao, did you ignore my words?” “Let go...” Yao Mengqing felt a sharp pain in her neck as he strangled her. Her eyes were filled with horror. “I didn’t... I didn’t hurt her. You have the antidote. She won’t die. Just save her...”","Smack!","Lu Yan raised his hand and slapped her again.","“Yao Mengqing, don’t you know that there’s a saying that ugly people cause trouble? If you dare attack Qiao Xi again, don’t blame me for being merciless!”","Yao Mengqing’s eyes were filled with resentment, but she did not dare to go against Lu Yan.","However, she was unwilling to accept it. What right did Lu Yan have to insult her like this? In what way was she inferior to Qiao Xi?","That was right. She was jealous of Qiao Xi. She was unwilling to accept this. Qiao Xi was just a country bumpkin, while she was the daughter of the Yao family and Ah Zheng’s childhood sweetheart. What right did Gu Zheng have to marry her? His heart was filled with her!","Lu Yan still had the cheek to say that about her. He was jealous of Gu Zheng because Gu Zheng was the head of the Gu family. Gu Zheng was also a famous rich businessman in Li City. Moreover, whether it was his status, appearance, or reputation, Gu Zheng was a hundred times better than him.","Even Lu Yan’s sweetheart, Qiao Xi, had married Gu Zheng. He was jealous of Gu Zheng, yet he looked down on her for being jealous of Qiao Xi. What kind of logic was this?","Not allowing her to deal with Qiao Xi? Unfortunately, it was too late.","Yao Mengqing lowered her head as the corners of her mouth curled up into a sinister smile. Even if she couldn’t poison Qiao Xi to death this time, she would still hire the top assassins in the world to assassinate Qiao Xi after this. Qiao Xi would definitely die.","Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi had just returned home when she received a call.","When she saw the number on it, she was slightly stunned. She then waved at Gu Zheng behind her. “Ah Zheng, I... I’ll go upstairs first!”","Gu Zheng glanced at her and nodded indifferently.","Qiao Xi anxiously returned to her room and closed the door. She hurriedly picked up the phone and said in a low voice, “Didn’t I say not to call me if there’s nothing going on? Do you wish to have me killed?!”","The other party was stunned for a moment, then said while trembling, “Eldest Miss, we’ve just received an offer. That person is willing to pay 20 million to have us kill someone.”","Qiao Xi frowned unhappily. “Our Ling Pavilion used to be an assassin organization, but this kind of livelihood isn’t a long-term solution. I’ve already said that you’re not allowed to take on such jobs in the future. Why do you have to earn a living like this?”","“No... No, Eldest Miss...” the other party stammered.","Qiao Xi instructed, “You can’t accept jobs like this. This is to avoid attracting trouble.”","“Eldest Miss, what I want to say is that you’re the person’s target!”","The air fell silent.","The person on the other end of the phone thought that Qiao Xi was angry. Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi casually said, “My life... is only worth 20 million?”"]},{"number":553,"title":"Chapter 553 - The Fish Has Already Taken The Bait","paragraphs":["The air was silent again.","The person on the other end of the phone was shocked. The corners of his mouth twitched slightly. “Eldest Miss, what do you think we should do about this? We’re...”","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed. Yao Mengqing was really stubborn. Not only did she poison her, but she even wanted to hire someone to assassinate her for fear that she would survive.","Unfortunately... Miss Yao was really unlucky. She was the one who developed the poison, and the assassin she wanted to hire was also her subordinate.","Qiao Xi was straightforward. “Take it!”","“This-“","“She wants to kill me. If you reject her, she’ll just find others to kill me. I might as well use my own people. That way, I’ll be more at ease.”","On the other hand, Yao Mengqing received a message on her phone. The other party only sent an ‘OK’ emoji.","She beamed as she quietly waited for the news of Qiao Xi’s death.","“Young Master Lu, it’s been so long. Have you already convinced Uncle Gu to let me marry Ah Zheng to be the new Mrs. Gu?”","Lu Yan’s voice was cold. “Yes.”","Yao Mengqing was proud of herself and forgot about the stinging pain on her face.","The next day.","Gu Weiming specially sent invitations to all his relatives and friends to gather at the Gu family’s old residence as he had an important matter to announce.","The branch families of the Gu family were all present, but Gu Zheng was not there.","Gu Yao was so anxious that his forehead was covered in sweat. He asked the assistant beside him, “Where’s Gu Zheng? The old man invited so many people here. There must be something wrong. Could it be that he’s going to announce Lu Yan’s inheritance?! Then, he’ll hand the Gu family over to Lu Yan!”","The assistant hurriedly said, “I’ve already called President Gu and even sent someone to pick him up, but there’s still no news from President Gu!”","Gu Yao was so anxious that his eyebrows were burning. “Quickly call him again and get him to come over quickly. If he comes any later, the Gu family will belong to Lu Yan! This won’t do! I have to stop them!”","Gu Weiming and Huang Lilan appeared hand in hand with Lu Yan standing beside them. Even Yao Mengqing’s family was here, but Gu Zheng was not.","Everyone knew that Gu Weiming was probably going to hand the Gu family to Lu Yan.","At this moment, Gu Zheng was sitting lazily on the sofa. He flipped through the documents and said casually, “Lu Yan won’t be inheriting the Gu family today.”","Song Shijing was confused. “Why?”.","“If Lu Yan wants to inherit the Gu family, there’s no need to invite the Yao family.”","Gu Zheng looked at Yao Mengqing’s name on the document and narrowed his eyes. They flashed coldly. “Have you gotten the poison?”","Song Shijing took out a small glass bottle from his pocket. “Young Madam gave me the poison this morning. It’s the same as Yao Mengqing’s poison, but Young Madam said that this poison is too savage. Unless necessary...”","Before he could finish, Song Shijing choked.","His boss’ eyes were filled with coldness and killing intent. Gu Zheng said casually, “She has to die.”","Song Shijing shuddered and lowered his head.","Since Yao Mengqing wanted to poison Young Madam to death, the president would definitely not let her off!","Gu Zheng sneered. “Inviting the Gu family’s relatives and friends to gather for an announcement... I’ve already guessed what my father is going to do. Let’s go watch the fun.”","Song Shijing was stunned. “To the Gu family’s old residence? Then, Young Madam...”","“Song Shijing,” Gu Zheng said slowly. “Let me handle this. If Mrs. Gu wants to kill Yao Mengqing herself, I’m afraid it’ll dirty her hands.”","On the other hand, Qin An looked at Qiao Xi in shock. “Little Six, you took the job?”","Qiao Xi blinked. “Why wouldn’t I accept it? If I didn’t accept it, she would have gone to look for someone else. Miss Yao poisoned me at the horse ranch and hired an assassin to kill me. She’s trying her best to kill me. It looks like she’s determined to have me dead.”","Qin An frowned. “Then what should we do next? You want to send someone to kill yourself?”","Qiao Xi could not help but laugh out loud. She threw the phone in front of Qin An. “The fish has already taken the bait. What happens next will definitely be very interesting.”","2 was a","There was a message on her phone. After Qiao Xi sent an ‘OK’ emoji, Yao Mengqing immediately asked when she would take action. Qiao Xi replied that it would be today.","She smiled. “Chairman Gu Weiming invited many relatives and friends to the Gu family today. He said that he wanted to announce something important, but he didn’t invite Gu Zheng, the head of the Gu family, nor did he tell me. Instead, he invited the Yao family.”"]},{"number":554,"title":"Chapter 554 - Announcing The Engagement","paragraphs":["“I’m guessing that he’s not going to announce that Lu Yan will be inheriting the Gu family. This matter is probably related to Yao Mengqing. “If I tell Yao Mengqing that the mission has been completed, will she get carried away? When she sees me standing in front of her, will she think that she’s seeing a ghost?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. She really wanted to see Yao Mengqing’s expression at that time!","Qin An smiled. Only Little Six could come up with such a plan.","Qiao Xi took out her phone and sent a message to Yao Mengqing.","In the Gu family.","Yao Mengqing lowered her head to look at her phone. The assassin from Ling Pavilion killer had sent her a message. It said ‘mission completed’. She was instantly overjoyed when she read it.","Mission completed... That meant that Qiao Xi was dead.","Qiao Xi was finally dead, but she had a feeling of disbelief. She did not expect that this b*tch who took Ah Zheng away would die so easily. It seemed that she was no match for her.","as","As long as it was Ling Pavilion, the assassination would not fail. Qiao Xi would be killed sooner or later, but Yao Mengqing never expected that the assassin would succeed with a single strike. She originally thought that she would have to be entangled with Qiao Xi for a period of time.","Yao Mengqing resisted the urge to laugh. Qiao Xi was finally dead.","Now, even if Ah Zheng was angry and unwilling, it could not change the fact that Qiao Xi was dead. She could stand by Ah Zheng’s side and become his only woman. She could give birth to children for him and accompany him for his entire life.","At this moment, Gu Weiming’s voice came from the banquet hall. “I’ve invited everyone here today to announce a joyous occasion.”","The Gu family’s business partners and branch family members were all gathered here. Everyone guessed that Gu Weiming was going to hand the inheritance to Lu Yan this time. While they were thinking of this, Gu Weiming announced loudly","“Today is my son Gu Zheng and Yao Mengqing’s engagement party.”","The entire place was silent.","Gu Yao stood up abruptly. Everyone below the stage widened their eyes in disbelief.","Gu Zheng... was engaged to Yao Mengqing?","But wasn’t Gu Zheng already married?","Although the two of them did not hold a wedding, all the relatives and friends of the Gu family knew about this. Moreover, most of them had seen Qiao Xi before.","Why was he suddenly getting engaged to Yao Mengqing?","“As Gu Zheng is the eldest son of the Gu family, we naturally can’t let him fool around when it comes to marriage. Miss Yao and Ah Zheng grew up together. The Yao family and the Gu family are on good terms as well. If we can become in-laws, that’ll be even better.","“As Gu Zheng’s father, I’ll officially announce Gu Zheng and Yao Mengqing’s engagement. Not long after, I’ll arrange for the two of them to get married. When the day comes, I hope everyone can come and show your support.”","There was silence-dead silence.","No one dared to say anything. Gu Yao could not help but say, “Dad! What are you doing?! Gu Zheng is already married, but you’re still making him get engaged to Sister Mengqing? Isn’t this a remarriage? If Sister Mengqing gets together with Gu Zheng, their relationship will be considered to be an affair. If news of this gets out, it won’t be good for Sister Mengqing either. You don’t want to be hurled with criticisms, right?!”","Yao Mengqing’s face was gentle.","Gu Weiming pretended to be a kind father. “Ah Yao, I know that you care about your brother, but as his father, I have to protect his future.","“You’re also clearly aware that Qiao Xi isn’t a good person. She’s not worthy to be the young madam of the Gu family. Not to mention her identity, even her upbringing and bearing are far inferior to Mengqing. Moreover, Mengqing and Ah Zheng grew up together. If it weren’t for Qiao Xi stirring things up, the two of them would have gotten married and had children a long time ago.”","Everyone knew that Mrs. Gu was the eldest daughter of the Qiao family, which could not be considered a noble family. Moreover, she grew up in the countryside when she was young. She was indeed not worthy of Gu","Zheng.","However, saying such a thing in public was really not giving Qiao Xi any face.","Gu Yao said indignantly, “Since it’s Gu Zheng’s marriage, you must ask if he’s willing first!”","Gu Weiming frowned. “I’m his father. I’ve already agreed to it, so how could he not be willing? Ah Yao, we noble families have always been particular about status. Qiao Xi isn’t compatible with our Gu family.","“If they weren’t married, I could just turn a blind eye. However, they’re already married. How can our Gu family tolerate such an unpresentable daughter-in-law?”","Gu Yao stomped his feet anxiously and turned to look at his assistant. The assistant said in a low voice, “I’ve called, but President Gu won’t pick up.”"]},{"number":555,"title":"Chapter 555 - Won’t Be A Good Outcome If It’s Forced","paragraphs":["Gu Weiming chuckled. “I’m sorry. Ah Yao is such a straightforward child. Ah Zheng and Mengqing’s marriage has already been decided. When the two of them get married, they’ll naturally send invitations to everyone here! In-laws, quickly come up!”","Mr. Yao and Madam Yao walked up the stage with smiles on their faces. They picked up the microphone and said, “Our Mengqing grew up with Ah Zheng since they were young. The two of them are childhood sweethearts. Now, they’re finally getting married. Perhaps some people think that President Gu is already married. If Mengqing does this, it’ll be against the rules. However, Chairman Gu has already said that the Gu family doesn’t accept Miss Qiao. In that case, there’s nothing wrong with Mengqing getting engaged to President Gu.","“Mengqing marrying President Gu is good for President Gu as well. If you were President Gu, you wouldn’t be able to tolerate a wife like Qiao Xi who is uncultured, uneducated, unfilial, and who’s always causing trouble for her husband.”","Everyone could not help but nod.","Mr. Yao continued, “Not only is my daughter outstanding, but she also has President Gu in her heart. She always has President Gu’s best interests in mind. She’ll definitely do her job well.”","Yao Mengqing lowered her head shyly. “Dad, I’m not that outstanding either. It’s just that I definitely care more about Ah Zheng than Xi","Xi.”","Madam Yao said, “My daughter and President Gu have known each other for more than ten years. President Gu married that woman on an impulse. He should be regretting it now. It’s just that the woman is still pestering him. Now that he’s engaged to my daughter, this matter is resolved.”","The Yao and Gu families were all very sure that even if Qiao Xi was dissatisfied with this, she would not be able to go against the two families.","Although Gu Zheng doted on Qiao Xi a little, that was only momentary. When he recovered his senses, he would still choose Yao Mengqing to be his wife.","After a moment of silence, everyone congratulated them.","Yao Mengqing smiled shyly. “Thank you, everyone. My marriage to Ah Zheng—”.","“I didn’t know that I was engaged to Miss Yao. Why didn’t my father inform me?”","A cold male voice sounded, and everyone was stunned.","Gu Zheng was wearing a high-end suit and exuded a suppressive aura. He swept over like a cold wind and appeared in front of everyone.","His cold gaze swept across the crowd, and the corners of his mouth could not help but curl up. Everyone held their breaths, not daring to make a sound.","“Miss Yao, you can lead a horse to water but you can’t make him drink. I’ve told you a long time ago that my taste isn’t so bad that any Tom, Dick, or Harry can attract me.”","Yao Mengqing’s eyes instantly turned red, and her body shook slightly. The hall fell silent.","Gu Weiming’s gaze darkened. “Gu Zheng, I’m doing this for your own good. Qiao Xi is really not suitable for you. You’ll know how good Mengqing is once you marry her.” Gu Zheng sneered. “How do you know whether Yao Mengqing is good or not? Could it be that you’ve been with her? If you want to marry Yao Mengqing, I’ll be very happy. I’ll even be willing to give out generous gifts to congratulate you, Father!” “You!” Gu Weiming almost gasped. He did not expect Gu Zheng to say such disrespectful words in front of everyone.","“What nonsense are you talking about?! Mengqing has been in love with you for more than ten years. If you don’t marry her, do you still have a conscience?”","Gu Zheng sneered, “Father, why don’t you ask around? There are so many women in Li City who want to marry me. If I don’t marry them, does it mean that I don’t have a conscience? Just because her feelings for me have lasted ten years, her wish has to be fulfilled? Father, you’ve been dreaming of getting rich for 40 to 50 years, but you still haven’t become the richest man in the world!”","Everyone suppressed their laughter. However, Gu Yao could not help but laugh out loud.","That was right. That old man was constantly fantasizing about becoming the richest man in the world and having endless money to spend. In the end, he still failed. Gu Yao knew very well that his father did not like the Yao family and Yao Mengqing at all. He just knew that Gu Zheng was unwilling to be with Yao Mengqing, which was why he arranged this.","The Yao family’s faces darkened. Gu Weiming frowned as well and said angrily, “Ah Zheng, your marriage with Mengqing has been confirmed. Stop fooling around!”","Gu Zheng was silent for a moment. His voice was low and hoarse. “Yao Mengqing, do you want to marry me so badly?”","Yao Mengqing was a little embarrassed, but she still bit her lip and said, “Yes, Ah Zheng -11","“But I’m already married. Although my father may be someone with overflowing affections, I’m not that kind of person. I’m afraid only my father can do something like having two wives.”"]},{"number":556,"title":"Chapter 556 - Chairman Gu Was Forcing The Marriage","paragraphs":["Gu Weiming suppressed his anger.","Yao Mengqing’s delicate body kept trembling as tears trickled down her face. “Ah Zheng, I know you like Xi Xi now, but the two of you are really not compatible. Moreover, we’re already engaged. We’re in front of so many people now. Why can’t you—”","“Yao Mengqing, are you done?!” Gu Yao roared. “No matter if Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng are compatible or not, they’re not divorced yet. What right do you have to be engaged to Gu Zheng? Since when did the Gu family have such a rule that a man can marry two women? Do you think the rest of the Gu family is like that old man?”","Seeing that his youngest son even dared to mock him, Gu Weiming was instantly infuriated.","“Gu Zheng, what exactly do you want? Mengqing is the daughter of the Yao family and is compatible with our Gu family. Why are you still unwilling?","“Or are you afraid that Qiao Xi won’t agree, so you’re unwilling?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent.","Gu Weiming was straightforward. “You don’t have to worry. Actually, Qiao Xi has already agreed to divorce you. The reason I announced your engagement today is that—” “Qiao Xi has already agreed!” Everyone sighed. Gu Zheng’s expression turned cold.","Gu Weiming snorted. “The Yao family went to look for Qiao Xi. She took the Yao family’s money and agreed to divorce you. Ah Zheng, things have already turned out like this, yet you’re still stubborn. She doesn’t really care about you at all. She might have run off with another man by now!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Yao Mengqing sobbed aggrievedly. “Uncle Gu, you shouldn’t have said anything. Xi Xi is Ah Zheng’s ex-wife, after all. Although she left, we should still leave her some dignity. Ah Zheng, she has already left your side. Can you just let her go?”","Yao Mengqing lowered her head and smiled sinisterly.","Qiao Xi was already dead now.","The assassins from Ling Pavilion had always done things efficiently. They would never let anyone find any traces that could lead back to her. Even if the assassin was caught, they would commit suicide. No one would ever suspect her.","Gu Zheng’s gaze landed on Yao Mengqing. Seeing her proud expression, his heart could not help but skip a beat. Yao Mengqing was so sure that Qiao Xi had left. Could it be that she had already sent someone to attack Qiao Xi?","Gu Zheng turned his head and shot Song Shijing a look. Song Shijing immediately understood and hurried out. Unexpectedly, he was stopped by Gu Weiming’s bodyguards halfway.","Gu Weiming pretended to be easy-going. “Ah Zheng, now that Qiao Xi has left and your marriage with Mengqing has been settled, stop fooling around. In the future, you’ll know that everything I do is for your own","good.”","Everyone was trembling with fear. They all knew that Chairman Gu was forcing the marriage!","If President Gu did not agree to Chairman Gu’s request today, he might not be able to leave this place.","Faced with the confrontation between the Gu father and son, everyone was alarmed and held their breaths.","Yao Mengqing’s tears fell like rain as she sobbed pitifully. “Ah Zheng, now that things have come to this, don’t go against Uncle Gu’s wishes.”","Seeing that Gu Zheng was silent, Gu Weiming could not help but roar, “Gu Zheng, do you know why I asked you to marry Yao Mengqing? Do you know where Qiao Xi has","gone?”","Everyone looked at Gu Weiming curiously.","Gu Zheng’s eyes darkened.","Gu Weiming snorted. “I know that you married Qiao Xi to anger me back then. She’s disrespectful to her elders and is extremely naughty. How is she worthy of being the young madam of the Gu family? Hence, I told her that you got into a car accident and was disabled. I told her that she had to take care of you in the future. Unexpectedly, when she heard this, she was unwilling. She made a scene at home. Not only did she want to divorce you, but she even extorted a sum of money from us before leaving.","“Ah Zheng, I was just testing her. I didn’t expect her to be so heartless. I used the same words to test Mengqing. I didn’t expect her to say that she was willing to stay by your side and take care of you for the rest of your life, even if she didn’t have a status. Qiao Xi doesn’t love you at all. Only Mengqing truly loves you.”","Yao Mengqing covered her mouth and shed tears silently.","At this moment, Lin Jie rushed over. “Ah Zheng, I just don’t understand why you dote on Qiao Xi so much. She was Gu Moling’s fiancée in the past, and after she married you, she has always caused trouble. Mengqing, on the other hand, is gentle and sensible. She has always admired you. For more than ten years, she has never been in a relationship because she was waiting for you alone. If you cancel the engagement now, how can you still be human?!”"]},{"number":557,"title":"Chapter 557 - The Pinker Her Clothes Are, The More Vicious She Is!","paragraphs":["Yao Mengqing’s body trembled slightly as she said aggrievedly, “Ah Zheng, if Xi Xi hadn’t left, I wouldn’t have asked to be engaged to you. But she’s already gone. You... Can’t you turn around and notice me? We grew up together since we were young. It’s only right for us to be together.","“If you hadn’t married Qiao Xi back then, we might have gotten married a long time ago. Ah Zheng, why can’t you pity me?”.","With that, she cried uncontrollably in grief.","Gu Zheng sneered. “Miss Yao, if you’re crazy, quickly get yourself treated.”","“Ah Zheng!” Yao Mengqing’s lips trembled. “In order to marry you and be worthy of you, I went overseas to study alone. I worked hard for many years and created huge benefits for the Gu family’s company. Now that I’ve finally gotten my wish and am engaged to you, are you going to break the engagement for the woman who abandoned you?”","The Yao family immediately chimed in, “Yes, President Gu. Our Mengqing has been pampered since she was young and has never been wronged. However, for your sake, she’d rather be bullied by that woman, Qiao Xi. Now that the woman has finally left, how can you abandon Mengqing for her?”","“President Gu, Mengqing really loves you. The marriage has been set. You have to be responsible for Mengqing!”","These accusations made Gu Zheng frown. After a long silence, he sneered.","Yao Mengqing begged humbly, “Ah Zheng, Xi Xi has already left. Just forget about her. I’m your fiancée now. I won’t ask for anything else. I just hope that you can save me some dignity in front of everyone. After all, this is our engagement banquet. If there’s anything, we can talk about it in the future, okay?”","The beauty shed tears as her voice was filled with pleading. Everyone felt their hearts ache. No matter what, Yao Mengqing was the daughter of the Yao family. Now that she was begging her fiancé without caring about her reputation at the engagement banquet, she must have truly fallen in love with Gu Zheng.","Yao Mengqing was really infatuated. It made President Gu seem heartless.","“Miss Yao, why are you spouting nonsense in broad daylight?!”","At this moment, a cold female voice sounded. Everyone immediately looked in the direction of the voice.","The door slowly opened, and a graceful figure appeared like a fairy.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were gentle.","Yao Mengqing, who was at the side, was instantly stunned. Then, she was shocked. In the end, her expression turned ferocious, while her eyes were filled with horror.","Qiao Xi?","How was this possible? Wasn’t she dead?","Fear and shock surged in her heart like a cold tide. Yao Mengqing immediately took out her phone and stared fixedly at the message she received just now. The other party had clearly told her that the mission was completed. How could Qiao Xi appear here?","Everyone was extremely shocked, and the bodyguards stood coldly on the spot. Qiao Xi walked in front of everyone as if she was walking into an uninhabited place.","She was wearing a pink dress that outlined her beautiful figure. As she stood in the middle of the banquet hall, it was as if everyone wanted to worship her.","Qiao Xi walked in front of Yao Mengqing and raised her eyebrows in disdain. “Miss Yao, are you daydreaming? You actually claim to be Gu Zheng’s fiancée and even asked him to save you some face at the engagement banquet? After hearing your words, everyone will naturally think that you’re humbling yourself for Gu Zheng, while Gu Zheng seems heartless for treating his gentle fiancée like this. But...”","She was already slightly taller than Yao Mengqing to begin with. Now that she was wearing a pair of high heels, she looked down at Yao Mengqing condescendingly and said slowly, “Miss Yao, have you forgotten that I’m Mrs. Gu?!","“Gu Zheng and I haven’t divorced yet, yet you’re claiming to be Gu Zheng’s fiancée. You’re not even letting him think about his wife. What’s your intention?”","The entire venue was in an uproar.","The pinker her clothes were, the more vicious she was!","The moment Mrs. Gu appeared, the atmosphere in the entire banquet hall was different. It was as though there was gunpowder in the air. Yao Mengqing was speechless.","Qiao Xi stood in the same spot and beckoned to Gu Zheng. Then, everyone saw President Gu walk to Qiao Xi’s side like a loyal dog and hug her waist intimately.","Yao Mengqing looked at the two of them snuggling together and instantly felt betrayed. She was so angry that she almost gritted her teeth.","Why was Qiao Xi back? She should be dead!","Trash! They were all trash!","She was afraid that she would not be able to kill Qiao Xi with the poison, so she specially contacted an assassin from Ling Pavilion and gave them 20 million yuan. However, Qiao Xi was still alive! Could it be that Ling Pavilion failed?"]},{"number":558,"title":"Chapter 558 - Going To The Gu Family To Snatch Her Husband!","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi was not dead. What should she do, then?","However, even if Ling Pavilion failed, Qiao Xi would still be poisoned. The poison was incurable, and she would definitely die from bleeding from her seven apertures within seven days. Before long, Qiao Xi would still be dead. The position of Mrs. Gu still belonged to her.","Yao Mengqing suppressed the uneasiness in her heart as big teardrops fell. “Xi Xi, you abandoned Ah Zheng. Why did you come back to say such things? You’re no longer husband and wife. I’m Ah Zheng’s fiancée now.”","When she said that, everyone suddenly came to a realization. Chairman Gu had indeed said that he had tested Qiao Xi. It was Qiao Xi who heartlessly proposed a divorce and left with the money she got from the Gu family. This meant that she was no longer Gu Zheng’s wife.","When Madam Yao saw this scene, her eyes shifted, and she immediately berated, “Qiao Xi, you married President Gu for his money. As soon as you heard that he was in a car accident, you took the money and left. Now that you know it was just a test, you came back to ruin my daughter’s engagement. You’re really too much!","“Qiao Xi, you’re so heartless. Do you still have the delusion of wanting Mrs. Gu’s identity?”","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi in disdain. Back then, President Gu did not care about his family’s obstruction and insisted on marrying Qiao Xi. If she really agreed to divorce him for the sake of money, her intention of returning now was even more obvious.","President Gu and Yao Mengqing were about to get engaged, but Mrs. Gu, who had abandoned President Gu, suddenly came back. Was she here to snatch her husband?","Qiao Xi’s icy-cold gaze swept past everyone. After a long time, she smiled lightly. “You said that I accepted Chairman Gu’s money to abandon Gu Zheng?","“And Miss Yao passed the test, so she’s qualified to be Gu Zheng’s fiancée?”","Gu Weiming looked disgusted. “You know very well what you’ve done! The moment you heard that Ah Zheng had become disabled, you kicked up a fuss and asked for money to leave. Now that you know that nothing has happened to Ah Zheng, you came back eagerly. You’re a greedy woman!”","“Where’s the evidence?”","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes. “Chairman Gu, you said that I accepted your money, so there should be a transfer record, right? You would’ve made a phone call to me to get me to come over and talk to you too, right? Moreover, you know that I’m close to Ah Zheng. Why would I simply believe you if you said that Gu Zheng has become disabled? Couldn’t I just call Gu Zheng myself and ask him?","“Since Chairman Gu insists that I accept the money, then show me the evidence!” Everyone felt that Qiao Xi’s words made sense.","Gu Zheng and Gu Weiming had always been at odds with each other. Of course, Qiao Xi would not easily believe Gu Weiming’s words. Gu Weiming must have shown her something or said something.","Gu Weiming choked: “...”","“Xi Xi, you’ve already taken the money and abandoned Ah Zheng. What evidence do you need? If you didn’t leave secretly, why didn’t you come to the Gu family with Ah Zheng just now?”","Yao Mengqing pretended to be helpless. “Uncle Gu wanted to save you some dignity. He didn’t want to make things too big. Don’t be stubborn. It won’t do you any good if you continue to be in a deadlock here.”","Qiao Xi elegantly sat down, picked up a glass of red wine, and took a sip. Then, she smiled meaningfully. “Miss Yao, shouldn’t you be very clear about why I didn’t come with Gu Zheng?”","Yao Mengqing’s body trembled as she stammered, “I-I don’t know...”","Qiao Xi raised her hand and gestured. The lights on the big screen flashed, scaring Yao Mengqing to the point her entire body trembled.","Yao Mengqing was filled with horror. She suddenly had a bad feeling.","Every time Qiao Xi wanted to deal with her, she would reveal a confident smile as if everything was under her control.","However, what kind of place was Ling Pavilion? Even if they did not succeed, it was impossible for them to expose the information of their employer. Yao Mengqing was sure that Qiao Xi did not have any evidence.","Lu Yan stood in the crowd and had a bad feeling.","At this moment, Yao Mengqing suddenly looked up and saw a video on the screen.","“The person in this video... is Miss Yao?”","“Who’s that man?”","“What does Qiao Xi mean? Even if Miss Yao had met another man in private, it doesn’t mean anything. It might be a friend. What does this have to do with her?”","At this moment, Yao Mengqing looked terrified. Her lips were trembling so much that she could not say anything."]},{"number":559,"title":"Chapter 559 - Help Me Kill Qiao Xi","paragraphs":["The man in the video was from Ling Pavilion! “Turn it off! Turn it off!”","At this moment, she no longer cared about her dignity and identity. She rushed crazily toward the stage and smacked the screen. “Turn it off!”","Everyone still did not understand why Yao Mengqing suddenly went crazy. The man on the screen was then heard asking, “Kill who?”","Kill who?","These two words shocked everyone.","Yao Mengqing’s body trembled. She wanted to turn off the video so badly, and a cold sweat broke out on her forehead.","“You... Don’t misunderstand. This is a movie that I filmed, but it hasn’t been aired. Why is Miss Qiao playing this here? It’s just—”.","Before she could finish, a cold snort sounded on the big screen. Although it was just a short snort, it was still very clear in the sound system. The next sentence made everyone turn pale with fright.","“Help me kill Qiao Xi!”","Yao Mengqing’s body froze, and her eyes were filled with horror.","The video was still playing.","“That’s a little difficult.”","Yao Mengqing said, “No matter how much it costs, I want to kill her! I want her to die! Do you hear that?! Is 20 million yuan enough? If it’s not enough, I can give more. As long as she dies, money won’t be a problem!”","The man hesitated for a moment. “I have to ask the higher-ups about this.”","He walked to the side and made a call. After a while, he returned to his original spot. “Alright. 20 million.”","Yao Mengqing laughed out loud. “Alright! I’ll transfer the 20 million to you later. I heard that Ling Pavilion has never failed. I want you to attack immediately. No matter what, kill her and don’t leave any traces!”","The scene stopped abruptly, and the entire venue was in an uproar.","Qiao Xi sneered. “Movie? Is it such a coincidence that the person you want to kill is called Qiao Xi? Ling Pavilion? I seem to have heard of it?”","Ling Pavilion was the number one assassin organization in the world. Ordinary people might not have heard of it, but everyone in high society knew about it.","The man just now had a mask on his face and a bright symbol of Ling Pavilion on his clothes. No one dared to forge that symbol, because if they offended Ling Pavilion, they would definitely be chased down by them.","Immediately after, a photo appeared on the screen. It was Yao Mengqing’s transfer record. She had indeed transferred a sum of money to Ling Pavilion. It was exactly as what was mentioned in the video—20 million.","Then, the scene flashed. Another video appeared. The Yao family’s expressions changed.","Madam Yao asked, “Mengqing, is the assassin organization you found reliable? Will Qiao Xi survive?”","“Mom, don’t worry! Ling Pavilion has never failed. Qiao Xi and I have a deep grudge. If I don’t get rid of her, she’ll definitely attack the Yao family. Moreover, she’s blocking my way. If she doesn’t die, how can I marry Ah Zheng?”","Madam Yao replied, “You’re right! We should kill her!”","Everyone’s eyes were on the Yao family. They were filled with disdain.","Madam Yao lowered her head and trembled. She knew that something was wrong.","Qiao Xi glanced coldly at everyone before her gaze finally landed on Lin Jie. Lin Jie’s body instantly trembled.","Then...","“Mengqing, you grew up with the bunch of us. You and Ah Zheng are publicly acknowledged as a couple. Even though he has married Qiao Xi, you still occupy his heart.","“When you were young, you and Ah Zheng even slept on the same bed. It’s because of your relationship from when you two were young that Qiao Xi always bullies you, especially when she sees that you’re weak. She deserves to die for targeting you!","“The brothers in the circle all dote on you like their younger sister. However, Qiao Xi always wants to deal with you and chase you away from Ah Zheng. Back then, when you were with Ah Zheng, she didn’t even know him!","“The position of Mrs. Gu will be yours sooner or later. Don’t worry. One day, Ah Zheng will hate Qiao Xi and abandon her.’","After these words, there were many scenes of Lin Jie and Yao Mengqing talking in private. Lin Jie cursed and slandered Qiao Xi, but Yao Mengqing pretended to be innocent and said aggrievedly that she and Gu Zheng were just friends. She asked why Qiao Xi was always targeting her.","Looking at the images flashing on the big screen, Lin Jie’s eyes were filled with horror.","At this moment, a young woman broke the silence first. “Yao Mengqing is a two-faced b*tch! She pretends to be pure and noble as though she has never done a bad deed in her life! Hence, all men like her. She says she has no other intentions of getting close to a married man and just treats him as a friend. Pah! What nonsense!”"]},{"number":560,"title":"Chapter 560 - Stupid Woman","paragraphs":["The young woman continued to attack. “The moment you speak, you reek of a hypocritical b*tch. Do you really think everyone is stupid? Only that fool, Lin Jie, would believe your nonsense! No matter if you had a good relationship with President Gu in the past or not, he’s already married now, so you should keep your distance. However, you just had to go over and provoke Mrs. Gu. You even said that she’s targeting you?","“Miss Yao, you’ve really broadened my horizons. Although you say that you only treat President Gu as a friend, you actually wanted to kill Mrs. Gu to replace her. You’re really a b*tch. Just looking at you makes me disgusted!”","The guests invited by the Gu family were all reputable people in Li City. They were all relatives or friends of the Gu family.","This woman scolded Yao Mengqing in front of Gu Weiming. This meant that she was already extremely angry and could not take it anymore.","The Lin family did not expect this fool, Lin Jie, to say so many slanderous words about Mrs. Gu behind her back.","Although the Lin family had produced such a bastard like Lin Jie, Mr. Lin was an understanding person. His expression instantly changed, and he raised his hand to slap Lin Jie.","“Bastard! It’s fine that you’re always causing trouble at home, but you’re even causing trouble outside now. How dare you offend Mrs. Gu for a woman?”","Lin Jie and Gu Zheng had grown up together. He was not afraid of Gu Zheng, so he retorted boldly, “What’s wrong with what I said? Qiao Xi is_”","Smack!","Mr. Lin slapped him again and interrupted him.","“It’s already come to this, yet you’re still unwilling to admit your mistake! Fine! Then get lost from the Lin family! I still have another son, so I don’t need you to inherit the family business!”","When Madam Lin heard this, her expression instantly changed. “Hubby, Ah Jie and Mengqing are childhood friends. This...”","Mr. Lin looked at Gu Zheng’s expression and could not help but tremble. Terror spread to his entire body, and he felt the blood in his body freeze.","Although Gu Zheng was not looking at him, the coldness exuding from his body was like a huge hand grabbing his throat, making him break out in a cold sweat.","Mr. Lin glared at Madam Lin and slapped her as well.","“You stupid woman! If you hadn’t spoiled Lin Jie, he wouldn’t have become so arrogant! You’re willing to be a mistress yourself, so you like Yao Mengqing as well. You’ll only be happy when she kills our Lin family, huh?!”","Gu Zheng curled his lips slightly. There was someone reasonable in the Lin family after all.","He would never let off anyone who bullied Mrs. Gu.","He had to deal with Lin Jie, Yao Mengqing, and Lu Yan one by one. Now that he had dealt with Lin Jie, it made him happy.","Actually, Mr. Lin had never liked Lin Jie, but all these years, Lin Jie had brought a lot of benefits to the Lin family because he was childhood friends with Gu Zheng. That was why he treated Lin Jie differently.","However, since some time ago, the Lin family’s company had been getting suppressed. Previously, their food factory was found to be unhygienic, and the Lin family’s reputation was affected. They lost hundreds of millions.","Mr. Lin had always thought that his competitor had reported him. Now, he realized that it might have been President Gu!","Gu Zheng said slowly, “President Lin, you’re a smart person.”","“I understand what you mean, President Gu.”","Mr. Lin instantly understood and immediately announced, “From today onward, Lin Jie is no longer a member of the Lin family. My eldest son will be the heir of the Lin family. He’s the son of my first wife, so it’s reasonable for him to be the heir!”","Gu Zheng smiled. He liked to talk to smart people.","“Ah!” Madam Lin screamed and shouted unwillingly, “No! No! Ah Jie was just being silly. Give him a chance!”","Gu Zheng looked displeased.","Mr. Lin’s heart jumped. “It would be fine if he was capable. I could just let him work in the company. However, he just had to offend Mrs. Gu! President Gu... President Gu, do you think you’re satisfied with this punishment?”","Everyone could not help but look at Gu Zheng. He slowly raised his eyes and nodded impatiently. Mr. Lin heaved a sigh of relief.","Although Gu Zheng did not say anything, Mr. Lin knew very well that if he did not ruin Lin Jie’s identity as the heir, the entire Lin family would be doomed."]},{"number":561,"title":"Chapter 561 - Extermination","paragraphs":["When the eldest young master of the Lin family ascended to the throne, Lin Jie and Madam Lin, the illegitimate child and mistress, would be chased out of the house sooner or later.","Lin Jie stood in the same spot with his mouth wide open in shock. Then, his body went weak as he lay on the floor. “Gu Zheng! I’m your good friend! I just saw Mengqing being bullied and said a few words. Are you... going to take down everyone involved?”","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with ridicule. “Young Master Lin, I was wondering why you wanted Yao Mengqing to interfere in my marriage with Gu Zheng. It turns out that your mother is a mistress!","“You want to prove to the world that it’s okay being a mistress? No matter who the other party is, anyone can snatch the person they like? We don’t have to care about being polite and ethical?”","Gu Yao also snorted. “Lin Jie, you’ve helped Yao Mengqing so many times, but you’ve always caused the Lin family’s business to suffer. You’re willing to sacrifice your family for a woman who doesn’t love you. If Uncle Lin doesn’t chase you out of the house, won’t the Lin family be ruined in your hands?!”","Lin Jie gritted his teeth. Gu Yao, this good-for-nothing, still had the cheek to scold him? Everyone in Li City knew that Gu Yao was a prodigal!","Before he could retort, everyone could not help but mock him.","“Miss Yao is scheming. She pretended to be innocent but in reality, she just wanted Lin Jie to stand up for her. After the matter is exposed, she wants Lin Jie to take the blame for her. If this continues, the Lin family will be completely destroyed!”","“This Lin Jie is really brainless. For a scheming b*tch, he almost lost the entire Lin family. He even implicated his mother and exposed the ugly fact that she’s a mistress!”","“Madam Lin, you can’t blame anyone else now. This is all your son’s fault. If the Lin family’s business is affected in the future, it’s all your son’s fault!”","Madam Lin widened her eyes and roared fiercely. Then, she rushed in front of Yao Mengqing and slapped her with all her might.","“B*tch! You’re the one who harmed my son! You jinx!”","“Everyone knows that you like President Gu, but you’re still hounding our Ah Jie. You say that you’re friends, but you’re actually seducing him behind his back. Otherwise, why would Ah Jie be so loyal to you? You’re just a b*tch. How can you be worthy of marrying President Gu!”","Madam Lin’s slap was too vicious. It made Yao Mengqing’s ears ring as blood seeped out of the corners of her mouth.","Lin Jie’s heart was dead, and his eyes were empty. He was born with a silver spoon in his mouth since he was young and had never suffered at all. Now that he was chased out of the house, his life in the future would be difficult.","He was just standing up for Yao Mengqing. How did he ruin his chance to get his family’s inheritance?","At this moment, Gu Zheng slowly raised his eyes and glanced at the Yao family coldly.","Yao Mengqing covered her red and swollen face, trembling in fear. Gu Zheng curled his lips. “The Lin family’s fool has been dealt with. It’s your turn now.”","As soon as he said this, Mr. Yao’s body instantly went soft. He knelt on the floor in horror. “President Gu... President Gu...”","Suddenly, the Yao family’s phones rang at the same time. Almost instantly, the Yao family’s companies were forcefully bought over. The assets under the Yao family’s name were all frozen. Some businesses were also sold at low prices.","The famous noble families in Li City were vanishing one by one in an instant.","In the end, the Yao family’s villa was also forcefully taken. It could be said that the Yao family no longer had any liquid assets under their name. All that was left were some jewelry and cash.","“President Gu! Please let the Yao family off! Mengqing is your good friend, after all. Moreover, Mrs. Gu is standing here perfectly fine. She didn’t-“","Gu Zheng glanced at him coldly, scaring Mr. Yao so much that he choked.","“Ah Zheng, forget it.” Gu Weiming frowned unhappily. This was the engagement banquet between the Gu and Yao families. Now that things had turned out like this, he had to stand up and uphold justice.","Now that the evidence of Yao Mengqing hiring someone to kill Qiao Xi was conclusive, the Yao family did not need to hide it. They might as well just admit it and beg Gu Zheng for forgiveness.","“Qiao Xi, you’ve suffered a lot, but the Yao and Gu families are old friends, after all. As long as you’re willing to forgive the Yao family, I’ll definitely make it up to you.”","Gu Weiming had his hands behind his back and put on the attitude of an elder. He seemed to be discussing with Qiao Xi, but he was actually ordering her around."]},{"number":562,"title":"Chapter 562 - Killing Her Would Be Going Easy On Her","paragraphs":["“Mengqing is in the wrong here, but she really loves Ah Zheng. Miss Qiao, you’re a woman too. You should understand that she did something irrational on the spur of the moment in order to be with the person she loves. The Yao and Gu families have been on good terms for many years. As Gu Zheng’s wife, you shouldn’t pursue this matter. It’s also for your own reputation.”","Qiao Xi could not help but laugh.","Qiao Xi knew very well that Gu Weiming was afraid that if Yao Mengqing went to jail, Lu Yan would be implicated as well. After all, they were in the same boat.","However, she did not expect the Yao family and Gu Weiming to be so shameless as to ask her to let the matter go.","“Chairman Gu, you’re such a good uncle! Miss Yao committed the crime of hiring an assassin to kill me, but you’re actually asking me not to pursue the matter. It turns out that in your eyes, the crime of killing and arson can be forgiven.”","With that said, everyone took a few steps back and looked at Yao Mengqing in disdain.","In order to marry Gu Zheng and get the position of Mrs. Gu, Yao Mengqing actually hired an assassin to kill Qiao Xi and treated human lives as grass. They naturally had to stay away from such a vicious woman.","Madam Yao’s expression softened a little. With Gu Weiming’s appearance, Mengqing should be fine. Hence, she became arrogant. “Qiao Xi, what’s there for you to be unwilling about? No matter what, Mengqing is President Gu’s friend. Moreover, you’re standing here perfectly fine. You still have your arms and legs. What else do you want?!”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing.","Madam Yao snorted. “What are you laughing about?! You’re not really going to call the police and let Mengqing go to jail, are you?!”","They had long known that the Yao family was shameless, but everyone could not help but be shocked.","Yao Mengqing hired an assassin to kill Qiao Xi, yet Madam Yao was still so arrogant. Logically speaking, shouldn’t she be kneeling on the floor and begging Qiao Xi for forgiveness?","Qiao Xi was just about to retort when Gu Zheng spoke first. “Yes, there’s no need to call the police.”","When they heard this, the Yao family instantly smiled. President Gu had already spoken, so it was useless for Qiao Xi to bicker with him.","Although the Yao family’s businesses were gone, as long as they were still in contact with the Gu family, they would have a chance to make a comeback.","Just as the Yao family heaved a sigh of relief, Gu Zheng curled his lips and waved his hand behind him. He said casually, “Take them","away!”","Gu Weiming’s heart skipped a beat as he hurriedly stopped him. “Ah Zheng, stop fooling around!”","“I can handle this small matter myself. There’s no need to trouble the police.” Gu Zheng smiled, but the smile did not reach his eyes at all. It was cold. “Song Shijing.”","Song Shijing nodded and gave the order. The bodyguards rushed in and surrounded the huge banquet hall.","Gu Weiming was furious. “Gu Zheng! What are you doing?!”","The bodyguards in the Gu family’s old residence were originally his subordinates, but now, they were all listening to Gu Zheng. With Gu Zheng’s order, they all made their move.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were cold. “Father, I love Mrs. Gu. Everyone knows that someone wanted to hurt her. I can’t let that person","off!”","The guests in the banquet hall were flustered as they watched Song Shijing drag the Yao family out.","Everyone knew that Gu Zheng was daring, but they did not expect him to take the Yao family away in front of everyone. Was he going to punish the Yao family himself?","If they learned that the Yao family had died, it would definitely have something to do with Gu Zheng.","At this moment, although Gu Zheng’s expression was normal, his eyes were filled with anger. He doted on Mrs. Gu and could not bear to let her suffer at all. However, these people actually wanted to kill her. He wanted to make everyone who hurt her pay a painful price.","“Yao Mengqing hurt... Mrs. Gu. She deserves it! Killing her would be letting her off easy!”","At this moment, Yao Mengqing was being escorted out. She was so afraid that her entire body was trembling. When she heard this, she instantly vomited a mouthful of blood and fainted.","Everyone exclaimed. Gu Weiming was so angry that his face darkened. However, he could not stop Gu Zheng’s actions.","“Father.”","Gu Zheng suddenly said, “Please put away your thoughts and don’t let your son appear in front of me again. Otherwise, he’ll share the same outcome as Yao Mengqing!”","Gu Weiming gasped.","Lu Yan narrowed his eyes, which had turned vicious."]},{"number":563,"title":"Chapter 563 - Cut Her Tongue And Make Her Shut Up Forever!","paragraphs":["Seeing this, the guests hurriedly packed their things and left the Gu family’s old residence.","After everyone left, Gu Weiming was angry and swept everything on the table to the floor.","“This bastard! He actually captured the Yao family!”","Lu Yan sat leisurely on the chair and said indifferently, “Yao Mengqing is already a useless chess piece. If she’s captured, so be","it!!","“If she—”","“Heh! Yao Mengqing has no evidence at all.” Lu Yan sneered. “Even if Gu Zheng finds out that all of this was my plan, so what? He can’t kill me without evidence.”","Gu Weiming wanted to say something but hesitated. Actually, so what if Gu Zheng had no evidence? If Gu Zheng really wanted to kill someone, he did not need any reason.","Lu Yan took a sip of tea and lazily leaned back in the chair. “Father, it’s a good thing if Yao Mengqing really dies. We can use her one last time.”","Gu Weiming suddenly felt his neck turn cold. He was silent for a long time and could not say anything. In the past, he thought that Gu Zheng was heartless, but now, it seemed that this son of his was even worse than Gu Zheng.","Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi was sitting on the sofa and looking at her phone when a notification popped up.","It was a news article about how the Yao family, a wealthy family in Li City, had gone bankrupt. The daughter of the Yao family, Yao Mengqing, had hired an assassin to kill someone. When the matter was exposed, she fled with her money.","Qiao Xi had a puzzled expression. “Wasn’t Yao Mengqing captured?”","Song Shiyu lowered his voice. “Young Madam, it’s because the president is afraid of leaving a bad impact, so he fabricated an article. This is the first time I’ve seen the president so angry. I think Yao Mengqing is in big trouble!”","Qiao Xi nodded. She was slightly curious about where Yao Mengqing was locked up at this moment.","At this moment, in the third floor underground dungeon of Longwan Residential.","The people from the Yao family did not expect that there would be such a dark dungeon under Longwan Residential. This place was more than 20 meters below the ground. Even if they shouted until their throats were hoarse, nobody could hear them.","Yao Mengqing shivered in the corner, staring at the blood on the floor. She looked at the man not far away and begged, “Ah Zheng, let me go. I know... I was wrong.”","Gu Zheng was dressed in black as he slowly walked over like a demon hidden in the darkness. He sat down elegantly and lazily leaned against the back of the chair, his long legs crossed.","Song Shijing stood behind Gu Zheng and handed him a cup of hot tea. The tea was still steaming and looked out of place in this cold and humid dungeon.","“It’s almost time.”","Everyone did not understand what Gu Zheng meant, but after a while, Yao Mengqing felt her heart tingle. The pain that followed made her look ferocious. Her fair and smooth face was in unbearable pain.","A heart-wrenching pain spread from her heart to her entire body. It was as if she was being dismembered, making her wish she could die immediately.","“Ah!!! Ah!!”","Yao Mengqing screamed in pain, “Ah Zheng! I love you! Why are you... so heartless?! For you, I went overseas to study alone. In order to please you, I learned how to serve men without caring about my reputation. I’m all","-11","“Miss Yao, your actions really make me nauseous. Since you’re so desperate, I’ll satisfy you.”","Song Shijing understood.","Yao Mengqing widened her eyes in horror. “Gu Zheng, what are you doing?! You can’t do this to me!","“I’ve liked you since I was young and treated you as my Prince Charming. Today, I found out that you’re a demon! You’re the most heartless person. If... Qiao Xi finds out that you’re such a man, she’ll be unable to accept you. Otherwise, why didn’t you let her come along? You’re afraid that she’ll leave you if she gets scared from seeing this scene! “Only me! Only I love”","Pfft!","Before she could finish speaking, a sharp dagger flew into Yao Mengqing’s mouth.","Gu Zheng looked up coldly. “You’re making me annoyed. Cut her tongue and make her shut up forever.”","The dungeon fell silent.","Yao Mengqing was in so much pain that her eyes almost popped out. The pain all over her body was already unbearable. The pain on her tongue made her sweat.","“Ah!!”","“Mengqing!”","The dungeon was filled with cries for help from the Yao family.","Gu Zheng waved his hand indifferently. “Get someone to stop the bleeding. Don’t let her die.”","“Yes!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. Even though he had just cut off Yao Mengqing’s tongue, he was expressionless."]},{"number":564,"title":"Chapter 564 - If You Want To Die, I’ll Help You","paragraphs":["The knife had already been smeared with poison. She would die sooner or later anyway. He wanted her to live a few more days so that she could experience the effects of the poison.","“Gu Zheng, you’re crazy and inhumane. You’ll die a horrible death!”","Madam Yao watched as her daughter fell to the floor, blood flowing out of her mouth. She screamed like a lunatic and shook the metal","railing","Gu Zheng glanced at her indifferently.","He had heard such curses countless times, but he was still living well in this world. On the other hand, all the people who opposed him did not have a good ending.","Gu Zheng stood up elegantly. Madam Yao glared at him fiercely and gritted her teeth in hatred. After a while, the corners of her mouth twitched. Then, she laughed crazily.","“Gu Zheng, you’re cruel and unscrupulous! If Qiao Xi finds out that you’re such a person, she’ll definitely be afraid! She’ll leave you forever!","“You’re a demon. My daughter and you are childhood sweethearts, yet you actually cut off her tongue. You can even bear to do this to her. If Qiao Xi finds out that you’re so vicious, won’t she be afraid that you’ll attack her one day?","“Gu Zheng! She’ll abandon you sooner or later! She’ll hate you and run away from","you!”","Gu Zheng stopped in his tracks. His gaze was cold, and his body emitted an icy-cold killing intent.","Song Shijing immediately felt a chill surrounding him. He was terrified.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with cold killing intent as the corners of his mouth curled into a bloodthirsty smile. “Madam Yao, if you want to die, I’ll fulfill your wish.”","Then, tragic screams sounded in the dungeon. The Yao family’s faces were ferocious as they screamed in pain like Yao Mengqing. They lay on the floor and rolled around in pain.","Song Shijing’s heart skipped a beat. The Yao family poisoned Young Madam and hired someone to kill her. They had really angered the president and would die a hundred times under his hands if it were possible.","Everyone involved in the Yao family was locked up now. Even if they did not die, they would be locked in the dungeon forever and suffer endless pain.","Gu Zheng stood up and left. He slowly walked into the luxurious villa from the dark dungeon. The ground floor and the underground seemed to be two different worlds. Even the air smelled different.","At the same time, Qiao Xi was still thinking about where Gu Zheng was keeping the Yao family.","Gu Zheng had taken them away, so he shouldn’t have brought them too far. The most dangerous place was the safest place. Could it be that they were locked in Longwan Residential?","Qiao Xi pondered slightly. She remembered that Longwan Residential had three floors underground. Although she had never been there, she knew its existence.","When there was no one around, she secretly searched for the secret door of the dungeon. An hour later, she found the entrance to the dungeon and carefully sneaked in.","Qiao Xi had just gone down one floor when she smelled a faint smell of blood.","At this moment, Gu Zheng was flipping through documents in the study.","Song Shijing rushed in and said in a panic, “President, bad news. Young Madam has gone to the dungeon!”","Crack!","The pen in Gu Zheng’s hand instantly broke into two halves. For the first time, a panicked expression appeared on his face, and his heart thumped violently.","At this moment, Madam Yao’s words repeated in his ears. ‘Gu Zheng! She’ll abandon you sooner or later! She’ll hate you and run away from you!","The dungeon was dark. Qiao Xi walked carefully, and the smell of blood grew stronger and stronger. Waves of painful roars and pleas sounded in her ears.","At this moment, she was sure that the Yao family was locked in this dungeon.","The second floor of the underground was used to store alcohol, so the air was fresh and clean. However, as soon as she stepped through the door of the third floor, it was filled with the thick smell of blood.","Qiao Xi looked at the scene before her and could not help but be slightly surprised. The farther she went in, the stronger the smell became. It was even to the extent that there were traces of blood on the floor.","There was a set of exquisite and elegant tables and chairs in front of her. It was obvious that they were expensive. There was also a cup of cold tea on the table.","Qiao Xi looked at the people in the cellar. Mr. Yao, Madam Yao, and Yao Mengqing were all here.","Yao Mengqing poisoned her and spent 20 million yuan to hire an assassin to kill her. Mr. and Madam Yao had long known about it and supported her decision. They even tried to hide the truth.","The Yao family must have done many heartless things over the years. If she, Qiao Xi, was dead, it would allow Yao Mengqing to get her wish of becoming Mrs. Gu. It would also allow the Yao family to climb up the social ladder. It was killing two birds with one stone."]},{"number":565,"title":"Chapter 565 - Your Fate Is Worse Than Mengqing’s!","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi grunted coldly.","The sudden noise woke the Yao family up. Madam Yao struggled to raise her head and glared fiercely at her. She gritted her teeth and shouted, “Qiao Xi!","“Gu Zheng is a demon! You’re a demon too! We’ve already been injured by you. What else do you want? Just kill us! Hahaha...”","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent. “Is Yao Mengqing dead?”","“You still have the cheek to ask her?” Madam Yao sneered, her eyes filled with resentment. Then, she laughed crazily. “Hahaha... Looks like you don’t know what Gu Zheng has done at all! He definitely wouldn’t dare to tell you!","“That’s right! He wouldn’t dare! I’m afraid you’ve always thought of him as a gentle and loving man, but in reality, he’s a vicious, cruel, and ruthless demon!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Yao Mengqing struggled to get up from the floor. The blood in her mouth had already dried up, and her face was pale. She looked like a demon that had crawled out of hell.","Madam Yao roared madly, “That demon Gu Zheng actually cut Mengqing’s tongue off! He even wants to kill us! Qiao Xi, now that you know that your husband is such a vicious man, aren’t you afraid?","“There’s so much blood on the floor here. He must have secretly killed many people! Haha... Who knew that this seemingly bright Longwan Residential is actually hiding such a cold, damp, and bloody place? Just how many lonely souls and wild ghosts are wandering here?!","“How do you think an illegitimate child like him became the head of the Gu family and a god-like figure in Li City? Do you know how much blood has stained his hands and how many people he has killed? Do you think he’s just the high and mighty President Gu as the rumors made him out to be?","“Mengqing grew up with him since she was young. They’re childhood sweethearts. However, he cruelly cut off Mengqing’s tongue. People like him have no heart at all!","“Qiao Xi! Just you wait! Sooner or later, you’ll die in his hands. Perhaps your outcome will be even more miserable than Mengqing’s! Be careful when you sleep at night. Perhaps he’ll kill you if he’s unhappy with you!” Madam Yao screamed, and the dungeon fell into a dead silence.","Song Shijing, who was hiding in the dark, looked at the president in front of him and shuddered.","Madam Yao was really tired of living!","Now, the president’s body was cold, and his eyes were bloodshot. He seemed to be going crazy. Although there were lights in the basement, it was still a little dark.","All these years, many people had attacked the president. In the beginning, he endured it silently. It was only later on that he secretly dealt with those people. Everything he did was to protect himself. He had never hurt an innocent person.","Madam Yao did not know the reason at all. What right did she have to say such things?","He only hoped that Young Madam would not believe in Madam Yao’s words. If Young Madam was afraid of the president or wanted to escape, then... the president would definitely go crazy. He did not know what crazy things he would do then.","Gu Zheng’s expression was cold as his eyes burst with killing intent.","Madam Yao was right. He had indeed killed people before. He had never been a kind person. His hands were stained with the blood of many people. Presumably, Mrs. Gu would be afraid of him too.","Then what would Mrs. Gu want to do? Leave?","At this moment, the dungeon was extremely quiet, and even the sounds of breathing were so clear. After a long time, Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes and sneered when she saw Madam Yao’s vicious gaze.","“Madam Yao, do you really think... I’ll think that Gu Zheng is brutal after you tell me all this?”","Qiao Xi smiled lightly and asked casually, “Madam Yao, aren’t you curious about how I survived even though Yao Mengqing found an assassin from Ling Pavilion to kill me?”","Yao Mengqing opened her eyes with difficulty, her heart twitching violently.","“After all, Ling Pavilion has never failed. Not only did I survive this time, but I even got the people from Ling Pavilion to cooperate with me. Don’t you want to know why?”","Madam Yao’s entire body trembled as she looked at Qiao Xi in horror. For a moment, she felt that Qiao Xi was even more terrifying than Gu Zheng.","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. “Why don’t I tell you?”","“I’m not listening!” Madam Yao covered her ears and shouted. She did not want to know how the Yao family lost.","“Because the pavilion master of Ling Pavilion is... my second brother.” Qiao Xi blinked and smiled arrogantly while the corners of her mouth curled up slightly. However, this sentence was like a heavy rock that smashed heavily on the hearts of the Yao family.","The Yao family’s expression changed drastically"]},{"number":566,"title":"Chapter 566 - Let You Die After Being Enlightened","paragraphs":["“You hired my second brother to kill me, and I immediately found out about it. Don’t you think it’s very laughable?”","Qiao Xi blinked, and her eyes were filled with doubt. “Ah Zheng wants to kill all of you to avenge me. I can’t even thank him enough, so why would I be afraid of him? Madam Yao, don’t tell me you think I’ll hate Ah Zheng because of this?”","Madam Yao widened her eyes in horror. She never expected that the pavilion master of Ling Pavilion was actually Qiao Xi’s second brother.","She had always thought that Ling Pavilion would attack Qiao Xi again. Since they had already accepted the money, they should kill Qiao Xi. Even if their family had been captured, Ling Pavilion should still fulfill their promise.","As long as Qiao Xi was dead and Chairman Gu was around, Gu Zheng might agree to the engagement. Who would have thought that Qiao Xi would have her ways to stay alive!","She was unable to figure out why Ling Pavilion had informed them that Qiao Xi was already dead, yet Qiao Xi could stand in front of them. Only now did she understand that Qiao Xi was from Ling Pavilion!","“Ah!!! Ah!!”","Yao Mengqing screamed in pain. Her shrill scream echoed throughout the entire dungeon.","Her tongue was already gone. When she opened her mouth, blood was flowing out from the wound. It was so painful that her face was contorted, but she still screamed like a lunatic.","A few seconds later, her body convulsed as she fell to the floor. Her fingers were twisted strangely, and the intense pain spread to her entire body. She clutched her chest and whimpered in pain.","Qiao Xi sat on Gu Zheng’s original seat and said slowly, “Right, I almost forgot that you’ve been poisoned.","“Miss Yao, you should know a lot about this poison. It’s savage and painful. You won’t be able to breathe properly and will feel pain all over your body. In the end, you’ll bleed from your seven apertures and die.","“Don’t think I don’t know that you poisoned me too!”","Yao Mengqing widened her eyes. Her heart had turned into ashes.","“Mr. Yao, Madam Yao, it seems you have some connections. You actually managed to buy poison like this. Did you think that this poison is incurable? You thought that even if Gu Zheng had the money to treat me, it’d be useless and I’d die a painful death?","“Since you poisoned me and even spent 20 million to look for an assassin from Ling Pavilion, it’s enough to prove that you want me to die!”","Madam Yao glared at Qiao Xi with","resentment.","She wanted her to die! She wanted her to die without a burial ground!","Who asked her to block Mengqing’s way and snatch the position of Mrs. Gu? Who asked Gu Zheng to like her and abandon Mengqing, his childhood sweetheart, for her? This b*tch had to die!","“Madam Yao, you must really want to know why I’m still alive after being poisoned, right?” Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows, and her eyes were filled with ridicule.","The three of them raised their eyes. Besides resentment, there was also a trace of doubt in their eyes. They knew that this poison was incurable. Moreover, Yao Mengqing stabbed the back of Qiao Xi’s hand with a needle that day. Why hadn’t the poison acted up yet?","“Then I’ll let all of you die after being enlightened.” Qiao Xi blinked, and her face carried a trace of a smile. Her next words caused the three members of the Yao family to feel as if they had fallen into an icy pit.","“Because I developed this poison!”","What? Impossible!","The Yao family was in disbelief. This poison was actually developed by her?","Qiao Xi sneered. “Madam Yao, you originally thought that I would be afraid of Gu Zheng, so you wanted to scare me away from him and let him have a taste of being abandoned, right?","“What a pity! I’m actually someone more terrifying than Gu Zheng!”","As soon as she finished speaking, the smile on her face vanished abruptly, and her expression was cold. “Although I developed this poison, I destroyed it because the toxicity is too strong. Naturally, there’s no antidote. I know very well where Yao Mengqing’s poison came from.","“You were used by a vicious man. Madam Yao, don’t you have any regrets now?”","Qiao Xi stood up and stopped in her tracks. She said coldly without turning her head, “Yao Mengqing, Madam Yao, Mr. Yao, enjoy your last moments!","“Qiao Xi, come back! Come back! We were wrong! Help us detoxify the poison!","“If we die, you can’t escape the blame!","“You’re standing here perfectly fine. Why can’t you forgive us?! Let us go...”","Qiao Xi ignored them and slowly walked out of the dungeon. She had just left when her arm was grabbed by someone and she fell into an icy-cold embrace."]},{"number":567,"title":"Chapter 567 - The Gentle Young Master Yao","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi cried out in surprise, “Ah... Ah Zheng?”","Gu Zheng’s body was cold, but his eyes were burning hot. Sweat covered his forehead, and he looked very nervous. Behind him, Song Shijing and Song Shiyu lowered their heads in fear.","Qiao Xi was slightly nervous. “I... I was just curious...”","“I know.”","Qiao Xi: “...” This time, it was ruined. Her image as a delicate woman had collapsed again.","Gu Zheng’s breathing gradually stabilized as he hugged her tightly. His voice trembled slightly as he said, “D-Don’t listen to her nonsense. I absolutely won’t hurt you.”","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled.","He was afraid because he thought that she would leave him because of Madam Yao’s nonsense.","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. “Ah Zheng, no matter who you are, I won’t leave you. I didn’t take her words to heart at all.”","Gu Zheng never harmed innocent people. The Yao family deserved what was happening to them now. They were not worth pitying.","If she liked Gu Zheng, she would not change her mind just because of someone else’s words. Moreover, she believed that Gu Zheng would still treat her the same way as he always had.","After coming out of the dungeon, Qiao Xi directly returned to her bedroom to rest. Unexpectedly, she slept until the next morning","Gu Zheng knocked on the door and walked in. “Xi Xi, the weather is good today. I’ll take you shopping, okay?” Qiao Xi nodded. It had been a long time since she went shopping.","The two of them got into the car. Gu Zheng said casually, “Let’s go to International Commercial Building. The Yao family has a shop there. Yao Junjie is in charge of it now. He gave us a gift card. Why don’t we go there and take a look?”","Yao family?","Qiao Xi was slightly puzzled. Wasn’t the Yao family’s company and businesses in shambles now? There was actually someone managing the Yao family’s shop?","Qiao Xi hesitated for a moment and asked in confusion, “Yao Junjie?”","She had heard of this name before. He was Yao Mengqing’s brother.","“The rest of the Yao family has been captured, but why didn’t Young Master Yao appear? Isn’t he Yao Mengqing’s brother? His sister and parents are missing. Why didn’t he come to beg you?”","Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully.","Qiao Xi curiously picked up her phone and checked Yao Corporation’s information. In the end, she saw the live press conference.","The man sitting in front of the stage was tall and straight. He was wearing a suit, and his eyes were red. He looked sad.","Gu Zheng took a look and sneered. “He’s really good at acting.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","This young master of the Yao family was completely different from Qiao Xi’s impression of him. She originally thought that Yao Mengqing was willful and vicious, so her brother would have the same character as Lin Jie. However, she did not expect him to look quite gentle.","Many people were also praising the new head of the Yao family online.","(Young Master Yao is so pitiful. He’s cleaning up the mess for the Yao family again.]","[Again? Could it be that something like this had happened in the past?)","[Six years ago, when the Yao family’s business was in trouble, the Yao family all ran overseas to look for Yao Junjie to clean up the mess. Yao Junjie originally had his own company overseas and it was developing very well. When he found out that the Yao family was bankrupt, he gave all his shares to Yao Mengqing. Yao Mengqing had money in her hands, so she founded Sunshine. Originally, Yao Junjie should also have shares in Sunshine, but he wasn’t given any.]","[I heard that he took out all his savings to save the Yao family’s company. This gave the company a chance to take a breather. Unexpectedly, the Yao family kicked Yao Junjie out as soon as the Yao family rose in power. He originally had his own career and company, but he was cheated out of everything. He had no choice but to return overseas to continue his business.]","Someone was curious: (But Yao Junjie is also from the Yao family. Why would they do that?]","[Yao Junjie is not Mr. Yao’s biological son. According to seniority, Mr. Yao is his uncle and Yao Mengqing is his cousin. Although they’re related by blood, they’re not directly related. Back then, when Yao Junjie’s parents were in trouble, Yao Mengqing’s family ignored them and even stole the shares and company that originally belonged to Yao Junjie. They let him go overseas to fend for himself. Yao Mengqing’s family is too heartless. Maybe they were the ones who were responsible for the incident that involved Yao Junjie’s parents.]","(You’re right. That family hired an assassin to kill and poison someone. What else can they not do?! I heard that Yao Junjie’s parents died for no reason. Yao Mengqing’s family then stole all his assets. He was even chased overseas by the Yao family.]"]},{"number":568,"title":"Chapter 568 - You Can’t Spend Money Like This!","paragraphs":["There were endless discussions online: (The Yao family is heartless. They chased Yao Junjie out of the country. But every time they encountered trouble, it was Young Master Yao who came to clean up the mess. He’s too kind.)","[If I were Young Master Yao, I definitely wouldn’t have cared about them and let them fend for themselves!]","Qiao Xi read the comments for a while and sighed. “Is that so? No wonder the Yao family is in pieces and Yao Junjie hasn’t appeared yet. It turns out that he isn’t Yao Mengqing’s biological brother.”","Gu Zheng’s thin lips moved slightly. “Yao Junjie gave you 20% of the Yao family’s shares as compensation.”","Qiao Xi’s face was covered in confusion.","Gu Zheng continued to explain, “Actually, the Yao family’s company originally belonged to Yao Junjie. It was snatched by Yao Mengqing’s family. Yao Junjie has been tolerating it for so many years. Now that you’ve helped him solve his problem and get revenge for him, he wants to give you shares as a gift.”","Qiao Xi nodded. Giving away shares was nothing, but this was the first time she saw someone give 20% of their shares to someone. This was too generous!","At this moment, the car had already stopped in front of International Commercial Building","Gu Zheng held her hand and walked into the shop. The staff could tell from their clothes and bearing that they were of extraordinary status. They must be either rich or noble.","The staff member went forward respectfully. “Sir, Madam, what do you need? I can help introduce you to the items here. Miss, you’re young, so it’s more suitable for you to wear a light-colored jade bracelet. How about this? It’s a high-grade ice-type jade without any impurities. Such a clean jade is rare. There’s only one in our entire shop.”","Qiao Xi glanced at it. Even though she did not know much about jade, she knew that the quality of this jade was extremely good.","Gu Zheng bent down and asked gently, “Do you like it?”","The color of this jade bracelet was indeed good. Qiao Xi nodded with satisfaction. “Yes.”","Gu Zheng took out a gold card. “Use this","card.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","The staff member widened his eyes in pleasant surprise. This jade bracelet was of considerable value. He did not expect that this person would ask for it without asking for the price. Everyone in the shop understood that the two people in front of them were filthy rich. They sent Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi off respectfully.","The two of them walked around a few more shops. No matter what the sales attendant recommended, as long as it was something suitable for Qiao Xi, Gu Zheng did not refuse. He swiped his card and took them all, instantly alerting the heads of several shops.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes. “Gu Zheng, you can’t spend so much money like this!”","Gu Zheng smirked. “I’ll buy it as long as you like it.”","He was in a very good mood today and felt like he had just survived a calamity. This was because Mrs. Gu was not afraid of him, nor did she leave him like Madam Yao had said.","At this moment, even if Qiao Xi wanted the stars in the sky, he would pluck them down to cheer her up.","After leaving International Commercial Building, the two of them went to visit luxury shops.","However, they had not gone far when Song Shijing rushed up to them. “President.”","Gu Zheng understood and stroked Qiao Xi’s cheek gently. “I have something to attend to. I’ll get Song Shijing to accompany you. Buy whatever you like. I’ll come look for you later.”","Qiao Xi nodded. She felt more at ease shopping alone. Song Shijing was also very sensible and followed her from an appropriate distance.","She strolled around in boredom and accidentally walked to a luxury men’s clothing shop.","Song Shijing was about to remind her that this was a men’s clothing shop when Qiao Xi walked in.","She glanced around, and her gaze finally landed on a grayish-blue windbreaker. The design was simple and the length was just right. She could already imagine Gu Zheng wearing this.","Gu Zheng’s clothes were mostly suits. They were black and white, and his tie was also a dark color. It made him look very mature.","Actually, Madam Yao was right. Gu Zheng had been pretending to be steady, gentle, elegant, and calm in front of her. He made himself appear just like the noble son of an aristocratic family.","However, Qiao Xi knew that his heart was dark, and he had a stubborn and overbearing character. He seemed to be steady, but he was actually doing his best to suppress the emotions in his heart. She felt that a grayish-blue color was more suitable for him.","Actually, there was no need for him to pretend. Even if she knew his true nature, she would still like him.","Qiao Xi pointed at the grayish-blue windbreaker. “Wrap it up for me and swipe my card.”","On the other hand, Gu Zheng had just finished dealing with his matters and was about to enter when he heard Qiao Xi’s conversation with the sales attendant."]},{"number":569,"title":"Chapter 569 - The President Is Smiling Like A Dog","paragraphs":["Chapter 569 The President Is Smiling Like A Dog","He looked at the size and knew that this windbreaker was for him. He usually wore black and white suits because Qiao Xi said that she liked steady and gentle men, so he chose the colors and styles that Qiao Xi would like. Who knew that she would choose something like this for him?","Song Shiyu was by Gu Zheng’s side. Seeing the corners of his mouth gradually curl up, he could not help but say, “President, control yourself.”","Gu Zheng: “?” Song Shiyu said, “Actually, I think you look better when you’re not smiling. You look sinister when you smile.”","Gu Zheng: “...”","“President, do you know what you look like now? You’re like a puppy wagging its tail and begging for Young Madam’s attention. I happened to see a puppy just now. It was grinning with its mouth open just like you!”","Like a dog?","Gu Zheng remained silent.","Seeing that he was silent, Song Shiyu asked curiously, “President, why aren’t you saying anything?”","Gu Zheng said, “I’m not saying anything because I think I should send you out for training.”","Song Shiyu: “...” It was over!","At this moment, Qiao Xi was about to pay when an extremely arrogant voice suddenly sounded from behind her.","“This piece of clothing is quite nice. Wrap it up for me! I’ll give it to Brother Xue Liang!”","The sales attendant was stunned for a moment. Seeing that the woman was staring fixedly at the piece of clothing in her hand, she hurriedly explained, “I’m really sorry, Miss Wen. This is the last piece. Another customer...”","Miss Wen looked impatient. “Since it hasn’t been paid for, why are you saying so much? As long as I want it, would it matter even if it has already been paid for? Do you still dare to refuse to give it to me?”","Qiao Xi glanced at Miss Wen. She did not know what the relationship between Miss Wen and Fourth Brother was, but she had never seen this woman before.","However, seeing how respectful the sales attendant was, it seemed that she was the daughter of a rich family. That was why she was so arrogant.","Miss Wen ordered the bodyguards beside her. “Snatch it over!”","A bodyguard walked toward Qiao Xi aggressively. Song Shijing hurried forward, blocked the bodyguard’s hand, and kicked him. The bodyguard screamed and took a few steps back.","“It’s first come first serve. Our Young Madam has already chosen this piece of clothing. I hope you won’t make things difficult for her.”","Miss Wen did not expect that the other party would dare to resist. She was instantly infuriated and shouted without caring about her image, “You actually attacked my people?! Do you know who I am? You’re not letting me have what I want?”","Qiao Xi thought for a moment and confirmed that no family in Li City had the surname Wen. She then thought about the capital, Luo City...","However, there were no rich families with the surname Wen there either. Song Shijing asked seriously, “Who are you?”","Miss Wen: “...”","With a ferocious expression, she gritted her teeth and shouted, “I’m the eldest daughter of the Wen family in Luo City! I’m the daughter of the Wen family! I’m a relative of the Xu family!”","Only then did Song Shijing remember that when he investigated the Xu family, there were indeed mentions of a family with the surname Wen.","“Young Madam, the Wen family is Xu Zhi’s wife’s family. This Miss Wen is probably the eldest daughter of the Wen family. She’s related to the Xu family and can be considered to be Xu Anran’s cousin.”","Qiao Xi: “...” This relationship was really a little complicated.","“Do you know my identity now?! Hurry up and give me the windbreaker! If you don’t let me, don’t blame me for being nasty!”","When Wen Xi saw that Qiao Xi had no intention of giving up the windbreaker, she was instantly infuriated. She rushed over to Qiao Xi aggressively and raised her palm fiercely. “Did you hear me talking to you?! You b*tch! Ah!!!”","Before she could finish, Wen Xi suddenly screamed.","Qiao Xi held her hand and exerted a little force before saying casually, “Miss Wen, even if you want to bully someone, you have to first see if you’re capable of doing so. Go home and train for a few more years!”","Song Shiyu, who was about to rush over to save her, was speechless.","He looked at her in admiration. “Young Madam is really too awesome. She looks so weak and delicate, but why is she so strong? I wanted to rush up to save her, but it turns out I was thinking too much!”","“Song Shiyu.”","“Huh?”","“You don’t have to worry about Mrs. Gu anymore. You have something more important to deal with.”"]},{"number":570,"title":"Chapter 570 - You And Dogs Are Not Allowed To Enter","paragraphs":["Chapter 570 You And Dogs Are Not Allowed To Enter","Song Shiyu said, “President, I promise to complete the task!”","“There’s a high-end pet shop under Gu Corporation. Since you like dogs so much, help take care of them. This job suits you.”","With that, Gu Zheng strode away.","Song Shiyu: “...”","This was revenge! He had only said a few words of truth, but the president was already unhappy.","At this moment, Qiao Xi was still grabbing Wen Xi’s wrist. Wen Xi roared in pain. “Let go of me! Let go! You b*tch! You actually dare to attack me?”","Song Shijing’s face darkened. “Young Madam, please leave. Leave this to me.”","Wen Xi looked at Qiao Xi and found her a little familiar. After looking at her for a long time, her eyes suddenly widened. “You’re... Qiao Xi?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes in surprise. This woman actually knew her?","Wen Xi suddenly shouted, “Qiao Xi! Let go! I’m a relative of the Xu family. You’re just an adopted daughter of the Xu family. If you dare to offend me, I’ll get Uncle Xu and Aunt Yunlou to chase you out of the house!”","Qiao Xi’s gaze was slightly cold.","Everyone realized that something was wrong and hurriedly lowered their heads.","Seeing that she could not win against Qiao Xi, Wen Xi pointed at those innocent sales attendants and shouted, “What are you idiots waiting for?! I’m the Xu family’s cousin. Moreover, our Wen family is also famous in Luo City. She’s just an adopted daughter of the Xu family. Are you sure she has the money to buy this windbreaker?","“Qiao Xi, you, an adopted daughter, dare to commit crimes in front of me? Anran and I are cousins, yet you dare to behave atrociously in front of me? Who the hell do you think you are?!”","When everyone heard that, they immediately started talking in low voices.","“Anran? She’s talking about Xu Anran?”","“Isn’t the eldest daughter of the Xu family Xu Anran? It seems that... Miss Wen is indeed a relative of the Xu family!”","“So, this miss is the adopted daughter of the Xu family? If she’s a child of the Xu family, she shouldn’t lack pocket money, right?!”","“She’s just an adopted daughter. Even if she has some pocket money, how can she compare to the legitimate eldest daughter? It’s not good for her to compete with the Xu family’s relatives, right...”","Wen Xi said arrogantly, “Qiao Xi! Did you hear that? You’re just an adopted daughter. Don’t think about spending money extravagantly. If Uncle Xu and Aunt Yunlou find out, they’ll definitely reprimand you!”","Qiao Xi sneered.","Adopted daughter?","It seemed that her biological parents really did not like her. Even though they had found their biological daughter, they announced to the public that she was their adopted daughter, while Xu Anran was the legitimate daughter of the Xu family.","“Miss, in that case, why don’t you give the windbreaker to Miss Wen?”","“Otherwise, you’ll be put in a tough spot when you go home. You might as well...” “You’re just an adopted daughter, and you’re spending the Xu family’s money. If you’re so arrogant with the Xu family’s relatives, it won’t be nice if news of this gets out!”","Wen Xi listened to everyone’s words and became even prouder. “Qiao Xi, give me the windbreaker. I’m a magnanimous person and won’t bicker with you. You have to understand your identity and know your place. Don’t come to a luxury shop such as this one. You don’t have the money to shop in these places anyway. It’ll be embarrassing if you continue acting like this.”","“Excuse me, this shop belongs to our president.”","As soon as Wen Xi finished speaking, a group of bodyguards suddenly rushed in. Following them was a tall and cold man.","A middle-aged man in a suit and leather shoes stood beside Gu Zheng. He had received a contract and said respectfully, “President Gu, when did you acquire this shop? Why didn’t 14”","“Just now.”","Gu Zheng glanced around, and Song Shiyu immediately announced loudly, “This shop belongs to our president, Gu Zheng!” Everyone was extremely shocked. Gu Zheng!","That god-like man, Gu Zheng!","Wen Xi looked at the handsome and noble man in front of her. She could not help but look shy. Before she could walk up to him, Song Shiyu walked over and smiled slyly. “Miss Wen.”","Wen Xi ran her fingers through her hair. “Is President Gu calling me—”.","Before she could finish, Song Shiyu interrupted her impatiently. “Miss Wen, our president has given instructions that from now on, you and dogs are not allowed to enter this shop.”","The entire shop fell silent.","Wen Xi thought that she was hallucinating. “Y-You...”","Song Shiyu turned around and waved his hand. “Miss Wen, please leave as soon as possible. Don’t make things too embarrassing for yourself.”","The bodyguards immediately walked forward and gestured for her to leave."]},{"number":571,"title":"Chapter 571 - Interrogation","paragraphs":["Chapter 571 Interrogation","Song Shiyu raised an eyebrow. “Miss Wen, you have bad hearing. I’ll repeat myself. You and dogs... are not allowed in!”","At these words, Wen Xi took a few steps back in disbelief. Her face was livid. She did not hear it clearly just now, but Song Shiyu’s words lingered in her ears this time and she could not ignore them.","Gu Zheng’s eyes darkened as they landed on the grayish-blue windbreaker. “Pack it up.”","After that, he held Qiao Xi’s hand and left. Qiao Xi looked at the man in front of her with a smile and suddenly felt a wave of warmth in her hand.","Nav","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes to look down. Gu Zheng had stuffed a piece of transparent jade into her hands. Even though she did not know anything about jade, she knew that this piece of jade was definitely not cheap. She seemed to have seen it at an auction before.","At that time, someone had bid 100 million for this jade. “Jade?”","“It’s for you.”","Gu Zheng held her hand with a gentle expression. “I’ll send this jade to be polished and set in a few days. I’ll make it into a pendant for you to wear.”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a few seconds before she said helplessly, “This jade is priceless, so it’s better to just keep it like this. Won’t it be too ostentatious to wear it around my neck every day?”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. “Ostentatious?”","Qiao Xi nodded. Could it be that it was wrong?","Gu Zheng said generously, “We have four similar jades at home. Use this as a pendant. You can keep the rest for collection or have them be made into rings and earrings. Don’t think they’re ostentatious. You’re Mrs. Gu, so no one will gossip.”","What? A few years ago, this piece of jade was auctioned for a sky-high price of 100 million yuan. Such quality could be said to be rare and would not even appear in ten years. However, Gu Zheng actually said that there were still a few pieces at home?","Qiao Xi was instantly slightly puzzled. She seemed to have underestimated Gu Zheng’s wealth. It seemed that it was even more formidable than she had imagined.","Gu Zheng’s voice was low. “Do you know the name of this jade?”","Qiao Xi nodded her head and said slowly, “This jade is shaped like a heart, and its color is clear. It’s like the heart of a pure young woman, so the person who first found this jade named it ‘The Heart of a Young Woman.’","Gu Zheng paused for a few seconds, his voice hoarse with deep affection. “Ten years ago, I saw this jade at an auction. It suited my taste, so I bought it.”","Ten years ago?","At that time, she was chased out of the Qiao family and led a wandering life in the countryside. That was how she got to know her senior.","Gu Zheng’s eyes lit up slightly. “When I bought this jade, I thought that one day, I would give it to the woman I love the most. If I couldn’t find that person, I would give it to you. Now, you’ve become the person I love most. Hence, this jade is destined to be yours.”","Qiao Xi was touched, and her eyes turned red.","It turned out that Gu Zheng had already prepared such a precious gift for her ten years ago. It was a hundred million yuan piece of jade!","She held the jade tightly in her hand and treated it as a treasure. She wrapped her other hand around Gu Zheng’s waist and leaned into his embrace obediently.","For a while, Qiao Xi did not know what to say to express her gratitude. Gu Zheng waited for her to speak for a long time. Just as he was about to ask, Qiao Xi suddenly started interrogating","“You said that I’m the person you love the most, but why did you wait until today to give this jade to me? Could it be that the person you loved the most before this wasn’t me?”","Gu Zheng: “...”","The touching atmosphere instantly vanished.","Song Shiyu was shocked. The president was doomed!","“Let’s continue shopping.”","At the Jade Pavilion in the middle of Li City.","This shop was called Jade Pavilion. As the name suggested, it sold all kinds of jade pieces for distinguished customers.","There was an antique-looking courtyard with a small bridge and flowing water. It looked like one had returned to ancient times when one stepped in. It was like a rich businessman’s house in a TV show. One could not tell that this was a jade shop at all.","At this moment, Xu Anran was entering with a group of friends. When she saw Wen Xi walking over angrily, she said gently, “Xi’er, what’s wrong?” Wen Xi’s face was filled with anger. “Cousin, it’s all because of that adopted sister of yours. She’s too arrogant!”","A trace of viciousness flashed past Xu Anran’s eyes. Then, she shifted her eyes and pretended to be surprised. “Xi Xi? She bullied","you?”","“That b*tch spent the Xu family’s money and still dares to snatch things from me. Cousin, she even ordered people not to let me enter that shop. She’s just an adopted daughter. How dare she bully me?!”"]},{"number":572,"title":"Chapter 572","paragraphs":["Chapter 572 The Real and Fake Heiress’ Birthday Party","The young woman beside her asked curiously, “Anran, I heard that your Xu family adopted a daughter as well. She’s already 20 years old, though. Why did your family think of adopting her? Could she be an illegitimate daughter?”","“Whether she’s an illegitimate daughter or not, she can’t snatch things from Wen Xi! That’s too rude!”","Xu Anran had a helpless expression and pretended to be magnanimous. “Xi’er, I didn’t expect Xi Xi to go so far. I’ll apologize on her behalf. Don’t be angry.”","“Cousin, why are you apologizing?! This has nothing to do with you!”","Xu Anran smiled lightly. “Xi’er, see if there’s any jewelry you like here. I’ll give it to you as an apology for Xi Xi.”","Then, Eldest Miss Xu waved her hand and instructed, “I’ll be booking this shop today. Don’t let anyone disturb us.”","At this moment, Gu Zheng had just brought Qiao Xi to Jade Pavilion. Unexpectedly, the manager came out in a hurry with a troubled expression. “President Gu, this shop has already been booked. I... We don’t have a choice either. President Gu, please forgive us.”","Song Shiyu was displeased. “No way! I called to make an appointment yesterday and have already paid the deposit. Now, you’re telling us someone has already booked the venue. Why did you agree to it so readily yesterday, then?","The manager was so scared that he broke out in a cold sweat. He quickly explained, “The employees in the shop didn’t know that President Gu had made an appointment. A customer happened to book the entire venue, SO... I’m really sorry. This is our mistake. President Gu, we’ll refund the money immediately. Why don’t...”","Qiao Xi did not care. It was just a shop. It did not matter if she had to come again another day, so she raised her eyes to look at Gu Zheng. “Then let’s go shopping elsewhere first. We’ll come back later.”","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes and glanced at Song Shijing. The group was about to leave when a woman’s voice came from the shop.","“My birthday is coming up soon. Thank you all for coming to Li City to attend my birthday banquet. You’re all my good friends, so I want to give you all some gifts. Feel free to pick out any of the jewelry here. I’ll pay for them.”","Qiao Xi’s expression froze.","The person in the shop was Xu Anran?","The woman’s excited voice sounded. “Anran, you’re really too kind. As expected of the eldest daughter of the Xu family, you’re so generous! However, we’re here to attend your birthday banquet. We should be the ones giving you gifts. How can we let you give us gifts instead?”","Xu Anran said generously, “After all, this birthday banquet isn’t just my own. You have to prepare two gifts. Mom is embarrassed to ask you to spend so much, so she instructed me to bring you here and let you choose the gifts you like. Take it as a gift in return for your gifts.”","Disdain flashed across everyone’s eyes. The adopted daughter was not worthy of receiving their gifts. They had just casually bought some gadgets to lessen her embarrassment.","“Anran, you’re really kind. You always think of that adopted sister of yours.”","“It’s clearly your birthday, yet you want your adopted sister to join. Anran, how can you tolerate this? Your identities are different, so how can you hold a birthday banquet together?”","Xu Anran said gently, “I don’t care about this. She’s my younger sister, so I naturally have to take care of her. I’ve been the only child in the family since I was young. Actually, I’m very lonely too. I’m very happy that Xi Xi can come to the Xu family to accompany me! Don’t talk about Xi Xi anymore. Quick, choose the jewelry you like.”","“Anran, this jade bracelet is really beautiful. Did you buy it here too?”","Xu Anran smiled. “No, it’s a birthday gift from Grandma.”","“Your grandmother? The Yin family in Shengdu? Madam Xu’s mother is the eldest daughter of the Yin family. My grandmother said that when the eldest daughter of the Yin family married the young master of the Yun family, the entire Luo City was shocked.”","“So, it’s a gift from the Yin family. No wonder it’s so expensive. Anran is too blessed to have such a loving grandmother. The Yin family is a famous family in the world!”","Qiao Xi smiled coldly. When did she agree to celebrate her birthday with Xu Anran?","Song Shiyu muttered in a low voice, “Is the Xu family crazy?! Xu Anran, a fake daughter, is putting on such a show. She even said that Young Madam is an adopted daughter? How unreasonable!”","As for the Yin family, they were rich and powerful. They should not be as horrible as the Xu family. Why did they give the fake granddaughter a birthday gift but not their biological granddaughter?"]},{"number":573,"title":"Chapter 573","paragraphs":["Chapter 573 There Is No Distinction Between High Or Low Statuses","She heard that Old Madam Yin did not have a good relationship with her daughter, Xia Yunlou, but when she found out that Xu Anran was not her biological granddaughter, Old Madam Yin immediately ordered them to find the Xu family’s biological child.","Logically speaking, Old Madam Yin should think highly of the real daughter. Why did she have to give Xu Anran such a precious thing? The two daughters were not given equal treatment. It seemed that Old Madam Yin wanted to tell everyone that the Xu family and the Yin family doted on Xu Anran, while the biological child was not valued.","Qiao Xi was unwilling to see those nauseating faces, so she pulled Gu Zheng along and was about to leave.","At this moment, Xu Anran’s surprised voice suddenly sounded behind her.","“Xi Xi? Why are you here too? Don’t go. Aren’t you here to see me?”","Everyone followed Xu Anran’s gaze and looked over. Their gazes landed on Qiao Xi. So, she was that legendary adopted daughter!","Xu Anran bit her lip. “Sister.”","Qiao Xi stopped in her tracks and sneered.","Was Xu Anran a b*tch? Did she like to be abused?","There were six to seven women standing beside Xu Anran. Wen Xi was the closest to her.","When Wen Xi saw Qiao Xi, her eyes instantly turned red as she glared fiercely at her.","“Qiao Xi, are you deaf?! Anran is the eldest daughter of the Xu family. She took the initiative to talk to you, yet you’re ignoring her? You’re not even greeting your sister when you see her. As expected of a country bumpkin. How rude!”","Xu Anran gently stopped her. “Xi’er, don’t say that. Xi Xi and I are both daughters of the Xu family. There’s no such thing as high or low statuses between us. Moreover, I’m her sister. I should let her have her way.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","How could there be such a two-faced woman?! People actually believed in her nonsense?","Wen Xi did not know their identities, but Xu Anran was well aware. There was no difference between them? It was just to show that she was magnanimous!","Xu Anran took a few steps forward with a sad expression. “Sister, why did you turn around and leave when you saw me? Dad and Mom are very worried about you. You should—”","“Sister, you have already booked the entire Jade Pavilion. If I don’t leave now, do you expect me to watch you put on a performance to demonstrate our sisterhood?”","The manager explained nervously, “Miss Xu, I’m really sorry. I didn’t know that this lady is your younger sister.”","The corners of Xu Anran’s mouth twitched. She restrained her expression and smiled. “Is that so? Then I misunderstood my sister. I thought that she didn’t want to see me!”","She walked over and pretended to accidentally bump into Qiao Xi, revealing a provocative expression. “I did book the entire venue so that outsiders can’t disturb me, but you’re my sister. Of course, you can come in.","“My birthday is coming up soon. Mom gave me a lot of pocket money. Xi Xi, pick whatever you like. I’ll buy it for you. Mom won’t say anything to you. Don’t worry.”","Qiao Xi looked at Xu Anran with an indifferent expression. If the two of them had not been swapped back then, she would have been the high and mighty eldest daughter of the Xu family. Xu Anran might not even have the chance to see her.","Xu Anran said these words in public to agitate her. A fake daughter thought she could suppress the real daughter? Did doing this make Xu Anran feel very accomplished?","She was showing off in front of the real heiress of the Xu family. She received an allowance from her mother, while the real heiress was not loved by the Xu family. She did not even receive a birthday present.","Wen Xi’s face was filled with pride, and she felt delighted when she saw Qiao Xi suffer a setback.","“Qiao Xi, you’re just an adopted daughter. Uncle Xu and Aunt Yunlou adopted you out of goodwill, but you have to remember your identity at all times. You’re different from my cousin. For example, even if my cousin wants this shop today, Aunt Yunlou will buy it for her. Meanwhile, you won’t even have a single piece of jewelry.","“Aunt Yunlou only has one daughter. She has been pampered by the family since she was young. Previously, Cousin took a liking to a set of clothes and a woman fought with her for them. The Xu family directly bought that shop and gave all the clothes to Cousin.","“Also, there was a female celebrity who mocked Cousin for her bad acting in public. Aunt Yunlou and Cousin bought over that female celebrity’s entertainment company and got her to apologize to Cousin in public.”","Wen Xi was proud of herself. “Cousin is the eldest daughter of the Xu family and is doted on by her parents. The Xia family also dotes on her. Meanwhile, you have the identity of the Xu family’s daughter as well, but you’re not favored.”"]},{"number":574,"title":"Chapter 574 - Lost The Emerald Ring","paragraphs":["Chapter 574 Lost The Emerald Ring","Xu Anran smiled sinisterly and pretended to stroke her hair, revealing the jade bracelet on her wrist.","Wen Xi’s eyes were dazzled by the emerald color. She hurriedly mocked, “Right! The Yin family even sent a set of jewelry over, but they only gave it to Cousin and not you. This is a priceless jade bracelet. Cousin’s grandmother, Old Madam Yin, dotes on Cousin very much. She was even willing to give Cousin such a precious jade!”","“It’s not just this bracelet. There’s also an emerald ring! Cousin, where’s your ring?” Wen Xi looked at Xu Anran’s finger and asked in surprise.","Xu Anran replied unhurriedly, “I tried on a few rings just now, so I took it off and placed it...”","Before she could finish, her face turned pale. “My ring! Where’s the ring?” Everyone was shocked.","Xu Anran’s emerald ring was a birthday gift from the Yin family’s old madam. Although it was just a small ring, the color and design of the ring were superb. It was worth at least ten million yuan.","This was a huge sum of money for ordinary people!","Now, this ring was missing from the shop!","The manager was anxious. If the ring was really lost, they would have to take responsibility. Being fired was a small matter. If Miss Xu demanded compensation, they would not be able to compensate even if they sold everything in their shop.","He hurriedly said respectfully, “Miss Xu, don’t worry. We have surveillance cameras in our shop. I’ll go check it first. I’ll definitely be able to find the ring.”","Xu Anran nodded indifferently. Then, her gloomy gaze fell on Qiao Xi as she said gently, “It’s fine. Maybe I was too careless. I wouldn’t have lost it.”","However, after searching for a while, they could not find the ring.","At this moment, a shop assistant walked out in a panic and said nervously, “We... We’ve checked the surveillance footage. Miss Xu seems to have placed the ring in her bag. How did she...”","Xu Anran’s friend immediately stood up and asked, “Then did anyone approach Anran after that?”","The shop assistant was stunned for a moment and said while trembling, “Miss Xu and Miss Qiao bumped into each other, but...”","Before she could finish, Wen Xi widened her eyes and sneered. “It seems that someone deliberately bumped into my cousin and stole her ring!”","One could hear a pin drop.","Qiao Xi sneered.","Xu Anran frowned. “No, Xi Xi is my sister. My parents give her pocket money. She has no reason to steal my ring!","“Moreover, if Xi Xi likes the ring, I’ll definitely give it to her. She doesn’t have to steal it in public!”","Xu Anran pretended to explain for Qiao Xi. As soon as she finished speaking, she looked shyly at the man beside Qiao Xi.","What right did she have to marry such an outstanding and handsome man?","If Qiao Xi was found to have stolen in public and her reputation was ruined, would President Gu still like her so much?","Qiao Xi, this country bumpkin, had climbed up the social ladder and entered high society. Now, she still wanted to compete with her for the position of the eldest daughter of the Xu family. What a fool’s dream!","Xu Anran was certain. “Impossible! It’s absolutely not Xi Xi!”","The manager looked troubled. The people in front of him were all rich and powerful. He could not afford to offend anyone. Moreover, they did not lack money. There was no need to steal. At the end of the day, the employees here were the most suspicious. After all, with that ring, they would have enough money for the rest of their lives.","The shop assistants immediately explained nervously, “Miss Xu, it’s not us! How could we dare steal from you?! If you suspect us, then come and search us! We’re willing to prove our innocence!”","Xu Anran and her friends immediately went to search the shop assistants’ pockets and bags, but they did not find anything.","At this moment, everyone was even more nervous. Xu Anran had lost such a valuable item. Everyone was suspicious. Although they were all rich young ladies, their families were inferior to the Xu family. Of course, they did not dare to offend Xu Anran.","At this moment, a lady said, “Anran, it must have fallen to the floor or been stolen. Everyone is suspicious, so let’s search everyone’s bodies. We might find out who stole it.”","Xu Anran smiled proudly. This was what she wanted to hear."]},{"number":575,"title":"Chapter 575 - This Set Of Jewelry Is Supposed To Be Yours!","paragraphs":["Chapter 575 This Set Of Jewelry Is Supposed To Be Yours!","There was no need for Xu Anran to say anything before someone stood up for her. No one would think that she was targeting Qiao Xi.","As soon as she finished speaking, Wen Xi took out her bag and showed it to everyone. The few women also cooperated with the search, but they still could not find the ring.","“How is that possible? We don’t have it on us, nor do the shop assistants. Where could the ring be?”","“The ring wouldn’t have disappeared for no reason. Did it fall in a corner somewhere?”","“That’s not right. We’ve all gone through a body search, but there’s still someone who hasn’t done it yet!”","The gazes of everyone fell on Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng. The atmosphere instantly became awkward.","Xu Anran was silent for a moment and pretended to be angry. “How dare you?! Is this gentleman someone you can offend?”","She said respectfully, “Let me introduce you. This gentleman is President Gu Zheng of Gu Corporation and my sister’s husband. They have high net worths, so why would they steal my ring? Don’t spout nonsense here!”","Everyone was stunned for a few seconds, then they looked at Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng in shock.","Gu Zheng? Mrs. Gu?","This was the legendary god-like man, Gu Zheng? What was even more shocking was that Qiao Xi was actually his wife?","If that was the case, then it was indeed impossible for them to steal Xu Anran’s bracelet. Gu Zheng’s wealth was enough to rival that of a country. Not to mention a ring worth ten million, even if it was 100 million or one billion, he would not take a liking to it.","Just as everyone was about to apologize, Wen Xi suddenly snorted. “So what if she’s Mrs. Gu? Everyone knows that she was a country bumpkin before she married President Gu. No one educated her when she was young, so she developed a naughty and mischievous character. She may not steal for money but just because it has become a habit. Even if she’s Mrs. Gu now, she won’t be able to change her bad habits so soon!”","Gu Zheng frowned.","“Are you tired of living?!”","Qiao Xi was not angry but whispered to Gu Zheng, “Something’s wrong! Xu Anran knows that I’m Mrs. Gu. How could I have stolen her things? Why would she frame me in public? Isn’t she afraid that the truth will be exposed?”","Gu Zheng explained softly, “This doesn’t concern money. It’s because this ring was given to her by the old madam of the Yin family, who’s also Xia Yunlou’s mother and your grandmother.”","Qiao Xi remained silent and felt an indescribable feeling. When Xia Yunlou and Xu Zhi were mentioned, she did not feel close to them at all. However, when the old madam of the Yin family was mentioned, she inexplicably felt close to her. Perhaps this was the power of blood relations.","Gu Zheng said, “When the old madam of the Yin family and Mr. Xia got married, the entire Luo City was shaken. After the two of them divorced, the Yin family became very concerned about their two daughters.","“However, Xia Yunlou has always been relatively close to the Xia family and even got along very well with her father’s mistress. It made Old Madam Yin very sad, so she liked Madam Xia Yunqiu more.","“But in the end, Xia Yunlou is still the Old Madam’s biological daughter. Of course, she still dotes on her. Although she doesn’t interact with Xia Yunlou, she still ordered people to find you as soon as possible.”","Gu Zheng smirked. “Then why do you think the old madam, the daughter of the Yin family, gave such a valuable item to Xu Anran, her adopted granddaughter, and not you, her biological granddaughter?”","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled as a trace of doubt gradually arose in her heart.","Gu Zheng’s voice was hoarse. “Because... this set of jewelry is supposed to be yours. “Old Madam Yin doted on her daughter, Xia Yunqiu, the most. You grew up with her since you were young, so how could the child she raise be bad? Moreover, you’re related to Old Madam Yin by blood. Most importantly, Old Madam Yin has never liked Xu Anran. Even if she would give her a birthday gift to save some face, she wouldn’t give Xu Anran something expensive.","“Xu Anran laid her hands on this set of jewelry and is even accusing you of stealing. How interesting!”","At the same time, Xu Anran was still shocked. “Xi Xi won’t steal anything! You’re not allowed to suspect her!”","Qiao Xi was instantly speechless.","Everyone present had gotten their bodies searched except for her and Gu Zheng. Of course, no one dared to say that Gu Zheng stole anything, so she was the only one left.","If she insisted on not letting everyone search her body, the seeds of doubt would be planted in everyone’s hearts. Xu Anran insisted on protecting her, but it was like a bucket of dirty water was poured onto her."]},{"number":576,"title":"Chapter 576 - Agree To Be Searched","paragraphs":["Chapter 576 Agree To Be Searched","Immediately after, Wen Xi mocked. “Did I say anything wrong? Everyone cooperated with the search, but she refused to cooperate. If we can’t find the ring today, we’ll know who’s the biggest suspect!”","The few women could not help but nod.","“That’s right. Although it’s impossible for Mrs. Gu to steal anything, everyone except her has been searched. If others find out about this, they’ll definitely suspect Mrs. Gu as well!”","Qiao Xi smiled coldly. Although these people said that they did not believe that she would steal anything, they still insisted on searching her body. As expected of Xu Anran’s good friends. They were all the same as her.","“Actually, you’re right...” Xu Anran frowned in embarrassment.","“Xi Xi, maybe you should agree to let us search your body? Although I believe that you didn’t steal it, doing this can prove your innocence. Otherwise, someone might suspect you. Do you think...”","Qiao Xi stared coldly at Xu Anran and guessed that she would definitely blame it on her.","Seeing that Qiao Xi was silent, Xu Anran bit her lip. “Xi Xi, if you’re unwilling, then forget it. They’re my friends anyway, so they won’t say anything.”","“I agree.”","At this moment, Gu Zheng, who had been silent all this while, glanced at his watch and suddenly spoke.","“Miss Xu, you’re right. Everyone else has gotten their bodies searched, so if Xi Xi doesn’t do it, she’ll be suspected. Since that’s the case, let’s search her body.”","Gu Zheng agreed?","Xu Anran widened her eyes. For a moment, she was unable to understand Gu Zheng’s thoughts. Was he sure that Qiao Xi would not steal anything, or was he actually not that fond of Qiao Xi?","No matter what the reason was, Gu Zheng agreed and said it was only right for Qiao Xi to be searched.","Xu Anran looked at the coldness in Gu Zheng’s eyes, and her heart could not help but tremble. However, she couldn’t care less now. The Yin family was about to arrive. She wanted Qiao Xi’s reputation to be ruined in front of everyone!","She wanted everyone to know that Qiao Xi had developed bad habits during her time outside. She was a good-for-nothing who stole. She was not worthy to be the eldest daughter of the Xu family!","No matter if it was the Yin family, the Xia family, or the Xu family, they would all treat her, Xu Anran, as their beloved daughter. They would leave all their assets to her, while Qiao Xi would not be able to get a single cent!","Xu Anran slowly walked in front of Qiao Xi and put her hand into Qiao Xi’s bag while suppressing the excitement in her heart.","The next second...","Xu Anran frowned, and her face was pale. Her body went weak as she took a few steps back. She looked at Qiao Xi in disbelief.","Qiao Xi was instantly speechless. Why was she pretending?!","When everyone saw Xu Anran’s pale face, they were immediately shocked. “Looking at Anran’s expression, could it be that the ring was really with Qiao Xi?”","“She’s already so rich, yet she still stole someone else’s ring. She’s really embarrassing President Gu!”","“Wen Xi is right. Although she married a handsome and rich man like President Gu, she still can’t change her habits. She can’t control her hands, ha!”","The mocking gazes of everyone descended onto Qiao Xi. Xu Anran recovered from her shock, and her voice trembled slightly. “Xi Xi, you... How could you...”","Xu Anran was distracted. Her legs went weak and she almost tripped as she looked at Qiao Xi in disbelief.","“You, why are you... Impossible! You couldn’t have stolen it! I remembered it wrongly. My ring isn’t missing. It must still be in my bag!”","Her weak explanation and flustered appearance proved that Qiao Xi was guilty. She was telling everyone that she had found the missing ring in Qiao Xi’s bag.","“Qiao Xi, you stole it, right?! You’re already the second miss of the Xu family, yet you still did a despicable thing like that. Are you worthy to be the daughter of the Xu family?”","Xu Anran hurriedly stopped them. “Don’t say anymore. Xi Xi is my younger sister. Pretend not to know about this. Forget it, just forget it. Previously, I asked Xi Xi to help me safeguard my ring. She didn’t steal it.”","“Mrs. Gu, what else do you have to say? You stole someone else’s ring and are even getting Anran to cover for you?”","“How did the Xu family adopt such a woman? She clearly stole something but refuses to admit it. She’s too much!”","“Miss Xu is indeed a top socialite. As the daughter of the Xu family, she didn’t bicker with her adopted sister and even said that she gave the ring to her for the sake of her reputation. Qiao Xi is really shameless!”"]},{"number":577,"title":"Chapter 577 - She Actually Came To Li City!","paragraphs":["Chapter 577 She Actually Came To Li City!","“Not only is this emerald ring expensive, but it’s also a birthday gift from Old Madam Yin to Anran. How could she have the heart to steal such a thing? It’s a gift to the eldest daughter of the Xu family. Is she worthy of possessing it?”","Everyone mocked loudly. The shop assistants also came over curiously.","Xu Anran’s lips trembled. “Xi Xi, why did you... do such a thing? Forget it, I won’t tell Mom and Dad, nor will I let everyone know.","“I can give you other things, but this is Grandma’s birthday gift to me. It means a lot to me. If you like it, I can get Grandma to give you one. However... don’t do such things anymore.","“You’re the daughter of the Xu family. Your words and actions represent the Xu family.”","Xu Anran’s eyes were filled with disappointment as she sighed helplessly. “Everyone, I’m sorry to have made you anxious. Please forget about this.”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing. On the surface, Xu Anran was trying to clear her name, but it had unknowingly confirmed her crime. She even told everyone not to spread the news. In reality, it was a display of her fake generosity. “Miss Xu, you’re so kind.”","“Old Madam Yin is a decisive person. If she finds out that her birthday gift to her granddaughter was stolen, she’ll definitely investigate it thoroughly.”","“Tsk tsk, that’s the Yin family! They’re a wealthy family, after all.”","Xu Anran lowered her eyes and smiled proudly.","So what if Qiao Xi married Gu Zheng? Her reputation would be ruined anyway. Perhaps after today, Gu Zheng would hate her and abandon her.","How could the Xu family tolerate a woman who lost Gu Zheng and had a ruined reputation?","Xu Anran comforted her gently. “Xi Xi, don’t worry. I’ve already told them not to spread the news. When I see Grandma, I’ll get her to give you a similar gift, alright?”","Gu Zheng’s phone vibrated.","The man smirked. It seemed that she had arrived.","At this moment, Wen Xi and Xu Anran were echoing each other’s words. One was criticizing loudly, while the other was pretending to be tolerant.","“Cousin, why are you so polite to her?! She clearly knows that this is Old Madam Yin’s birthday gift to you, yet she still stole it in public. She’s just jealous of you and wanted to see you frantic after you lost the ring!","“Qiao Xi, you’re just an adopted daughter. You have to know your identity. What right do you have to snatch things from the eldest daughter of the Xu family? It’s already your honor that you’re allowed to stay in the Xu family. Don’t be ungrateful!”","Xu Anran said gently, “Xi’er, don’t fool around. Xi Xi grew up in the countryside. There are many things that no one taught her. It’s expected that she doesn’t know the rules. She’ll understand in the future.","“Xi Xi, you have to be polite when you see Grandma. She’s a very good person and is very friendly to the younger generation. If you want to meet her, I can bring you over. As long as you ask for a gift, she definitely won’t refuse.”","The corners of Xu Anran’s mouth curled up proudly. At this moment, Qiao Xi should be very aggrieved. She clearly did not steal anything, yet she still had to be criticized by everyone. Qiao Xi wanted to meet her grandmother, yet she had to be introduced by Xu Anran. Qiao Xi was such a failure as a ‘true daughter’!","“Eldest Miss Xu!”","Suddenly, a cold and dignified female voice came from the door.","At some point in time, Song Shiyu had run to the door and pushed it open. More than ten bodyguards rushed in and stood in two rows in an orderly manner. They opened up a wide path.","An elegant old madam in gorgeous clothes walked in with a cane in her hand. The pressure she exuded made everyone present tremble.","The old madam’s sharp gaze landed on Xu Anran as she slammed her walking cane on the floor.","Xu Anran’s body trembled as her face turned pale.","She... She was actually in Li City?","They originally thought that Old Madam Yin didn’t actually mean it when she said that she was coming. They never expected that she would really come. Her relationship with the Xu family was clearly not good, so why did she still come? Could it be... Could it be because of Qiao Xi?","“Xu Anran, you don’t even dare to say anything when you see me?”","The entire venue was silent. Xu Anran’s body was stiff, and she felt that her heart was about to stop.","Everyone asked in confusion, “Who is it? Why is Anran so afraid?”","Wen Xi looked at the old madam in front of her and found her a little familiar, but she could not remember where she had seen her before."]},{"number":578,"title":"Chapter 578 - This Did Not Even Happen In TV Shows","paragraphs":["Chapter 578 This Did Not Even Happen In TV Shows","Old Madam Yin frowned and walked past Xu Anran to stand in front of Qiao Xi.","She held Qiao Xi’s hand excitedly while the two young masters behind her revealed delighted expressions.","Qiao Xi looked at the three of them in surprise. It was very obvious that they seemed to be very passionate about her, but she was sure that she had never seen them before. She just faintly felt a little close to them.","The eyes of Old Madam Yin, who had always been calm and composed, turned red. She was over 50 years old but was as happy as a child at this moment. Her exquisite face was filled with love.","Qiao Xi roughly knew who this old madam was. Before she could speak, Old Madam Yin’s tears trickled down as she said excitedly, “Xi Xi, I’m your grandmother! Your grandmother!”","Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes.","Old Madam Yin cried. “Xi Xi, I’ve finally found you. I’ve let you down. You’ve suffered so much. Yunqiu... How is she?”","Qiao Xi replied truthfully, “Mom... passed away.”","Old Madam Yin’s eyes were filled with sorrow. “No wonder. No wonder there was no news of her at all. I never understood why she didn’t come back home. It turns out that she...”","“I’ve already caught the person who harmed her,” said Qiao Xi.","Old Madam Yin shed a few tears of sorrow and slowly looked up with a loving expression. “It’s good... It’s good that you’re still here. Although Yunqiu has left, you’re still my precious granddaughter. Although you’re Yunlou’s child, you were raised by Yunqiu. You’re basically Yunqiu’s child.","“From now on, you’re the eldest daughter of the Yin family!”","The two young men chuckled as they walked forward and looked at Qiao Xi gently. “Sister, we finally found you. There’s finally a girl in the Yin family.”","“Big Brother will certainly be very happy to know about this!”","“Yes, Dad and Mom will be very happy too. They’ve always liked girls, but our Yin family is filled with men. Although you’re not our parents’ child, you’re Aunt’s child. Aunt was also part of our Yin family.”","“From today onward, you’re the eldest daughter of the Yin family and our younger sister. You’re the only girl in our family. We’ll definitely be good to you!”","“Xi Xi, I’m your fifth brother. You have a total of seven brothers in the Yin family. Are you happy about that?”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘Happy? I’m afraid!’","She already had a bunch of brothers, and she still had a senior like Gu Zheng. Now, she had seven more brothers. This did not even happen in TV shows!","Qiao Xi instantly did not know what to say.","Everyone was stunned. One of the women looked at the handsome young men and felt that they looked a little familiar. They seemed to be the young masters of the Yin family.","Wait! What did the Yin family have to do with Qiao Xi?","Someone asked in confusion, “Who are they? Why are they so ostentatious?”","“Looks like they’re Qiao Xi’s relatives?” “Isn’t Qiao Xi from Li City’s Qiao family? Now that she’s adopted by the Xu family, she can be considered half a member of the Xu family. If these three are relatives of the Xu family, they shouldn’t be greeting Qiao Xi directly after ignoring Eldest Miss Xu!’","“So these people are the Qiao family’s relatives?”","“The Qiao family’s relatives dare to ignore the eldest daughter of the Xu family? They’re too arrogant!”","Xu Anran trembled nervously. “No, no...”","“Heh! Xu Anran, it looks like your friends are very curious about who I am. Tell them.”","At this moment, Old Madam Yin wiped her tears and suddenly looked up at everyone. Her sharp gaze finally landed on Xu Anran, and her eyes were filled with faint mockery.","Wen Xi snorted. “What are you being arrogant for?! Cousin, tell us who she is! How dare she talk to you like that? Does she think she’s the old madam of the Yin family?”","“Don’t think that we’re afraid of you just because you’re old. Anran is the eldest daughter of the Xu family and the daughter of the Yin family behind them. Who do you think","you are—”","“Shut up!”","When Xu Anran heard everyone’s words, she immediately roared in horror and interrupted their discussion. Then, the corners of her mouth twitched slightly as her lips trembled. “She... She’s...”","Everyone looked at her in confusion.","At this moment, Xu Anran wished for nothing more than to find a hole to bury herself in. She gritted her teeth and said guiltily, “She’s my grandmother.”","Xu Anran’s grandmother?","Everyone was stunned. Old Madam Yin?","Wen Xi’s body went weak as she took a few steps back in horror."]},{"number":579,"title":"Chapter 579 - Things Have Blown Up","paragraphs":["Chapter 579 Things Have Blown Up","When she heard Xu Anran’s answer, Old Madam Yin sneered. “Eldest Miss Xu? Don’t spout nonsense. I’m not your grandmother. Xi Xi, since the Xu family can’t tolerate you, come back to the Yin family with me. Let’s see who still dares to bully you!”","Qiao Xi smiled and nodded.","“What’s going on?”.","The few of them looked at each other and asked in confusion, “The Yin family is actually so good to Qiao Xi, the adopted daughter. Earlier, Xu Anran even said that if Qiao Xi wanted to meet Old Madam Yin, she had to introduce Qiao Xi first. Clearly, what she meant to say is that Qiao Xi doesn’t have the qualifications to see Old Madam Yin herself!”","Old Madam Yin looked at Xu Anran sharply.","Xu Anran’s body trembled as she explained while trembling, “Grandma, I... I didn’t say that. It’s... Everyone misunderstood.”","Wen Xi could not stand Qiao Xi’s arrogant appearance. Since she was an adopted daughter, she should behave herself. How could she surpass the Xu family’s biological daughter?","She said unhappily, “Old Madam Yin, you can’t blame Cousin. She’s just a little angry. You just came and don’t know what’s going on. Qiao Xi stole Anran’s ring just now.","“It’s because of this that Cousin Anran said some angry words. She didn’t deliberately target Qiao Xi, nor did she look down on her identity. Instead, she regarded Qiao Xi as her younger sister and tried to protect her! On the other hand, Qiao Xi stole something but refused to admit her mistake. Is such a person worthy of being the Xu family’s daughter?”","The crowd could hear a pin drop. Everyone hurriedly reacted. The matter of Qiao Xi stealing something hadn’t been resolved yet!","Even if Old Madam Yin admitted that Qiao Xi was the daughter of the Xu family, it was a fact that she stole Xu Anran’s ring. Even if Xu Anran said something overboard, she couldn’t be blamed. Moreover, she did not blame Qiao Xi at all.","Wen Xi pointed at Qiao Xi and roared angrily, “She stole the emerald ring you gave Anran! Even after she was caught red-handed, she didn’t show the slightest regret! Now you know Qiao Xi’s true colors, right?! She even dares to steal the birthday gift you gave Anran! She’s really too much!”","After a few seconds of silence, Old Madam Yin suddenly smiled.","Read the next chapter on our vjpn0vel. c0m","“I gave her an emerald ring?”","Wen Xi was suddenly slightly perturbed when she saw this. “Yes. It’s a set of jade jewelry, and an extremely good emerald ring is part of the set. It’s very expensive. Qiao Xi probably knows that the ring is expensive, so she stole","it.”","Old Madam Yin’s gaze gradually turned cold.","The two young masters behind her also frowned. One of them looked at Xu Anran angrily.","Everyone looked confused. Xu Anran’s body trembled as she lowered her head guiltily.","She hurriedly explained, “Grandma, I didn’t make things difficult for Xi Xi, nor did I blame her for stealing. Besides, I’m afraid that if news of this gets out, it won’t be good for Xi Xi. I’ve already told everyone not to tell anyone. If you don’t believe me, ask them.","“Xi Xi bumped into me and the ring disappeared. I found the ring in her bag. I didn’t malign her. I just told her not to do such things in the future—”","“If you think Xi Xi did it, then call the police.” Gu Zheng glanced at her coldly, then looked at Old Madam Yin. “What do you think?”","Old Madam Yin instantly understood. If she proved that this ring was for Xi Xi, then Xu Anran...","Before she came, she already knew that Xi Xi was married to Gu Zheng. This man was in charge of the entire Gu family despite his young age. His influence was growing, and his businesses were spread throughout the world. Now, it was obvious that he doted on Xi Xi very much.","Old Madam Yin looked at the young man in front of her and nodded in satisfaction.","Now that the matter had already blown up, if news of it were to spread, it would ruin Xi Xi’s reputation. Since it was already like this, why not make the mess bigger so that Xi Xi would not suffer?","“Alright, call the police,” said Old Madam Yin.","Xu Anran turned pale with fright as her body trembled violently.","No! She could not call the police!","She pretended to be calm and said, “Let’s forget it. If we call the police, how will Xi Xi keep her reputation? Grandma, I won’t pursue the matter anymore, so don’t-“.","Before she could finish speaking, Old Madam Yin waved her hand impatiently. Her subordinates immediately called the police.","When the other party heard that it was a matter between Miss Xu and Mrs. Gu and that it involved an emerald ring worth more than ten million yuan, they did not dare to delay and arrived at Jade Pavilion in just a short while."]},{"number":580,"title":"Chapter 580 - Self-Directed Play","paragraphs":["Chapter 580 Self-Directed Play","Xu Anran was so nervous that she could not say anything. However, she had already sent a message to her mother. Her mother told her not to worry and that everything was settled. She then heaved a sigh of relief.","However, Xu Anran still did not want the police to come because this matter would blow up to greater proportions. Even if Qiao Xi really stole something, it would implicate her and make her lose face.","After a while, a police officer walked in front of everyone.","Xu Anran thought about it and realized that this person must be someone her mother had arranged. He would definitely help her.","The police officer said awkwardly, “Old Madam Yin, your granddaughter...”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent.","When Xu Anran saw this scene, she knew that the other party was definitely going to accuse Qiao Xi of stealing, so she immediately bit her lip and pretended to be aggrieved. She said, “Grandma, this is our family’s matter. It’s better if we don’t make it public. If Xi Xi’s reputation is ruined, how am I going to explain it to Dad and Mom?! It’s just a misunderstanding, so...” Old Madam Yin knew very well that Xi Xi was Yunqiu’s child and would definitely not steal anything. This police officer was stammering, so he must have been bribed by Xia Yunlou.","This Xia Yunlou was really muddle-headed. She always helped her adopted daughter bully her biological daughter. Was there a mother like her?","Before Old Madam Yin could say anything, the police officer said in embarrassment, “Old Madam Yin, your granddaughter, she... she didn’t steal anything!”","Everyone was in disbelief.","The police officer said, “I’m telling the truth. She didn’t steal anything.”","Qiao Xi: “...” Then why are you stammering? It’s as though I stole something.’","Xu Anran was stunned for a few seconds as her expression gradually stiffened. Her mind instantly went blank. Didn’t her mother say that she had already arranged everything? Why was this police officer not helping her?","Read the next chapter on our vjpn0vel. c0m","Wen Xi thought that the matter had already been arranged beforehand. Hearing the police officer’s words, she instantly snorted. “You said that she didn’t steal it, but why are you so hesitant?”","The police officer looked innocent. “I’m not making things difficult for anyone! I just thought that it was pitiful that Old Madam Yin’s granddaughter was accused despite not stealing anything. That’s why I sighed and stammered a little.”","Wen Xi instantly choked.","“Miss Wen, did you think I’d say that Mrs. Gu stole something? Why would you think so?!” The police officer was a little puzzled.","Wen Xi revealed an awkward expression. “That’s not what I meant! It’s because we found the ring in Qiao Xi’s bag. We have evidence!”","The policeman nodded thoughtfully. “Miss Wen, you have a point. We’ve checked the surveillance footage on the opposite side of the shop and slowed it down. We learned that Miss Qiao didn’t steal the ring at all. Instead, Miss Xu tossed the ring into Miss Qiao’s bag.","“Miss Lu, may I ask if you accidentally dropped the ring or if you did it on purpose? This is a case involving ten million yuan, after all. I hope you can answer truthfully.”","Xu Anran’s body trembled.","Everyone gasped. Xu Anran was the one who tossed the ring in? If that was the case, wasn’t she framing Qiao Xi?!","“No way! It turns out Xu Anran framed Qiao Xi, then pushed all the blame on her. I thought she was pure and kind, but I didn’t expect her to be so sinister!”","“This is such a big mess. So, she was framing her this whole time! If she had succeeded, Mrs. Gu’s reputation would’ve been ruined!”","“It’s a good thing that President Gu is here. No one dares to lie in front of him. That’s why Mrs. Gu can prove her innocence! A certain someone has been pretending to be magnanimous as though she’s protecting Mrs. Gu. It turns out that she was just pretending!”","“Disgusting!”","Hearing everyone’s mockery, Xu Anran’s face turned pale. She lowered her head and did not dare to look at the strange gazes around her.","What was going on? Didn’t her mother say that everything had been sorted out?","Xu Anran explained nervously, “Grandma, I... I didn’t. Xi Xi is my younger sister. How could I wrong her? The ring must’ve accidentally fallen into her bag. This is just a misunderstanding.”","Wen Xi also said, “Old Madam Yin, you can’t believe this police officer’s words. Maybe he was bribed by Qiao Xi and is speaking up for her. I think this whole incident is Qiao Xi’s self-directed play. She’s slandering Sister Anran!”","Old Madam Yin slowly raised her eyes. “Xu Anran, then explain to me why Xi Xi would malign you.”","Xu Anran immediately choked."]},{"number":581,"title":"Chapter 581 - Who Is The Real Thief?","paragraphs":["Chapter 581 Who Is The Real Thief?","Xu Anran was in a daze as she lowered her eyes. If she did not push the blame on Qiao Xi, then she would be the unlucky one. She would implicate the entire Xu family and make her parents sad.","She bit her lip and said aggrievedly, “You only gave me a birthday gift but not Xi Xi. She got jealous of me, so—”","“I gave you a birthday gift?”","Old Madam Yin retorted with eyes filled with mockery, “Are you so sure that the birthday gift is for you?”","Xu Anran widened her eyes.","“When I sent someone over, I said that this set of jewelry is for Eldest Miss Xu!”","Old Madam Yin’s voice suddenly became sharp. “Xu Anran, don’t you know who the eldest daughter of the Xu family is? Who gave you the confidence to think that you’re the eldest daughter of the Xu family?!”","Xu Anran’s body trembled!","The entire venue was in an uproar.","What did Old Madam Yin mean? Xu Anran was not the eldest daughter of the Xu family. Could it be Qiao Xi?","Under everyone’s puzzled gazes, Old Madam Yin slowly walked in front of Xu Anran and sneered.","“I’ve lived for so many years. Don’t use your little tricks on me. Don’t think that I won’t do anything to you just because Xia Yunlou and Xu Zhi are protecting you?!”","“Grandma!” Xu Anran shouted in horror, her eyes filled with pleading. Then, she lowered her voice. “Please save me some dignity in front of so many people.”","Read the next chapter on our vjpn0vel. c0m","“Dignity? If you really cared about your dignity, you wouldn’t have framed Xi Xi. Why didn’t you think about whether Xi Xi would still have any dignity left if you managed to successfully frame her for stealing something?!”","Xu Anran said softly, “Grandma, we shouldn’t air our dirty laundry in public. It’s better not to let outsiders know about this. You can ignore me, but what about the Xu family? What about the Yin family?”","Old Madam Yin never thought that Xu Anran was incompetent just because she was swapped at birth. What she disliked most about Xu Anran was that she pretended to be something she was not even when she knew the truth. In Old Madam Yin’s eyes, that was the greatest manifestation of her incompetence.","“Xu Anran, you know very well who the birthday gift is for. Xi Xi won’t be jealous of you at all because with your identity, you’re not worthy!”","Xu Anran’s face was ferocious, and her sharp nails pierced through her palms.","Old Madam Yin stared at Xu Anran with a sharp gaze and said word by word, “I did send someone to deliver this set of jewelry to the Xu family, but I said it was for Xi Xi. You used the jewelry to frame Xi Xi for stealing and even said that she’s jealous of you. Xu Anran, why don’t you tell me who the real thief is?”","These words were like a thunderclap that exploded in everyone’s hearts. At the same time, it completely destroyed Xu Anran’s pure and kind image.","Everyone was extremely shocked as they digested Old Madam Yin’s words in a daze.","The Yin family was a noble family with a strict upbringing. Moreover, Old Madam Yin had no reason to lie. This set of jewelry was for whoever she said it was for.","On the other hand, Xu Anran was wearing someone else’s jewelry to show off. She even used the jewelry to wrongly accuse the owner?","Old Madam Yin sneered. “Xu Anran, you should know that our two families have not been in contact for so many years. I’ve never given you a birthday gift. The jewelry set I sent over this time is for Xi Xi. You clearly knew that, yet you still took the jewelry for yourself. You didn’t tell Xi Xi about this at all.","“If you knew your place, I wouldn’t make things difficult for you. However, you’re bullying Xi Xi with your fake identity. Although I’ve been in Shengdu, I know about everything you’ve done.”","Xu Anran’s body stiffened as she trembled uncontrollably.","Suddenly, someone asked in confusion, “Old Madam Yin said that this set of jewelry is for Eldest Miss Xu, and she also said that it’s for Qiao Xi. Does this mean that Eldest Miss Xu is Qiao Xi? But shouldn’t Eldest Miss Xu be Xu Anran?”","“Now that you mention it, I think it’s strange as well. Why did the Xu family suddenly adopt a 20-year-old daughter? Logically speaking, even if they wanted to adopt a child, they would’ve adopted a kid. Qiao Xi already has a family of her own, so why did the Xu family adopt her? Moreover, Old Madam Yin and the two young masters of the Yin family seem to be even closer to Qiao Xi than the legitimate daughter, Xu Anran. Why is that?”","“Could it be that... Qiao Xi is the biological daughter of the Xu couple?”","Hearing the last guess, Xu Anran’s face turned pale as if she would faint in the next second.","No! No!","She was the real daughter of the Xu family! Qiao Xi was just an adopted daughter!"]},{"number":582,"title":"Chapter 582 - Sister, Welcome Back","paragraphs":["Chapter 582 Sister, Welcome Back","Although Old Madam Yin did not explicitly state their identities, it was not difficult to guess. Even if the women present could not guess it, the elders in their families would be able to.","Xu Anran felt her entire body turn cold. She felt everyone’s questioning gazes on her and heard their mocking voices. Her body trembled violently before she fainted and fell to the floor.","Old Madam Yin frowned. “Carry her back.”","Then, she looked at Qiao Xi affectionately. “Xi Xi, can you come back to the Yin family with me? Have President Gu... come with you!”","Old Madam Yin felt a sense of familiarity when she looked at Qiao Xi, but when she looked at Gu Zheng, she still felt slightly distant. This was because this man was too cold. His entire body emitted a cold aura that made it difficult for others to approach him.","“President Gu, if you have time, why don’t you be a guest at the Yin family’s residence? I’ve already asked Xu Zhi and Xia Yunlou to go to the Yin family. I’ll get them to apologize to Xi Xi in public.”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. “Alright.”","He agreed, so Qiao Xi would naturally not refuse.","The Yin family’s bodyguards entered and carried Xu Anran into a car. Old Madam Yin and the two young masters sat in one car while Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng sat in the other. This gave the couple some privacy.","“The legendary Old Madam Yin is actually quite kind!” Song Shiyu was sitting in the front passenger seat with a smile.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were gentle as he stretched out his hand to touch Qiao Xi’s cheek and said softly, “Old Madam Yin isn’t close to Xia Yunlou. Don’t worry.”","Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes. “You were the one who contacted the Yin family, right?”","Gu Zheng’s gaze was indifferent. “I guess you can say that.”","Read the next chapter on our vjpn0vel. c0m","Qiao Xi was puzzled.","“I did inform the Yin family, but they were already planning to come before that. Shen Yu must have told them about you being in Li City.","“Your brother does dote on you a lot. He sent someone to monitor Xu Anran and then passed the news to the Yin family. That’s why Old Madam Yin and the two young masters came to Li City so quickly.”","ca","Qiao Xi smiled. Her eldest brother did indeed dote on her very much. Moreover, he was the most composed of her few brothers. He had always been very reliable, both in his words and actions.","After an unknown period of time, the sky turned dark. The car slowly stopped.","The Yin family’s residence was like a castle. When the car entered, they realized that there were a few villas, gardens, and various entertainment facilities. It was a hundred times more majestic than the Gu family’s old residence.","The butler hurriedly came forward to open the door for Qiao Xi and respectfully invited them into the house. The few young masters of the Yin family also came out to welcome them. “Sister, welcome back.”","“I’m Yin Jinglin, your cousin. I’m ranked fifth in the Yin family. You can call me Fifth Brother. There are a total of seven boys in the Yin family. Eldest Brother and Third Brother are biological brothers and direct descendants of the Yin family.","“A few are the grandchildren of your grandmother’s other brothers, but they’re all your brothers too. Although we’re not that close, they’ll still be very good to you.","“The current head of the Yin family is my father, your uncle. The other uncles also have shares. After all, the Yin family doesn’t have many people, so we all get along very well. We weren’t even in Li City at first, but we heard that our younger sister was found. Hence, my brothers and my parents all rushed over from Shengdu.","“Our Yin family has many boys but no girls. There isn’t a single girl in our generation. The elders are all looking forward to having a girl. Our family can laugh a little now, so everyone values you very much.","“Sister, you’ve been suffering outside for so many years. The Yin family doesn’t care what the Xu family thinks of you. We’ll make up for all the pain and grievances you’ve suffered for the past 20 years. We definitely won’t let you be bullied again.","“If the Xu family can’t tolerate you, then you can still hold onto your title as the eldest daughter of the Yin family. In any case, you’re the only eldest daughter in the Yin family. No one will snatch your identity anymore!","Qiao Xi was so touched that she was about to cry.","Although she had only met Fifth Brother for the first time, she could feel his love for her. All her brothers sincerely welcomed her back, unlike the Xu family who had ulterior motives.","Then, Yin Jinglin brought Qiao Xi to the second floor.","“Sister, this is the room we prepared for you. Do you like it? If you don’t, you can change","it.”"]},{"number":583,"title":"Chapter 583 - Give Her The Best","paragraphs":["She pushed open the door to the room and was greeted with the sight of a spacious balcony. She entered the inner room and saw a luxurious master bedroom. There were also two walk-in closets, a huge bathroom, and a makeup room.","The luxurious bathtub in the shower could even accommodate six to seven people at once, like a small swimming pool.","There was a glass door on the inner side of the master bedroom. When the door was pushed open, it was a large open-air balcony. There were fragrant flowers and plants there, as well as exquisite dining tables and chairs. Whatever facilities one could imagine were here.","“I spent a long time thinking about how to decorate the balcony. There’s still a lot of space on the balcony. You can do whatever you like with it. I also mentioned that girls might like keeping pets. I prepared a pet area for you. If you think it’s not suitable, you can move it somewhere else. Just get the servants to do it.”","Yin Jinglin looked at Qiao Xi nervously. “After all, there are no girls in the house and we don’t know what you like. This bedroom was decorated by my mother after she consulted many noble young ladies. After some consideration, I decided to decorate it myself. If you think it’s inappropriate, I’ll get someone to redo it.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Gu Zheng. No wonder the usually cold and arrogant President Gu would take the initiative to look for the Yin family. It turned out that he had long known that the Yin family and the Xu family were different. The Yin family was really good to her.","As the biological daughter of the Xu couple, she was arranged to stay in the basement when she returned to the Xu family, but the Yin family could not wait to give her the best. “Sister, it’s fine if you don’t want to stay here. This room will be left for you. You’re welcome to stay here anytime, okay?” Yin Jinglin asked gently. Qiao Xi smiled like a flower. “Thank you, Fifth Brother.”","Perhaps he was shocked by Qiao Xi’s sudden smile, Yin Jinglin scratched his head in embarrassment. “It’s good that you like it. You don’t have to thank me. There’s no need to thank your family members! It’s just a room.”","Qiao Xi was slightly at a loss for what to do. After all, it was the first time she was meeting someone from the Yin family, so it was normal for her to feel slightly uncomfortable.","Fortunately, Yin Jinglin was very cheerful and chatted with her. “Sister, you should know that the Yin family is called the ‘Yin family of Shengdu’, right?”","Qiao Xi nodded. There were probably many people who knew about this.","Yin Jinglin said, “The Yin family is a noble family in Shengdu, but in the beginning, the Yin family’s surname was not Yin but Qi. This surname is rare. I heard that the ancestor of the Qi family was saved by a benefactor with the surname Yin. In order to thank him for saving his life, he changed his surname to","Yin.","irna","“Although everyone in the family is surnamed Yin, you still have to know about this matter. You’re also a member of the Yin family now, so of course, you have to know.”","Qiao Xi nodded obediently, then heard Yin Jinglin say, “Actually, if our surname was Qi, I’d be Qi Five. You’re the youngest child in the family, so you’d be Qi Eight. It’s quite amusing, hahaha...”","Qiao Xi: “??”","Qi Eight? This nickname sounded horrible!","...","When Yin Jinglin went downstairs, Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng stayed upstairs to rest.","Qiao Xi lay on the bed. Yin Jinglin’s words ‘Qi Eight’ kept echoing in her mind. She could not help but laugh.","After a while, there was a commotion downstairs and a woman’s scream. “Anran!”","Qiao Xi walked to the window and indeed saw the Xu couple’s car. The corners of her mouth could not help but curl up. Xu Zhi and Xia Yunlou came quite quickly!","Two hours ago.","Xu Zhi and Xia Yunlou received a call from Old Madam Yin. She said that Xu Anran was in the Yin family and that if they wanted their daughter, they should immediately come to the Yin family’s residence.","The couple hurriedly drove to the Yin family’s residence.","The moment the two of them entered, they saw their precious daughter kneeling on the tiles at the door in a thin long dress. Her weak body was swaying slightly, making her look pitiful.","Xia Yunlou’s heart ached. She hurriedly went forward to support her and shouted, “Anran!”","She raised her eyes and looked at Old Madam Yin angrily. “Mom! Why are you doing this?! Anran is so obedient and sensible. How could you bear to make her kneel as punishment?!”","Old Madam Yin took a sip of tea unhurriedly and slowly walked to the two of them with the help of the third young master of the Yin family, Yin Jingting. She said slowly, “You’re so worried about an adopted daughter?”"]},{"number":584,"title":"Chapter 584 - If The Xu Family Doesn’t Dote On Their Daughter, The Yin Family Will Dote On Her!","paragraphs":["Xia Yunlou cried, “Anran is the daughter I raised since she was young. I treat her as my biological daughter and dote on her! Anran! Anran, are you okay? Mom! What do you want? Look at how pale Anran’s face is. You’re too heartless...”","“Xu Anran is punished to kneel because she made a mistake. You’re all very nervous, huh? When that bastard, Xu Anyi, sent someone to crash into Xi Xi’s car, why didn’t you all show any concern?”","Bang!","Old Madam Yin slammed her walking cane on the floor with a cold expression. “Xia Yunlou, let me ask you this today. Do you want your biological daughter or this scheming adopted daughter?”","The Xu family’s trio’s expressions changed drastically.","Xu Anran’s weak body instantly softened as she fell into Xia Yunlou’s arms and silently cried.","Xia Yunlou frowned. “Mom! What are you doing?! I want both daughters...”","“I didn’t say that you’re not allowed to have two daughters, but Xi Xi is your biological daughter. You have to treat her well. Even if you dote on Xu Anran, you can just treat both of them equally and I won’t say anything. But you actually let Xu Anran bully Xi Xi! You gave my birthday gift that’s meant for my biological granddaughter to your adopted daughter. You’re really muddle-headed!","“If you don’t like Xi Xi, I won’t force you. I’ll adopt Xi Xi under Yunqiu’s name. In the future, she’ll be the noble eldest daughter of my Yin family!”","Xia Yunlou suddenly widened her eyes and shouted unwillingly, “No! She’s my biological daughter! Why should she be adopted under my sister’s name?”","“So, you still know that Xi Xi is your biological daughter?” Madam Yin sneered, her eyes filled with indifference.","“Looks like you know it very well, but you still let your adopted daughter bully your biological daughter. You let your adopted daughter wear the jewelry I gave my biological granddaughter and indulged her when she schemed to frame Xi Xi. She framed Xi Xi for stealing and almost caused Xi Xi’s reputation to be ruined!","“Xia Yunlou, I don’t need your permission to do things. I’m just informing you.”","Old Madam Yin glanced at her coldly and said confidently, “If you don’t dote on your daughter, then our Yin family will! From today onward, this child will be Yunqiu’s daughter. I don’t care who the eldest daughter of the Xu family is, but I can make Xi Xi the only eldest daughter of our Yin family. Your Xu family and the Yin family will have nothing to do with each other anymore!”","Everyone fell silent.","Old Madam Yin’s meaning was very obvious. Xi Xi had nothing to do with the Xu family anymore, and the Yin family would cut ties with the Xu family. Qiao Xi would be considered Xia Yunqiu’s daughter and Old Madam Yin’s only granddaughter.","All these years, the Xu family was able to gain a foothold in Luo City only because of the Xia and Yin families. Now that the Yin family wanted to cut ties, there was only the Xia family left.","Cold sweat broke out on Xu Zhi’s forehead as he said in a trembling voice, “Mom! Don’t be angry. Of course, we treat Xi Xi as our daughter. She’s the eldest daughter of our Xu family! We were already preparing to announce her identity at the birthday banquet!”","“No!” Xia Yunlou shouted agitatedly as she looked at Old Madam Yin pleadingly.","She hugged the weak Xu Anran and shouted, “No! If we announce that Qiao Xi is our biological daughter, what will happen to Anran? She has been by our side for 20 years. If others find out that she’s our adopted daughter, what will they think of her?!”","Old Madam Yin’s eyes darkened.","This heartless Xia Yunlou really doted on Xu Anran.","“Xu Anran, what do you think?”","Old Madam Yin’s sudden question made Xu Anran’s body tremble.","“You knew long ago that you’re not the biological daughter of the Xu family, so what do you choose? Do you want to continue staying in the Xu family or return to your biological parents?”","Xu Anran lowered her head with vicious eyes.","This damned old woman! Why was she forcing her?","“I—”","“Mom! What are you talking about? Anran has been living with us for 20 years. How can she bear to leave us?” Xia Yunlou’s tears fell like rain.","“Why must you force me to give up on my daughter? I can’t bear to part with either one of them. Although Anran and I are not related by blood, she has been by my side for so many years. How can I bear to send her away?”"]},{"number":585,"title":"Chapter 585 - What A Good Person","paragraphs":["Xia Yunlou continued, “Although the Xu family isn’t a top-notch noble family, it’s definitely not a problem for us to raise two daughters. What’s wrong with letting Xi Xi be the second daughter? How can I not treat my biological daughter well? She used to live in the slums. Now that she’s living in the Xu family’s villa, it’s already a hundred times better for her. Why does she have to chase Anran away the moment she comes back?","“Moreover, Anran is the leader of the top socialites in Luo City. If others find out that she’s not our biological daughter, where will the Xu family put our dignity? How will Anran raise her head in the future?!","“Since the children were swapped at birth, why don’t we just let it be? Other than not having the identity as the eldest daughter of the Xu family, Xi Xi will have everything Anran has. I definitely won’t treat her badly. Why must she compete with Anran for an identity? Can’t she be more tolerant?","“Anran is a top socialite. She plays the zither, chess, knows calligraphy, is cultured, good-mannered, and can dance. How is she lacking?","“But Xi Xi has lived in the countryside since she was young. She has never attended banquets at all, nor does she know how to pick gowns. She doesn’t even know what those high-end brands are. Having her as the eldest daughter of the Xu family will only embarrass us!”","In front of everyone, Xia Yunlou said everything in her heart.","The entire place was silent.","Old Madam Yin looked at her coldly and applauded amidst the silence.","“How good you are with your words! You’re saying that although Xi Xi is your biological daughter, it’s already her honor to be able to return to the Xu family now. Xu Anran has been living like a princess since she was young, so we can’t let her suffer even a little,","right?”","Old Madam Yin waved her hand. “Jingting, immediately announce that from today onward, the Yin family and the Xu family are no longer in contact. Moreover, Xi Xi is the eldest daughter of the Yin family!”","Xia Yunlou gritted her teeth. Even if one of her daughters were to return to the Yin family, it should be Anran. After all, Anran was the child they watched grow up, while Qiao Xi was just a wild girl.","Old Madam Yin’s voice was indifferent. “Xia Yunlou, do you still have a heart? Your biological daughter was swapped with Xu Anran by Xu Anran’s mother, causing you to be separated from your biological daughter. The culprit involved is still with the Xu family, and Xu Anran is not affected as well.","“You think that Xi Xi should be grateful that she’s able to return to the Xu family. What right do you have to make other requests? Just look at your qualifications as a mother!”","Xia Yunlou shouted unwillingly, “This has nothing to do with Anran!”","“What about her biological mother?”","Old Madam Yin slammed the table heavily, her eyes filled with anger. At this moment, she wished she could rush up to Xia Yunlou and slap her daughter until she could think things through","“Where’s the servant who swapped Xi Xi with her daughter? Just because of Xu Anran, not only did you not punish that servant but you even let her live in a villa in Luo City. The servant’s biological daughter, Xu Anran, is occupying the identity of the eldest daughter of the Xu family and enjoying everything that originally belonged to Xi Xi. However, she still wants to frame Xi Xi! What kind of logic is this?!”","Xia Yunlou’s face turned pale.","Anran did nothing wrong! She was just afraid that Qiao Xi would snatch away her things!","Xu Zhi stood at the side, his heart churning.","At this moment, he couldn’t help but be slightly dazed. Even though he despised Xi Xi for growing up in the countryside, she was his biological daughter, after all. It was just that if Xi Xi had been raised by their side since she was young. If Xi Xi had never left their side, perhaps Xi Xi would’ve become an outstanding socialite who was praised by everyone.","Seeing the look in Xu Zhi’s eyes, Xu Anran’s heart trembled. With tears in her eyes, she shouted weakly, “Dad...”","As soon as she finished speaking, Old Madam Yin rushed over and slapped Xu Anran hard.","Xia Yunlou shouted, “Anran!”","“Are you feeling heartbroken? Do you know how Xi Xi has been doing all these years? When she was abused by her stepmother in the Qiao family and chased out of the house, why didn’t you feel heartbroken? Don’t forget that she’s your biological daughter!” Old Madam Yin ordered, “Men! Beat her up!”","As soon as she finished speaking, two bodyguards walked over. One of them held Xu Anran’s face while the other slapped her hard.","Old Madam Yin said casually, “Does it hurt? Xi Xi endured all of this when she was young, and it was even more painful than this.”"]},{"number":586,"title":"Chapter 586 - Identity And Shares","paragraphs":["Xia Yunlou’s tears came streaming down non-stop. “Mom! Hurry up and stop them! Xi Xi is my daughter, but so is Anran. My heart aches for her, but Xi Xi has already gone through the most difficult period and even has the assets left behind by my sister. Why should she... compete with Anran?","“Xi Xi has suffered outside. I’ll treat her well in the future. But don’t hit Anran!","“I know that Xi Xi is my biological daughter and I want to treat her well, but Anran is also my precious daughter. How can I bear to let her suffer? If I treat Xi Xi well, what will Anran do? What did she do wrong to deserve this?","“Anran isn’t related to us by blood. If I don’t treat her well, she won’t have any status in this family. So, I can only side with her.”","Since Xi Xi had suffered for so many years, what was wrong with letting Anran be? Wasn’t Xi Xi already used to suffering?","“Alright.” Old Madam Yin sneered. “Take your good daughter and get out of my Yin family, then!”","Xu Zhi’s expression changed drastically, and he hurriedly rushed to Old Madam Yin. “Mom, Xi Xi is my daughter and the eldest daughter of our Xu family. How can I abandon her? I’ll announce her identity at the birthday banquet. I won’t let her suffer.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Qiao Xi walked over slowly while holding Gu Zheng’s arm.","Xu Zhi’s mind went blank, and the words of Old Madam Yin echoed in his ears. If they didn’t want Xi Xi, then the Yin family would cut off all ties with the Xu family. The Xu family had been relying on the Yin and Xia families all these years. If the Yin family cut off their support, it would be like losing an arm.","He rushed madly to Qiao Xi. “Xi Xi, come home with me, okay?”","Xia Yunlou calmed down. She knew clearly in her heart that if she lost the support of the Yin family, the Xu family would lose a lot and their status would definitely be far inferior to before. Hence, she gritted her teeth and persuaded Qiao Xi as well. “Xi Xi, come home with us. As long as you don’t fight with Anran, I’ll dote on you.”","Gu Zheng nodded slightly at Old Madam Yin as a form of greeting. Then, with a malicious expression, he casually said, “Madam Xu.”","The man’s voice was calm, but one could feel the faint coldness exuding from him that made one shudder.","Gu Zheng adjusted his gold-framed glasses with his slender fingers. His tightly pursed thin lips curved into a cold smile. “I can let Xi Xi return to the Xu family with you.”","The worry in Xia Yunlou’s eyes instantly disappeared. A trace of disdain and ridicule appeared. As expected, Qiao Xi was still unable to reject the identity of the Xu family’s young miss.","Although Qiao Xi was married to Gu Zheng and had already become the prestigious Mrs. Gu, if she didn’t have a wealthy family, how would she be able to stand firm in the Gu family? At least, if she was abandoned by Gu Zheng one day, she could still return to the Xu family to be a wealthy young miss who didn’t have to worry about food and clothing.","Gu Zheng swept his cold gaze across the area and clearly saw the ridicule in Xia Yunlou’s eyes. He lazily said, “But I have a few requests.”","Xu Zhi immediately replied, “President Gu, please speak.”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. “Mrs. Gu is your biological daughter. If you want her to return to the Xu family, she must return as the eldest daughter of the Xu family. Otherwise, there’s no need to talk about it.”","Xia Yunlou was indignant. “No,”","“President Gu, I agree. What other requests do you have?” Xu Zhi interrupted in a panic, then roared at Xia Yunlou, “Stop being silly! If the Yin and Xia families cut ties with us, the Xu family will be finished! The old master will definitely not let you off!”","Gu Zheng said, “The servant who swapped my wife must be dealt with. If the Xu family doesn’t want to be the bad guy, then I’m willing to settle it for you.”","Xu Anran widened her eyes in horror and shook her head hurriedly.","Xu Zhi had a difficult expression on his face. He knew clearly that if the servant was handed to Gu Zheng, then she would either be sent to prison or be secretly dealt with by Gu Zheng. Either way, the outcome would be painful.","Gu Zheng said slowly, “Thirdly, Xu Anyi is your biological son. I don’t care how many shares he has, but Xu Anran is just an adopted daughter. She doesn’t deserve 30% of the shares, so the shares under her name must be transferred to my wife.”","Boom!!!","Xu Anran and Xia Yunlou looked up in disbelief. Xu Zhi revealed a difficult expression."]},{"number":587,"title":"Chapter 587 - Secret","paragraphs":["Translations","“An adopted daughter has 30% of the shares, even more than Xu Anyi, but the real daughter doesn’t even have any. Do you think that’s reasonable?” Gu Zheng asked coldly.","“Mr. Xu, you know very well that the title is just a title. What really shows her status is the shares. If Xi Xi doesn’t have any shares, she’ll always be suppressed by Xu Anran.”","Xu Anran gritted her teeth.","No! The shares were hers!","That b*tch, Qiao Xi, had been waiting for this all along. It wasn’t that she didn’t want to return to the Xu family but that she had been coveting her shares and wanted to use this opportunity to snatch them away.","Xia Yunlou thought so too and said anxiously, “President Gu! You’re going too far! The shares are Anran’s. Why should Xi Xi take them away the minute she comes back? Although Xi Xi is our biological daughter, we can’t bully Anran like this! We’ve already given in and agreed to let Xi Xi be the eldest daughter of the Xu family, but the status of the heir can’t be changed. The heir can only be Anran.","“Xi Xi doesn’t have the ability to manage the company at all. If we give her all the shares, the company will be ruined by her! Instead of fighting with Anran, she should study hard and become more outstanding. She can only blame her bad luck when she was swapped back then. This has nothing to do with Anran!”","Old Madam Yin glared at her.","Gu Zheng’s expression did not change. Instead, he sneered indifferently. “What Madam Xu said makes sense. Although Xi Xi is your biological daughter, the law doesn’t specify that you must leave your shares to your biological child. I’ll naturally not force you.”","Xia Yunlou thought that he had compromised and heaved a sigh of relief.","“If you don’t agree to this request, then there’s nothing to discuss,” Gu Zheng said coldly.","Xu Anran’s scheme, Xu Anyi’s getting his bodyguards to commit murder, Xia Yunlou’s humiliation, and Xu Zhi’s coldness had all hurt his weak little woman. Not to mention 30% of the shares, even if he destroyed the entire Xu family, it would not be able to quell the anger in his heart.","They did not dote on their daughter who had led a wandering life for 20 years. Instead, they let the instigator of the matter stay in the Xu family and treated her well. Instead, they let their biological daughter return to the Xu family only for her to continue suffering. Now, they were not even willing to compensate her with 30% of the shares.","Good! Very good! Then they shouldn’t blame him for being merciless!","Updates by","Gu Zheng’s gaze was malicious as he said, “Mr. Xu, Madam Xu, I’ve given you a chance, but I didn’t expect that you would still make my wife unhappy because of Xu Anran. As long as Mrs. Gu is unhappy, then I, Gu Zheng, am unhappy as well. From today onward, the Xu family has nothing to do with me!”","The last sentence was filled with anger. It was like a thunderbolt striking everyone’s hearts. It shocked Xu Zhi so much that his whole body trembled.","In the next second, Gu Zheng regained his gentle expression and held Qiao Xi’s hand. “Go upstairs and rest.”","Xu Zhi’s body softened, and he almost fell to the ground. If President Gu attacked the Xu family, then the Xu family would be completely destroyed. He would never allow that to happen.","He was about to plead when—","“President Gu! Wait a minute! Do you really want to treat the Xu family like this for Qiao Xi? Although Qiao Xi is already married to you, she’s not suitable for you at all. Only a top socialite like Anran can serve you well. Why can’t you give Anran a chance? You’ll definitely like her!","“Anran doesn’t care about anything else. As long as she’s with you, she won’t care about the past. But a woman like Qiao Xi definitely won’t be able to tolerate it. President Gu, you’ll definitely regret it in the future!”","Qiao Xi’s face sank. What? They wanted to snatch her man?","Gu Zheng’s gaze was malicious and insidious. “Madam Xu, you’re such a good mother! Are the words ‘a woman like Qiao Xi’ something that should come out of the mouth of a mother?”","“Although these words are harsh, I’m just telling the truth! President Gu, if Qiao Xi knows about your secret, she definitely won’t be able to accept it. But our Anran is gentle and has always loved you deeply. She won’t mind your past. Qiao Xi will find out about it sooner or later. When that time comes, she’ll definitely have a falling out with you!”","Everyone looked at the screaming Xia Yunlou with disdain.","Gu Zheng’s mocking gaze landed on her as the corners of his lips slowly curled up. “I’ve always been open and honest. Why don’t you tell me what my secret is, Madam Xu?”"]},{"number":588,"title":"Chapter 588 - Dont Do It","paragraphs":["Xia Yunlou looked at Gu Zheng’s indifferent expression and sneered. It seemed like President Gu was very confident that no one would know about this secret. Of course, there was another possibility, which was that he didn’t care about Qiao Xi at all. Even if Qiao Xi knew, it wouldn’t matter to him. Otherwise, how could he be so calm?","No woman would be able to accept this secret, let alone a jealous woman like Qiao Xi. She would definitely be unable to accept this fact.","Xia Yunlou’s face was ferocious, but there was a trace of fear in her eyes. “President Gu, you said it yourself. If I say it out loud, don’t take your anger out on me!”","She suddenly raised her eyes and looked at Qiao Xi with ridicule. She laughed maniacally and spat out words that shocked everyone.","“Qiao Xi, you must not know that President Gu has an illegitimate child outside!”","Boom!!!","The entire venue was in an uproar.","Everyone looked at her in disbelief, unable to digest this news.","Xia Yunlou laughed out loud. “If you don’t want others to know about it, you shouldn’t have done it. Don’t think that no one will know as long as you hide the child! Xi Xi, you haven’t been to Longwan Residential’s side courtyard, right? That child is hiding there. Your husband has an illegitimate child. You’d better divorce him quickly. He doesn’t really love you!","“Given your personality, it’ll definitely be hard for you to accept that your husband has an illegitimate child. You might as well get a divorce as soon as possible and let Anran marry Gu Zheng in your place.”","She then looked at Gu Zheng with a crazy expression. “President Gu, I’ve already said that Xi Xi isn’t suitable for you. If she doesn’t say anything, it means that she can’t accept your past. But Anran is different. She can accept it because she’s magnanimous and tolerant. You should know who is truly suitable for you now!”","The entire place was silent.","Old Madam Yin’s eyes were filled with anger as she glared at Gu Zheng.","The Yin family’s young master also revealed a difficult expression. If Gu Zheng really had an illegitimate child, then his younger sister would have to become that child’s stepmother.","Updates by","Xia Yunlou looked at the silent crowd and became even more arrogant. “Haha... Only Anran—”","“Madam Xu,” Gu Zheng interrupted her.","Everyone’s gazes landed on him, only to see the man lifting his eyes lazily. “Is the illegitimate child you’re talking about the one who has been staying in the courtyard of Longwan Residential for a year?”","Xia Yunlou replied without hesitation, “It’s him!”","“I see...” Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully. Then, he approached Xia Yunlou and said a few words in a voice that only the two of them could hear.","Xia Yunlou’s expression changed from arrogance to shock. She shook her head crazily. “Impossible! This is impossible!”","Gu Zheng said mockingly, “The people you sent to investigate are really amateurs. They didn’t even investigate the matter properly, yet they reported it to you so casually. No wonder the Xu family is starting to decline.”","Gu Zheng turned around and returned to Qiao Xi’s side. He held her hand with a gentle expression. “Let’s go upstairs.”","Xia Yunlou’s eyes were empty. She did not expect that the only trump card of hers did not hurt Gu Zheng at all. Instead, it gave her a heavy blow.","Xu Zhi’s angry roar was heard along with Xu Anran’s crying. Xia Yunlou felt that her mind was a mess. Her vision turned black, and she fell to the ground weakly.","Seeing the Xu family’s embarrassing state, Old Madam Yin’s face was full of disdain. She waved her hand and signaled the bodyguards to carry them away.","Yin Jinglin frowned and hesitated. “Grandma... President Gu has an illegitimate child? Why didn’t we know about it?”","Yin Jingting was more composed, but his expression was gloomy. “If President Gu... really has an illegitimate child, he probably won’t let others know about it so easily. Grandma, do you think Aunt Yunlou was telling the truth?”","Old Madam Yin’s expression was grave.","She wasn’t sure either. Xia Yunlou seemed to be serious, but Gu Zheng didn’t seem like someone who would do something like that.","“I heard that President Gu has always been a clean man who doesn’t get close to women. Before he got married, he didn’t have a single woman by his side, nor did he have any scandals. The Gu family isn’t as strict as the Yin family, though. It’s a little strange. Does he have another woman behind his back?” Yin Jinglin guessed.","Old Madam Yin felt like a fishbone was stuck in her throat.","She had seen too many such things at her age. She had also experienced her husband cheating on her and getting a mistress. Now, she only hoped that Xi Xi would find a man who truly loved her and would no longer have to suffer. She didn’t expect Gu Zheng to have an illegitimate child."]},{"number":589,"title":"Chapter 589 - An Idiot At Love","paragraphs":["At this moment, Yin Jingting’s gaze was gloomy. “If Gu Zheng really has an illegitimate child, we definitely can’t let Sister suffer.”","Yin Jinglin sighed. “Maybe Madam Xu was lying. I don’t think President Gu is that kind of person.”","...","On the other hand, Qiao Xi couldn’t help but feel puzzled when she went upstairs.","She had been to the courtyard of Longwan Residential. It didn’t look like a place where people lived. If Gu Zheng really had an illegitimate child, would he arrange for him to stay so close to him?","Qiao Xi frowned and couldn’t help but ask, “He’s... over a year old?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. “No, it has probably been longer than that since I picked him up. Someone left him at the entrance of Longwan Residential.”","At that time, the child was lying on the ground, dying. His small body was covered in dirt. If Gu Zheng didn’t take him in, he would’ve definitely died.","Qiao Xi only felt tears well up in her eyes. Ordinary people wouldn’t come to Longwan Residential. Since the child was left at the entrance, then the child was surely related to Gu Zheng. Moreover, Gu Zheng had never been a kind person. Being able to casually take a child in meant that the child was indeed related to him.","Qiao Xi suppressed the sorrow in her heart and said indifferently, “Can he walk now?”","Gu Zheng smiled and nodded. “Of course. He can run!”","Qiao Xi’s heart ached even more. It seemed that Gu Zheng really liked this illegitimate child of his, and his face was filled with gentleness at the thought of him.","Immediately after, Gu Zheng spoke again, “Every time I visit him, as long as I call his name, he’ll quickly run toward me and be very close to me.”","Qiao Xi was extremely jealous and almost couldn’t control her sobs, so she didn’t speak.","Updates by","That child was indeed President Gu’s son. He was so obedient at such a young age and good at currying favor with Gu Zheng. In a few years, would he be raised in Longwan Residential? What would her status be then?","“You named him?”","Gu Zheng replied, “Yes, his name is Lele—Gu Lele.”","Qiao Xi: “...” President Gu gave his child such a name. That’s too simple! And it doesn’t sound like a boy’s name!","Gu Zheng continued, “He’s always happy and carefree, so I named him Lele.”","Qiao Xi frowned. Gu Zheng couldn’t possibly have come up with such an ordinary name. Perhaps it was the child’s mother who gave him this name. Gu Zheng doted on this child too much and didn’t change it.","The more she thought about it, the more bitter she felt. Qiao Xi took a deep breath and asked, “Where’s his mother?”","Mom?","Gu Zheng was a little puzzled. How did he know where the mother of the dog was? She might already be dead.","The man thought for a moment before replying, “I don’t know where she went either. She left Lele behind.”","Qiao Xi: “??”","Actually, with Gu Zheng’s power, it was very easy for him to look for a woman. However, he said he did not know where that woman had gone. There were only two possibilities. Either he had not searched at all, or he had long forgotten who that woman was.","If it was the first, then he would be too heartless. No matter what, she had given birth to a child for him, yet he treated it as if that woman was already dead and did not care about her at all.","If it was the second possibility, which was that he had completely forgotten who it was, then it meant his previous life was very messy. Otherwise, how could he not even know who the child’s mother was?","Qiao Xi only felt a wave of anger surge into her heart. Tears fell from her eyes as she sniffled. She fiercely pushed Gu Zheng away, then slammed the door shut.","Gu Zheng was confused. Why was she so angry?","When they first got married, he was afraid that Qiao Xi didn’t like dogs, so he kept Lele in the courtyard. He didn’t expect this matter to make her so angry.","Gu Zheng was silent for a long while before gently knocking on Qiao Xi’s door.","Not far away, Song Shiyu looked disappointed. “Brother, you said that the president is good at everything, but he doesn’t know anything about relationships! No wonder Young Madam misunderstood his ambiguous words!”","Song Shijing said, “Don’t talk nonsense about the president!”","“Did I spout nonsense?! He’s an idiot at love! Young Madam obviously believes in Xia Yunlou’s words and thinks that the president has an illegitimate child. If he doesn’t explain it clearly, Young Madam will be so heartbroken! I can’t believe a man like him could even find himself a wife!”","Song Shijing shook his head helplessly and dragged Song Shiyu downstairs to avoid disturbing the president and his wife."]},{"number":590,"title":"Chapter 590 - Overwhelmed With Jealousy","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng was still standing in front of the door, gently persuading her. “Why don’t you come with me to the courtyard? If you really don’t like him, I’ll send him away.”","Inside the room, Qiao Xi was in a fit of anger. When she heard Gu Zheng’s words, she was even more furious.","This man was too heartless!","If Gu Zheng had told her the truth before they got married and told her that he had an illegitimate child, Qiao Xi would not have been angry. Instead, she would have felt that this man was a calm person.","But they had already been married for so long. How could Gu Zheng keep it from her for so long? How long did he plan on lying to her?","The more Qiao Xi thought about it, the more sorrowful she felt. She couldn’t help but choke up. “You’re going to send him away if I don’t like him? But he’s your son! Even if he leaves, it won’t change the blood relationship between the two of you. Do you want outsiders to say that I’m a vicious stepmother?”","Gu Zheng remained silent, his brows tightly furrowed.","... Mrs. Gu must have misunderstood. Lele wasn’t an illegitimate child at all. He was just a dog!","Thinking of Xia Yunlou’s words, Gu Zheng gritted his teeth. It was all that woman’s fault for making Mrs. Gu think too much.","He thought that Qiao Xi had been to the courtyard and knew that there was a dog there, so she wouldn’t think too much about it.","After a moment of silence, Gu Zheng couldn’t help but laugh. His voice was gentle as he spoke, “I’ll bring you to see him, okay?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","‘No way! I’m still angry, yet you want me to see your illegitimate child?","‘Alright! I’ll go take a look, then! I want to confront him face to face and see if that child is as cute as you say he is!’","Updates by","Qiao Xi got into the car angrily while Song Shiyu stepped on the accelerator. They soon arrived at Longwan Residential.","After entering the villa, the two of them headed straight to the side courtyard.","Although it was also a part of the villa, it was still a distance away. The place wasn’t big, but it was clean and exquisite.","There was a housekeeper in the courtyard as well, and she was a kind-looking middle-aged woman. When she saw Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi walking over together, she immediately greeted them respectfully, “President, Young Madam.”","Qiao Xi was slightly puzzled. Shouldn’t the person responsible for taking care of the illegitimate child be very alarmed to see her, the legitimate wife, here? Wasn’t she afraid that this ‘vicious’ stepmother would do something to that illegitimate child?","Qiao Xi’s expression was icy-cold. “Your son... Lele has always stayed here?”","Gu Zheng couldn’t help but smile. Qiao Xi saw his gentle expression and felt that he was emitting the aura of a parent. She felt bitter.","She didn’t mind Gu Zheng being with another woman before they got married. It wasn’t a big deal for them to be in a normal relationship. After all, she was previously in a relationship with Gu Moling. However, he had a child with another woman. That was a different story.","Qiao Xi suppressed the bitterness in her heart and followed Gu Zheng into the courtyard, but she didn’t see the child.","At this moment, a young maid walked over and smiled. “President, Young Madam, are you looking for Little Master? He’s upstairs.”","Ahh! She even called him ‘Little Master’!","Gu Zheng came over and held her hand. Qiao Xi shook it off angrily.","The man didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. He said helplessly, “He’s not my child.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were misty with tears. “Gu Zheng, you’ve learned how to lie. If you told me earlier that you had an illegitimate child, I wouldn’t have fussed over it. After all, who doesn’t have a past? But you’ve been hiding it from me. What exactly do you mean by this?!”","Gu Zheng said, “He really has nothing to do with me. I just couldn’t bear to—”","“I’m not listening! I’m not listening!”","Qiao Xi broke down and interrupted Gu Zheng’s words. If he wasn’t his biological child but was still raising him, it was impossible for the child to come from a clean and pure background. It must be that Gu Zheng couldn’t forget about the child’s mother, so he took the child over to raise him.","She pushed the door open, and there was silence inside.","Qiao Xi took a deep breath and walked in slowly.","If he wasn’t Gu Zheng’s biological son, then she wouldn’t have to be a stepmother. Moreover, Gu Zheng had also said that if she didn’t like the child, he could send him away. With Gu Zheng’s status, it shouldn’t be difficult to find a happy family for that child.","Qiao Xi’s gaze swept the surroundings.","Where was he?","There was no one in the room. There was no one on the bed or on the chair. Besides, such a young child would definitely have an adult accompanying him. How could Gu Zheng be at ease leaving him alone?","However, there were many toys and dog food in the room. Not far away, there was an exquisite kennel with a small black dog resting there."]},{"number":591,"title":"Chapter 591 - He Really Has A Dog","paragraphs":["When the little black dog heard the commotion coming from the door, he jumped up and stared at the door with his obsidian-like eyes. He turned around and looked at the unfamiliar Qiao Xi, tilting his head curiously.","Qiao Xi’s eyes widened. This dog was too cute!","But how could one raise a dog in the same room as a child? Children were fragile. Gu Zheng was too careless.","Just as Qiao Xi was puzzled, Gu Zheng had already bent down slightly and called out gently to the little black dog not far away, “Lele, come over to Daddy!”","Qiao Xi’s body froze abruptly as the corners of her mouth twitched slightly.","It was called Lele?","This was Gu Zheng’s son?","She felt her ears buzz for a moment, and her mind went blank.","While she was still in a daze, she saw the little black dog running toward Gu Zheng excitedly. It jumped into Gu Zheng’s arms and enthusiastically licked Gu Zheng’s hand.","The little black dog stared fixedly at Qiao Xi, his eyes filled with curiosity toward this female owner who had suddenly appeared. “Woof!”","Qiao Xi: “...” Was this the so-called illegitimate child?","Xia Yunlou had shouted in front of everyone that Gu Zheng had an illegitimate child hidden in the courtyard and thought that she had something on him. In the end, the so-called illegitimate child she was talking about was a dog?","If Gu Zheng really had a son, wouldn’t it be a real person?","The rims of Qiao Xi’s eyes were still red as the sorrow lingered in her heart. But at this moment, she was unable to flare up no matter what. Her emotions were replaced with shock instead.","Updates by","After a long time, Qiao Xi recovered from her shock. “This... is your son?”","“Yes, he’s yours too.” The man smiled. “Lele, call Mommy.”","“Woof!”","The little black dog stretched out his little legs and directly jumped into Qiao Xi’s embrace. He rubbed his soft fur against Qiao Xi’s hand and enthusiastically tried to curry favor with this female owner.","When Qiao Xi thought of Gu Zheng’s questioning earlier, as well as the scene of her sorrowful tears flowing down her face, she instantly felt ashamed.","“Mrs. Gu, do you know who my son is now?” Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with ridicule.","Qiao Xi felt a weight pressing down on her chest. When her anger had reached its peak just now, she had even thought of divorcing Gu Zheng. If she couldn’t accept it, then she would really do it. In any case, she would be even more carefree after she regained her freedom.","“Xi Xi, you have to believe me. You’re the only woman I’ve had since the beginning. It was the same in the past and will continue to be like this in the future. Nothing will change.”","Gu Zheng’s voice was extremely gentle. Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes and met those deep eyes of his. He was gazing at her affectionately, and she instantly indulged herself in this wonderful feeling.","His hot breath blew across her face. “Believe me.","“No matter what they say, you have to believe me. You’re the only one I’ve ever had.”","He leaned closer and pecked her lightly on the lips. “If I really had an illegitimate child, I would never hide the news from you. I’ve already made myself clear on the day I married you.”","Qiao Xi didn’t understand why she was so impulsive just now. She clearly knew that Gu Zheng wouldn’t do such a thing. He had always been clean and honest. He hadn’t had a single woman by his side all these years, so how could he have an illegitimate child?","But she just couldn’t control herself. The moment she heard that he had an illegitimate child, her rationality vanished. It was probably because... she loved him too much.","Song Shijing, who had been guarding outside the door, was also surprised. This boss of his who had always been cold and heartless was so gentle in front of his wife, fearing that she would feel wronged.","Before Young Madam showed up, Song Shijing didn’t expect the president to fall into the hands of a woman one day.","Perhaps the president was not heartless, but the torture and abuse from his childhood had made him restrain his feelings and never reveal them easily. Only when he faced the person he trusted and loved deeply would he show them.","Song Shiyu frowned. “The president likes animals? And he’s raising a dog in the courtyard? Isn’t it too extravagant to let a dog live in such a big house?”","Song Shijing said calmly, “Watch what you’re saying. He isn’t a dog. It’s the little master. When the president picked up Lele, he was almost dead. After raising him for so long, the president has developed feelings for him. As long as the president is happy, the dog can stay anywhere.”"]},{"number":592,"title":"Chapter 592 - There Are Spies In Longwan Residential","paragraphs":["Song Shiyu was confused. “Don’t you think a cold-blooded man like the president should have a tiger or a lion as his pet? Why would he have a dog?”","Gu Zheng was the god of Li City. Rumors had it that he was bloodthirsty, cold, and ruthless. Although he did not lose his temper easily, he was the God of Plague who must not be provoked.","Someone of his status was actually raising an abandoned dog? It was indeed different from his personality.","Song Shijing said seriously, “Shiyu, the president is not as cold as the rumors say.","“Actually, he’s very kind at heart. It’s just that the bad memories from his childhood had forced him to become cold. He wears a fake and cold mask to hide the softness in his heart. He’s afraid others will see through him.","“It’s only after Young Madam appeared that she slowly warmed up the president, allowing him to gradually remove his mask and become more human.”","...","Qiao Xi hugged the obedient dog and gently stroked its soft fur. “Haha... No wonder Xia Yunlou was so shocked when you spoke to her earlier. She definitely didn’t expect you to be raising a little black dog in the courtyard.”","A cold glint flashed across Gu Zheng’s indifferent eyes. “Xia Yunlou reminded me of something.”","“What?”","“There are spies in Longwan Residential.”","Gu Zheng’s voice was slightly cold, and the smile on Qiao Xi’s face gradually disappeared as she suddenly reacted.","That was right! As the mistress of the house, she didn’t even know that Gu Zheng had a puppy. How did an outsider like Xia Yunlou know so much?","Whoever it was guessed that Gu Zheng was keeping his illegitimate child in the courtyard, and he had only moved in a year ago. This was probably something that only the people from Longwan Residential would know, but who was it?","Updates by","Gu Zheng’s eyes were deep, and his thin lips moved slightly. “Looks like I have to clean up the ‘trash’.”","...","Lu family.","Lu Yan lazily leaned on the sofa and took a sip of hot tea.","Suddenly, the assistant rushed in. “Young Master! Uh...”","Lu Yan suddenly opened his eyes. “What was Qiao Xi’s reaction?”","That secret had already been revealed to Xia Yunlou. A person like her who couldn’t hide anything would definitely not be able to refrain herself from saying it in public. Qiao Xi probably already knew about Gu Zheng having an illegitimate child.","According to his understanding of Qiao Xi, she would probably divorce Gu Zheng this time.","When Lu Yan thought about this, he smiled proudly. Divorced women needed comfort. He would take advantage of the situation and snatch Qiao Xi to his side.","Unexpectedly, the assistant stammered, “P-President Gu’s son is... is a dog!”","Lu Yan suddenly opened his eyes, thinking that he had heard wrongly. “Say that again?”","“It’s a dog! The so-called illegitimate child is just a dog!”","Lu Yan was puzzled for a moment. “Gu Zheng gave birth to a dog?”","Impossible! He had sent people to investigate, and they said that Gu Zheng was raising an illegitimate child in the courtyard. How did the child become a dog?","Coincidentally, a few guests of the Lu family came in at this moment. When they heard his words, they frowned slightly.","Although everyone in Li City knew that Gu Zheng and the Lu family were enemies, it was not nice to badmouth others behind their backs.","“I heard that Young Master Lu was as gentle as jade. Seeing you today, however, you’re nothing much. You appear polite on the surface, but behind the scenes, you’re badmouthing President Gu, saying he gave birth to a dog!”","Everyone else chimed in softly, “That’s right. Does President Gu’s son have anything to do with him? He even said that President Gu’s son is a dog. That’s too rude!”","Lu Yan instantly choked, unable to release the anger in his heart.","The people he sent to Longwan Residential definitely would not lie to him. So how did the illegitimate child suddenly become a dog? What exactly happened?","A moment later, another subordinate rushed in hurriedly. “Young Master, bad news! The people we arranged at Longwan Residential have all...”","Lu Yan suddenly sat up from the sofa, feeling uneasy.","“They were all beaten up by President Gu and chased out of Longwan Residential. Not a single one was left.”","Lu Yan narrowed his eyes.","Gu Zheng’s methods were swift and decisive. Not a single person was left behind?","He had gotten rid of all the spies within a day. It seemed like he had already sensed their presence but had pretended not to notice anything wrong. And this time, he got rid of all of them so irrationally.","Did he feel that there was no need for these people to stay, or was it because this matter had hurt Qiao Xi?"]},{"number":593,"title":"Chapter 593 - Holding Two Birthday Parties At The Same Time","paragraphs":["At the Xu family’s villa.","Xia Yunlou’s heart ached as she hugged Xu Anran and shouted with all her might, “No! I’ll never allow Anran to leave this place! Anran has already lived in this house for 20 years. If you chase her away, how can she bear it?! She’s also your daughter! You’re so cruel!”","Xu Zhi’s expression darkened. “It’s fine if we don’t chase her out, but get that servant out of the Xu family! Otherwise, our Xu family will completely offend the Yin family and Gu Zheng!”","Xu Anran’s body trembled slightly.","Xia Yunlou held her in her arms. “Nanny Deng has been working in the Xu family since she was young. Although she did something wrong and swapped the two children, she still gave us an obedient and sensible daughter, Anran. They’re both our daughters, after all. What difference does their identity make? Why must we pursue this matter?”","“Shut up, idiot! It’s fine if you don’t approve. Just get out of the Xu family with them, then!” Xu Zhi pointed at her nose and roared in anger.","He looked at his scheming daughter and his stupid wife. If this continued, the Xu family would be ruined by them sooner or later.","Xu Zhi took a deep breath and ordered, “It’s going to be Xi Xi’s birthday soon. I’ve already prepared a grand birthday banquet for her. I’ve invited all the relatives and friends of the Xu family to participate. At the banquet, I’ll announce that she’s the eldest daughter of the Xu family.”","Xia Yunlou gnashed her teeth in anger. “No way! It’s clearly Anran’s birthday, so why should we hold a birthday party for Qiao Xi? Ever since Qiao Xi returned to the Xu family, she has been targeting Anran in every way and wants to fight with Anran for everything! Anran is the daughter we raised for 20 years! Moreover, don’t forget who caused your son to be sent to the police station! All of this is thanks to Qiao Xi!”","No matter what Xia Yunlou said, Xu Zhi had already made up his mind. He shouted angrily, “Xia Yunlou! If you don’t let Xi Xi come back, how are you going to explain this to the family head?! Also, about the things Yunqiu left behind...”","His voice paused, and his eyes lost focus for a moment.","Xia Yunlou was stunned for a few seconds before she laughed crazily. “Haha... Xu Zhi, I really thought your heart was aching for Qiao Xi! So, it’s because of Xia Yunqiu! You’ve always liked her, so you like the daughter she raised too, right?","“Qiao Xi is our biological daughter. Of course, she has to return to the Xu family, but she absolutely can’t take over the identity of the Xu family’s eldest young miss!” Xia Yunlou roared with a malevolent expression.","“Anran is a top socialite who we have nurtured with all our heart. If outsiders find out that she’s just an adopted daughter, I don’t know how those daughters of rich families will laugh at her. All our years of hard work will be ruined! Qiao Xi is a country bumpkin. She doesn’t know anything. What can she bring to the Xu family?”","Updates by","Xu Zhi remained silent.","“Do you want to talk about President Gu? Although Qiao Xi is already married to President Gu, how long can President Gu’s love last? With Qiao Xi’s personality, she’ll be abandoned by him sooner or later. Without President Gu, she’s useless! In the end, she still needs us to support her!","“Anran is now the leader of the top socialites, and she has connections with all the big families. She can bring great benefits to our Xu family. If her identity is known by others, none of those families will be willing to interact with Anran anymore. So, if Anran is destroyed, our Xu family will go down too! Don’t you understand this logic?!”","Xu Zhi’s eyes were filled with contradictions. It was indeed because of Gu Zheng that he had to agree to his requests, but now...","Seeing that he was wavering, Xia Yunlou continued, “Why don’t you hold a birthday party for your two daughters? However, the guests will be divided into two venues. It’ll be clear then which daughter can bring more benefits to the Xu family.”","If the two daughters’ birthday parties were separated, then the guests could only choose to attend the birthday of the person more important to them. This was indeed a good idea.","Xu Zhi said helplessly, “Okay, let’s do it this way. If Xi Xi achieves a better result, then you must consider the big picture and stop making a fuss. Let Xi Xi return as the eldest young miss of the Xu family.”","Xu Anran remained silent as a cold glint flashed across her eyes.","After returning to her room, Xu Anran made a call to invite a few guests over.","When Wen Xi heard that the Xu family was going to hold a birthday party for both their daughters at the same time, she instantly roared. “Is Qiao Xi even worthy of celebrating your birthday with you? You’ve been celebrating your birthday alone for so many years! Why should she interfere?”"]},{"number":594,"title":"Chapter 594 - Battles","paragraphs":["Xu Anran’s eyes were filled with disappointment. “Actually, it’s also her birthday...”","At that moment, Xu Anyi was walking down the stairs and exploded the moment he heard Qiao Xi’s name. “Anran! With me around, Qiao Xi’s birthday party will definitely be cold and cheerless. I’ll have all my friends attend your birthday party.”","Xu Anyi had just been released today, and he looked a lot more haggard than before. After being locked up in the police station for so many days, the resentment in his heart had reached its peak.","Xu Anran smiled bitterly. “Brother, she’s your sister too.”","“Nonsense! You’re my only sister!”","Xu Zidie recalled how Qiao Xi had snatched her clothes previously, bullied Xu Anran, and even angered Xu Anyi. Her eyes darted around. “Sister Anran, Brother Anyi, I have an idea. I can ruin Qiao Xi’s reputation.”","Xu Anyi’s expression was cold. “Tell me about it.”","Xu Zidie voiced her idea in a low voice. Xu Anyi’s gaze turned from gleeful to one of excitement. In the end, he laughed out loud.","Wen Xi also beamed with joy. “Good! This is a good idea! Qiao Xi will definitely lose all her dignity. At that time, what qualifications will she have to be the Xu family’s eldest daughter?”","Xu Anran lowered her eyes and remained silent. A trace of danger flashed past her eyes.","Since Xu Zidie was the one who came up with the idea, there would be a scapegoat if the matter was exposed. She didn’t have to worry.","“Brother, I think this is too much. No matter what, Xi Xi is our parents’ child...” Xu Anran frowned and pretended to be kind.","When Xu Anyi heard this, he felt that his sister was too obedient. Qiao Xi actually bullied such a beautiful and kind woman. She deserved to die, so he snorted. “She’s not from the Xu family! It has nothing to do with us! Since she dares to bully you, she’ll have to bear the consequences!”","Wen Xi chimed in, “Brother Anyi is right. She stole your room, and now, she’s trying to steal your identity. What can’t we do to her? You’re a kind person. Just remember that you didn’t cause all of this to happen. Don’t feel guilty!”","Updates by","Seeing how stubborn everyone was, Xu Anran could only nod her head helplessly.","...","At this moment, not far away from the villa’s door, two tall men had cold expressions on their faces.","Shen Yu sneered. “This is Little Six’s family!”","There were many bodyguards at the entrance of the Xu family’s house. Outsiders naturally could not barge in, but these two men had appeared silently outside the door. They were calm and composed. They did not even panic when they saw the bodyguards not far away.","Shen Yu looked at the expressionless man beside him and raised his eyebrows. “Second Brother, Little Six is being bullied so badly. Why aren’t you reacting at all?”","The man was dressed in a black suit, and his gaze was even sharper and colder than Gu Zheng’s. His entire body was filled with killing intent. His thin lips were filled with bloodthirsty killing intent. He was completely different from the calm and gentle Shen Yu.","He said casually, “Then kill them.”","The tone of this sentence was too flat as if he was not talking about murder but a simple meal.","Shen Yu’s expression remained unchanged. “You don’t have to be so ruthless. After all, these people are related to Little Six by blood, and they’ve caused some trouble recently. If Xu Anran and Xu Anyi suddenly die, it won’t be good for Little Six. Little Two, don’t always fight and kill.”","Luo Qing frowned. “Don’t call me ‘Little Two’.”","Shen Yu chuckled and said, “The Xu family intends to attack Little Six while she’s under our watch. They must be tired of living. Destroying the Xu family is like crushing an ant to us.”","Luo Qing thought so too. However, if he destroyed the Xu family, it would affect Little Six’s reputation. It wasn’t worth it.","Shen Yu said, “Little Six is kind and doesn’t like to kill people. She just wants to know why her mother, Xia Yunqiu, died for no reason. It wasn’t all Xu Mei’s doing. Xia Yunlou must be involved too. They can’t die before we find out the truth.”","After a moment of silence, Shen Yu’s voice suddenly turned cold. “Little Six doesn’t have to go back to the Xu family anymore. If she goes back, she’ll be frustrated facing these people every day. We don’t know how many more battles Little Six will have to face. This time, the Xu family has given us a chance. We have to grasp it.”","Luo Qing looked up at him meaningfully, then frowned. “I understand.”"]},{"number":595,"title":"Chapter 595 - Definitely Lose","paragraphs":["“Control yourself. Don’t kill them,” Shen Yu warned.","Luo Qing nodded and watched as Shen Yu turned around and left. He leaped onto the roof opposite to observe the movements in the villa, then hid his tracks.","His eyes were cold and filled with killing intent.","If Shen Yu hadn’t stopped him, he would have killed these scumbags, but he had to endure it for Little Six.","How annoying!","Luo Qing flicked his wrist, and a slender silver needle was now in between his fingertips. His eyes narrowed, and before anyone could notice, he suddenly flicked it out.","“Ah! It hurts! What is it?” Xu Anyi’s painful cry came from inside the house.","...","On the other hand, Qiao Xi picked up Xu Zhi’s call. Her expression was cold. Gu Yao, who was beside her, sensed that the atmosphere was not right. He was so scared that he did not dare to make a sound. Gu Lele also lay on the ground obediently.","After a while, she sighed helplessly. “What do you mean, Mr. Xu?”","Xu Zhi was a little nervous. “Xi Xi, this—”","“You want to hold birthday parties for me and Xu Anran on the same day, but the parties will be divided into two venues. You want to see which of us can bring more benefits to the Xu family, right? Mr. Xu, you know very well that I’ve never attended a banquet before. I don’t have as many connections as Xu Anran. I’ll definitely lose this match! Do you want me to lose my dignity?”","Xu Zhi quickly explained, “Xi Xi, don’t think that way. I just want to celebrate your birthday for you. How could I want to embarrass you? It’s just that there’ll be too many guests, so we have to separate the parties.”","“Mr. Xu, do you think I’m a three-year-old child? There’s no point in beating about the bush. There are some things that are better said openly. You and Xia Yunlou just want to let the Yin family know that Xu Anran is the most suitable person to be the eldest daughter of the Xu family as she has more connections than me.”","Updates by","Qiao Xi said lightly, “You don’t want the Gu family to get involved, and you want me to rely on my own connections for this event. But Mr. Xu, you know very well that I’m already at a disadvantage when compared to Xu Anran. Even so, you want me to attend this birthday banquet willingly. Don’t you have anything to say about this?”","Xu Zhi’s heart trembled. “What do you want?”","“Didn’t Gu Zheng say that as long as Xu Anran transfers the 30% of shares to me, he won’t hold a grudge against the Xu family? Did you forget what had happened yesterday so quickly?”","Qiao Xi sneered. “That’s the only way I’ll agree to attend the banquet. Otherwise, why would I go even though I know I’ll embarrass myself? I’m not a fool! It’s fine if you’re not willing to let Xu Anran suffer. Then just transfer her shares to me.”","Xu Zhi was in a difficult position.","To be fair, he liked Xu Anran more. After all, she was his daughter who had lived by his side for 20 years. She was smart, capable, beautiful, and generous. She was indeed qualified to be the eldest daughter of the Xu family.","Qiao Xi, on the other hand, was too mediocre. She didn’t look like someone who knew how to manage a company. If she managed the company, the Xu family would be finished. Hence, Anran and Anyi had to manage the company.","But... if they didn’t agree to Qiao Xi’s conditions, then the Yin family and Gu Zheng wouldn’t stop just like this.","He would agree to give her 30% of the shares first, but he wouldn’t let her manage the company. He could make this compromise.","Xu Zhi took a deep breath. “Okay! I agree, but you have to promise me that you’ll attend my birthday party.”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “Okay! I’ll be there on time. Don’t be late, Mr. and Mrs. Xu.”","After hanging up the phone, Gu Yao immediately scolded, “Does the Xu family really think that there’s no one else in the Gu family? They want a daughter like you who has been living outside to compete with Xu Anran? They want to use this to determine who’s the most qualified to be the eldest daughter of the Xu family? No one else can think of such a despicable way.”","Qiao Xi pursed her lips and remained silent.","Everyone could tell that the Xu family was biased toward Xu Anran. However, it didn’t matter to her. She didn’t care about that bit of pitiful kinship either. She had obtained 30% of the shares. It was still unknown who would lose their dignity in the end!","Gu Yao was indignant. “I’ll call people now!”","Qiao Xi waved her hand. “Don’t.”","“Why? Xu Anran and Xia Yunlou must have already contacted a lot of people. Although Xu Anyi is useless, he has a lot of friends. They’ll definitely attend Xu Anran’s birthday party.”"]},{"number":596,"title":"Chapter 596 - The Winner Is Decided","paragraphs":["“Moreover, the Xu family even said that they won’t let the Gu family get involved. It’s obvious that they don’t want you to use Gu Zheng’s identity. They’re probably banding together and waiting to see you make a fool of yourself!”","Qiao Xi smiled. “Don’t worry.”","The Xu family thought that she wouldn’t have any family or friends if she didn’t rely on Gu Zheng. But she had more than one helper!","...","At that moment, the families that were close to the Xu family had all received invitations. The two daughters’ birthday parties were being held on the same day, but the parties were divided into two venues. Everyone could only choose one to attend.","Actually, those with discerning eyes knew clearly in their hearts that the party they went to represented which side they stood on. If they went to Qiao Xi’s birthday party, then after Xu Anran took over the Xu family in the future, it would be impossible for her to have any dealings with them.","Although the noble families valued bloodline inheritance and wanted their children to inherit the family business, the Xu family was completely different because they already had an heir—Xu Anyi. It didn’t matter which of their daughters was their biological daughter. The key was who the Xu couple liked more.","It went without saying that Xu Anran was not comparable to Qiao Xi.","The Chen family’s patriarch had already received the invitation. He went silent for a moment before he said, “Let’s attend Xu Anran’s birthday banquet, but we still have to prepare a gift for Qiao Xi. At the very least, we shouldn’t offend her.”","Madam Chen was puzzled. “Didn’t they say Qiao Xi is their biological daughter?”","“It doesn’t matter who the biological daughter is. The Xu couple is biased toward Xu Anran and wants to support their adopted daughter. I don’t think that biological daughter is important at all. It won’t do us any good to attend her birthday party. We just have to focus on Xu Anran.”","At the Wu family’s residence.","Madam Wu sat on the sofa and said to Mr. Wu, “The birthday parties are organized by the Xu family this time... To put it nicely, they’re both banquets. To put it bluntly, it’s a battle between their two daughters. Whoever can bring more benefits to the Xu family is qualified to be the eldest daughter of the Xu family.","“This morning, Madam Xu called me and told me that I must attend Xu Anran’s birthday party. Since she said so, how can I reject her? I thought that the couple wouldn’t interfere in this matter. After all, one is their biological daughter while the other is their adopted daughter who has lived with them for 20 years. I didn’t expect the Xu couple to actually help their adopted daughter. I think Qiao Xi will definitely lose her reputation this time.”","Updates by","Mr. Wu said, “You’re right. We have to attend Xu Anran’s party. Although she’s an adopted daughter, she’s favored by the Xu couple. Their family matters have nothing to do with us. We just need to choose the most powerful party.”","At the same time, Xu Anyi invited a bunch of friends to the party as well and announced loudly, “If you’re my friends, all of you are to attend Anran’s birthday party. Whoever goes to Qiao Xi’s party will be disrespecting me and I’ll never see you again!”","Wen Xi and Xu Zidie also looked for their friends in the circle and said with disdain, “Qiao Xi is a wild girl. Everyone in the Xu family hates her. So what if she has joined the Xu family? Sister Anran is still the eldest daughter of the Xu family. She can’t win.”","Just like this, the winner and loser seemed to have been decided.","...","Two days later on the day of the birthday parties.","Early in the morning, Xu Zhi sent someone to pick Qiao Xi up. He had even brought a makeup artist to help Qiao Xi dress up.","“The Xu family is finally being generous this time. They even prepared a decent gown for you. It seems like they’re afraid of gossip, so they’re treating you equally.”","Gu Zheng glanced at the gown in the box, then looked at Qiao Xi and asked, “Is today really your birthday?”","Qiao Xi replied indifferently, “If the Xu family says it’s today, then it is. No one has celebrated my birthday for me in the past. Only when Mom was still around did she celebrate it for me. It’s a few days from today. They must have deliberately ignored it.”","Gu Yao was indignant. “You’ve been back in the Xu family for so many days now, but the Xu couple hasn’t even said that they care about you. All they’re thinking about is how to use you to become Xu Anran’s foil. Are you kidding me?! You’re their biological daughter! Xu Anran is nothing! She has been occupying your identity for so many years, but now, she even wants to snatch my brother away?”"]},{"number":597,"title":"Chapter 597 - The Joke Of Li City","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi was puzzled. “I’m not even angry. Why are you so resentful?”","“I’m angry on your behalf! Damn it!” Gu Yao could not help but swear.","“I’ve received 30% of the shares from Xu Zhi. It’s about a billion yuan. Not only will attending this birthday party make Xu Anran lose her dignity, but I’ve also gotten so much money. What’s there to be angry about?”","Gu Yao: “...” Why didn’t he realize before that Qiao Xi loved money so much? As Gu Zheng’s wife, how could she lack money?","However, he was curious how Qiao Xi could be sure that the person who would lose their dignity later was definitely Xu Anran.","...","Half an hour before the two birthday parties started.","Shen Yu stood in the corner and whispered, “Almost everyone is here.”","Luo Qing nodded and hid in the darkness.","Xue Liang looked at his friends who had rushed over from the capital and said elegantly, “Thank you all for coming to my sixth sister’s birthday party. Please wait outside for a moment.”","Xu Anran was wearing the same long dress as Qiao Xi and had exquisite makeup on her face. She looked like a proud swan as she proudly looked at Qiao Xi’s banquet hall.","How could Qiao Xi be a match for her in terms of connections?!","“Anran, everything is ready. We’ve already informed the various families of Li City that they absolutely aren’t allowed to attend Qiao Xi’s party.”","When Xu Anran heard Wen Xi’s words, she smiled smugly. However, when she looked up, her face was full of sadness. “It’s a pity that Dad is in her banquet hall. I really want Dad to accompany me on my birthday.”","Updates by","Hearing this, Xu Anyi couldn’t help but snort. “Seriously, how dare Dad celebrate that wild girl’s birthday?! Anran, you don’t have to be sad. Dad will come here soon after seeing that there’s no one there. You’re Dad’s most beloved daughter. This won’t change.”","Xu Anran pretended to be worried. “But... what will happen then? You and Mom are already here with me. If Dad comes too, won’t she...”","Xu Anyi looked at her gently. “Anran, you’re too kind. Why do you care about her? Just let her lose her dignity. It’s best if she leaves the Xu family immediately and never comes back.”","Xu Anran did not say a word as a sinister look flashed across her eyes.","Even if everyone came to attend her birthday banquet, she was still unwilling because there was Gu Zheng beside Qiao Xi. Even if Qiao Xi lost her dignity today, no one would dare to say anything because of Gu Zheng. At most, they would only speak badly about her behind her back. It wouldn’t cause too much harm to Qiao Xi.","So, this time, she had to amaze everyone at the party and make Qiao Xi lose all her dignity!","Xu Anran was all smiles. Soon, Qiao Xi would become the joke of the entire Li City. The Xu family wouldn’t be able to afford to lose their reputation like this, so they would definitely abandon their biological daughter.","...","The birthday parties officially began.","Xu Anran’s banquet hall was filled with people. Soon, it was almost fully packed. The guests gathered and discussed.","“How many people do you think will go to Qiao Xi’s banquet hall?”","“I’m guessing that there aren’t many people there. Everyone knows what the Xu family is doing. Who would attend the birthday party of the young lady who isn’t favored by her family? Doing so will offend Madam Xu and Young Master Xu!”","“Qiao Xi is in deep trouble this time. Not only will she lose her dignity, but she might even be abandoned by the Xu family. Actually, her status as the biological daughter might not be that important. After all, Xu Anran is the daughter that the Xu couple has raised for 20 years. Moreover, this daughter of theirs is outstanding enough and has a good relationship with the Xu family’s relatives and friends. Of course, she’s not someone a wandering daughter can compare to.”","“That’s right! After today’s parties, Miss Qiao will become the laughing stock of the entire Li City.”","After another ten minutes, the banquet hall at Qiao Xi’s side was still very quiet compared to the lively scene at Xu Anran’s side. The ridicule on the guests’ faces became even stronger.","Xu Zhi stayed in Qiao Xi’s banquet hall and couldn’t sit still.","Originally, he thought that because Qiao Xi was Gu Zheng’s wife, he would surely make use of some of his connections. Moreover, Madam Shen seemed to think highly of Qiao Xi as well. Could it be that he was thinking too much?","Even the Shen family didn’t attend Qiao Xi’s birthday banquet. Did this mean that the Shen family had only helped Qiao Xi out the last time because they couldn’t bear to see such a thing happen? They didn’t have any other intentions at all? To them, Qiao Xi was only an unfamiliar junior who was dispensable?"]},{"number":598,"title":"Chapter 598 - Not Even One Guest Came","paragraphs":["Xu Zhi turned around and saw that Xu Anran’s banquet hall was full of guests. He couldn’t help but frown.","If it weren’t for the sake of the Yin family and Gu Zheng, he wouldn’t have come to attend Qiao Xi’s birthday party. Now, even if there was no one in the banquet hall, he couldn’t leave just like that. He asked with slight impatience, “Who’s here?”","The butler immediately said, “The Chen family is here.”","Xu Zhi’s expression softened a little. “Finally, someone is here. Xi Xi won’t be too embarrassed this way. Actually, it doesn’t matter if she loses. As long as she knows her place, she’s still the daughter of my Xu family. The Chen family and my Xu family have a good relationship. Arrange for them to sit down at a table.”","Xu Zhi was afraid that Gu Zheng would take his anger out on him because of this matter, so it was better to have some people come than no one at all.","After all the guests on Qiao Xi’s side were seated, he would go celebrate Anran’s birthday with her.","At this moment, the butler suddenly said in embarrassment, “Sir, the Chen family only sent someone to deliver the gift. They’ve gone to Eldest Miss’ banquet hall.”","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent.","Xu Zhi’s face was gloomy, and he suddenly felt a bit embarrassed. They were both his daughters, but why was there such a huge gap between them? Didn’t Qiao Xi have any friends who could help her?","At this moment, another family came in with a gift in their hands. “I’m really sorry, Mr. Xu. My daughter is good friends with Miss Anran. She insisted that we attend Miss Anran’s birthday party, so...”","Xu Zhi felt somewhat depressed in his heart. Was he wrong? He should have chosen Anran from the very beginning. How could Qiao Xi compare to Anran?","Then, a few other families came. They all sent gifts and apologized before going to Xu Anran’s banquet hall.","Xu Zhi frowned. “Even if President Gu and the Yin family continue to blame me, I’ll have something to retort with. I gave Xi Xi a chance, but she failed to live up to my expectations. They can’t blame me for this!","“I’m staying with Xi Xi in her banquet hall, but she doesn’t have a single friend. Forget it, there’s no point in me staying here. Let’s go look for Anran!”","Updates by","The butler frowned and felt that Qiao Xi was being wronged.","The two daughters could not be compared to each other. Xu Anran had attended all kinds of banquets since she was young and befriended the daughters of noble families. As for Qiao Xi, she had never shown her face in the upper-class society, so how could she compare to Xu Anran? In the end, it was just the Xu couple favoring their adopted daughter.","Xu Zhi stood up and left, but the butler stood still.","It was the birthday of the daughter of the Xu family. How could not a single person from the Xu family be present?","The butler and Nanny Li walked up to Qiao Xi. “Miss, it’s fine if no one comes. Please don’t be angry. If you don’t mind, what do you think of Nanny Li and I staying?”","Qiao Xi smiled. “Of course.”","...","When they saw Xu Zhi walking over from the banquet hall on the other side, Xu Anran and Xia Yunlou revealed proud smiles.","Xia Yunlou said coquettishly, “Hubby, I thought you weren’t coming! Anran, I knew that your father still cared about you. He just didn’t want Qiao Xi to lose too badly.”","Xu Anran pretended to be worried. “But what about my sister? If you come over to my side, there won’t be anyone on her side? Our relationship isn’t good to begin with. Now, she’ll hate me even more.”","Xu Zhi was a little irritated in his heart. His mood only improved a little when he saw the hall full of guests and heard the cheerful laughter. He was somewhat regretful. He shouldn’t have gone to Qiao Xi’s side just now. He wouldn’t have been so upset if he had come directly to Anran’s side.","“Anran, don’t think too much about it. It’s her own fault. It has nothing to do with you!”","When everyone heard Xu Zhi’s words, they could not help but turn around and look at the banquet hall over there.","“Look, they’re both the daughters of the Xu family, but not a single guest went to that lady’s birthday party!”","“Xu Anran is a top socialite. She’s beautiful and popular. Of course, the guests will choose to attend her birthday party. Actually, if it weren’t for the fact that the two of them insisted on celebrating their birthdays together, I would’ve attended Qiao Xi’s birthday party on the account that she’s the biological daughter of the Xu couple.”","“But if we have to choose between the two of them, of course, we have to come to Xu Anran’s side.”","“Biological? Tsk tsk... There’s nothing much to it!”"]},{"number":599,"title":"Chapter 599 - The Xue Familys Heir Appears","paragraphs":["Although the guests were discussing softly, Xu Anran could still hear what they were saying and smiled proudly.","‘Qiao Xi, the last thing you should do in your life is to become enemies with me!’","Xu Anran walked up to the stage and smiled gracefully. “Thank you very much for coming to my birthday party. There’ll be a dance segment later. I hope that everyone—”","Before she could finish speaking, someone pointed at the banquet hall opposite and shouted, “Look! Is there a guest in Miss Qiao’s banquet hall?”","...","Ten minutes ago.","Qiao Xi’s banquet hall was still cold and cheerless. The butler said helplessly, “Miss, why don’t you just go back, in case you start feeling unhappy?”","Qiao Xi replied indifferently, “What’s there to be unhappy about? It’s still early.”","“Miss, someone is here.” A voice came from outside.","Qiao Xi chuckled as she looked at the entrance. Sure enough, she had already heard the hum of cars. Instantly, dozens of luxurious cars stopped outside the banquet hall, and the scene was extremely magnificent.","The butler walked out and couldn’t help but take a deep breath. These luxury cars were all top-notch. Some of them were even custom-made and limited edition sports cars. This represented not only wealth but also status.","A young man got out of the car. He was handsome and gentle like jade. Miss Qiao, who was rumored to have no connections, went up to him. The butler was very familiar with him.","Xue Liang took the gift box from his assistant and handed it to Qiao Xi. He said gently, “Xi Xi, happy birthday.”","At the same time, all the guests in Xu Anran’s banquet hall looked over. They were extremely curious about who this young nobleman was and what relationship he shared with Qiao Xi.","Updates by","Suddenly, someone stood up abruptly, his eyes filled with astonishment. “He... He’s the heir of the Xue family! I heard that the Xue family has already handed over the inheritance to him. He actually came, and he seems to be very familiar with Qiao Xi!”","“Mr. Xu, you know Young Master Xue? Which daughter’s birthday will he attend?”","Everyone was slightly puzzled as well. Even though Young Master Xue had gone to see Qiao Xi, it didn’t mean that he was going to attend her birthday banquet. After all, many people had gone there to deliver gifts before coming to Xu Anran’s banquet hall to take their seats.","Xue Liang had only delivered a gift to Qiao Xi. He might still come to Xu Anran’s side later. No one knew whose friend he was.","When Xu Zhi heard that the other party was the heir of the Xue family, he immediately stood up and instructed his assistant, “It doesn’t matter which daughter he came for. Since he’s here, he’s our Xu family’s honored guest. Quickly invite him in!”","“Of course, he’s here for Anran’s birthday. How could he be here for Qiao Xi? How could she know Xue Liang?” Xia Yunlou said with a mocking expression.","Xu Anran also held up her gown and followed her father over. She said excitedly, “Dad, I didn’t expect Mr. Xue to come as well. His status is honorable. I’ll go out with you to welcome him!”","Xu Zhi beamed with joy and said with a smile, “Of course, quickly! Come with me quickly. I didn’t expect that Mr. Xue would also come to attend your birthday party. Anran, you’re really my good daughter. Quickly come with me to welcome Mr. Xue!”","Xia Yunlou’s face was full of pride. As expected, she was right. Anran was a hundred times more outstanding than Qiao Xi. Even Mr. Xue thought highly of her and was willing to lower himself to attend her birthday party.","The guests also complimented her. “Miss Xu is a top socialite, and many young masters admire her. It’s not strange that the young master of the Xue family is here!”","“Yes! Miss Xu, hurry up and go welcome Mr. Xue!”","Xu Anran beamed with joy and nodded slightly at everyone. She gracefully lifted her gown and went to welcome the outstanding man with Xu Zhi.","However, before she reached the door, the smile on Xu Anran’s face suddenly disappeared.","The guests also looked up, their eyes full of surprise.","How... How was this possible?!","Xue Liang... He actually entered the banquet hall with Qiao Xi? Moreover, he had no intention of coming out again. Worst of all, he didn’t seem to have Xu Anran in his eyes. He didn’t send anyone to send her a gift.","Xu Anran’s eyes darkened as she asked in disbelief, “Sister... She knows Xue Liang? Isn’t Mr. Xue here to attend my birthday party?”","Xu Anyi’s eyes were filled with viciousness. “She actually snatched Anran’s guest?”"]},{"number":600,"title":"Chapter 600 - The Mysterious Luo Family From Xuan Island","paragraphs":["The guests stood up one after another and curiously looked across. Xue Liang had actually gone to Qiao Xi’s banquet hall?","No matter whose birthday Xue Liang wanted to celebrate, the fact that he had entered Qiao Xi’s banquet hall meant that he had a close relationship with Qiao Xi.","Could it be that... the biological daughter of the Xu family, Qiao Xi, actually had more connections than Xu Anran?","Xu Anran’s expression was cold. “So, Mr. Xue is here to attend my sister’s birthday party. My sister has led a wandering life for 20 years. It’s not strange for her to have friends.”","No one said anything, but they all had certain thoughts in mind. Although it was only the Xue family, they were more powerful than all the other noble families on Xu Anran’s side.","At this moment, the assistant rushed in with a face full of surprise. “Congratulations, Eldest Miss. The Qin family is here. They’ve arranged for people to send over gifts.”","Imperial Capital’s Qin family? This family actually came to celebrate Xu Anran’s birthday?","All the guests shuddered. That family could be said to be on par with the Xue family. If the Qin family came over, then they wouldn’t have to curry favor with the Xue family and Qiao Xi.","Xu Anran’s expression softened a little. Luckily, the Qin family came.","She heard that Qiao Xi and Xue Yi were good friends and that Xue Liang was Xue Yi’s elder brother. Hence, it was understandable for him to celebrate Qiao Xi’s birthday on account of Xue Yi.","The smile on Xu Anran’s face gradually recovered. It didn’t matter even if Xue Liang had gone to Qiao Xi’s side. Anyway, the Qin family was here for her.","She said elegantly, “Dad, I didn’t expect the young master of the Qin family to come. We have indeed met once. Young Master Qin is very easy-going. Let’s go and welcome him now. Let’s not be rude.”","As soon as she finished speaking, the assistant said in a panic, “Eldest Miss, there’s no need to go. Young Master Qin only sent someone to deliver the gifts. He got out of the car and went straight to Second Miss’ banquet hall.”","The entire place fell silent as if a thunderclap had exploded in everyone’s hearts.","Updates by","Previously, the guests had all gone to give gifts to Qiao Xi before going to Xu Anran’s side to take their seats. Now, Young Master Qin actually sent someone to send gifts to Xu Anran while he directly went to Qiao Xi’s side.","The tables had turned?","Xu Anran’s face turned pale as the corners of her mouth twitched. Just as she was about to speak, a voice sounded from outside. “The Wang family of Luo City has arrived!”","After a while, the assistant said nervously, “Miss Wang’s family sent a gift and... went straight to Second Miss’ banquet hall.”","“Imperial Capital’s Yang family has arrived!”","“The Zhao family from Lingcheng City has arrived!”","“Eldest Miss, the Yang family and the Qin family are long-time friends, so they also went to Second Miss’ hall. Second Miss once saved Mrs. Zhao, so the Zhao couple also went to Second Miss’ hall.”","...","Several aristocratic families came in succession, and all of them went to Qiao Xi’s side without exception.","Although the Xu and Xia families had great reputations in Luo City and could be ranked at the top, while the Yin family was the cream of the crop among the wealthy families, they still paled in comparison to so many wealthy families.","Xu Anran stood rooted to the ground as her body trembled. It was not anger or jealousy but fear!","Impossible! It was absolutely impossible for Qiao Xi to know so many people from noble families!","At this moment, the guests were filled with regret. If they had gone to Qiao Xi’s side, they would surely be able to meet many wealthy and noble families. Perhaps they would be able to use this opportunity to get to know the big shots.","The successors and members of those noble families were all intelligent people. There was absolutely a reason why they chose to attend Qiao Xi’s birthday banquet. This meant that Qiao Xi’s identity couldn’t be underestimated. She was even able to make these people think highly of her.","At this moment, some guests were already unable to restrain themselves from heading over to Qiao Xi’s side. The remaining guests were slightly unable to sit still as well. But it wouldn’t do their reputation any good if they left directly, so they could only brace themselves and sit on their seats.","The rims of Xu Anran’s eyes were slightly red, and her expression was filled with resentment. However, she still put on an indifferent smile as she faced the many guests. “It’s really great that Sister has so many friends. I... I’m also very grateful that everyone is staying here with me.”","“You’re too kind, Miss Xu.”","“We’ve been friends with your father for years. Of course, we won’t leave.”","The next second—","“The Shen family from the capital has arrived!”","Boom!!!","The Shen family was here too! The rest of the people started to get restless.","Everyone had yet to recover from the shock of the Shen family’s arrival when—","“The Luo family from Xuan Island has arrived!”","As soon as that sentence was uttered, the entire banquet hall was in an uproar. The mysterious Luo family from Xuan Island had also come!"]}]);
